window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":501,"title":"Chapter 501: 501. The identities are becoming increasingly numerous.","paragraphs":["After the establishment of Yunshan Capital, Zhou Muchen and the other five, along with Liu Yutong, all seven became partners.","Among them, Liu Yutong, as the founding partner, contributed the most capital and held the greatest decision-making power.","Consequently, she naturally assumed the role of Chairman of Yunshan Capital.","Similar to the practice of Mingzhu Capital, Yunshan Capital also established a special Investment Decision Committee. Only partners could become its members, and its function was analogous to a group company's board of directors.","Liu Yutong possessed veto power.","Major investment matters required discussion by the committee, though the final decision rested with Liu Yutong's judgment.","No one had any objections to such an arrangement.","Subsequently, Liu Yutong announced the personnel appointments for Yunshan Capital.","Among the six of them, only Zhu Silin had consistently worked in investment and had a track record of success.","The others all had their own other ventures to varying degrees. For instance, Gu Yebai and Shen Hao operated the top-tier Cloud Peak Club in Da Nan City, and another female member, Bai Shisui, was more interested in fashion design and planned to start a clothing brand company.","In short, the only candidate capable of handling the day-to-day management of Yunshan Capital was Zhu Silin.","Liu Yutong immediately announced the appointment: \"Silin, among everyone, your investment experience is the most extensive. From now on, you will serve as President and Chief Investment Officer, responsible for building and leading the investment team.\"","Zhu Silin was somewhat surprised. \"Me?\"","She thought she had misheard. There was no way she could compete with Liu Yutong for the position of Chief Investment Officer.","\"No... no, I can't. Sister Yutong, you should...\"","\"It's fine. With me here, you just need to execute my strategic vision, and you won't go wrong,\" Liu Yutong interrupted her.","Hearing this, Zhu Silin had no choice but to nod and accept. The others also had no objections.","Next, Liu Yutong said to Chen Mo, \"You will serve as Vice President of Yunshan Capital, assisting Silin in her work. Is that acceptable?\"","Chen Mo immediately responded, \"Absolutely! I will definitely assist Miss Zhu well in her work!\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Your 270 million in funds can be invested. We will grant you a performance dividend share corresponding to the proportion of your capital.\"","Chen Mo was instantly overjoyed. \"Thank you, Miss Liu!\"","\"I, Chen Mo, swear here that I will spare no effort to serve Yunshan Capital and you to the best of my ability!\"","This meant he was almost equivalent to truly becoming a member of this circle.","Of course, while there was still some gap, that was to be expected.","Because whether in terms of social status, background, or capability, he could not compare to the others present.","However, as long as he could integrate into this circle, his future achievements and status were bound to rise steadily.","With the arrangements for the Yunshan group largely settled, Liu Yutong's titles also multiplied.","Chairman of the Wanlong Group.","Chairman of Wanlong Capital.","Chairman of Yunshan Capital.","Chairman of Mingzhu Capital.","Director of the Yu Group.","President of the Mingzhu Chamber of Commerce.","And President of the Wanlong Charity Foundation.","Suddenly acquiring so many titles meant her influence had now risen to an entirely new level.","Although Wanlong Capital was affiliated with the Wanlong Group, it was essentially completely independent.","The Wanlong Charity Foundation is also independent and is currently going through the relevant procedures. Once the process is complete and it is officially established, the over one billion yuan in donations originally pledged to BS Province will be immediately channeled through this foundation.","The Wanlong Charity Foundation does not accept external donations; this is a rule firmly set by Liu Yutong.","This prevents outsiders from making comments or criticisms about her foundation.","All charitable funds are provided by the Wanlong Group and some close partners.","For instance, the members of the Yunshan Association have each pledged to donate one hundred million yuan.","Their contributions, combined with the amount Liu Yutong intends to donate, will result in an initial fund of approximately two billion yuan.","Liu Yutong has already communicated with Uncle Zhu, confirming that all these charitable funds will be used for rebuilding new school campuses in the disaster areas, covering over a hundred schools including both primary and secondary schools.","Furthermore, the reconstruction projects have already commenced ahead of schedule, with construction companies advancing the funds initially.","Liu Yutong only needs to subsequently provide the pledged funds in a timely manner.","Uncle Zhu has also expressed high praise for Liu Yutong.","Disaster area reconstruction is undoubtedly a lucrative opportunity, yet Liu Yutong and the capital behind her have not considered competing for this benefit at all. Instead, they have decisively invested approximately two billion yuan upfront for rebuilding schools.","Such a purely charitable act easily wins people's goodwill.","Although Liu Yutong did not ask for any return, Uncle Zhu felt compelled to offer something in recognition.","Several cities involved in the disaster area reconstruction will, through compliant means, allocate several plots of land in their central urban areas to Liu Yutong for developing commercial plazas, with a five-year tax exemption.","This is the first form of support from his side for Liu Yutong!","The value of these land parcels is substantial.","As these areas are mostly smaller cities with concentrated populations, once a shopping plaza is built and operated in a central location, it essentially creates a quasi-monopoly, making it nearly impossible for a second commercial plaza to compete with them.","Wanlong Plaza will undoubtedly become the commercial landmark of its respective city and the preferred shopping destination for local residents.","This also indirectly validates Liu Yutong's statement that wherever a Wanlong Plaza is, that place becomes the city center.","In addition to the ten affected counties and cities, a Wanlong Commercial Plaza will also be built in the provincial capital of BS.","This adds up to eleven commercial plazas to be built directly, with varying scales depending on regional limitations.","For example, the commercial plaza located in the provincial capital of BS will have the highest positioning and the largest scale, aiming to be developed into a city landmark-level complex, with a single project investment estimated at around one billion yuan.","If other real estate enterprises were to handle this, the investment would likely at least double, as they would not only develop the shopping plaza but also invest in building residential communities nearby.","Liu Yutong made it clear long ago that she would absolutely not get involved in such real estate projects.","As for whether Yu Mo's Yu Group will build supporting residential communities next to the future Wanlong Plazas, she will not interfere; it depends on whether Yu Mo has the capability.","In short, all real estate projects under her Wanlong Group will always be primarily for self-use.","Aside from the provincial capital's commercial plaza, the other ten plazas are estimated to require investments ranging from 300 to 400 million yuan each, depending on the city's situation and population size.","The preliminary total estimated investment in BS Province is around 4 to 5 billion yuan.","This meant that nearly one-third of the 15 billion yuan Liu Yutong had just earned for the Wanlong Hui Group was already allocated and needed to be spent.","Liu Yutong began planning to allocate over 5 billion yuan for the Wanlong Hui Group's normal development and operations. As for the 10 billion yuan in Wanlong Capital, it was essentially reserved as backup funds for the group's future growth.","Before being deployed, these funds would be used elsewhere, such as for long-term investments.","When the need arose—like this time for the large-scale expansion in BS Province, where the group's cash flow was insufficient—the capital from Wanlong Capital could be tapped.","Funds from other capital companies, such as Mingzhu Capital and Yunshan Capital, were unrelated to the Wanlong Hui Group. They would be used for investments in other areas, like the critically important technology sector in the future.","Liu Yutong had retained technology stocks worth 6.6 billion US dollars overseas. Beyond knowing these stocks would multiply in value, there was also an exploratory purpose: to see if she could acquire something valuable.","Take, for example, the future lithography giant, ASML."]},{"number":502,"title":"Chapter 502: 502, Easy Come, Easy Go","paragraphs":["As the funds arrived one after another, everyone at the Wanlong Society finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Yang Xin should have been the happiest one, after all, they finally had money.","Previously, they had almost emptied their coffers. The past few months had been like walking on thin ice, each day feeling like a year, terrified that a single misstep could cause the Wanlong Society Group to go bankrupt due to a broken capital chain.","It must be understood that a significant portion of the group's funds were dedicated funds like payment for goods or loans, totaling over a billion.","If someone suddenly sabotaged them, or due to other reasons, it could instantly plunge the Wanlong Society Group into an abyss of ruin.","After first securing over five billion in funds, Yang Xin and the others were overjoyed.","However, before their joy could last long, their faces fell again one by one.","Was this money really that easy to spend?","Their provincial capital needed about 1 billion to invest in building a commercial plaza. The investment plan for the 11 commercial plazas in BS Province required 4 to 5 billion.","Fortunately, BS Province could provide some low-interest loans.","The Greater South City area also needed roughly 1 billion. The logistics company needed to expand its scale, requiring at least 500 million as a base.","Then, Li Xiaohui's newly established esports club took 50 million.","Add to that the expansion of restaurants and so on...","Furthermore, for the newly planned industrial park in Pearl City, some partners had already agreed to invest and build factories there. Wanlong Society would also provide some funds to partners short on money or make direct investments.","Wanlong Supermarket's future was not just about the supermarket business; it also needed to develop downstream industry chains to ensure the quality and competitiveness of its products were strong enough.","All these miscellaneous expenses added up, and the over five billion was instantly allocated. Excluding the funds within Wanlong Capital, the Wanlong Society Group was even tens of billions in debt on paper.","If it weren't for Wanlong Capital backing them up, Yang Xin and the others would probably be worrying themselves bald again.","Of course, this debt was all projected for the future on paper. In reality, these over five billion could last quite a while, not being a one-time investment, estimated to take one to two years to spend.","Even so, while chatting with Liu Yutong, Yang Xin couldn't help but complain, \"I thought we had struck it rich, but it turns out we're almost paupers again.\"","He meant \"paupers\" in a positive sense.","After all, for an enterprise to develop and grow rapidly, spending money is an unavoidable truth.","After this round of spending was complete and all the shopping malls officially began operations, the Wanlong Society Group would become a large-scale group with a valuation starting at tens of billions.","Strictly speaking, the Wanlong Society Group was already a multi-billion enterprise because Wanlong Capital held substantial cash.","However, based on the internal restricted share price calculation, the group's valuation hadn't yet broken the tens of billions mark.","A company's valuation is both related and unrelated to its cash flow.","Simply put, cash itself doesn't directly create a high valuation; it's only one part of a company's value.","For example, a company with 1 billion in cash but no growth prospects might have its valuation primarily reflected in that 1 billion cash.","Another company also with 1 billion in cash but in a phase of explosive growth could have a valuation dozens or even hundreds of times its cash.","Just as Yang Xin and the others were experiencing the bittersweet pain of spending money like water, the internet, both domestic and international, remained a scene of widespread misery.","The aftermath of the financial crisis hadn't dissipated so quickly.","On the TV screen, a financial news anchor was reporting the latest updates.","[During this period, following Lehman's declaration of bankruptcy, global stock markets have continued to plummet. Preliminary statistics show this round of financial crisis has led to the evaporation of over XX billion USD in global market value...]","On domestic internet portals, forums, and message boards, the same cries of despair echoed.","Everyone was discussing this news.","[Circuit breaker triggered, again! My principal is only one-tenth left, damn it!]","[Can anyone save me? I can barely pay my mortgage.]","[Those bastards on Wall Street! They knew the crash was coming and hid it, dragging us down with them!]","[I'm never touching stocks again in my life.]","[I heard a big shot jumped last night in XX place...]","On the internet, especially in the financial sections, almost no good news could be seen.","Just as everyone was becoming numb, a piece of hearsay began spreading rapidly online.","Initially, risk departments at several top Wall Street investment banks and brokerages noticed some anomalies.","Some accounts opened through complex offshore structures had reaped astonishingly huge profits with every market plunge.","These accounts wielded their sickles with remarkable precision, their methods cold-blooded and utterly merciless.","Subsequent investigations revealed that the owners behind these accounts were highly likely from the East.","This infuriated them.","They were used to being the ones harvesting the world, accustomed to this asymmetrical relationship. This time, however, they had been harvested by a mysterious force from the East.","Who could stand that?","Many were furious upon hearing this, shouting \"Shit!\"","This news later reached China, instantly causing an uproar on forums and message boards.","\"Did you hear? There's a mysterious cluster of accounts that harvested over ten billion USD in profits from across the ocean during this crash!\"","\"No way! How is that possible? How did they do it? Do we have such masters in China?\"","\"Holy crap, this must be the Stock God! I want to be his disciple! I don't want to be a 'chopped vegetable' (a metaphor for retail investors who lose money) anymore!\"","Me too! I'm begging for the big shot's info.","I think this info might be fake, just to boost our confidence as retail investors. Don't fall for it, everyone...","\"I think it's fake too. How could this be possible?\"","\"I actually think it's true. Who says we Chinese can't harvest from across the ocean? Don't underestimate our own people.\"","\"Exactly!\"","\"...\"","Just as everyone held their own opinions, arguing about its authenticity, a relatively authoritative financial media outlet updated with the latest news.","According to some foreign media and confirmation from a certain domestic big shot, during this round of the financial crisis there indeed was a mysterious capital from the East that used high leverage to precisely short the overseas markets, estimated to have profited nearly 20 billion USD. The boldness of its operations and the precision of its judgment are breathtaking — it can be called a textbook example of the art of plunder. This capital and the mainland...","When this news report came out, it was no less than dropping a nuclear bomb on those wealthy individuals and retail investors whose net worth had been slashed or who were nearly bankrupt.","In a certain villa, a big shot who had just suffered heavy losses in the stock market received a call from a friend and suddenly stood up from the sofa, his face filled with excitement.","\"What? Say that again?! Our Chinese people snatched back over a hundred billion from across the ocean? Holy shit! Our ancestral masters must be showing their power! Which immortal did this?!\"","\"Spare no expense to help me find these people and the traders behind them. I must pay them a visit!\"","\"...\"","Similar scenes played out in many places across the country.","\"Is it true? Over a hundred billion? Snatching food from the tiger's mouth on Wall Street? Incredible!\"","\"Finally we can hold our heads high! Damn, seeing those guys across the sea take such a massive fall was depressing, but who knew we had a literal god descend on our side!\"","\"Even though I lost money, hearing this news feels inexplicably satisfying! The boss is a legend!\"","\"Please, take me under your wing!\"","\"This is too insane! This is a hundred times more thrilling than reading a power fantasy novel!\"","\"I always said it, there's a true dragon hidden among us Dragon Nation people!\"","\"Find that person, quick!\"","\"............\"","Meanwhile, elsewhere.","The mysterious figure revered online as the Stock God, after meeting with the high-level executives of the Wanlong Hui Group in Great Southern City, made a decision.","\"Yun Cheng, arrange to withdraw two hundred million in cash. We're handing out bonuses to everyone!\"",".........."]},{"number":503,"title":"Chapter 503: 503. Recommended Assistant Candidates.","paragraphs":["The allocation of the two hundred million funds was straightforward: one hundred million for the core members, and one hundred million for the regular employees across the group's subsidiaries.","Calculated, each core member received around one hundred thousand, while the average regular employee got about ten thousand.","Don't ask why there's favoritism; perhaps it's because the core members are more loyal and handle more of the grueling, difficult work.","Take the last disaster relief effort, for instance. Many were injured, and some even nearly got buried while rescuing people during aftershocks. Now that there's money, it's only right to compensate them.","After this impromptu meeting concluded,","Yu Xin couldn't help but remind, \"Sister Yutong, I think you should find an assistant.\"","What major group chairman doesn't have a secretarial team? Yet, she still hadn't sought an assistant. In the early days, Yu Xin acted as Liu Yutong's right hand, and later, most related matters were handled by Yun Cheng.","However, continuing like this was certainly not feasible. Yun Cheng, wearing multiple hats alone, simply couldn't manage it all.","Now, Liu Yutong wasn't just heading the Wanlong Hui Group; she also served as chairman of several other important organizations. The daily decisions and approvals she needed to make were far greater than before.","Ideally, someone could help her schedule in advance, filter information, lead an assistant team, and streamline her workflow, so she only needed to make the final call.","Of course, this task seemed simple but was actually far from it. Managing affairs across various companies and arranging various tasks required a high level of personal competence.","Besides strong personal ability, execution skills also needed to be equally robust.","After listening, Liu Yutong also felt the current arrangement was indeed inappropriate. She really did need an assistant to help her coordinate affairs across the companies.","\"So, do you have any candidates?\"","Yu Xin glanced at Yun Cheng: \"Brother Yun's idea is to select from our core members. I think we should recruit externally.\"","The loyalty and execution of Wanlong Hui's core members were beyond doubt, but that didn't mean they were suited for this role.","Not everyone had Yu Xin's strong learning ability, nor could everyone handle multiple roles like Yun Cheng.","Yu Xin was gradually showing signs of becoming the helm of the Wanlong Hui Group. In the future, she might very well take over Liu Yutong's role and become the group's CEO.","This was something even Ma Da and Yun Cheng couldn't achieve.","Although Ma Da and Yun Cheng were veterans of Wanlong Hui, they still fell somewhat short when it came to managing the entire group. Besides educational background, they both had their specialized strengths and weaknesses.","Yu Xin was the one who most closely resembled Liu Yutong; in both work style and methods she was very well-rounded, with almost no weaknesses.","Liu Yutong did indeed intend to cultivate Yu Xin to become the group CEO in the future. Previously, having Yu Xin represent the Wanlong Hui Group in meetings with leaders in BS Province and appear on radio already indicated training her in that direction.","After hearing Yu Xin's words, Yun Cheng continued, \"I think the Young Lady's assistant must be sufficiently loyal. Our core members' loyalty is not in question, but outsiders are harder to gauge. After all, they would be working closely by the Young Lady's side. What if...\"","Although he didn't finish, Liu Yutong understood.","Given Yu Xin's personality, she had likely already evaluated the current core members of Wanlong Hui and found no one suitable for the role of principal assistant. She was more inclined, for example, to use a headhunter to poach a top-tier talent with outstanding ability and personal qualities.","The person serving as Liu Yutong's assistant would undoubtedly hold a high-level executive position within the group. This role was destined to handle a large amount of core information and resources, and to manage them well.","Precisely because of this position's importance, Yu Xin believed they needed to find someone highly capable.","Clearly, in Yu Xin's view, there was no suitable candidate among the current core members.","Yun Cheng, on the other hand, believed that Miss Liu Yutong's assistant would be exposed to top-level work secrets. Loyalty was more important than ability, and they could reasonably relax the requirements for competence.","Actually, both their perspectives had merit.","\"In that case, bring me the profiles of your respective recommended candidates.\"","Yu Xin seemed to have been well prepared. As soon as Liu Yutong spoke, she produced a personnel file.","Yes, only one.","It showed she was very confident in her chosen candidate.","Liu Yutong took the file and looked at it. When she saw the occupation field, she was slightly taken aback.","\"Teacher?\"","This came as something of a surprise to her. She had originally guessed that Yu Xin's recommendations would most likely be elites from top investment banks, professional managers from well-known companies, and so on.","She hadn't expected it to be a university teacher.","However, precisely because of this profession, it instantly piqued her curiosity, making her want to read on.","Name: Su Mansu","Age: 24","Gender: Female","Education: Ph.D. in Financial Mathematics","Graduated from: Princeton University","Position: Specially Appointed Associate Professor, School of Economics and Management, Nancheng University","Just this brief introduction of their background showed how exceptional this person was.","A 24-year-old Ph.D., from a world-top university, and already a specially appointed associate professor at a key domestic university—her intelligence quotient was evidently very high.","However, judging from the resume, this Su Mansu seems to have no other work experience yet and leans toward the academic field.","Yu Xin added promptly: \"Sister Yutong, Su Mansu is no ordinary university teacher. At 16 she was specially admitted to the Special Class for the Gifted Young at the University of Science and Technology of China. At 20 she received a full scholarship for a direct-entry PhD program at Princeton, earned her doctorate at 22, returned to China, and was exceptionally appointed as an associate professor at Nancheng University. Her academic achievements are outstanding.\"","\"I came across her by chance. A while ago, when you weren't at the school, she came for an exchange visit, and I was the one who received her. If she were merely academically strong, I wouldn't recommend her. From what I know, she has done risk models and arbitrage strategies for several investment banks, with frightening accuracy. Most crucially, I like her personality.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Personality? What kind of personality could make you like her?\"","Yu Xin: \"A hatred for evil and injustice.\"","After saying this, she couldn't help but chuckle.","Liu Yutong seemed to understand something.","Yun Cheng's face also showed a peculiar expression.","Hatred for evil and injustice? What did that mean?","Liu Yutong didn't say more and looked at Yun Cheng.","Yun Cheng had also long been prepared: he submitted five résumés, each belonging to a capable female core member of Wanlong Hui.","Liu Yutong indeed hadn't planned to find a male assistant, mainly for convenience; Yun Cheng was the exception.","However, she also intended to send Yun Cheng out to gain experience once a suitable assistant was found.","Someone was needed to take charge in BS Province. So far, within the Wanlong Hui Group, he was the most suitable candidate.","After reviewing the five resumes, Liu Yutong set the materials down.","\"Yun Cheng, this time, you go back to Mingzhu City to oversee the bonus distribution and the core member promotion ceremony. After it concludes, directly transfer half of the people to Da Nancheng.\"","\"Yu Xin and I will go meet that university teacher.\"","............."]},{"number":504,"title":"Chapter 504: 504, The Arrival of Three.","paragraphs":["\"Me, go back to preside over it?\"","Yun Cheng thought he had misheard. \"No, Miss, according to the rules, the promotion ceremony for core members should be presided over by you. How could I...\"","He was about to say that doing so would be overstepping his bounds.","In his mind, some rules were ironclad, especially the promotion ceremony for core members. Its importance was self-evident, and it had always been presided over personally by the Miss. This was the way to make members more loyal to her.","But Liu Yutong interrupted him: \"Yun Cheng, rules are rigid, but people are flexible.\"","Her authority within the Wanlonghui Group was now unrivalled, so occasionally missing one promotion ceremony was inconsequential.","Moreover, whether in terms of actual status or position, Yun Cheng was the true second-in-command of the group. Furthermore, he had been by her side since her high school days, almost inseparable.","Who in the Wanlonghui didn't know that he was the one she trusted most? To some extent, Yun Cheng was the only person within the Wanlonghui who could completely represent her will.","\"Yun Cheng, over in BS Province, I need someone trustworthy who can hold their ground. This time when you go back, you'll be taking charge independently.\"","She said this while looking at him very seriously.","Although Yun Cheng had long known he would be sent out and was aware of the Miss's trust and cultivation of him,","the thought of not being able to follow her closely like this anymore, not being able to protect her at the first moment, left a hollow feeling in his heart.","However, he would never refuse the Miss's arrangements.","Finally, he straightened his back and nodded firmly. \"Miss, I will handle the matter properly.\"","Liu Yutong looked at him. Although she also felt somewhat reluctant, she said, \"Go on. The sooner you leave, the sooner you'll return.\"","\"Yes!\"","Yun Cheng added, \"Miss, during my absence, please take extra care of yourself, especially regarding your recent itinerary—safety must be the top priority.\"","Liu Yutong nodded gently. \"I will.\"","Yun Cheng said no more, turned neatly, and left the office.","Yu Xin looked at the closed door and sighed inwardly. \"Brother Yun must be feeling bad.\"","In an instant, a smile appeared on her face. \"Sister Yutong, you're sending Brother Yun out to be a feudal lord, aren't you?\"","Liu Yutong walked to the window, looked down, and saw Yun Cheng drive away in a black car.","\"He can't forever just be my shadow. Let's arrange it this way for now. If he really can't adapt, he can always come back.\"","Actually, she didn't know if what she was doing was right or wrong.","But she had seen the original elders of the Wanlonghui either getting promoted or taking charge of more and more sectors, while only Yun Cheng had almost stayed in place. This wasn't fair to him.","However, what she said earlier was indeed true. With such a large-scale operation suddenly set up in BS Province, she really wouldn't feel at ease sending an ordinary person.","Yu Xin also understood Liu Yutong's thinking and was quite supportive, only...","\"Then, Sister Yutong, with Brother Yun gone, what about your safety? To be honest, with him by your side, we all feel secure.\"","Liu Yutong turned around, looked at her, and smiled faintly. \"We live in a society governed by law now. It's not like there are that many bad people everywhere.\"","As she spoke, she walked gracefully to the sofa and sat down.","\"Wait another ten minutes. Sit down and have a cup of tea.\"","Yu Xin was taken aback but didn't ask further. She just nodded and sat opposite Liu Yutong. With slender hands, she picked up the teapot, poured a cup of clear tea for Liu Yutong, and filled one for herself.","Then the two of them simply chatted.","About a little over ten minutes later, the office door was knocked.","\"Come in.\"","As soon as the words fell, a group of people hurried in.","At the front were Lin Muyang and Yu Mo. Behind them followed a girl, one who seemed naturally cold and aloof.","The girl looked to be in her early twenties, with a slender figure. She wore black athletic wear, her hair in a simple ponytail, and her features were delicate. However, her eyes were extremely indifferent. The whole person gave off the feeling of a shadow with no warmth at all.","After Lin Muyang entered, he pointed to the girl named Lan Die behind him. \"Brought her along for you. The procedures are all in order.\"","Liu Yutong's gaze passed over Lin Muyang and settled on Lan Die. She nodded slightly.","Only when Lan Die saw Liu Yutong did a trace of light appear in her ice-cold eyes. She also nodded slightly as a greeting.","Seeing Lan Die, Yu Xin immediately understood.","She knew this girl's background. She was someone brought back by Hua Muying, had a case on her record, and later, it was Sister Yutong who stepped in, and coupled with her own meritorious service, she obtained parole.","Only, her personality was extremely solitary and cold. She had almost no friends and spent her days either at the boxing gym or training and sparring at the martial arts hall.","Her strength was undoubtedly formidable.","At least within the Wanlonghui, not many could defeat her.","Plus, with her rather inconspicuous appearance and figure, she was indeed a good candidate for a close-protection bodyguard.","Only her loyalty remained questionable.","As soon as Lin Muyang sat down in front of Liu Yutong, he couldn't wait to ask, \"Yutong, that huge movement in the international financial markets a while ago, wildly harvesting tens of billions of US dollars, was that your doing?\"","\"Seriously, I can't think of a second person who could have such incredible skill.\"","Liu Yutong nodded very straightforwardly.","\"It was me.\"","Lin Muyang had only been guessing, but now seeing Liu Yutong admit it so frankly, he was completely floored.","\"It was really you?\"","\"You really scooped over ten billion, in US dollars, from across the ocean? You treated Wall Street like your personal ATM?!\"","\"No, Yutong, you pulled off such a huge deal so quietly without even notifying us. And now, we missed out on hundreds of millions!\"","Liu Yutong: \"I wanted to bring you along, but did you have the money?\"","\"I checked the accounts of Mingzhu City Capital before. There were only a little over twenty million on there. You can't blame me for that, right?\"","Before she decided to enter the market, she had someone pull out all the cash flow from the Wanlonghui Group, and with loans and other miscellaneous funds, she only managed to scrape together 2.3 billion.","With such a big move, Lin Muyang couldn't have been unaware.","It wasn't that she hadn't considered letting Mingzhu Capital contribute some funds. It's just that, apart from Lin Muyang and Yu Mo, the others had invested too little money in the fund.","But it was understandable. Aside from them, few major bosses who joined the Mingzhu Chamber of Commerce had invested funds into Mingzhu City Capital.","Those truly wealthy bosses initially looked down on the chamber of commerce she was building.","Also, both Lin Muyang and Yu Mo's funds were tied up elsewhere. Lin Muyang was frantically acquiring copyrights, leaving almost no room. Yu Mo, because the Yu Group operated on a heavy-asset model, didn't have much readily available cash on the books either. Most importantly, they didn't have Liu Yutong's kind of all-or-nothing courage to empty their coffers for such a venture. That's why they missed this opportunity to make big money.","Hearing Liu Yutong say this, both of them knew they were in the wrong and let out a sigh.","Liu Yutong was well aware they were putting on an act.","These two had come with their own agendas.","She didn't call them out on it, nor did she beat around the bush.","\"Muyang, you've bought quite a few copyrights by now, right? It's time to start assembling a team and build that video streaming platform. Aim for a launch next year. I'll take the lead on funding.\"","\"As for BS province, the Wanlong Hui Group has planned the investment and construction of eleven shopping plazas. I'm handing that project over to the Yu family. Also, there's a property foreclosure auction in Da Nan City the day after tomorrow. You're coming with me.\"","Upon hearing this, the two of them grew excited almost simultaneously.","\"So we can go ahead with the video site now?\"","\"Eleven shopping plazas in BS province? Does that mean I can develop residential buildings in the surrounding areas?\""]},{"number":505,"title":"Chapter 505: 505, Invitation.","paragraphs":["Because of Liu Yutong's one sentence, that acquiring enough copyrights could easily build a film and television company worth tens of billions, Lin Muyang had been buying up copyrights in large quantities since last year.","He now held the copyrights to over eight hundred thousand films and TV dramas, not to mention other online music copyrights.","He had spent almost all his money on this. Not only that, he had also borrowed hundreds of millions from the bank where his mother worked, and that was almost all used up now.","However, as long as Liu Yutong didn't give the word, he could only keep his head down and continue acquiring copyrights.","Moreover, during the acquisition process, he had encountered a competitor.","A company called Leshi was also frantically buying up copyrights, but their moves weren't as big as his, and their efforts weren't as aggressive, so he still held the advantage in terms of the number of copyrights.","In short, he was now considered a leader in the domestic copyright field.","It was just that so far, he hadn't received any arrangements from Liu Yutong regarding the next step. Coupled with the immense financial pressure, this was why he anxiously rushed from Pearl City to find Liu Yutong for clarification.","Now he had finally gotten a definite timeline, and he felt a sense of relief.","Finally, the hard times were about to be over.","Immediately after, the two began discussing the equity distribution for the soon-to-be-established film and television company.","\"Yutong, I've basically bet my entire fortune on the copyrights. I'd like to hear your thoughts on the next steps and how the equity should be arranged.\"","It was quite rare for these words to come from his mouth, clearly different from his previous style.","Perhaps he had also realized that the current Liu Yutong was completely different from before.","In the past, he could consider himself on equal footing with Liu Yutong based on his status, even thinking he was superior at the very beginning.","But now, look at the people in Liu Yutong's circle.","Zhou Muchen, Gu Yebai, Zhu Silin... and so on.","All were top-tier young masters and young ladies whose status far surpassed his.","Lin Muyang looked at Liu Yutong at this moment, and an image of himself squatting at the entrance of the Finance University to give her flowers flashed in his mind.","Thinking back on it now, it seemed somewhat laughable.","But... he didn't regret it.","Liu Yutong was also very direct. With a mindset of keeping clear accounts even between close friends, she directly allocated the shares.","\"For the new company, you will contribute with all your existing copyrights. I will be responsible for all subsequent capital investments, including funds for building the video platform, content production, and operations. For the initial equity distribution, I will take fifty-one percent.\"","This was a controlling stake ratio for a normal company.","Lin Muyang's fingertips tightened slightly.","If it were before, he probably would have jumped up immediately, arrogantly demanding controlling interest.","But now, after a brief silence, he lifted his head and managed a smile that wasn't entirely carefree.","\"Okay! Fifty-one percent, no problem.\"","\"The company's management and decision-making will also be led by you. I'll cooperate.\"","Liu Yutong looked quietly at Lin Muyang. She could clearly feel that a certain balance between them had shifted.","Although he was still her business partner, a partner of Pearl Capital, he was no longer that Lin Muyang who was once high-spirited and everywhere proclaiming he would win her over.","For the first time in a real sense, he had lowered his head before her.","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"I don't have that much time to manage. I'll only be responsible for providing you with strategic direction. The company's daily operations and decision execution will still be fully under your responsibility. You will still be the chairman of the new company.\"","Hearing this, Lin Muyang was slightly taken aback.","He had thought that giving up controlling interest would also mean losing the leading role, but he hadn't expected Liu Yutong to have no intention of seizing power at all.","\"Alright, we'll do it as you say.\"","Liu Yutong continued, \"Since the direction is set, we need to quickly build a core team next. You need to resolve the heads for the three sectors: technology, content, and market as soon as possible. I'll arrange for the funds to be transferred.\"","\"No problem.\"","Lin Muyang thought of something and added, \"That Leshi company, I wonder if you've heard of it, Yutong? I feel this company's philosophy is quite similar to ours and could likely become a formidable rival.\"","\"I've heard of it. A company whose boss likes to talk about dreams.\"","Liu Yutong said calmly, \"But the market is never short of competitors. You focus on building the platform framework first. The copyright library is your confidence, and the funds are mine. Next, we're going to show everyone what it truly means for content to be king!\"","When Lin Muyang heard Liu Yutong's last sentence, his gaze became mesmerized for a moment.","He seemed to see again that girl from last year who first showed her brilliance on the Finance University campus, the one who made his heart flutter at first sight. Only now, she had shed some of her youthful naivety, becoming more mature, powerful, and dazzling!","How could there be such a perfect woman in the world.","After finishing the conversation with Lin Muyang and agreeing with Yu Mo on attending the judicial auction the day after tomorrow, everyone went their separate ways.","Lin Muyang planned to go to Shenzhen in the south to poach some talent to build the platform.","After all, there were more software talents there.","Liu Yutong's heart also stirred slightly. She thought of a very important figure from her past life, a talent who created a national-level social software, Zhang Dalong.","This person might be worth trying to recruit.","Based on the timeline, he should still be in charge of the email project now. It would be two years later that he would officially launch that software which would later have over a billion users, becoming a legend in the industry.","Before leaving, she specifically instructed Lin Muyang to visit this person named Zhang Dalong at the Tencent company when the time came.","As long as they could poach him, money was not an issue. Whatever compensation he wanted, she could afford it. She had that confidence. At this time, even Pony Ma probably couldn't have more cash flow than her.","If they couldn't poach him outright, even just luring him over first would do.","As long as he came, she would handle the rest.","Lin Muyang seriously memorized the name Zhang Dalong and said he would definitely go find this person.","After learning about the project Liu Yutong intended to bid on, Yu Mo also left to make preparations.","Only Liu Yutong, Yu Xin, and Lan Die, who had been standing quietly to the side all along, remained in the room.","Lan Die hadn't sat down since entering the room, always standing quietly by Liu Yutong's side.","It was as if Liu Yutong finally remembered her now. She stood up, turned around, and asked,","\"Lan Die, have you gotten used to being in Pearl City, in the Wanlong Hui, during this time?\"","Lan Die was slightly startled, seemingly not expecting Liu Yutong to suddenly ask her this.","She nodded gently, her voice cool. \"Quite well.\"","\"When Hua Muying recommended you to me, he specifically mentioned your abilities.\"","\"He said you are a person of exceptional perseverance and also particularly hardworking.\"","\"But our Wanlong Hui is not short of people with perseverance and hard work. What we lack are partners we can completely trust.\"","\"I'll be going out of town on business to Yuncheng. During this time, my safety will need someone in charge, but this position is not one just anyone can fill.\" Liu Yutong said seriously.","Lan Die: \"If Miss Liu needs a bodyguard, there are many more suitable candidates in the association.\"","\"No!\"","Liu Yutong gently shook her head. \"I've said before, what I need is more than just a bodyguard. You'll understand in time.\"","Then she extended her hand, offering a sincere invitation. \"Lan Die, your past has made you accustomed to solitude, but I'd like to invite you to try living a different kind of life.\"","Lan Die gazed into Liu Yutong's earnest eyes and finally understood why so many people within the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were utterly devoted to her.","Because only when you stood right before her could you truly feel it—it was genuinely difficult for any normal person not to develop a fondness for her.","Unless, of course, you were her enemy.","After a moment of silence, Lan Die slowly raised her hand and grasped Liu Yutong's, uttering a single word: \"Okay.\""]},{"number":506,"title":"Chapter 506: 506. Humiliating Foreigners","paragraphs":["\"Yu Xin, are we just going to wait for Professor Su here?\"","The place Yu Xin brought Liu Yutong and the others to was an open-air café near the university.","The three of them were currently sitting at a wooden table under a sunshade, surrounded by the aroma of takoyaki and oden.","Next door, there was a very aesthetically decorated dessert shop with a long line, mostly students from the nearby university district.","Liu Yutong also noticed many foreign students of different skin tones.","This alone highlighted the difference between Danan City and Mingzhu City. Mingzhu City was just a third-tier city, not an international metropolis, so it naturally didn't attract many foreigners to study or visit.","Danan City, as a renowned city, clearly had many more exchange students and international students.","As soon as Liu Yutong and her two companions sat down, they saw a few foreigners who had been in line glance their way, chattering away in English.","Especially one blond young man dressed very flamboyantly, who spoke the loudest, as if afraid others couldn't hear him.","Perhaps they instinctively thought they were speaking a foreign language that others wouldn't understand.","But Liu Yutong and Yu Xin understood perfectly.","The gist was something like: these Oriental girls are very pretty, should we invite them out to play later, and so on.","Their tone seemed certain that Liu Yutong and the others wouldn't refuse.","\"Yutong-jie, should I go have some fun with them?\" Yu Xin deliberately smiled at those foreign students and turned to ask Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong knew exactly what she was thinking—nothing more than wanting to deliberately tease those guys and then humiliate them.","\"Forget it, it's better to avoid trouble. We have important business to attend to.\"","She couldn't be bothered to expend energy on such matters right now. Instead, she was very interested in that Professor Su.","And this wasn't because of Yu Xin's confident recommendation.","It was because she had carefully reviewed the resumes. Yun City had recommended five people, plus the teacher recommended by Yu Xin, making a total of six resumes.","Comparing them overall, the Professor Su recommended by Yu Xin did indeed stand out the most on paper.","Since she wasn't planning to return to Mingzhu City for the next couple of days, it was convenient to come take a look.","Yu Xin had the other party's contact information, so she arranged to meet here.","By the way, the other party didn't know Yu Xin's identity; they had just exchanged contact information during a previous academic exchange at the Finance University.","Just as they continued drinking their coffee and waiting, those foreign students, seeing that Liu Yutong and the other two were ignoring them, swaggered over to their table.","The blond young man, hands in the pockets of his ripped jeans, wore a smile he thought was charming and greeted Liu Yutong and the others in awkward Longguo language.","\"Hey! Pretty Longguo ladies, waiting for us? Want to go have a drink together? I know a great bar nearby.\"","However, Liu Yutong and the others remained unmoved.","Seeing this, a shorter, brown-haired guy among them deliberately said, \"Forget it, Hawke, they look too shy. I bet they don't dare go out with us.\"","The blond young man named Hawke shrugged. \"Come on, everyone knows these Oriental women pretend to be pure and reserved on the surface, but actually... heh, they're wilder and more open than anyone!\"","\"That's right!\"","\"Stop pretending, come with us, we promise you an unforgettable night!\"","\"Hahaha...\"","They bantered about Liu Yutong and the others, thinking themselves humorous as they high-fived each other and laughed heartily.","Liu Yutong still showed no expression, idly stirring her coffee with a spoon.","Lan Die was much the same, her face cold and unapproachable.","Instead, it was Yu Xin who actively turned around to look at these foreigners.","Although she had already mentally sentenced these foreigners to death, on the surface, she put on an expression as if she had heard something interesting, her smile becoming increasingly charming and captivating.","First, she made a sound of surprise (\"Huh?\"), then propped one elbow on the table, her slender fingers slightly curled, using her fingertips to slowly tap her own smooth, delicate cheek, putting on an act of innocence mixed with a hint of seduction.","Her posture was very much like that of an inexperienced young girl, easily giving people the illusion that she would be easy to get.","\"An unforgettable night?\"","\"That sounds really interesting.\" Yu Xin said in fluent foreign language.","Hawke and his companions' eyes instantly lit up upon hearing this, thinking to themselves, \"See, I knew they were just pretending.\"","\"These Oriental chicks are so easy to fool.\"","Hawke simply plopped down in the empty seat next to Yu Xin, his words becoming more and more explicit.","\"Of course it's interesting. Oriental girls like you don't usually get to meet real, capable men from the West like us.\"","\"You should consider yourselves lucky to have met us.\"","\"Come on, don't hesitate, let's go have a drink.\"","The smile on Yu Xin's face grew even sweeter, and then she deliberately retorted in a mixed foreign language combining elements.","\"Drink your mother's head!\"","\"WOW! YOU guys' confidence is really TOO big, is your skin made of titanium alloy? SO thick!\"","\"I think you guys are NO ZUO NO DIE, WHY YOU TRY?\"","Hawke and the others were immediately stunned, completely not understanding.","What on earth was that?","Before they could figure out what Yu Xin meant, she spread her hands and continued, \"Invite US? SOrry, we're not interested in monkeys!\"","\"Hurry up and GET OUT. Keep yapping, and I'll make you all FLY IN THE SKY!\"","As soon as she said this, except for Hawke and his still-confused friends, everyone around who heard couldn't hold back and burst out laughing.","Fly in the sky? What fly in the sky?","But even if Hawke and the others didn't fully understand, seeing the mocking looks from the surrounding bystanders and Yu Xin's clearly taunting expression, they realized.","They had been made monkeys of and humiliated by this girl.","Hawke pointed at Yu Xin, angrily saying, \"YOU, HOW dare YOU...\"","Yu Xin couldn't be bothered to waste more words on them. She parted her red lips and made an internationally understood mouth shape.","\"Gǔn!\" (Scram!)","\"FUCK OFF!\"","Hawke had never suffered such an insult, especially since coming to Longguo, where he had always felt a sense of superiority and had never been humiliated like this.","Even abroad, he was usually arrogant and domineering because he was the son of a certain gang boss.","Anyone who dared to talk back to him like that basically wouldn't see the next sunrise; he'd have them taken out directly.","Unfortunately, this was Longguo. He couldn't get weapons here, nor could he take people out.","Although starting a physical fight wasn't advisable, it didn't mean they would let it go.","Just as they were about to settle the score with Yu Xin, a police car stopped nearby, and several patrolling officers got out.","These guys immediately chickened out, cursed \"FUCK,\" and turned to leave."]},{"number":507,"title":"Chapter 507: 507. A Chance Encounter with a High School Classmate.","paragraphs":["Watching the retreating, disheveled backs of Hawke and his companions, Yu Xin curled her lip and turned back around.","\"What a buzzkill, wasting our time for nothing. I really thought he'd dare to hit me.\"","Liu Yutong glanced in the direction where the foreign youths had disappeared and offered a bland assessment: \"They're nothing but clowns.\"","Although those foreign men were tall and burly, the three women weren't necessarily afraid of them.","After over a year of training and guidance from several masters, Liu Yutong's skills were quite formidable, though she had never truly fought anyone—there was never a need.","The training was for self-defense, not to prove a point.","Although Yu Xin had trained a bit less, she still had the ability to protect herself, not to mention Lan Die, who was always ready to step in.","Moreover, their ages and appearances were highly deceptive, easily lulling others into a false sense of security.","A moment's carelessness, and someone would end up eating dust.","This minor incident didn't affect the trio.","Yu Xin took out her phone, made a call, and said to Liu Yutong, \"Teacher Su will be here soon.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, then asked the server for another iced Americano.","Not long after.","A waitress who had just started her shift brought over an iced Americano.","\"Here's your iced Americano, miss.\"","\"Thank you!\"","As the waitress set down the coffee and prepared to leave with her tray, she paused for a moment upon looking up.","\"Yu Xin?\"","\"Liu Yutong?\"","Liu Yutong and Yu Xin looked up simultaneously at the girl wearing a cap and an apron.","\"Fang Yaqiong?\"","\"What a coincidence, do you work here?\"","Fang Yaqiong was their high school classmate. They had gotten together once after graduation.","Back then, in Wushui County, they had a conflict with the local hoodlum Crazy Dog Brother and almost got into serious trouble at a KTV.","A year had passed in the blink of an eye, and so much had changed.","Now, Liu Yutong was the chairwoman of several companies, managing billions in capital, and Yu Xin had become an executive at the Wanlonghui Group.","Though only nineteen, they were noticeably more mature than their peers, unlike their high school classmate Fang Yaqiong, whose face still bore the youthful innocence of adolescence.","Fang Yaqiong seemed a bit embarrassed, instinctively tugging at her apron with the shop's logo. \"Yeah, I work here part-time while studying. I'm at Nan Da Normal University, it's close by.\"","As she spoke, her eyes swept over Liu Yutong and Yu Xin.","Her two former classmates were clearly around the same age, yet they gave off a completely different vibe.","Yu Xin, once a very introverted girl, now appeared poised and graceful. The clothes she wore were obviously expensive.","Liu Yutong was even more remarkable. She carried an undeniable, powerful aura—calm, composed, as if everything was under her control.","It was a quality Fang Yaqiong had never seen in any of the students around her.","\"What about you guys? Here in Da Nancheng for fun?\" Fang Yaqiong asked curiously.","Yu Xin and Liu Yutong exchanged a knowing look. \"You could say that. We're here to take care of some business and meet a friend.\"","Fang Yaqiong uttered an \"Oh,\" looking at the two extraordinary figures before her and comparing them to her own situation as a working student. A subtle sense of distance inexplicably arose in her heart.","She felt that Yu Xin and Liu Yutong had both changed so much. She couldn't pinpoint exactly how, but it felt like they were no longer from the same world as her.","\"Well, you two enjoy your drinks. I have to get back to work.\"","\"Alright, go ahead.\" Liu Yutong smiled and nodded.","Watching Fang Yaqiong hurry away with her tray, Yu Xin sipped her coffee, a trace of imperceptible emotion in her tone. \"Fang Yaqiong still seems quite innocent.\"","Saying this, she seemed to recall her high school self—that introverted, timid, shy, and cowardly girl.","It wasn't until Liu Yutong stepped in to teach the school bully Zhao Zhu a lesson, and until she herself had faced death, that she slowly began to change.","Hearing this, Liu Yutong turned her head to look at Yu Xin and teased, \"We're only nineteen, why do you sound so world-weary?\"","Yu Xin first pouted and laughed at Liu Yutong's words.","\"Not at all!\"","Then she composed herself, looked seriously at Liu Yutong, and said what she had long wanted to say: \"Sister Yutong, really, thank you.\"","That \"thank you\" contained so much.","Thanks for stepping in to help back on campus, thanks for leading her out of the gloom, thanks for giving her a completely different future full of infinite possibilities.","Without Liu Yutong, perhaps she would still be that timid, introverted girl, easily bullied, with no chance of having the life she had today.","Liu Yutong naturally understood the meaning behind her words. She just smiled gently, saying nothing more. Some things were understood without words.","Lan Die sat quietly to the side, watching the genuine affection between Liu Yutong and Yu Xin. A faint ripple stirred unexpectedly in her heart.","The feeling was strange, like someone who had long dwelled in darkness catching a glimpse of a warm campfire. Knowing it didn't belong to her, yet instinctively wanting to draw closer.","Truth be told, it was precisely because the environment she grew up in was filled with schemes, survival of the fittest, and absolute obedience, devoid of experiences like friendship or familial love, that forged her current icy demeanor.","She couldn't fully comprehend how bonds like the one between Liu Yutong and Yu Xin were formed, but the scene before her seemed to confirm what Liu Yutong had once told her.","\"What I need isn't just a bodyguard, but a partner.\"","Perhaps this was what it should be like between partners?","This thought flashed through Lan Die's mind only briefly before she quickly reined in her emotions, minimizing her presence once again.","Meanwhile, Fang Yaqiong, busy working not far away, perhaps excited from seeing her old classmates, kept glancing toward Liu Yutong's table even as she worked.","Just as Fang Yaqiong was carrying a coffee to deliver to a table inside the cafe, an accident happened.","The customers at that table were none other than Hawke and his group, who had returned.","Fang Yaqiong carefully carried the tray, about to set it down, when the shorter, brown-haired guy deliberately shifted his body, his arm bumping backward \"unintentionally.\"","\"Ah!\" Fang Yaqiong exclaimed as coffee spilled from the tray.","At the same moment, she could clearly feel a lecherous hand groping her buttock forcefully.","\"Ah!\"","Fang Yaqiong jumped back like a startled rabbit, her face instantly flushing crimson, looking at the foreign exchange students with a mixture of shame and anger.","\"Oh, sorry, it wasn't on purpose.\"","Hawke and the others offered an apology on the surface, but the smirking, laughing expressions on their faces showed they weren't sincere.","By the time Liu Yutong and the others noticed the commotion in the cafe, the situation had already escalated further."]},{"number":508,"title":"Chapter 508: 508, Conflict Erupts Again.","paragraphs":["\"It's her! She was the one staring at me, giving me signals, and even deliberately spilled her coffee to get closer to us. And now she claims we harassed her? Absolutely ridiculous!\"","The foreign students who worked out with Hawke also started shouting.","\"That's right, Hawke, we all saw it.\"","\"That girl was definitely sneaking glances at you earlier.\"","\"She was trying to get your attention, wasn't she?\"","They echoed each other, twisting the truth, aiming to paint Fang Yaqiong as a scheming girl who tried and failed to seduce foreign guys and then falsely accused them.","Fang Yaqiong was trembling with anger. \"You're lying! It was you who bumped into me and touched me.\"","\"Proof?\"","Hawke spread his hands, wearing an expression of both innocence and arrogance. \"Don't you Eastern girls like guys like us? If you wanted to chat me up, you should have just said so. Why play these games?\"","His words were incredibly provocative and insulting.","Some students around them, either unaware of the truth or already harboring some prejudice, began pointing fingers and whispering about Fang Yaqiong.","\"Some girls these days really have no shame.\"","\"So desperate to latch onto a foreigner?\"","\"What an embarrassment...\"","\"...\"","Isolated and helpless, confronted by the pointing fingers of the crowd and the smug looks of Hawke and his friends, Fang Yaqiong's eyes welled up with tears of grievance.","Just then, a woman in her twenties wearing black-framed glasses walked over.","She was precisely the Teacher Su that Yu Xin and Liu Yutong were waiting for—Su Mansu.","She had just arrived at the agreed spot when she witnessed this scene. Hearing Hawke's nonsense, she couldn't help but frown tightly.","Su Mansu was famously a thorny teacher at the school. Extremely capable, she was also known for her upright character and her intolerance of injustice.","Whenever she encountered unfairness, even knowing it might bring her trouble, she would never stand idly by.","Some said she was inflexible, too naive, but those who knew her understood—this was Su Mansu, a righteous idealist.","In her heart, right was right, and wrong was wrong. There was never any gray area.","Seeing Fang Yaqiong on the verge of tears, Su Mansu went straight up to Hawke and his group, questioning them in fluent English. \"What's going on here? Why are you bullying someone?\"","\"Which school are you from? What are your names?!\"","Hawke clearly didn't take Su Mansu seriously, answering flippantly, \"Who are you? Mind your own business. And get your facts straight—she was harassing us. How is that us bullying her?\"","Containing her anger, Su Mansu demanded again, \"Which school are you from? Your names? Judging by your appearance, you should be exchange students, right? With behavior this improper, I will definitely report you to your school, have disciplinary marks placed on your records, and have your exchange qualifications revoked!\"","\"Disciplinary marks? Revoked qualifications? Hahahaha...\" Hawke and the others burst into laughter as if they'd heard the biggest joke.","\"Who are you trying to scare? We're exchange students at Nan Cheng University. Go ahead and report us if you dare!\"","\"Some random nobody, really thinks she's something.\"","Hearing they were actually exchange students at her own university, Su Mansu's face instantly darkened.","At that moment.","A slightly portly middle-aged man who happened to be passing by hurried over upon hearing the commotion. He was a minor administrator at Su Mansu's university.","\"What's all this noise? What kind of scene is this!\"","Su Mansu obviously knew him. She immediately stepped forward and succinctly explained the situation, emphasizing Hawke and his group's terrible attitude and the need for serious consequences.","The administrator glanced at Hawke and his friends, then at the isolated and helpless Fang Yaqiong; a look of awkwardness crossed his face. He pulled Su Mansu aside.","\"Teacher Su, consider the implications. These international exchange students are related to the university's international reputation and cooperative programs. Without solid evidence, don't jump to conclusions, and certainly don't rashly talk about disciplinary marks or revoking qualifications. Let's just drop this, alright?\"","\"Drop it? This is molestation and slander! How can we just drop it?!\"","Su Mansu never expected a university administrator to take such a muddling, appeasing stance, even showing partiality toward the foreign students. She grew even angrier.","\"Fine. Since you won't handle it, I'll call the police. At the same time, I will file a formal complaint with the university's disciplinary committee. I believe the truth won't change just because of a few foreigners.\"","\"Are you insane? Do you know how badly this could reflect on the university?\"","The administrator warned, \"You need to remember you're also a teacher at Nan Da. Have you considered the consequences of doing this?\"","\"Consequences! I'll bear any consequences!\"","Su Mansu's stance was extremely firm. \"And let me tell you, the bad reputation isn't created by the victim, but by people like you who condone wrongdoing!\"","\"You...\"","\"Well said!\"","Before the administrator could finish, a cool, clear female voice suddenly sounded from the entrance.","Everyone turned to look.","Three girls with exceptional figures and presence stood at the entrance.","It was precisely Liu Yutong and her two friends.","Liu Yutong glanced calmly at the administrator, then looked at Su Mansu, a slight smile curling at the corner of her lips.","\"Teacher Su is right. Upholding justice should never be seen as causing trouble. The real trouble is condoning evil and the inaction that chills the hearts of victims.\"","Perhaps due to the powerful aura she naturally carried, the students who had been whispering and pointing moments ago instantly fell silent.","Seeing it was Liu Yutong and her friends again, Hawke flared up. Feeling emboldened by the administrator's apparent bias, his arrogance returned.","\"What's this got to do with you? Fuck off!\"","As he spoke, he impulsively stepped forward, raising his hand as if to push Liu Yutong.","At the very moment his arm lifted.","Lan Die, who had been silent until now, moved.","Her movements were incredibly fast.","Just as Hawke's hand was about to touch Liu Yutong, Lan Die stepped swiftly between them.","To an outsider, it looked like Hawke was trying to push Liu Yutong roughly, and Lan Die had stepped forward to block him in order to protect her.","However, the result was...","Thud!","A dull sound.","Lan Die's elbow struck the nerve on Hawke's arm with precise, ruthless accuracy, while her foot subtly hooked his ankle.","\"Ah!\"","Hawke let out a sharp cry as his entire arm instantly went numb and weak. Immediately afterward, his hefty body lost its balance and he crashed heavily onto the floor with a thud, his chin striking the tiles. He howled in pain.","Having done all this, Lan Die deliberately staggered back a few steps and was caught just in time by Yu Xin.","She looked as if she had been shoved and was frightened.","\"Hawke!\"","\"Are you okay?\"","His companions exclaimed, rushing to help him up.","Yu Xin immediately embraced her inner drama queen, supporting Lan Die, and angrily scolded the howling Hawke on the ground and his friends.","\"Did everyone see that? First, he harassed Miss Fang, and now he tried to lay hands on us girls, assaulting us in public! Is this what these so-called international exchange students are like? Are you all just going to stand by and watch outsiders bully us?!\"","With those words, the situation completely tilted in their favor.","The students who had gathered to watch had witnessed Hawke's failed attempt at violence and his subsequent fall—that's exactly how it appeared to them. Seeing that Lan Die and the others had almost been bullied by the other party, their righteous indignation flared up instantly.","\"Whoa! Is this foreigner trying to stage a fake accident?\"","\"Exactly! The young lady was standing there without moving a muscle, and he's the one who took a nosedive!\"","\"These foreigners are utterly lawless!\"","\"Daring to hit girls from our Dragon Kingdom right in front of so many people? How arrogant!\"","\"Get out of our school! Get out of the Dragon Kingdom!\"","\".........\"","Public sentiment was furious, with all accusations pointed squarely at Hawke and his companions.","The school administrator's face turned completely dark.","This time, it had happened under the watchful eyes of the crowd. The evidence was clear and undeniable—at least from their perspective. He couldn't find any excuse to gloss over the matter or muddle through."]},{"number":509,"title":"Chapter 509: 509. The newcomer is not to be trifled with.","paragraphs":["In the end, those foreigners were taken away by the police officers, including the passing school administrator and Fang Yaqiong, who also went along to give statements.","After all, the incident had caused quite a stir, so some explanation was necessary.","\"Thank you!\" Su Mansu expressed her gratitude.","\"You're welcome!\" Liu Yutong said.","Yu Xin: \"Teacher Su, don't you remember me?\"","Only then did Su Mansu realize, mainly because she had been utterly furious earlier.","\"Yu Xin, oh my, look at my memory. Last time I went to your university for an exchange, you were the one who received me, right? Thank you.\"","Then she looked at Liu Yutong and Lan Die: \"Are these two your classmates?\"","Before Yu Xin could introduce them, Liu Yutong smiled gently and extended her hand: \"Teacher Su, I've long heard of you. The way you stood up for what's right earlier was truly admirable.\"","Su Mansu shook her hand, her tone carrying a hint of helplessness: \"I'm afraid I embarrassed myself. Actually, this kind of thing isn't the first time it's happened. Last time, there was an issue over dormitory assignments. It's just that often, like just now, things get suppressed in the name of 'the bigger picture'.\"","\"Never mind, let's not talk about it. Yu Xin, where's the boss you mentioned on the phone that you found for me?\"","Although she hadn't met Yu Xin many times, they got along very well, mainly because Yu Xin's way of speaking really clicked with her.","Previously, she had confided online to Yu Xin about her dissatisfaction with her current job. Unexpectedly, Yu Xin proactively offered to introduce her to an absolutely fantastic boss.","Initially, Su Mansu thought Yu Xin was joking, but then Yu Xin actually came all the way to Danan City to contact her.","Yu Xin pointed at Liu Yutong: \"Well, she's right here in front of you.\"","Su Mansu: \"???\"","She had originally thought these two were Yu Xin's classmates, but it seemed she was mistaken.","This girl, who looked even a few years younger than her, was actually an entrepreneur? That was indeed surprising.","Liu Yutong: \"Let me formally introduce myself. Liu Yutong, Chairman of the Wanlonghui Group.\"","\"Teacher Su, I've seen your resume. The paper you wrote during your tenure at Nan University, 'Conjectures on Consumption Reform in the Next Decade,' left a deep impression on me.\"","Su Mansu had originally thought Liu Yutong was just a small boss of a startup, but when she heard the term \"Group,\" she was taken aback again.","Generally speaking, only companies with at least several thousand employees and assets in the hundreds of millions or even billions dare to call themselves a \"Group,\" right?","This young woman was the chairman of a group enterprise?","How impressive!","Since childhood, Su Mansu had always been called a genius, and there were very few among her peers who could earn her admiration. She never expected to meet one right here.","Even if the other party had inherited the company, that was still incredibly impressive.","Most people wouldn't dare to let their children take over so early.","Also, the name \"Wanlonghui\" sounded a bit odd to her. It didn't sound like a company name led by a woman at all; it sounded more like a... society name.","But she didn't dwell on it. After reining in her surprise, her expression became noticeably more formal.","\"I didn't expect Chairman Liu to pay such attention to me. I'm honored.\"","Liu Yutong: \"To be frank, after reviewing your information, I think you could try the position of Assistant to the Chairman.\"","\"At the very least, at Wanlonghui, you wouldn't need to worry so much, especially about having to swallow your pride in front of outsiders.\"","Su Mansu seemed to understand her meaning. Moreover, the other party clearly knew her personality was quite straightforward, yet still said this. It seemed this Wanlonghui Group might truly be a good place to go.","Unlike her current teaching profession, where everything requires layer upon layer of approval, seniority matters, and considering the overall situation...","Just like today, clearly the other party started the trouble, yet they were always told to bear it silently. Sometimes she really felt stifled.","This was also one of the reasons she wanted to resign.","Just as she was pondering and weighing her options,","Yu Xin gave a helpful push: \"Teacher Su, you have to trust my judgment. Sister Yutong is absolutely a great boss. Trying it out won't be a loss.\"","Upon hearing this, Su Mansu took a deep breath, looked at Liu Yutong, and asked the question she cared about most.","\"Wanlonghui... is it legitimate?\"","The question was so abrupt that it nearly left Liu Yutong and the others speechless.","She had thought Su Mansu might ask about the position, salary, and benefits. She never expected this question at all.","Could it be that she was wrong to let Ma Da come up with the name \"Wanlonghui\" back then?","Actually, many people had asked this question, and it always left her at a loss for words.","Wanlonghui is such a large group; how could it not be legitimate?","Yu Xin couldn't help but laugh: \"Oh, my dear Teacher Su, you're too adorable! Our Wanlonghui is of course a legitimate company! We pay taxes according to the law, provide full social security and housing fund, and are a large group with nearly ten thousand employees. How could we not be legitimate?\"","\"Sorry, sorry.\"","Su Mansu said somewhat apologetically: \"It's mainly that your company's name is indeed a bit unique. And I personally don't want to have any involvement with... societies.\"","She herself was quite straightforward and hated injustice, so naturally, she didn't want to join some society without understanding it clearly.","That's why she couldn't help but ask that somewhat abrupt question earlier.","\"Understood. But I can assure you, Wanlonghui is indeed a legitimate and compliant, proper company,\" Liu Yutong said.","Su Mansu nodded: \"Then I'll give it a try. Thank you for giving me this opportunity.\"","Actually, with her qualifications, it wasn't that she didn't have chances to apply for positions like Assistant to the Chairman or Executive Assistant at other major companies.","But she chose the company recommended by Yu Xin so readily precisely because the new boss was a woman, and a very young and beautiful one at that.","In the future, facing such a young female boss would surely be much better than dealing with those pot-bellied middle-aged men, right?","Liu Yutong extended her hand: \"Welcome to Wanlonghui!\"","Yu Xin also said happily: \"Welcome Teacher Su to Wanlonghui!\"","Although Su Mansu was already certain they weren't lying, for some reason, she felt deep down as if she had boarded a shady ship. It was a strange feeling.","To celebrate Su Mansu joining, Liu Yutong decided to treat everyone to a meal. Actually, this also showed she really didn't put on airs normally.","Otherwise, she wouldn't have proactively come to find Su Mansu; she would have waited for her to come for an interview.","Perhaps this was because Wanlonghui's origins were slightly... grassroots. Everyone was used to addressing each other as brothers and sisters, without deliberately enforcing that strict workplace hierarchy.","So she seemed quite approachable.","Liu Yutong and the other three found a well-reviewed food stall near the university for a meal.","It was a joint decision, as it would be convenient to go shopping after eating.","But before they could finish their meal and leave, they ran into Hawke and his group again, and this time they had brought a bunch of local troublemakers as backup.","The expression on Liu Yutong's face turned cold: \"Is there no end to this?\""]},{"number":510,"title":"Chapter 510: 510: Three Women with Drastically Changed Auras.","paragraphs":["\"These guys are clearly up to no good!\"","Yu Xin's eyes sparkled, not with fear, but with a surge of eager excitement.","Liu Yutong wiped the corner of her mouth with a napkin, her expression seeming to show she didn't take the dozen or so men opposite them seriously at all.","Lan Die also quietly felt for the dagger in her sleeve, ready to strike at any moment.","Su Mansu, however, was somewhat more nervous. On their side, there were only four women. Opposite them, counting Hawke and those other foreigners plus the seven or eight thugs with dragons and tigers tattooed on their arms, there were over a dozen people. In a real fight, it looked like a lost cause no matter how you sliced it.","What surprised her most was that Hawke and his crew had gotten out of jail so quickly.","Liu Yutong and the others also found it suspicious, guessing they had probably paid for bail. Otherwise, by normal procedure, they should have been detained for at least a few days.","They might have also used their status as foreigners to go through special channels.","But to seek revenge the moment they got out... that was a bit too hasty. Could it be that these foreigners were all so petty?","Su Mansu's heart beat faster and faster. She took a deep breath, made up her mind, stepped forward, and spread her arms, shielding the other three.","\"Boss, this started because of me. I can't let you get involved. You should leave, quickly. I... I'll hold them off. I'm a teacher at the school, they wouldn't dare do anything to me...\"","Before Su Mansu could finish her sentence, she heard the sound of shoes hitting the ground behind her.","She instinctively turned her head and saw Liu Yutong take off the black stiletto heels she was wearing today and casually toss them aside.","Yu Xin did the same, and she even somehow produced an expandable baton, flicking it open with a shua sound.","The most outrageous was Lan Die.","Lan Die silently and swiftly gathered her long hair, securing it into a simple bun using just a single chopstick.","Then, as if by magic, she flipped out two daggers with one hand, her eyes suddenly turning cold, carrying a faint, almost imperceptible aura of killing intent.","At that moment, the aura of the three women underwent a dramatic transformation.","Their usual air of being students or corporate executives vanished completely, replaced by the feel of tough, seasoned fighters ready to charge into battle.","The sheer contrast left Su Mansu stunned. Comparing them to the approaching gang of hoodlums, she felt like a naive innocent who had accidentally stumbled into a gang war.","Liu Yutong smiled at her: \"Mansu, don't be nervous. This will be over soon.\"","Yu Xin chimed in: \"Yeah, Mansu-jie, just stand behind us and watch. There's no need to be afraid of a little scene like this.\"","Su Mansu: \"...\"","That's more like it!","Suddenly, it all made sense!","What happened to the proper, legitimate group company?","This presence of yours, this combat-ready reaction... you all look more professional than that gang of hoodlums over there!","\"It's them! Fuck! It's these women who made me lose face!\" Hawke pointed at Liu Yutong and the others, speaking in broken Mandarin to a greasy-looking man leading the group who wore a thick gold chain.","The man had a toothpick in his mouth. His gaze swept over Liu Yutong, Yu Xin, and the others, and he grinned, revealing a mouthful of yellow teeth.","\"Young Master Hawke, these delicate little girls took you down? You foreigners are too damn useless! But then... these chicks really aren't bad looking.\"","\"Oho... taking their shoes off? Planning to fight us?\"","\"Hahaha...\"","The thugs behind the man burst into laughter, clearly thinking the girls on the other side were overestimating themselves.","\"Scram! All of you, get lost! Don't get in the way here!\"","\"...\"","Seeing the situation turning ugly, the street food stall owner and the other customers quickly moved away, afraid of getting caught in the crossfire.","A fight was imminent.","Liu Yutong looked at Hawke: \"What, didn't get enough of a lesson earlier?\"","Hawke, emboldened by his backup, laughed arrogantly: \"Fuck! The cops were around earlier. Now, let's see who can help you. You dare make me lose so much face? If I don't make you get on your knees and beg me today, my name isn't Hawke!\"","\"Oh?\"","Liu Yutong raised a delicate eyebrow slightly: \"Causing trouble on Chinese soil? It seems you really don't know the harsh realities of the world.\"","\"And you all,\" she continued, her gaze shifting to the thugs, \"are you sure you want to back him up? If you leave now, I might let you off. Otherwise, you'll bear the consequences!\"","Her words were spoken lightly, yet carried an inexplicable chill.","The lead thug was provoked by Liu Yutong's tone. He stepped forward, pointing a steel pipe at her. \"Little lady, quite the attitude you've got! I wasn't born yesterday. Be smart, apologize nicely to our Young Master Hawke, then have a few drinks with us brothers, and we'll call it even today! Otherwise...\"","He didn't finish, but the threat was obvious.","\"Otherwise what?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Lan Die, who had been almost like a ghost until now, suddenly had killing intent flash in her eyes. She looked at the leader as if he were already a dead man.","The bald thug felt an inexplicable twinge of fear under Lan Die's gaze, but relying on their numbers and the fact their opponents were just a few seemingly frail women, he didn't pay it much mind. \"Otherwise, don't blame us brothers for not knowing how to be gentle with the fairer sex!\"","Thud!","The moment the lead thug finished his threat, the sinister grin on his face froze instantly.","He slowly lowered his head to look at his left shoulder.","There, a delicately crafted dagger had somehow appeared. The blade was completely buried in his deltoid muscle, leaving only the black hilt protruding, trembling slightly.","Strangely, the wound didn't bleed immediately, and he didn't even feel pain.","\"Huh?\"","\"What is this?\"","The thugs beside him were stunned for a moment, then one of them instinctively reached out to touch it.","\"Boss, it's a knife. Looks like it's stuck in there.\"","As he spoke, this underling actually instinctively grabbed the hilt and shua—pulled it out.","Thug Boss: \"???\"","He stared blankly at the small hole in his shoulder that suddenly began to gush blood, then looked at the still-dripping dagger in his underling's hand. His brain seemed to short-circuit for a few seconds.","Then, a pig-slaughtering scream erupted.","\"OW! OW! OW!\"","\"My arm! My arm! It fucking hurts!\"","\"You idiot! Who the hell told you to pull it out!!!\"","\"Sorry! Sorry, boss! I'll put it back right now!\"","\"Hey... don't!\"","The lead thug tried to stop him, but it was too late.","Thud!","The blond underling, with precise technique, inserted the dagger back into the exact same spot. To prevent it from falling out again, he even gave it an extra push.","The world seemed to stand still for a moment.","The expression on the lead thug's face shifted from twisted pain to bewilderment, then to a kind of indescribable collapse.","He looked down again at the dagger that had returned and was now embedded even deeper in his shoulder, then looked up at the underling before him, and instantly lost it.","\"Fuck your grandmother! You're done following me! I don't have a brother as stupid as you!\" he yelled, kicking the underling and sending him sprawling.","After the younger thug scrambled up from the pain, he looked aggrieved and said to another stunned gangster beside him, \"Third Brother, look at the boss. I helped him put it back in, so why is he even angrier?\"","The gangster called Third Brother twitched his mouth uncontrollably upon hearing this and silently took two steps away from this idiot teammate.","The boss was right; this guy really couldn't be kept around. Keeping him would be nothing but trouble sooner or later!"]},{"number":511,"title":"Chapter 511: 511: Women Who Overturn Conventional Beliefs.","paragraphs":["Hawke and his foreign companions stared, their jaws practically hitting the ground.","This was nothing like the Dragon Country gangsters they had imagined!","They completely lacked the imposing aura of foreign gangs, instead looking like a bunch of clowns.","\"FUCK! You idiots! What are you standing around for? Get them!\"","Hawke, having snapped out of it, roared at the remaining thugs who were also a bit dazed.","The thugs finally came to their senses. Even though their boss looked ridiculous, they were paid to do a job. Gritting their teeth, they charged forward.","The battle officially began!","What followed completely overturned Su Mansu's understanding of these three girls, who were close to her in age.","Liu Yutong, barefoot, gripped the wooden stick she had picked up, ready for a fight.","When a thug charged at her, she simply sidestepped slightly and thrust the stick forward, hitting him squarely in the armpit.","\"Oww!\"","The thug instantly stiffened as if electrocuted. Before he could recover, Liu Yutong brought the stick down on his face, knocking him out.","Then, with a flick of her wrist, she jabbed the stick backward, poking another thug who was trying to sneak up from behind right in the navel.","\"Ugh!\"","The thug immediately doubled over like a shrimp, clutching his stomach as he fell to his knees, gasping for air.","Meanwhile, Lan Die stayed close to Liu Yutong's side, protecting her from any threats.","Compared to Liu Yutong's seemingly effortless style, Lan Die's fighting method was shockingly brutal.","Holding another dagger, Lan Die met the charging thugs head-on. Her fighting style was simple and direct, with almost no wasted movement. Every strike temporarily incapacitated a thug.","Some had the tendons in their wrists severed by her; others clutched their bleeding arms, howling in pain as they crumpled to the ground.","Compared to their side, Yu Xin's area was a bit more... entertaining.","She was the busiest one on the field, specializing in attacks below the belt and other... unconventional spots.","The telescopic baton in her hand was like an extension of her will.","\"Whack-a-mole time!\"","Yu Xin shouted, her baton thwacking and cracking against the thugs' ankles and the sides of their knees.","\"Yow! My kneecap!\"","\"My foot's gone numb! Numb!\"","\"Ouch, ouch, ouch, that hurts...\"","One thug tried to grab her from the side when she wasn't looking. Yu Xin dropped into a low slide—yes, a slide tackle!","Not only did she dodge the sneak attack, but her baton also managed to give the thug's backside a solid whack on the way.","\"Smack!\"","\"AHHH!!!\"","The thug grabbed his butt and jumped straight up. He lost his balance upon landing, landing hard on his rear end again, grimacing in pain.","Yu Xin looked at the thug who had tried to ambush her, put her hands on her hips, and quipped, \"Not bad back there, but too fragile!\"","Then, taking advantage of a lull in the attacks, she pulled out her phone and pretended to film.","\"Can you believe it, folks? Ran into a bunch of losers today who insisted on performing spontaneous splits...\"","In less than three minutes, the fight was over.","All six or seven thugs were lying on the ground in various bizarre positions.","Especially their leader with the dagger in his shoulder, who had already passed out from the pain. Only Hawke and his foreign companions remained, staring dumbfounded at these three Dragon Country women.","One foreigner couldn't help but stick out a thumb: \"Dragon Country Kung Fu, awesome!!!\"","Liu Yutong casually tossed the stick aside, found a stool to sit on, retrieved her shoes, and put them back on.","Yu Xin, not quite satisfied, retracted her baton, clapped her hands, and mocked, \"Six or seven grown men, and you can't even take a hit? How boring! Remember to bring more people next time!\"","Lan Die had already neatly re-done her hair. She walked over to the unconscious leader, cleanly pulled out her dagger and put it away, then returned to Liu Yutong's side, reverting to her usual silent, aloof demeanor.","Su Mansu, who had watched the whole fight without getting involved, stood there with her mouth agape. She looked at her three companions, then at the thugs scattered across the ground, nursing their wounds. Only one thought remained in her mind.","\"Just what kind of company did I join? Or did I join some kind of... organization?\"","\"Is everyone here this good at fighting?\"","As she was lost in thought, Yu Xin walked over. \"Sister Mansu, weren't you scared? Don't worry, we were acting in self-defense. It's legal!\"","\"Even if we had finished them off, it would've been fine.\"","Su Mansu: \"...\"","Well, she supposed that was true. A dozen men trying to bully a few women—under normal circumstances, that justified unlimited self-defense. She knew that even without studying law.","It was just the outcome that was...","Liu Yutong walked up to Hawke, who was petrified with fear.","\"So, do you still need us to kneel and beg you?\"","Hawke shuddered, almost dropping to his knees on the spot, and hurriedly apologized: \"NO! NO! SOrry! I'm SO SOrry!\"","\"........\"","Just as Liu Yutong and the others had finished dealing with the thugs and were about to settle accounts with Hawke and his group...","In a nearby alley.","A group of thugs with green-dyed hair, wearing matching tight green outfits, sat slumped on the ground like beaten dogs.","After confirming no one was chasing them, their leader, a thug with a \"Heavenly Eye\" tattoo on his forehead, couldn't hold back his curses.","\"Damn it! Lost our turf!\"","\"Goddamn it, those Southern District bastards have no honor either. They brought over a hundred guys to smash our place, and even chased us down.\"","\"Count them. How many brothers do we have left?\"","A lackey finished counting and reported, still panting heavily.","\"Heavenly Eye Bro, c-count's clear. Less than twenty.\"","\"Five or six went down during the chaos. We lost another four or five while running. The rest... three ran until they got side stitches and are puking back there.\"","Liu Hao looked at the sorry state of his hard-earned Heavenly Eye Gang, feeling a wave of bitterness.","\"This is a curse! All my hard work building up that arcade, gone!\"","\"One of these days, I'm gonna take that turf back!\"","Just as Liu Hao was beating his chest in frustration, a lackey next to him suddenly nudged him and pointed towards the entrance of the food stall not far away.","\"Heavenly Eye Bro! Look over there. There's a fight going on too, and it's women?\"","\"Damn! Are women these days that fierce in a fight? They took down seven or eight guys.\"","\".........\"","Liu Hao immediately looked in the direction his lackey pointed. He saw a woman of extraordinary poise putting her shoes back on and standing up.","And indeed, in front of them, seven or eight groaning thugs were lying on the ground, along with a few foreigners cowering like quails.","What kind of women were these? Fighting so fiercely—female special forces? Professionally trained bodyguards?","But when he got a clear look at the leading woman's profile, he jolted.","\"Holy shit! That's Liu Yutong?!\"","A flood of unbearable memories instantly rushed into Liu Hao's mind.","Back in the day, Liu Hao was the undisputed king of Internet Cafe Street in Wushui County, living his glory days.","That all ended when he met Liu Yutong.","First, she outmaneuvered him, then she taught him a lesson and had him thrown in jail. Later, she even poached all his underlings, leaving him a commander without an army. In the end, he could only beat a hasty retreat to Mingzhu City.","It's fair to say that period was the darkest chapter of his life on the streets.","\"What a small world, running into you here...\"","Liu Hao stroked his chin, staring fixedly at Liu Yutong, his mind beginning to churn with possibilities.","They had just finished a fight. Even if they looked fine on the surface, their stamina must be drained. This was a once-in-a-lifetime chance for revenge!","The most crucial point was that her formidable bodyguard from Yuncheng wasn't around!","The advantage was clearly his!"]},{"number":512,"title":"Chapter 512: 512, The Situation Takes a Sudden Turn","paragraphs":["\"Boss, do you know that woman?\" A green-haired lackey beside him, seeing Liu Hao staring dazedly at the beautiful woman not far away, couldn't help but ask.","Liu Hao snapped back to reality and nodded: \"Know her? More than that. See that most beautiful woman up front? Her name is Liu Yutong. She was my number one enemy back in the day in Wushui County!\"","Hearing their boss say this, the lackeys' gossipy hearts ignited, and they all crowded around to ask.","\"Boss, can you tell us about your past?\"","\"Yeah, boss, tell us. We haven't heard about your glorious exploits before.\"","\"........\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Hao's expression immediately became somewhat awkward.","The past was truly too embarrassing to recall, and he naturally couldn't go into detail with his lackeys about how miserably he'd been beaten back then.","But seeing the expectant looks on their faces, he couldn't just refuse either.","After thinking for a moment, he decided to embellish the story just a little bit, just a tiny bit.","\"Ahem...\"","Liu Hao cleared his throat, putting on an air of reminiscing about the glory days: \"Since you want to hear it, I'll tell you about my mighty deeds back then!\"","\"Back in the day, I was one of the top bosses on Internet Cafe Street in Wushui County. That Liu Yutong, relying on having some skills, tried to steal my turf and poach my men. Tell me, could I let her get away with that crap?\"","His gaze gradually grew distant, as if he had truly fallen into those bloody memories.","\"I remember that night, the moon was dark, the wind high! Right on the river dam in Wushui County, she brought dozens of guys to corner me. I was alone, on my own, and I didn't back down! Wielding a machete, I fought from one end of the dam to the other, and then back again, without even blinking! The scene was truly a river of blood!\"","Originally, the other side only had about a dozen people, and it was actually Liu Yutong's side who were outnumbered when they fought his group, and they took down him and all his lackeys.","But now, in his telling, it became him single-handedly taking down dozens of them.","\"I can't even remember how many of her underlings I took down, the machete got so chipped! In the end, it was that ridiculously fierce bodyguard of hers who stepped in, plus they had the numbers advantage, wearing me down with a war of attrition. I was exhausted and had no choice but to make a strategic retreat.\"","Liu Hao said this, even deliberately pretending to look pained: \"Sigh! If they hadn't been so dishonorable, ganging up on me and resorting to sneak attacks, how could I have possibly abandoned the territory and the brothers I'd fought for back then?\"","\"I'll settle this score with her sooner or later!\"","He deliberately omitted the fact that he not only got beaten but also ended up in jail because of it, which led to his lackeys being absorbed by the other side. Instead, he emphasized his own bravery and their underhanded, shameless tactics.","Not to mention, this story of his, mixed with just a tiny bit of truth, really managed to fool his lackeys.","So their boss of the Tianyan Gang used to be that badass!","Thinking about how dishonorable the other side was, the lackeys all grew indignant.","\"Damn! That's too much!\"","\"Boss was so fierce back then, and they still managed to screw him over!\"","\"So the boss has such a glorious yet tragic past!\"","\"A true man doesn't let a grudge go unavenged, boss!\"","\"Yeah! We gotta get revenge!\"","\".........\"","Just as emotions were running high, one tactless, brash young lackey inappropriately spoke up: \"Boss, you were so fierce back then, but today when we were being chased by the people from Da Nan Cheng, how come you...\"","He didn't have the nerve to say the second half, \"ran faster than all of us,\" but everyone understood.","Today, their turf had been hit with retaliation from a gang of thugs, at least a hundred people showed up, but the boss ran faster than a rabbit. That didn't quite match the image of the fierce guy who single-handedly took down dozens in the story.","Everyone instantly looked at Boss Liu Hao, waiting to hear his explanation.","Liu Hao had already cursed this clueless lackey ten thousand times in his heart. Before he could even fabricate a reason to cover his lie,","Right then, another lackey nicknamed Ah Cong suddenly slapped his thigh, his face lighting up with a look of sudden realization.","\"I know! I know the reason!\"","Everyone was stunned: \"What reason?\"","Ah Cong looked at Liu Hao and asked: \"Boss! Was it because that bloody battle back then... damaged your foundation?\"","\"Foundation?\" The other lackeys didn't catch on immediately.","\"It's... it's the foundation of us men!\"","\"The boss fought dozens alone back then. In such a vicious fight, it's inevitable he got injured, leading to a severe depletion of his vitality. His skills aren't what they used to be. It might be because his foundation was damaged.\"","\"I remember now, that seems to be the case. I remember when we first took over the arcade, several young hotties threw themselves at the boss, wanting to be our big sister-in-law, but the boss turned them all down.","I was wondering back then, how could such a fierce man like the boss not be interested in women? So this is why. The boss didn't want to hold those girls back!\"","With this perfectly reasonable explanation, all the lackeys were shocked.","The looks they gave Liu Hao instantly turned to sympathy, admiration, even deep respect.","So the boss was carrying so much on his shoulders.","To avoid burdening others, he'd rather bear it all alone.","\"Boss, you've suffered!\"","\"Wah, boss, we wronged you!\"","\"The boss is a true, righteous man of honor!\"","\"It's all that she-devil's fault, so damn sneaky!\"","\".......\"","Liu Hao: \"???\"","What the hell is all this?!","How did it get more and more outrageous?!","When did I ever damage my foundation? It's purely because those hotties were just too ugly!","Liu Hao looked at his lackeys' moved and worshipful gazes and swallowed the words of explanation he was about to say.","He was afraid the more he explained, the worse it would get, and then it would be even harder to clear things up.","But fortunately, his heroic and fierce image was mostly maintained, even if with a slight flaw.","\"Let's not bring up the past anymore.\"","The lackeys immediately nodded in unison: \"We won't, we won't. We promise not to tell outsiders.\"","Liu Hao: \"Keep your mouths shut.\"","Everyone again thumped their chests in assurance: \"Boss, don't worry, our lips are sealed.\"","Liu Hao nodded with satisfaction, but as soon as he turned around, several lackeys behind him secretly pulled out their phones and started texting.","\"From now on, we don't have to be sneaky. Our boss... can't perform.\"","\"......\"","Liu Hao completely missed the little actions behind his back. He looked at Liu Yutong again, his mind in turmoil.","On one side was a man's dignity and past humiliation; on the other was the favor she unintentionally did him last time by helping him out of a tight spot.","Would it be a bit too dishonorable if he took advantage of her vulnerable state now?","\"Boss, that she-devil is so sneaky. We have the numbers now. Kick her while she's down! Let's go teach them a lesson and get your revenge at the same time!\" one lackey said.","Liu Hao waved his hand. \"No rush, let's see how things play out first.\"","While he could be a bit of a scoundrel, he was fairly clear-cut when it came to debts of gratitude.","He owed someone a favor; he couldn't just pretend it didn't exist, could he?","Most crucially, he wasn't sure if that tough guy from Yun Cheng was around or not. Based on his understanding of Yun Cheng, that guy would normally never stray too far from Liu Yutong. He was probably lurking nearby somewhere, playing the ambusher.","Just as he was stewing in his dilemma, his forehead furrowed so tightly his third eye was practically squinting, another wave of cursing and commotion suddenly erupted from the street corner.","Another group had shown up!"]},{"number":513,"title":"Chapter 513: 513. Forced into a Passive Position","paragraphs":["\"Shit! Where did those green-haired turtles run off to?\"","\"Damn it, today we're gonna beat the shit out of them!\"","\".........\"","Just then, from the east side of the food stall, a swarm of gangsters with dyed hair in all colors of the rainbow, wearing tight-fitting shirts, came pouring out.","They were all carrying steel pipes, chains, and similar tools, clearly looking for trouble.","A moment later.","A lackey ran up to the leader and reported, \"Brother Qi, we checked that alley too, not a damn hair. Those green-haired bastards are like rats, really good at hiding!\"","\"That's weird, we clearly saw them running this way just now. Could they have all jumped in the river together?\"","\"A bunch of clowns, they'll never amount to anything!\"","\".........\"","The leader looked different from the gangster-like thugs around him. He was around thirty, with neatly slicked-back hair, wearing black-rimmed glasses and a black shirt, looking more like a refined businessman.","The only exception was a shallow scar on his left brow that broke the tail of his eyebrow, adding a touch of sinister ruthlessness to his face.","At this moment, as if he hadn't heard his men's words, his gaze was fixed dead on the food stall not far away, specifically on the girl with an extraordinary presence standing in front of the foreigner.","After confirming she was Liu Yutong, the boss of the Wanlong Society who had screwed over their boss multiple times, he suddenly spoke.","\"Stop looking.\"","\"Huh? Brother Qi, why?\" a yellow-haired lackey beside him asked, puzzled.","The corner of Brother Qi's mouth suddenly curled into a chilling smile.","\"We're in luck. We've stumbled upon more valuable prey.\"","The lackeys also followed his gaze to the food stall not far away. Seeing several women who had taken down a bunch of thugs and a few foreigners, they were all stunned.","Before they could figure out what these fierce women were all about,","Brother Qi decisively waved his hand and ordered, \"Grab those women! As long as we catch them, the boss will definitely give us a huge reward!\"","Whoosh!","The thirty-plus men who had been searching for the green-haired gangsters immediately scattered, moving to surround Liu Yutong and her companions.","Actually, Liu Yutong had sensed something was wrong as soon as these uninvited guests appeared, feeling that trouble was brewing.","Although she didn't know this group, she could clearly feel the malice radiating from them. They were not here with good intentions.","So, when she saw their men starting to close in, she made a snap decision and shouted to Yu Xin and the others.","\"Everyone, run!\"","Calling the police was definitely too late now; running was the only option.","They had just been in a fight, their stamina was already depleted, and these gangsters were clearly more professional and numerous. No matter how skilled they were, they couldn't possibly be a match for this group.","The appearance of these people was too unexpected, beyond Liu Yutong's predictions.","Originally, she was confident she could easily handle Hawke and his crew, which is why she hadn't called the police. Who could have expected someone else to show up halfway?","It never occurred to her that they might be reinforcements called by Hawke. If they were, they would have attacked earlier, not waited until now.","It could only be said their luck was terrible today; they shouldn't have left the house.","Lan Die also recognized the danger. The moment Liu Yutong shouted to run, the dagger in her hand flashed coldly as she hurled it at the feet of the gangster charging at the front.","With a clang, the dagger embedded itself deep into the ground, giving the thug a huge scare.","\"Go!\"","Lan Die hissed, shielding Liu Yutong's side as the group tried to break through the relatively weaker part of the encirclement.","\"Trying to run?\"","Brother Qi wore a mocking expression and gave another order: \"Stop them! I want the woman in black alive! The others... handle them however you like!\"","As soon as the order was given, the gangsters charged forward with wild shouts.","These gangsters were clearly more professional and vicious than the amateur thugs Hawke had brought earlier.","Although Liu Yutong's stamina was low, she was still agile. She sidestepped a swinging steel pipe, grabbed an empty beer bottle from a nearby table, and smashed it over the attacker's head with a crack.","But as more and more people swarmed them, their situation grew increasingly desperate. Yu Xin even took a blow to the arm from a club, her arm instantly going numb, causing the telescopic baton in her hand to drop. She let out a frightened yelp.","\"Hey, hey, hey! Fight all you want, but don't hit the face! This lady relies on her looks for a living!\"","Lan Die, fighting to open a path for them, showed no mercy either, taking down two opponents instantly upon contact. But there were simply too many of them; for every one knocked down, two more took their place, forcing her to retreat step by step.","Su Mansu was utterly terrified, her face as pale as paper.","She hadn't even officially started her job yet, and she'd already been in two fights with her new boss?","The same thought grew even stronger in her mind: Was this new company definitely a legitimate business?","Why were enemies coming at them wave after wave?","She could understand the first fight; after all, Hawke and his crew were petty and wanted revenge.","But this second group was clearly real, hardened gangsters, ready to cut them down at first sight. She'd only seen this kind of scene in gangster movies before.","She even started wondering if she should tell Liu Yutong she wasn't going to work at the company after all, and just go back to being a teacher honestly.","Being a teacher meant putting up with some frustration at most. Hanging out with Liu Yutong and the others wasn't about frustration—it was about risking her life!","Su Mansu hated evil, but that didn't mean she wasn't afraid of dying!","Soon, Su Mansu realized she was thinking too far ahead.","Forget resigning; right now, the question was whether they could even get out of this unscathed.","The four of them ultimately failed to break through the encirclement and were forced to stand back-to-back, ready for a desperate fight against the dozens of armed gangsters surrounding them.","Even the usually composed Liu Yutong felt that getting out of this unscathed today was unlikely.","Unless the cops showed up in time.","As for reinforcements from the Wanlong Society, they were too far away and wouldn't make it in time. Besides, they had no way to call for help now.","\"Stop struggling, Liu Yutong. Be smart and come with me quietly.\"","Although Liu Yutong didn't know him, she could roughly guess his affiliation.","\"You're Master Jiu's men?\"","\"Oh? So the young lady of the Wanlong Society isn't completely in the dark about us.\"","\"Since you know my boss, Master Jiu, you should understand even more that we can't possibly let you go. Give up that idea!\"","They had suffered at the hands of the Wanlong Society no less than three times, each time a major loss. If not for the inability to operate across cities, they would have retaliated long ago.","Wait, that's not entirely true—they had tried to cross cities once, but as soon as they arrived in Pearl City, the other side rounded them up in one go. It was especially humiliating.","Later, they were almost implicated in the collapse of the East Sea Alliance, losing a huge sum of money and business.","Not long ago, they had the audacity to go to Danan City and take out a portion of their brothers, even causing many of their operations to get raided by the cops, dealing a heavy blow.","Being shat on repeatedly, and it getting worse each time—even a clay Buddha would develop a temper.","Boss Master Jiu had issued an order: whoever captures Liu Yutong, the young lady of the Wanlong Society, gets a direct reward of five million.","Who would have thought... who would have thought he'd run into her by chance today.","It truly was a case of searching far and wide with no success, only to have it fall into your lap without the slightest effort!","From a distance, Liu Hao watched the scene unfold. Logically speaking, seeing that female devil Liu Yutong in such a desperate situation should have filled him with satisfaction.","Liu Yutong, so you have a day like this too!","But when he actually witnessed Liu Yutong and her companions in a moment of crisis, his heart was instead tangled.","Should he lend a hand? He could repay the favor he owed first, and then settle their old scores later.","On one side was an enemy. On the other side was an even more detestable enemy.","Helping one enemy fight another enemy—this relationship was getting a bit complicated."]},{"number":514,"title":"Chapter 514: 514. The Unexpected Ally.","paragraphs":["The encirclement tightened further, squeezing Liu Yutong and her companions into an even smaller space. The situation was now extremely precarious.","The leader, Brother Qi, unhurriedly lit a cigarette, took a deep drag, and slowly exhaled, squinting his eyes as he scrutinized the women who were still fighting back fiercely. This guy seemed to relish this game of total control.","There was no denying it, these women were absolutely the toughest fighters he had ever seen.","It's just a shame...","He shook his head and took another drag from his cigarette.","Meanwhile, Liu Yutong and the others were rapidly exchanging words.","Given the huge commotion they'd caused, as long as they held on a little longer, reinforcements or the cops were bound to arrive.","\"I suddenly miss Brother Yun and the others. If even one of them were here, they'd make these guys pay!\"","\"It's too strange how these guys suddenly showed up. I have a feeling they weren't originally after us.\"","\"I feel the same way. It must be a coincidence, or we're just having incredibly bad luck.\"","\"We can't let this go!\"","\"Of course not!\"","\"...\"","Their guess was indeed correct. This gang had originally been chasing a bunch of green-haired guys and just happened to run into them. The very culprits who had led this gang here were now watching stealthily from the shadows.","\"Boss, are we just going to watch?\"","\"Obviously! Someone as smart as our boss is definitely waiting for both sides to wear each other out before making a move. Haven't you heard the saying? 'When the snipe and the clam grapple, the old fisherman profits.'\"","\"..........\"","Liu Hao looked at Brother Qi smoking his cigarette with a smug face, then at Liu Yutong and the other women, and finally made up his mind.","\"Goddamn it!\"","\"These bastards from Da Nan City are going too far! Chasing me is one thing, but now they want to mess with my enemy? That I absolutely cannot tolerate!\"","Underlings: \"???\"","Boss, is your logic a bit off?","\"Boss, you mean we jump in now?\"","\"I think it's doable! Master Jiu's men are our enemies too. We can settle old scores with them and the Demoness together! That's called... right, that's called killing two birds with one stone!\"","\"Stone your head! You don't understand a damn thing!\"","Liu Hao cursed irritably. \"Is that Demoness so easy to catch? A starved camel is still bigger than a horse. Even if she looks rough now, do you know how many men she has under her? The number would scare you to death.\"","\"Besides, last time, if she hadn't inexplicably started a fight with Master Jiu's men, we would've been wiped out by that Brother Pao.\"","\"Even though the Demoness didn't mean to help us, in our line of work, you have to be clear about favors and grudges. If you owe someone a debt and don't repay it, it just doesn't sit right!\"","The underlings exchanged bewildered looks, a bit stunned by their boss's sudden burst of underworld chivalry. When we're seizing territory or shaking people down, we never see you being so principled, boss!","Right at that moment, the battle situation suddenly changed!","A thug wielding a chain seized a moment when Lan Die was distracted. With a fierce swing of his arm, he lashed the chain hard at Lan Die's right leg.","Although Lan Die had strong combat instincts and subconsciously tried to evade as the chain neared, she was ultimately a split-second too slow. Or perhaps, she chose to take the hit to protect Liu Yutong and Su Mansu behind her.","Thwack!","A dull impact sound rang out.","Lan Die grunted, her right leg instantly buckling, nearly causing her to kneel on one knee. She forced herself to brace against the ground with her hand to steady her stance, but that right leg was clearly unable to bear full weight anymore, and her movements became sluggish.","\"Lan Die!\"","\"Sister Lan!\"","Liu Yutong and Yu Xin's hearts both sank.","\"I'm fine!\" Lan Die gritted her teeth and straightened up again, her voice still cold, though fine beads of sweat had already appeared on her forehead.","Seeing this, Brother Qi elegantly flicked his cigarette ash and sneered, \"A dying struggle.\"","\"Finish them off quickly. The cops will be here any minute!\"","Hearing this, the attacking thugs became even more ferocious, focusing their assaults on the injured Lan Die, Liu Yutong, and the others. The pressure instantly doubled.","\"Hao-ge, look! That cold-faced beauty seems to be at her limit!\" a sharp-eyed underling reported immediately.","Liu Hao had naturally seen Lan Die get injured and felt they couldn't wait any longer. He hardened his heart.","\"I've decided! Only I get to beat up Liu Yutong, that Demoness! Nobody else can, especially not these bastards from Da Nan City! Brothers, grab your weapons! Follow me! Let's fuck them up!\"","His decision actually involved an element of gambling.","First, to repay the unintentional favor he owed Liu Yutong from before. Second, he was tired of running.","From Wushui County to Mingzhu City, then to Da Nan City, starting over again and again... he was getting sick of it.","Besides, he always felt that wherever he went to set down roots, Liu Yutong's Wan Long Society would inevitably show up, sticking to him like a damn plaster. He couldn't just avoid confrontation every single time, could he?","What kind of gangster life would that be!","By helping her out of this jam now, they'd be square.","After this, they'd go their separate ways. He wouldn't have to run at the sight of her anymore and could focus on developing his Tian Yan Gang in peace.","Liu Hao hesitated no longer and stepped out of the alley mouth.","His gang of green-haired underlings behind him also hefted their weapons again and swaggered out, charging straight for the other gang of thugs.","Just as Brother Qi, wearing glasses, was watching his men about to capture the women...","Suddenly! An angry shout came from behind!","\"You Da Nan City dogs! Let go of that Demoness... no, let go of those girls!\"","The shout was so sudden that everyone on the battlefield faltered, stopping to look toward the source.","They saw a group of green-haired guys led by Liu Hao. After shouting, they brandished their weapons and charged fiercely into the fray from the flank.","Liu Hao, swinging a steel pipe, yelled in the direction of Liu Yutong, \"Liu Yutong, don't get the wrong idea! I'm just helping the weak and oppressed! I'm not specifically here to save you! After we finish off these dogs, we'll settle our score slowly!\"","He and his gang of green-haired underlings might have looked ridiculous, but they had plenty of street fight experience. Plus, they were pent up with the humiliation of being chased, and now they finally had an outlet. Howling, they charged toward Brother Qi's gang, instantly making the scene even more chaotic.","The composure vanished from Brother Qi's face. He threw away his cigarette butt, his eyes darkening with fury.","\"Tian Yan, you green-haired turtle dares to show your face? Perfect, I'll take care of you too!\"","Liu Hao knocked down a thug and pointed his steel pipe at Brother Qi. \"Four-eyes! Cut the crap! I hate bastards like you who gang up on people and bully women the most! Go eat shit!\"","Brother Qi laughed in extreme anger. \"Fine, fine, fine! Since you green-haired turtles are so eager to die, I'll oblige you! Take them down too!\"","At his command, a large portion of the thugs besieging Liu Yutong immediately turned their focus to meet Liu Hao and his men.","Liu Yutong and her group instantly felt the pressure lessen dramatically and breathed a sigh of relief.","She glanced at Liu Hao, who was noisily fighting his way into the battlefield, genuinely surprised.","She never expected to run into Liu Hao for the second time in Danancheng, of all places, and even more surprisingly, he took the initiative to help her.","Though she couldn't fathom his motives, for her, it was an extremely fortunate turn of events."]},{"number":515,"title":"Chapter 515: 515. Can We Still Back Out","paragraphs":["\"Yutong Sis, the people have arrived from Pearl City.\"","\"Good!\"","As soon as Yu Xin finished the phone call, she shouted towards Liu Hao's direction: \"Hey! You over there, the green-haired good samaritan! Thanks! I'll treat you to a meal later!\"","She didn't recognize Liu Hao at first.","Of course, it was also because she had never dealt with Liu Hao directly.","Liu Hao was clumsily dodging attacks from two blond-haired thugs. Hearing this shout, he stumbled, nearly tripping over his own feet, and cursed inwardly: \"Who wants your meal? I'm here to repay a favor!\"","These green-haired guys from the Tianyan Gang might fight without any real technique, but they made up for it with a reckless, fearless ferocity. Plus, there were quite a few of them, which indeed tied up most of Brother Qi's men.","However, as another group of hoodlums, originally chasing Liu Hao and his crew, joined the fray, Liu Hao's side began to lose ground. Several of his green-haired underlings were knocked to the ground, howling in pain.","Liu Hao himself took a few hits, grimacing in pain, and started to feel a twinge of regret.","Damn, why haven't Liu Yutong's reinforcements arrived yet?","Could it really be just these few women here today?","He suddenly felt a sense of being treated differently.","Whenever Liu Yutong dealt with him or those gang bosses from Pearl City before, wasn't she always surrounded by a whole entourage of people?","This time, she actually didn't bring any muscle?","That doesn't make sense!","Actually, it's not strange for him to think that. Normally, with Liu Yutong's own skills plus Lan Die, it was enough to handle any unexpected incidents.","The earlier incident with Hawke and his crew proved that point.","She was also basically used to going out with just Yun Cheng before, only this time Yun Cheng was replaced by Lan Die.","Liu Hao didn't know Lan Die, but he knew Yun Cheng, which was why he instinctively assumed their backup would arrive soon.","Unfortunately, he bet wrong this time.","\"Damn it! Am I really going to get myself killed over this?\"","\"This Liu Yutong is nothing but trouble!\"","He forgot that these people were originally chasing them; he was actually the one who dragged Liu Yutong into this.","Liu Yutong and her group were the real victims here, okay?","Brother Qi, seeing the situation tipping back in their favor, regained his cold, controlling smirk. He pulled out another cigarette and flicked his lighter.","Click!","The flame had just sprung up...","\"Woo-woo... Woo-woo... Woo-woo...\"","The sound of police sirens suddenly blared, reaching everyone's ears.","\"Cops are here!\"","Someone shouted.","All three parties in the melee immediately stopped fighting.","In Long Country, there wasn't a single person on the streets who didn't feel a chill hearing that sound.","Brother Qi's face instantly turned extremely ugly. They had dragged it out for too long.","In the end, he could only toss away the unlit cigarette with reluctance and immediately ordered: \"Fall back!\"","His underlings hurriedly helped up their injured comrades and followed Brother Qi, hastily retreating in the direction opposite the sirens.","In the blink of an eye, the open space that was just filled with shouts and fighting was left with only Liu Yutong and the three other women, along with Liu Hao and his green-haired crew.","Liu Hao looked at Brother Qi and the others running away, then at the police officers getting out of the cars and running over. He didn't even have time to settle accounts with Liu Yutong.","\"Cops! Brothers, let's scram!\"","Before leaving, he didn't forget to turn back and yell at Liu Yutong: \"Liu Yutong, you remember this! I've repaid that favor today. Let's never meet again!\"","After saying that, he led his injured crew, limping and hobbling, into another alley and disappeared.","Liu Yutong watched them run off without trying to stop them.","She was just puzzled. When had she ever helped that guy?","The only thing she could think of was sending him to jail that time in Wushui County.","If that counted as a favor, then she wouldn't mind doing him that 'favor' a few more times.","By now, several police officers had run over.","Liu Yutong and the others briefly explained the situation to the officers and then took a police car to the hospital.","This time, among the four of them, only Lan Die had a relatively serious leg injury. The others were mostly fine.","Su Mansu's nerves only began to settle after arriving at the hospital and getting checked.","Today's scene had genuinely frightened her.","She hadn't even officially started the job yet, and she'd already been in two fights with two different groups.","A moment later.","When Liu Yutong came out of the hospital room, Su Mansu couldn't help but ask: \"Boss, when our company negotiates business deals normally, do we also need... um... professional skills like Sister Lan Die's?\"","Liu Yutong: \"That depends on you. However, our company does place emphasis on cultivating well-rounded, comprehensive abilities in our employees.\"","Su Mansu: \"...\"","Comprehensive abilities? Comprehensive fighting abilities?","The kind where if negotiations fail, you just start throwing punches?","She looked at Liu Yutong's pretty yet somewhat heroic face and muttered to herself.","The boss's fighting skills were abnormally good. It wasn't normal for a boss to have skills like that. She seriously suspected the boss might have practiced so much because she had a lot of enemies.","Liu Yutong seemed to guess her thoughts: \"You don't have to learn if you don't want to. It's not mandatory.\"","\"Also, don't overthink it. Today was purely bad luck, a coincidence.\"","\"I've already found out. That second wave of people wasn't originally targeting us.\"","She had figured it out by now. Those people were originally chasing Liu Hao and his crew. They were just innocent bystanders who got caught in the crossfire.","And that Liu Hao actually had the nerve to say he was repaying a favor.","If Liu Hao hadn't helped them out a bit, she'd almost suspect he teamed up with those guys to ambush them.","Yu Xin was also comforting Su Mansu on the side. After all, it was Su Mansu's first time experiencing a street brawl like this. No matter how strong her nerves were, it was scary.","\"Mansu Sis, you really don't need to be afraid. Those guys will absolutely never come looking for trouble with us again.\"","Su Mansu was half-convinced, half-doubting: \"Are you all telling the truth?\"","She was still feeling a bit shaken.","After all, that was real fighting with real weapons, not some movie about gangsters.","\"Of course it's true. Why would we lie to you?\"","Yu Xin looked at Su Mansu sincerely and assured her: \"Our company is absolutely a legitimate company. What happened today was a pure accident, like getting hit by bird poop while walking down the street. The probability is actually very low.\"","Seeing Yu Xin's earnest expression, Su Mansu's doubts lessened a bit.","Maybe she really did have terrible luck and ran into an extremely low-probability event?","If that were the case, then perhaps she could try working for a while and see.","Honestly, if it weren't for the fact that Liu Yutong and the others had protected her throughout the fight, she would have already said she quit.","It was really too scary.","Yu Xin: \"Mansu Sis, you just focus on being a good assistant for Yutong Sis from now on. If any more troublemakers come looking for us in the future, our company has professional brothers... um... colleagues who will handle it.\"","Su Mansu: \"...\"","She was just about to say something when she heard a flurry of rapid footsteps coming from the far end of the hospital corridor.","She instinctively looked up. The next second, her entire body froze.","At the end of the hallway, two rows of young men dressed in identical black suits approached, a dark and imposing mass. There were at least twenty or thirty of them, giving off an unmistakably underworld vibe.","The scattered passersby and medical staff in the corridor instinctively pressed themselves against the walls at the sight of this group, not daring to make a sound.","The black-clad men moved with clear purpose, stopping in unison about three steps away from Liu Yutong.","At their head was a man with stern features and an upright, imposing stature.","\"Miss, we're late. We apologize for the fright you've had.\"","Dozens of black-clad youths behind him bowed in unison. \"Miss!\"","This kind of display, this kind of presence—it was nothing like ordinary company employees coming to pick up their boss.","Su Mansu slowly turned her head to look at Liu Yutong beside her, whose face remained calm, as if she were utterly accustomed to such a grand and intimidating spectacle.","This is what you call bad luck?","This is what you call a legitimate company?","This was clearly the kind of entourage befitting a mafia princess!","Su Mansu couldn't help but whisper secretly to Yu Xin beside her, \"Can I take it back?\"","\"Huh?\" Yu Xin didn't catch it.","Su Mansu: \"Never mind, it's nothing.\"","............."]},{"number":516,"title":"Chapter 516: 516. Exclusive Security Regiment","paragraphs":["\"Yun Cheng, keep your voice down. This is a hospital. Lan Die is inside. She has leg injuries and needs quiet rest.\"","\"Yes, Sister Tong.\"","Yun Cheng made a gesture, and the group of black-clad youths behind him immediately dispersed and took up positions, invisibly securing the area.","Su Mansu: \"......\"","She looked at Yu Xin again, really wanting to say to her: \"They are indeed very professional.\"","These black-clad youths were far more professional than the small-time thugs she had seen before, with their unified black uniforms, looking just like a scene from a movie.","Moreover, on the left chest of their suits was embroidered a silver dragon pattern.","\"Is this the emblem of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? It's actually quite nice.\"","Among these black-clad youths of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, there weren't only men; there were also nine women.","They were also dressed in black suits, their presence not losing out to their male companions in the slightest, valiant and heroic, possessing a unique imposing manner.","After arranging the personnel, Yun Cheng quickly returned to Liu Yutong's front, his face suppressing anger.","\"Young Mistress, what exactly happened? Who did this?!\"","\"I've brought over five hundred brothers this time. I'll take them now to find the culprit and wipe them out!\"","Liu Yutong waved her hand, signaling him to calm down: \"The situation is rather complex. We'll discuss the details later. First, tell me about the situation back home.\"","Here, 'home' referred to Pearl City.","\"Yes, Young Mistress.\"","Yun Cheng forcibly suppressed his anger and began reporting the results of his management in Pearl City.","\"Young Mistress, based on this quarter's assessment and evaluation, 221 people have passed the core member review this time. Currently, the total number of core members in our Ten Thousand Dragons Society has reached 1,306.\"","\"Across the entire group, including all formal employees of various subsidiary companies, the latest statistics show the total number has surpassed ten thousand. This growth rate is considerably earlier than our previous projections...\"","Su Mansu listened not far away, her heart experiencing another wave of shock.","Although she could guess that the scale of Liu Yutong's group company should be considerable, and since it bore this name, the number of employees certainly wouldn't be too small, she hadn't expected it to already exceed ten thousand.","This was already the scale of a large enterprise.","She just hadn't figured out yet what exactly the 'core members' Yun Cheng mentioned were.","A company having a core member system? Is it differential treatment? Or are these people all management?","If it's management, isn't that number a bit too large?","It's almost a ten-to-one ratio. Having one manager for every ten employees would suggest problems with the company's structure!","Before she could think it through, Liu Yutong beckoned to her.","Su Mansu quickly gathered her thoughts and walked over.","Liu Yutong introduced her to Yun Cheng: \"Yun Cheng, this is Su Mansu, my newly hired assistant. She has a very upright character. From now on, she can gradually start to get involved with and familiarize herself with some group affairs that don't involve core secrets.\"","She didn't comment on Su Mansu's abilities because she hadn't witnessed them yet.","Yun Cheng's sharp gaze immediately fell upon Su Mansu, who instantly felt a wave of pressure.","However, he quickly reined in his imposing manner, giving Su Mansu a slight nod as a greeting. His attitude wasn't exactly warm, but it maintained basic courtesy.","\"Assistant Su, hello.\"","\"Mr.... Mr. Yun, hello.\"","She had previously heard a brief introduction from Yu Xin about the company's main senior executives and knew that this coldly handsome man before her was the new boss's former assistant, effectively the second-in-command.","In a sense, she was taking over his position, or more accurately, half of his position.","The other half was now Lan Die's responsibility.","Although the emergency that happened today was unfortunate, it at least reassured Yun Cheng and the others, proving that Lan Die was reliable.","Actually, they hadn't fully trusted Lan Die from the start because the woman was too aloof.","After this incident, Lan Die could be considered fully onboard.","However, for safety's sake, the size of the security detail around Liu Yutong would need to be increased in the future.","These people brought into the hospital today were specifically selected by Yun Cheng for Liu Yutong—a full twenty-eight individuals.","Whether men or women, they were among the best fighters in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, elites among elites chosen through a grand competition.","Ever since Yun Cheng learned the Young Mistress planned to give him more responsibilities, he had this idea.","He also knew the Young Mistress meant well for him. The founding members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were all progressing, each climbing higher, yet he, the second-in-command, was staying in place. Regardless of what those below thought, he needed to achieve some results.","Also, he had to admit, not having a female bodyguard following the Young Mistress wasn't as convenient.","So, since the Young Mistress wanted him to take charge of the multi-billion investment project in BS Province, he had to arrange this matter before leaving.","Therefore, seizing the opportunity of distributing benefits and core member promotions, he gathered all core members for a grand competition and selected these twenty-eight individuals to form the Young Mistress's security team.","Among the nine women, five were candidates he had originally recommended to the Young Mistress for the assistant position. This time, he called them over as well.","They were primarily to serve as members of the Young Mistress's exclusive administrative secretariat, assisting Su Mansu with some group work, their functions similar to departments like the President's Office in some companies.","Su Mansu alone certainly couldn't handle everything. She needed some people specifically responsible for daily tasks, such as answering phones, preparing for and recording meetings, and other miscellaneous chores.","Moreover, these five women were more capable fighters than secretaries and assistants in ordinary companies and could protect the Young Mistress's safety at critical moments.","The other four women were purely skilled in combat and could follow Lan Die in providing close protection for the Young Mistress.","The others were specifically for driving, following, and performing perimeter security.","Initially, Yun Cheng was worried that the Young Mistress might refuse such a lavish security team he had so ostentatiously selected for her.","Because having too many people following could indeed make one feel uncomfortable. Everyone desires some privacy. Even the richest individuals rarely bring many bodyguards for regular activities; usually, just a secretary and an assistant suffice.","This is related to the national context. The Dragon Kingdom isn't like America, where it's all 'BiU! BiU! BiU!' everywhere.","Why do foreign tycoons travel with large, professional security teams? Because without them, you really can't hold up; you might get shot at any moment.","But after what happened today, no matter how uncomfortable the Young Mistress might feel, he would insist.","\"Young Mistress, you can take these people with you when you go out from now on.\"","\"Isn't that a bit too many? It might feel too ostentatious for ordinary outings.\"","\"Young Mistress, your safety is always the top priority. Today's incident is a warning. I believe you should understand that some troubles will seek us out regardless of how low-key we are. We must ensure your safety.\"","Yun Cheng gestured toward the more than twenty people in the corridor. \"They've all been selected from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. Don't worry, they won't all need to follow you at all times, nor will they interfere with your normal life and schedule.\"","Seeing Yun Cheng's insistence, Liu Yutong had no choice but to agree.","Of these twenty-eight individuals, five were assistants from the administrative secretariat who did not need to accompany her constantly. The remaining twenty-four were divided into two groups of twelve, taking turns being responsible for Liu Yutong's security.","Each group included two female bodyguards who, like Lan Die, would stay close to her person, while the remaining ten male members were responsible for perimeter security.","From that point on, Liu Yutong's exclusive security detail was officially established."]},{"number":517,"title":"Chapter 517: 517, Can You Feel It","paragraphs":["In Yun City, they had just arrived when, shortly after, another group of people showed up.","From down the corridor, led respectfully by the hospital leadership, walked several young men and women.","This group's aura was distinctly different from the black-clad men of the Wanlong Hui. Each one was either wealthy or noble, with an extraordinary bearing.","Su Mansu could tell at a glance that these people were here for her boss, Liu Yutong. She immediately asked Yu Xin beside her, \"Yu Xin, who are these people?\"","It wasn't that she asked too many questions, but she needed to get up to speed quickly. As the boss's primary assistant, she definitely had to familiarize herself with the people in the boss's circle. It would help her prioritize when reporting work and scheduling.","\"They are members of the Yunshan Hui,\" Yu Xin said.","\"Yunshan Hui?\"","Su Mansu looked puzzled, wondering if this was yet another social organization. But judging by this group's demeanor, it didn't seem like it.","Yu Xin then briefly explained the identities of the newcomers.","After hearing Yu Xin's introduction, Su Mansu was surprised once more.","Without exception, these people were all top-tier second-generation heirs from Greater Nan City and even surrounding provinces.","She also learned what the Yunshan Hui truly was: a private, immensely influential top-tier circle with extremely high entry barriers, accessible only to those with the most elite backgrounds.","And at this moment, they had gathered here for one person only.","That's right, her boss, Liu Yutong!","She was the universally acknowledged core and soul of this top-tier circle, the Yunshan Hui, their default big sister.","\"Sister Yutong, are you alright? We came as soon as we got the news.\"","\"Sister Yutong, who was the fool who provoked you? We'll make sure he regrets it!\"","\"......\"","Liu Yutong didn't hide it either. \"It was Master Jiu's people.\"","\"Master Jiu?\"","\"Who's that?\"","\"Gu Yebai, as a local, you should know, right?\"","To everyone's surprise, Gu Yebai also shook his head. \"Don't know him, though it sounds somewhat familiar.\"","Given their status, it was normal they wouldn't pay attention to those so-called 'big brothers' of the underworld.","Yun Cheng was exasperated by these second-generation heirs. \"Last time when you were surrounded by over a hundred people, those were also Master Jiu's men.\"","As soon as Yun Cheng said this, Gu Yebai and the others were stunned for a moment before erupting in anger. \"What? It's the same group as last time?!\"","\"How dare they!\"","\"Do they really think our Yunshan Hui is made of clay, that any stray cat or dog can come and take a swipe?!\"","\"Once is an accident, twice is a deliberate provocation! These scum really don't know how to write the word 'death'!\"","\"......\"","At this moment, the members of the Yunshan Hui stopped worrying about whether it was beneath them. Their only thought was to make Master Jiu pay the price for his stupidity!","Just as Gu Yebai was about to make a call to arrange manpower to deal with the other side, Liu Yutong stopped him.","\"Not so fast. Dealing with this sort of person doesn't require you all to take action. Besides, if we just make him serve some time, it would be letting him off too easy.\"","\"Then, Sister Yutong, what do you plan to do?\"","Liu Yutong quietly explained her plan to them.","Gu Yebai and the others' eyes immediately lit up. \"Then we'll follow Sister Yutong's plan.\"",".............","That night.","At one of Greater Nan City's most high-end five-star hotels, the doors to the largest banquet hall were tightly shut, guarded by men in black outside.","After getting out of the car, Liu Yutong headed straight for the banquet hall.","Su Mansu, Yu Xin, and others followed behind her.","The shocks of the day had been considerable for her. From street fights to men in black, to an elite circle of power and privilege... in just one day, she had witnessed the immense influence her new boss wielded.","If she hadn't experienced so much today, she probably wouldn't have believed, even if beaten to death, that a nineteen-year-old girl could achieve all this from scratch.","\"Yu Xin, I still don't quite understand. Mr. Yun Cheng said earlier that our company has over thirteen hundred core members. What exactly do they all do? If they're all management, that ratio is way too exaggerated, and it doesn't seem like a healthy proportion either.\"","\"They're indeed not management.\"","Yu Xin said mysteriously, \"Our company is indeed just a tiny bit different from others.\"","Su Mansu: \"Just a tiny bit different?\"","Yu Xin: \"Let me put it this way: your understanding of 'core members' is completely different from what 'core members' mean in our Wanlong Hui.\"","\"You'll understand in a moment,\" she said deliberately, keeping Su Mansu in suspense.","Even though Su Mansu was mentally prepared, the moment the banquet hall doors were pushed open, she was still stunned by the scene before her.","Her mind went completely blank.","The banquet hall was packed with a vast sea of people, all dressed in identical black suits, with a silver dragon emblem embroidered on their chests.","The moment Liu Yutong stepped into the banquet hall, everyone stood up in unison, bowing and greeting her with lowered heads.","\"Eldest Miss!\"","\"Eldest Miss!\"","The chorus of voices was incredibly loud, making Su Mansu's eardrums buzz and her heart pound uncontrollably.","This scene was a hundred times more shocking than any gangster movie she had ever seen!","Yu Xin, long accustomed to such scenes, gently nudged Su Mansu, who had completely frozen. \"See, Sister Mansu, these are about half of the core members of our Wanlong Hui.\"","\"Now do you feel the weight of the term 'core members'?\"","Su Mansu didn't know how to reply to Yu Xin anymore. She certainly felt it, but her overwhelming feeling could be summed up in a few words: \"I'm in deep now!\""]},{"number":518,"title":"Chapter 518: 518, The Grand Gesture of Yu Mo.","paragraphs":["When Su Mansu left the banquet hall to return to school, she was in a complete daze, unable to snap out of it for a long time.","She had originally thought she was joining a company in a phase of rapid development. She imagined a professional life wearing appropriate business attire, handling documents in a bright office, attending various business meetings with the boss, occasionally working late into the night to prepare materials, and so on.","But the reality?","It made her feel like she had accidentally stumbled into a massive, shadowy underworld organization.","Just a few hours earlier, she had personally witnessed the shocking scene of over five hundred people shouting in unison, \"Young Mistress!\"—and these five hundred were only about half of the core members.","She simply couldn't imagine what it would be like if all thirteen hundred-plus core members were present.","Yu Xin had also told her that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's goal was to expand to a scale of ten thousand members.","This number didn't refer to the total number of group employees, but rather the core members, like the people in black suits she saw in the banquet hall, aiming to reach a scale of over ten thousand.","Upon hearing this news, Su Mansu's first reaction was: Are you planning to rule the entire underground world of the planet?","Whether in movies or reality, she had never heard of any organization with a membership in the tens of thousands.","In her understanding, an organization with over a thousand members was already terrifying enough.","This clearly showed the immense ambition of her new boss.","Su Mansu had no doubt that if the boss had been born in ancient times, he would absolutely have become a powerful warlord.","Although, more likely, he would have been a bandit king ruling over a mountain stronghold.","After returning to her dorm.","Su Mansu opened her laptop. This computer was given to her by the man named Yun Cheng, and it contained a vast amount of information about the Ten Thousand Dragons Society Group.","This included the current total number of employees in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, the distribution of the group's various industries, and which companies the boss held shares in or held positions at, among other things.","All of this was what she needed to familiarize herself with.","After today's experience, she wouldn't be too surprised now even if she found out the boss was also the chairman of several capital institutions.","What truly caught her off guard was when she was reviewing the company materials and saw two lines of text at the very top of the motto section.","[Those who betray the Ten Thousand Dragons Society shall face three blades and six holes.]","[Be cautious, meticulous, bold, understand the law, and unify knowledge with action.]","When she saw the first line, her heart instantly sank.","\"What kind of company have I actually joined?\"","Was she scared? Absolutely.","She had never seen such a hardcore company motto before.","But strangely, aside from fear, a sliver of indescribable excitement also stirred within her.","That night, Su Mansu was completely unable to sleep.","After thinking for a long time, she still decided to go and resign the next day...","..............","This year's real estate market was noticeably more depressed compared to last year. Many companies, due to hoarding large amounts of land for development earlier, faced broken capital chains and ultimately couldn't withstand the impact of the financial crisis, ending up in bankruptcy liquidation.","Liu Yutong, this time, started with a court auction price of two hundred million and ultimately secured a shopping mall with a future value exceeding one billion for just thirty million more.","The reason the price could be so low was mainly because no one dared to participate in the bidding.","Many of these court-auctioned fixed assets had significant disputes. The shopping mall Liu Yutong's group acquired was said to have an original owner with considerable influence and rather shady methods. Most people, even if tempted, didn't want to invite this trouble, so naturally, no one competed with her.","However, even knowing there could be trouble, Liu Yutong didn't care. She only knew she had acquired the mall through legal means.","If anyone dared to cause trouble, they'd better first weigh whether their head was hard enough.","Yu Mo also seized the opportunity to acquire two unfinished residential complexes near the shopping mall, similarly auctioned off by the court due to debt issues.","These residential complexes and the shopping mall were actually developed as a package. Many domestic real estate developers favored this model: building a large shopping mall while developing commercial housing in the surrounding area.","If the mall operated successfully, it could not only boost the sales of the commercial housing but also drive property prices significantly higher than in other areas.","Yu Mo was now basically following in Liu Yutong's footsteps. Wherever she built her shopping centers, he would try every means to acquire the surrounding land plots or residential complexes.","It had to be said, this year's financial crisis had indeed created opportunities for him.","From the beginning of the year until now, the Yu Group had more than quadrupled the number of land plots in its possession compared to last year.","Of course, along with that came a soaring company debt ratio.","Because obtaining loans this year was far more difficult than last year, Yu Mo had gone so far as to crazily pledge all his personal equity shares.","It could be described as utterly insane.","If Liu Yutong weren't sure he wasn't planning some \"returning next week\" escape scheme, she would suspect this guy had suffered some kind of shock.","This year, most real estate developers were desperate to quickly liquidate their land holdings to recoup funds. Yu Mo's behavior of leveraging against the trend and frantically acquiring land was seen by his peers as completely mad.","However, he did have some basis for doing this.","This basis came from a sentence Liu Yutong once said to him: \"The winter is almost over. Next year will definitely be spring for real estate.\"","Yu Mo deeply believed her words.","And Liu Yutong wasn't lying to him. Starting next year, the real estate industry would enter a period of rapid development. A massive migration of rural populations to cities would create enormous rigid housing demand.","Real estate developers would also frantically hoard land and build houses. Coupled with the fueling efforts of various property speculation groups, housing prices would truly rise day by day.","However, as an old saying goes, the moon wanes after it is full, and water overflows after it fills.","The prosperity of real estate lasted only a few years before beginning to decline. In later years, many once-glorious real estate tycoons fell from their pedestals. The core reason was their unrestrained expansion, unable to sustain that high-turnover, high-leverage, high-debt operational model.","Now, Yu Mo was adopting this model ahead of time. At this current stage, it wasn't a major problem.","As long as he could hold on until next year and maintain this expansion speed, he was very likely to become one of the top-ranked real estate developers in the country.","Except, during this period, this guy did something incredibly foolish."]},{"number":519,"title":"Chapter 519: 519, Yu Mo's Ambition.","paragraphs":["After listening to Yu Mo's account of the recent maneuvers within the Yu Group, Liu Yutong was utterly speechless.","\"Are you out of your mind?\"","\"Yu Mo, do you have a death wish?!\"","Yu Mo was taken aback, not expecting Liu Yutong to react so strongly, and hurried to explain:","\"Sister Yutong, you know how it is. Land and housing prices are falling right now. Those guys are all shouting about holding the line together to prop up prices, but in reality, they're secretly selling at discounts. I was just following suit, releasing a few more properties to recoup some funds. Isn't that perfectly normal...\"","Liu Yutong shot back directly, \"Then let me ask you, how many units did you release?\"","Not daring to hide the truth, Yu Mo answered honestly, \"Over five thousand units in HS Province, more than nine hundred in JH Province...\"","Hearing these numbers, Liu Yutong laughed in exasperation. \"Is this just about recouping funds? Dumping such a huge volume of properties all at once—what exactly are you trying to do? Or do you think you can hide this from me?\"","\"You just want to flood the market, drive prices down further, preferably trigger a complete crash, and then swoop in to buy at the bottom, don't you?\"","\"Yu Mo, you're too greedy!\"","Yu Mo lowered his head and fell silent, tacitly admitting it.","The 2008 financial crisis had a severe impact on all industries, especially real estate.","Whether in HS Province, where the Wanlong Association headquarters was located, or in JH Province, where Liu Yutong was based, the assets of many major real estate companies had shrunk drastically, with smaller developers going bankrupt outright.","Real estate companies elsewhere were no exception.","For instance, last year's domestic real estate tycoon saw his net worth peak at over a hundred billion, but this year it had been slashed to less than thirty billion—a nearly 80% plunge.","Having learned from Liu Yutong earlier that the market outlook for the year was grim, Yu Mo had taken preemptive measures. He halted land acquisitions, quietly offloaded some high-priced plots, and stockpiled a large cash reserve through loans and equity pledges, all in preparation to buy at the bottom when the market crashed.","This massive property sell-off was simply driven by greed—he felt the price drop wasn't steep enough and wanted to push it down further before making his move.","He was clever enough to carry out the sales through a company not under the Yu Group's umbrella, but a new one he had secretly set up himself.","Besides positioning for the market bottom, this company served another purpose: he wanted to use this opportunity to strip assets from the Yu Group.","All this was thanks to his father, who remained overseas and refused to return.","\"Yu Mo, sometimes I really don't know what goes on in your head. Do you have any idea how many eyes are on the real estate market right now? This year, because of the financial crisis, real estate has fallen too fast. The authorities definitely want a soft landing, they want stability. Prices can adjust moderately, but they absolutely must not crash!\"","\"Do you know why? Because it involves hundreds of thousands of jobs, local GDP, fiscal revenue, bank loan security, and even the stability of the entire industrial chain.","Those real estate bosses colluding to halt sales—do you think the authorities don't know about it?","Although their tactics are despicable, on the surface at least they align with the goal of stabilizing the market, so the authorities will turn a blind eye. Even if someone sells a little secretly, it's because they're truly desperate for cash, forced into it, and it won't have a major impact.\"","\"But what are you doing? You're directly smashing the market!\"","\"Those in your real estate circle—Boss Li, Boss Zhang, who are even more powerful than you—aren't they all shrewd? Why aren't they doing this? Because they know whoever crashes the market becomes everyone's enemy. Not only will they not let you off, the authorities will also come to settle accounts with you!\"","\"Don't you see you're asking for trouble?\"","By the time Liu Yutong finished speaking, cold sweat was beading on Yu Mo's forehead. He had indeed been blinded by the enormous potential profits, leading him to do something so reckless.","Now, with Liu Yutong laying it bare, he panicked.","\"Sister Yutong, I was wrong. What should I do now? I've already released the properties.\"","Seeing his frightened state, Liu Yutong's tone softened slightly. \"What can you do? Stop the ones that haven't been sold yet, but don't halt everything. Keep some available for those with genuine housing needs. Try not to maliciously speculate to drive up prices, and don't maliciously crash them either. Just engage in normal market behavior.\"","\"Also, if you want to buy at the bottom, it's about time you can start. And when you do, make a show of it. Announce publicly with every acquisition that you are highly optimistic about the housing market's development. Understand?\"","Yu Mo nodded hurriedly. \"Understood, understood.\"","Even he wasn't so foolish as to not realize who these public statements were meant for.","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Go and arrange it as soon as possible.\"","Yu Mo didn't delay any longer, quickly getting up to leave. Just as he reached the door, he suddenly turned back.","\"Sister Yutong, my father, from abroad, instructed Yu Meng to sue me. He wants to use Yu Meng to regain control of the company and told me that if I want to negotiate, I should go see him overseas. Do you think I should go?\"","Liu Yutong looked at him as if he were an idiot. \"Go? Walk right into a trap? Yu Mo, your father's move isn't very sophisticated.\"","\"He's abroad now, far beyond anyone's reach, yet he wants you, the Yu Group chairman who's here domestically, to go talk to him? Talk about what? What is there to discuss?\"","Yu Mo: \"Then what should I do? The lawsuit has already been filed. If I don't respond...\"","\"Who said not to respond?\"","Liu Yutong cut him off. \"Respond, of course we respond. But we do it on our own terms. If he wants a legal fight, we'll give him one, but it has to be here domestically. This is our home turf. The law, connections—which advantage don't we hold?\"","Your father wants you to go abroad for nothing more than two reasons. First, to get you out of the way, making it easier for Yu Meng to return and stir up trouble at home. Second, abroad he has many ways to force you into submission, even to prevent you from coming back.","A chill ran down Yu Mo's spine. He really hadn't thought that deeply.","After all, the situation seemed settled long ago; he didn't think his father could turn things around. So what if he went?","Of course, most importantly, he wanted to retrieve something—something his mother left for him.","Seeing him lost in thought, Liu Yutong knew this guy still wanted to go.","\"If you really want to go, make preparations in advance. I know you want to strip the Yu Group's assets, so go ahead and proceed with your plan first.\"","Yu Mo nodded. \"Sister Yutong, I understand.\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and added, \"Housing prices will definitely rise in the future, but let me remind you, you'd better not get involved in property speculation. Houses, in the end, are for people to live in. Do you understand?\"","Yu Mo nodded again. \"Understood.\"","Liu Yutong: \"First, clean up your mess. Come see me again after you've handled it.\"","Yu Mo: \"Alright, Sister Yutong. I'll take my leave now.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Go on.\""]},{"number":520,"title":"Chapter 520: 520: The Billionaire's Banquet.","paragraphs":["After watching Yu Mo leave, Liu Yutong fell into deep thought.","Originally, she had pulled in Yu Mo's Yu Group to jointly create replicable super urban complexes similar to the Wanda developments from her previous life.","For example, a standard Wanlong Plaza typically wouldn't be just an isolated shopping mall, but a large-scale architectural complex integrating multiple functions.","The core would be the Wanlong Shopping Center, used to attract foot traffic. Around it, office buildings, commercial streets, apartments, and residential buildings would be constructed, forming a self-sustaining commercial ecosystem.","This way, people could work, live, shop, entertain, and stay there—meeting all their needs while also enhancing commercial value.","Liu Yutong had a very clear development focus for this sector, concentrating solely on the shopping center segment.","They could build them themselves or cooperate with others who would provide the capital and land. The Wanlong Hui Group would be responsible for design, construction, tenant recruitment, and operations, charging corresponding management fees.","This model was essentially copied from the Wanda model of her previous life. However, with the lessons learned from their predecessor's mistakes, she was determined not to let the Wanlong Hui Group face a sudden crisis. In the future, she would definitely pivot to an asset-light operation model ahead of time.","At this current stage, focusing on heavy assets was unavoidable. After all, the brand recognition of Wanlong Plaza and Wanlong Shopping Center wasn't strong enough yet, making it difficult to get others to provide capital and land.","They would need to wait until they had built up their reputation before they could initiate the asset-light model.","The reason Liu Yutong had brought Yu Mo on board in the first place was because she saw him as sufficiently obedient and valued the Yu Group's experience in development and construction.","A super urban complex definitely required good overall planning; they couldn't just each do their own thing.","The Yu Group could precisely develop and construct residential communities, apartments, office buildings, and star-rated hotels around the shopping center according to the overall plan, perfectly filling out the ecosystem centered on Wanlong Plaza.","However, the gambling tendencies and potential instability Yu Mo had shown recently made Liu Yutong somewhat uneasy.","Human ambition is prone to expansion. Yu Mo was no exception.","She certainly didn't want this guy's sudden impulsive ideas to affect the development of the Wanlong Hui Group.","\"It seems I must put a leash on him to ensure he doesn't run wild.\"","Liu Yutong called for Su Mansu: \"Mansu, there's something I need you to handle immediately.\"","\"Boss, please go ahead.\"","Su Mansu had also changed into a new professional outfit, the Wanlong Hui standard black suit with an additional silver dragon embroidery on the chest.","One had to admit, in these clothes, she looked even more like a white-collar professional.","Of course, Su Mansu herself didn't think so.","She thought the clothes were stylish, sure, but just a bit too black...","\"Contact Zhao Tianyi's side. Have them draft a proposal, for example, to establish a special fund. We would inject the future brand premium and guaranteed customer traffic brought by Wanlong Plaza as intangible assets into this fund. Require the Yu Group to pledge a portion of its equity as compulsory risk collateral to this fund...\"","In short, if the Yu Group cooperates with us properly on the super urban complex, all these future benefits will be returned to them. If they modify the plans or take other actions without authorization, those benefits will be confiscated...","\"Understood, Boss. I'll arrange it immediately.\" After noting it down, Su Mansu began contacting people to handle the matter.","Truthfully, Liu Yutong didn't really want to do it this way. She could easily increase her influence in the Yu Group by taking an equity stake to restrict Yu Mo.","But that would violate her original intention of not getting involved in residential real estate.","Up to now, all the land she had acquired was for her own use. She clearly knew that housing development would be very profitable in the coming years, but she just didn't want to get involved.","There are countless ways to make money; she wasn't short of this one.","Therefore, she wanted to use other methods to restrain Yu Mo, lest he become arrogant after growing too powerful.","It was almost time for lunch.","Su Mansu, holding a folder, walked into the suite where Liu Yutong lived to report on her work.","She was now somewhat accustomed to the transition from university lecturer to assistant.","\"Boss, regarding the matter you instructed this morning about establishing a special fund to restrain President Yu, I have communicated with Mr. Zhao Tianyi's team. They indicated they will provide a detailed proposal within three days.\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"Remember to show it to me once it's done.\"","\"Understood.\"","After noting it down, Su Mansu continued her work report.","\"Also, here is the weekly work summary for your review. For the mall acquired in Da Nan Cheng, the design team has submitted three preliminary concept proposals... News came from Mingzhu City that the valuation of Wanhui Youxuan has increased again, and they are preparing for a Series C financing round at the end of the year. Thirdly...\"","Once she truly got into work mode, one could see that Su Mansu's competence was quite high, organizing all sorts of information in an orderly manner.","Overall, Liu Yutong was relatively satisfied with her performance.","After finishing the report, Su Mansu closed the folder and said, \"Boss, there's one more thing. The secretariat just received a call from Mr. Huang Yu's secretary.\"","Liu Yutong's originally somewhat languid gaze sharpened slightly.","Huang Yu, the current richest person in mainland China (on paper), a top figure in the retail industry.","Last year, while still at school, Liu Yutong had received him. Currently, he didn't have much interaction with her Wanlong Hui.","\"Are you sure it's Huang Yu?\"","\"Yes. His secretary said that Mr. Huang Yu is hosting a dinner tomorrow evening at the Xingyi Hotel and would like to invite you to join him for a meal, saying he wishes to exchange ideas.\"","\"That's all the other party said; they didn't reveal any specific intentions,\" Su Mansu added.","Liu Yutong couldn't figure out at all why Huang Yu would suddenly want to invite her to dinner.","Could it be he wants to win her over to deal with Old Zhang together?","It's possible. After all, her supermarket chain does have cooperation with Suning, and he might have found out.","After a moment of contemplation, Liu Yutong made a decision: \"Reply to them that I will attend on time tomorrow evening.\""]},{"number":521,"title":"Chapter 521: 521, The Peacemaker","paragraphs":["The second evening.","Liu Yutong arrived at the revolving restaurant atop the Xingyi Hotel, accompanied by Yun Cheng, her assistant Su Mansu, and several core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society specifically tasked with her protection.","This restaurant was one of the most upscale in Danan City, boasting an excellent view. Standing there, one could overlook the nightscape of most of the city.","As she entered the private room, a man in his thirties with slicked-back hair and sharp eyes rose from the head seat.","This man was none other than Huang Yu, the currently illustrious and unmatched richest man.","This wasn't Liu Yutong's first time meeting him, yet upon seeing him again, he still exuded an aura of formidable power.","This was consistent with his style.","As the leader in the retail industry, Huang Yu's expansion methods were inherently frenzied and aggressive.","This guy never considered steady, step-by-step growth; every move he made was on a grand scale, like a mountain bearing down.","For instance, a few years prior, he had invested over six billion to swallow up the country's third-largest home appliance retail chain in one go.","Later, he successively annexed regional leaders like Zhongda Electric and Wulian Electric, and there were even rumors he intended to acquire Jinyang Electronics, a company listed on the A-share market.","It's worth noting that Jinyang Electronics' current market capitalization was over forty billion.","Incidentally, Jinyang Electronics was precisely the listed company controlled by Shen Hao's family of the Yunshan Society.","Of course, those were just rumors, as no one believed the richest man Huang could muster that much capital to directly acquire a company worth tens of billions.","However, Huang Yu had indeed invested over ten billion in real estate and publicly declared his intention to build his property company into a leading enterprise like Guomei.","Unfortunately, his timing to enter the market seemed less than ideal.","When Huang Yu saw Liu Yutong appear, a flicker of astonishment passed through his eyes. Besides being surprised by her youth, he also had a persistent feeling that this girl looked very familiar.","But he quickly composed his expression, stepped forward with a smile, and extended his hand: \"President Liu, welcome, welcome!\"","Liu Yutong also smiled and extended her slender hand: \"President Huang, it's been a long time. Last year at the Finance University, I listened to many of your insightful views on the market, which benefited me greatly. I didn't expect to have the honor of meeting you again so soon.\"","Hearing her say this, Huang Yu's memory gradually clarified.","The girl before him was indeed the freshman who had been responsible for receiving him, Old Zhang, and the others in Mingzhu City last year.","If he remembered correctly, this girl had even made bold remarks back then, commenting on wealthy individuals like them.","She said they were destined to be left behind by the times, that his expansion would inevitably lead to problems, and even boldly claimed she might become their competitor in the future.","Naturally, he hadn't taken it seriously at the time.","What could a freshman girl possibly accomplish? It was just empty boasting.","But how much time had passed since then?","One year, to be precise, not even a full year.","That female student who once served them food and poured tea now stood before him, the richest man, as an equal.","And at his invitation, no less.","However, before this meeting, he truly hadn't connected this \"President Liu\" with that freshman girl from last year.","The reason he had extended the invitation was actually at someone's request.","Furthermore, after that meeting last year, he and Liu Yutong had had no further contact, so naturally, he wasn't that familiar with her.","\"President... President Liu? My goodness, I truly didn't expect it to be you!\"","Huang Yu looked Liu Yutong up and down again, unable to hold back a sigh. \"How long has it been? You've changed so much. I still vaguely remember those sharp comments you made back then, truly eye-opening.\"","Liu Yutong laughed. \"President Huang, you flatter me. I was young and ignorant back then, speaking recklessly. Please don't take it to heart.\"","Huang Yu waved his hand. \"Ah, not at all, not at all.\"","\"President Liu, please, have a seat inside!\"","\"After you!\"","Liu Yutong and Huang Yu took their seats, and they began chatting about the old times at the Finance University last year.","Of course, Huang Yu was the one who initiated the topic.","They chatted for over ten minutes, neither broaching the real matter.","Liu Yutong didn't ask, and Huang Yu didn't bring it up.","Observing Liu Yutong's calm, composed, and unassuming demeanor, Huang Yu couldn't help but sigh inwardly again.","This young woman was even more patient than he had imagined; this level of composure was completely unlike someone under twenty.","He had met too many young entrepreneurs; most found it difficult to control their emotions in front of him, more or less excitedly treating him as an idol.","Although the title of \"richest man\" was just a label, the wealth and influence it represented were real and substantial enough to make many younger people subconsciously feel inferior in his presence.","Having collected his thoughts, Huang Yu stopped beating around the bush and finally stated the purpose of today's invitation.","\"President Liu, to be frank, besides catching up, the reason for inviting you today is also that I'm acting as a mediator at a friend's request.\"","Before Liu Yutong could guess who might have the clout to ask Huang Yu to mediate, the door to the private room was pushed open again.","Master Jiu walked in, his face dark.","\"President Liu, I admit defeat this time.\"","I, Master Jiu, have been hanging around Danan City for so many years, but this is the first time I've been pushed to this point. President Liu, truly skillful methods!","There wasn't much apology in his words; rather, they carried a sense of humiliation from being forced to bow before absolute power.","During this period, all the venues under his name had been inspected, countless of his underlings had been arrested, and even his legitimate businesses had encountered continuous problems, not daring to open for operation.","Opening meant being inspected.","Even the connections he had cultivated previously were useless now, completely ineffective, and were even avoiding him.","Although he didn't know how an outsider like Liu Yutong managed it, she had undeniably used stronger connections to suppress him.","With no other choice, he had sought out the richest man, Huang Yu, hoping to mediate.","Liu Yutong truly hadn't expected Master Jiu to back down so quickly. She didn't know if he couldn't hold on himself or if Gu Yebai's methods were too ruthless, making it completely unbearable for him.","However, if he thought reconciliation could be this simple, he had another think coming.","Seeing Liu Yutong remain silent, Huang Yu spoke up again to broker a reconciliation: \"President Liu, look, Old Jiu here admits his mistake. As the saying goes, matters of the jianghu should be settled within the jianghu. Sometimes, taking a step back can lead to open skies and vast seas.\"","\"How about this: I'll have him compensate you with a sum of money and guarantee he will never provoke you again. Give me some face, and let's consider this matter closed, alright?\"","Master Jiu immediately chimed in: \"Name your price, President Liu. As long as it's within my means, I won't utter a word of objection.\"","Watching the two of them perform this duet, Liu Yutong roughly guessed they must have some sort of vested interest.","It was likely that Huang Yu's real estate investments were entangled with this Master Jiu.","One had the money, the other was a local gang boss — their cooperation just fell into place.","She speculated that Huang Yu must have encountered difficulties, leading him to choose to cooperate with such a person.","Otherwise, given Huang Yu's status, how could he possibly speak up for a local big shot?","Of course, they might also be relatives.","However, regardless of their relationship, reconciliation wouldn't be that simple.","Time passed little by little, and the atmosphere in the private room grew awkward.","Yun Cheng and the others watched Master Jiu's men warily, while Master Jiu's men stared intently at Liu Yutong and her companions.","A moment later.","Liu Yutong finally spoke, pointing at a bespectacled man behind Master Jiu. \"First, have that guy crawl over here on his knees.\"","Master Jiu's brow furrowed sharply, suppressing his anger as he said, \"President Liu, what is the meaning of this? Is this your condition?\"","\"Condition?\"","\"You seem to have misunderstood something. Having him crawl over on his knees isn't a condition; it's to see just how much sincerity you have.\"","\"Show me your sincerity first, then we can talk terms! Otherwise, get the hell out of here!\""]},{"number":522,"title":"Chapter 522: 522, Ruthless","paragraphs":["Master Jiu's face instantly turned from livid to the color of liver.","He had been in the underworld for most of his life and had never been publicly humiliated by someone young enough to be his daughter.","If Aqi really knelt today, what face would he have left to show his men afterwards?","At this moment, his men were also getting restless, their hands unconsciously reaching towards the small of their backs.","Yun Cheng and those core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society almost simultaneously took half a step forward, ready to protect the young lady at any moment.","Just then, Huang Yu, who had been watching from the sidelines all along, spoke up again: \"Old Jiu.\"","Just two words were enough to instantly calm the about-to-erupt Master Jiu.","When Huang Yu looked at Liu Yutong again, the initial gentleness was gone, replaced by a trace of displeasure.","Having navigated the business world for many years, he had met all sorts of people, but this was the first time he encountered a young person like Liu Yutong who showed him absolutely no face.","No matter how unhappy he was inside, he had to resolve this matter, otherwise it would be troublesome if it affected his upcoming financial maneuvers.","He was counting on making a huge profit this time to ease the financial pressure from the group's expansion.","Then, Huang Yu gave a slight nod towards Master Jiu.","This action completely confirmed Liu Yutong's earlier suspicion—there was definitely an interest binding them together. Huang Yu would absolutely not allow Master Jiu to ruin his major plans at this moment over a fit of temper.","Master Jiu understood the meaning in Huang Yu's eyes. Even though he felt utterly humiliated, he forcefully suppressed his rage and roared at the bespectacled man beside him:","\"What the hell are you still standing there for? Are you deaf? Get the hell over there and kneel!\"","The bespectacled man shuddered all over, a flash of venom in his eyes. But he also knew he had to bow his head today, otherwise he wouldn't get past his boss.","Then, gritting his teeth, he fell to his knees with a thud and began shuffling towards Liu Yutong on his knees.","He could feel the gazes from his brothers behind him—anger, pity, shared indignation, and even a faint, almost imperceptible trace of disdain.","Honestly, being humiliated like this in front of so many people was worse than killing him.","What chilled his heart even more was his boss's attitude.","He had initially followed Boss Master Jiu because he admired his boldness, domineering aura, and sense of brotherhood, believing he had a future with him.","To help the boss grow bigger and stronger, he, Aqi, had done plenty of dirty and hard work. He considered himself Master Jiu's most capable right-hand man, his strategist, at the very least far more useful than that waste, Brother Pao.","But today, this right-hand man was personally pressed under the enemy's feet by his own boss, just to exchange for a pitiful bargaining chip.","He was truly disappointed.","\"After all these years of risking my life for you, this is what I get?\"","Aqi's resentment towards Liu Yutong unconsciously shifted partly onto Master Jiu.","When it came down to it, it was Master Jiu's incompetence, Master Jiu's weakness, that made him suffer this extraordinary humiliation!","So-called underworld brotherhood and loyalty turned out to be so fragile and easily shattered when it really mattered.","While Aqi shuffled over on his knees, Liu Yutong didn't even glance at him. She turned her head and whispered a low instruction to the somewhat stunned Su Mansu beside her.","Su Mansu, snapping back to reality, immediately walked out of the private room.","As she turned her back, she couldn't help but purse her lips slightly. Is this the way of a proper company?","The scenes from the past few days could still be explained away.","For instance, the boss's good fighting skills are for self-defense. It's perfectly reasonable for a girl to have some means of self-protection.","The large number of core members in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society is because the company is large-scale. The black clothes are just the company's employee uniform, which is also perfectly reasonable.","But how do you explain this now?","\"A man's knee holds gold beneath it.\" Did he come here to deliver gold to someone?","Internal sarcasm aside, the boss's moment of commanding aura just now was truly handsome!","Finally, Ah Qi shuffled his way to Liu Yutong's front, head bowed low. The veins on his neck bulged from humiliation, like a mangy dog ready to bare its teeth at any moment.","All eyes were focused on Liu Yutong, waiting for her next move.","Liu Yutong finally moved. She lowered her gaze slightly, looking at Ah Qi.","\"Look up.\"","Ah Qi's body stiffened for a moment, then he slowly raised his head, meeting Liu Yutong's deep, unfathomable dark eyes.","\"Who ordered you to attack us last time? Please point them out. And don't you dare say it was you.\"","Ah Qi's pupils contracted sharply. His eyes instinctively flickered towards Master Jiu, unsure how to answer.","\"I... I...\"","He never expected Liu Yutong to not play by the usual rules, to ask a question she already knew the answer to. How was he supposed to reply?","Say he did it himself, that he alone was responsible? She had already blocked that path.","But if he said it was Master Jiu, could he still survive in the Great South City underworld?","Not only was he caught off guard, but Huang Yu and Master Jiu also didn't anticipate Liu Yutong's sudden question.","It seemed she wasn't planning to negotiate with them!","Master Jiu slammed the table hard. \"Liu Yutong! What do you mean by this? My brother has already knelt for you. Don't push your luck! Push a man too far, and you will definitely not leave Great South City in one piece!\"","He had a feeling Liu Yutong had ulterior motives and could only try to seize the initiative by threatening her.","Liu Yutong: \"I was asking him. Master Jiu, why are you so agitated? Or was it you who gave the order?\"","Huang Yu interjected again: \"President Liu, harmony is most precious. I am also invited to your school's 50th-anniversary celebration.\"","He could see now that this young lady was also a hardliner and could only continue playing the emotional card.","Liu Yutong remained completely unmoved, looking at Huang Yu. \"Mr. Huang, I respect you as a senior. Don't blame me for not warning you: you won't be attending our school's anniversary celebration.\"","Huang Yu frowned deeply. \"What do you mean by that?\"","Liu Yutong didn't answer him. \"I, Liu Yutong, have always acted with clear distinctions between gratitude and grievance. If others respect me by an inch, I respect them by a foot! But if anyone dares to touch me or my people...\"","She paused, her voice suddenly rising sharply. \"...then I will tear down their temple and smash their pot. It doesn't matter if they're some local snake; even if they were a real dragon, I would pull out its sinews!\"","Yun Cheng didn't react much to the first part of the young lady's words, but hearing the latter part, he felt something was off and really wanted to say, \"Young lady, pulling out a dragon's sinews... that really won't do!\"","Liu Yutong looked at Ah Qi again. \"Ah Qi, is it? It seems your boss doesn't want to protect you.\"","At that moment, Yun Cheng, standing behind Liu Yutong, moved.","He directly had someone toss a steel pipe, wiped clean of fingerprints, in front of the other party.","\"Pick it up!\"","Ah Qi had no idea what they were trying to do. Could it be they wanted to start a fight right here?","But he knew very well a fight absolutely couldn't break out today.","So what did they mean by this?","However, despite his confusion, he still picked up the steel pipe.","The moment he picked up the steel pipe, Yuncheng suddenly made his move.","The next second, a sharp crack echoed through the private room!","\"Ah—!\"","Aqi let out a shrill scream. The arm holding the steel pipe was bent at a grotesque angle, clearly disabled by Yuncheng in an instant.","Yuncheng's strike was swift, and his withdrawal even faster.","From the moment he entered and saw this Four-eyes, he had already sentenced the man to death.","Whether in Wushui County or in Pearl City, anyone who had ever threatened the young lady's safety had met a bad end.","Crazy Dog Brother was still inside, serving a twelve-year sentence.","Of the Zhao father and son, one was left an idiot, the other dead.","There was no reason to let this Four-eyes get off unscathed.","After doing all this, Yuncheng turned to the brothers in black behind him and said, \"Located the principal offender from the assault on the pedestrian street last time. To prevent the suspect from attacking the victim with a weapon again or fleeing, we were forced to subdue him.\"","\"Brother Yun, it's all recorded. We were acting righteously!\"","Master Jiu: \"???\"","Huang Yu: \"???\""]},{"number":523,"title":"Chapter 523: 523. Does Anyone Still Want to Compete in Numbers","paragraphs":["No one had anticipated that Liu Yutong and her people would suddenly strike, and with such ruthless ferocity at that.","The tension in the private room instantly became palpable, thick enough to cut with a knife.","Master Jiu looked at Ah Qi rolling on the floor in agony, clutching his arm, the veins on his forehead bulging. Then, he whipped his head around to glare at Yun Cheng, who was whispering something to the black-clad men behind him.","\"What the hell are you muttering about? Just drop dead!\"","Of course, he only thought this to himself and didn't utter a word out loud.","\"Liu Yutong, isn't that enough? You've beaten the man, vented your anger. Can we sit down and have a proper talk now?\"","\"If you don't want to talk, then let's just settle this with our fists!\"","\"Let me be straight with you. I brought all my men today, they're right downstairs. One word from me, and you won't be leaving this establishment!\"","When Master Jiu came, he had anticipated that Liu Yutong might not let things go easily, so he had brought his entire crew and even borrowed some men from other local bosses. In total, he had gathered two to three hundred guys.","Liu Yutong seemed to have heard a joke, sneering, \"Master Jiu, are you trying to outnumber me? Why don't you take a look downstairs?\"","Hearing this, Huang Yu was the first to stand up and walk to the floor-to-ceiling window, peering down.","With just one glance!","Huang Yu's pupils constricted sharply. For the first time, this titan of the business world wore an expression of sheer horror and shock on his face!","The scene below couldn't simply be described as lively!","The square in front of the Xingyi Hotel was now blanketed in a sea of black. Dense crowds of black-clad figures stood there silently, their sheer presence seeming to dim the very light around them.","Even from this height, one could feel the suffocating pressure they exuded!","The only slightly incongruous element was the faint sound of music, the tune of \"The Most Dazzling Ethnic Style,\" drifting up.","As for Master Jiu's two hundred-plus \"social connections,\" they were now either lining up to get into police vans or scattering in all directions.","After all, their gathering was illegal, unlike the group downstairs, which had obtained prior approval for a formal assembly.","Seeing Huang Yu's reaction, Master Jiu's heart sank, a sense of foreboding instantly washing over him. He rushed to the window and looked down. When he saw the scene below, his face turned even grimmer.","So underhanded!","Damn it, they actually called the cops to chase and round up his men like chicks.","No wonder it was all black as far as the eye could see; his motley crew had vanished without a trace.","Liu Yutong walked to the window, standing shoulder to shoulder with the ashen-faced Master Jiu, looking down at the peculiar spectacle below.","\"Master Jiu, do you still want to play the game of overwhelming with numbers?\"","Master Jiu: \"What do you actually want?!\"","Just then, Liu Yutong's assistant, Su Mansu, returned, holding a stack of freshly prepared documents.","\"Boss, the documents are ready.\"","Liu Yutong took them without even glancing at the contents, flipped directly to the signature page, accepted the pen Su Mansu handed her, and then turned to pass it all to Master Jiu.","\"Sign it!\"","\"What is this?\" Master Jiu was clearly unwilling.","\"Either sign, or...\" Liu Yutong had no intention of letting him read the contents, but her meaning was perfectly clear.","Master Jiu looked toward the richest man, Huang Yu.","Huang Yu sighed and said, \"Sign it, just sign it. Consider it paying to avert disaster.\"","He obviously assumed these were some kind of compensation or settlement agreement.","Finally, with great reluctance, Master Jiu signed his name and pressed his thumbprint.","Only as the document was being closed did he catch a fleeting glimpse of a single character: 'Demolition.'","Demolition? Demolition of properties?","Did she also know about his and top tycoon Huang Yu's plans for the old neighborhood relocation project in Da Nan Cheng? Did she want a piece of the pie too?","Before he could figure out exactly what he had signed, the private room door was pushed open again, and two uniformed officers walked in.","The lead officer scanned the room, his gaze finally settling on Ah Qi, who was still kneeling on the floor, wailing.","\"You're Liu Zhiqi, right? Come with us.\"","The faces of Master Jiu and Huang Yu changed once more. They hadn't anticipated officers coming up to make an arrest at all.","\"It's a frame-up! Officers, they're the ones who beat me! I'm the victim here! Master Jiu, Master Jiu, save me!\"","Master Jiu's face was livid, but he didn't dare utter a single word.","As a local boss who had operated in Da Nan Cheng for so many years, he was getting a profound lesson in what it meant when the tide turns against you.","His man gets beaten, and then gets hauled away by the officers instead.","It also showed just how ruthless the other side was. Venting their anger wasn't enough; they had to send the man to jail too.","They were playing for keeps!","Ah Qi was dragged out like a dead dog.","Deathly silence fell over the private room once again.","Liu Yutong gently smoothed her clothes and said, \"Tonight's misunderstanding is temporarily resolved. Mr. Huang, I'll take my leave now.\"","It wasn't that she hadn't considered dealing with Master Jiu as well, but that would have been going too far. Huang Yu, the richest man, wasn't someone to be trifled with either. It was better to leave him a little face.","With that, she turned and left without a backward glance.","In the corridor.","Yun Cheng followed behind Liu Yutong and asked in a low voice, \"Young Mistress, are we just letting Master Jiu off like that?\"","Liu Yutong directly handed him the contract she was holding: \"Naturally not.\"","Yun Cheng flipped through the contract. Seeing the large characters on the first page, he suddenly smiled."]},{"number":524,"title":"Chapter 524: 524, New Discoveries.","paragraphs":["\"Miss, this move of yours is about to uproot Master Jiu's entire operation,\" Yun Cheng said after closing the contract.","\"Since he made a move against us, he should have anticipated this outcome.\"","Liu Yutong turned to Su Mansu and said, \"Arrange to acquire a qualified renovation company as soon as possible.\"","\"Understood, boss,\" Su Mansu replied.","Just as the elevator doors were about to close, a deafening crash of shattering porcelain erupted from the direction of the private room, accompanied by Master Jiu's hysterical roar.","\"Unbearable! Absolutely unbearable!!!\"","\"I will settle this score!!!\"","At that moment, Huang Yu hadn't left yet. Seeing Master Jiu's impotent rage, he too felt a surge of irritation.","Why on earth did I partner with this guy in the first place?","But now the arrow was already on the bowstring; he had to proceed. He needed to act on both fronts and secure funds quickly, otherwise his company risked a cash flow rupture.","\"Alright, let's consider this matter closed for now. Hurry up and find some reliable people to handle the tasks I've assigned.\"","\"Got it,\" Master Jiu grunted.","Huang Yu said no more, straightened his suit jacket, and turned to leave.","Master Jiu looked at the table full of untouched delicacies from land and sea and lost his appetite, preparing to depart as well.","As he reached the entrance, his phone suddenly rang.","\"Have you found those Green Hair punks or not?\"","\"You haven't?\"","\"Useless! A bunch of useless trash! What do I keep you all around for? You can't even catch a few green-haired street thugs!\"","\"First, Liu Yutong pushes me around, and now some gutter-crawling scum I don't even know dares to steal from me! Do they really think I'm made of clay?!\"","\"Find them! Keep looking! Tear Danan City apart brick by brick if you have to, but find those green turtles for me! Otherwise, you lot can go fill the river in their place!\"","After hanging up, Master Jiu nearly hurled his phone, but managed to restrain himself at the last second.","A strong sense of foreboding faintly rose in his heart. He probably couldn't stay in Danan City much longer.","First, this formidable outsider Liu Yutong suddenly stormed in from Mingzhu City. Then there were his past shady dealings with Zhao Tianxing. While Zhao Tianxing's death meant no witness, making it hard to pin anything on him directly, it was precisely because Zhao Tianxing was dead, coupled with Liu Yutong's untimely appearance in Danan City, that amplified his sense of crisis.","\"That woman is nothing but a scourge! A venomous shrew! A viper!\"","Master Jiu cursed a few times, and the thought of going abroad began to take root in his mind.","Truth be told, unless forced, few people genuinely enjoy living overseas.","Putting aside the issue of not acclimating, going abroad would mean becoming a rootless wanderer, with no family or friends in sight. All the power and status he possessed now would vanish into thin air.","The taste of falling from the clouds and being at others' mercy was particularly unpalatable for someone like him.","But if he didn't leave now, a bad ending seemed likely. Although he didn't understand Liu Yutong's purpose in making him sign that contract, his gut told him it was nothing good.","If push comes to shove, grab a pile of cash and run.","Rather than staying in Danan City to be slowly devoured by that viper Liu Yutong and ending up worse than Zhao Tianxing, it was better to cut his losses now while he still could. Take the fortune he'd accumulated over the years and gamble on a life of freedom abroad.","And in this regard, he already had some leads.","An \"unable-to-return\" friend abroad had tipped him off that several major foreign gangs and the conglomerates behind them seemed to be searching for two items.","One was a very miniature key, and the other was a uniquely designed emblem.","According to that friend, traces of the emblem had reportedly been found, but there were no clues whatsoever about the key.","Anyone who could obtain either of these two items and deliver it to any related gang overseas would earn their friendship and a hefty reward.","Coincidentally, he had seen something that looked suspiciously like the key, hanging around the neck of one of those Green Hair punks.","That was why he had sent men after them.","Of course, given the item's importance, he hadn't told a soul, not even his most trusted subordinates. He had already written them off as expendable.","The domestic situation was getting tougher for people like him; getting taken down was only a matter of time. You can't exactly bring a whole entourage when you're running for it, can you?","Isn't there a saying in the underworld? Brotherhood is in the heart; if my brother's in trouble, I'm the first to depart...","In short, if he could get that key, he could still live large, even more lavishly, overseas.","...","Meanwhile.","After parting ways with Richest Man Huang and the others, Liu Yutong met up with Gao Min, who had rushed over from Mingzhu City.","Gao Min had already made contact with the local police in Danan City. The extended investigation into the cases involving Zhao Tianxing and others had finally reached Danan City.","It wasn't that their progress was slow, but the resistance was significant. Some people didn't want them to dig any further.","Unfortunately for those people, they were being naive. Some individuals' determination isn't something that wavers just because of resistance.","Upon seeing Gao Min, Liu Yutong immediately gave her a big hug.","\"Sis, it's been so long. Did you miss me?\"","Gao Min's body stiffened for an instant before she replied with a soft \"Mm-hmm.\"","\"Grandpa and Grandma want you to call when you have time. The old folks have mentioned it several times.\"","\"Mm, I'll call first thing tomorrow morning. Are they keeping well?\"","\"They're fine. Grandpa went to set traps in the fields for loaches and eels just yesterday. But what about you? Is everything going smoothly here?\"","\"Pretty much. Just some loose ends to tie up.\"","\"Sis, if you encounter any resistance with your case here in Danan City, come find me. I'll help you sort it out.\"","Gao Min seemed accustomed to Liu Yutong's way of doing things and didn't refuse.","Working on a case in an unfamiliar city, having Liu Yutong's local assistance could indeed save a lot of trouble.","\"Yutong, do you know of a 'Master Jiu' in Danan City?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Why? Are you looking for him?\"","Gao Min shook her head: \"Not directly. That would alert him. You have more people. Could you arrange for some to help me gather evidence covertly?\"","\"No problem,\" Liu Yutong agreed.","Gao Min: \"Thank you!\"","\"You're my sister. No need for thanks.\"","Liu Yutong thought of something and asked, \"By the way, sis, have you had dinner? Do you want to go for a late-night snack? We're not far from the Riverside Night Market. There's a very authentic river fish restaurant there; their signature steamed swordfish is absolutely divine.\"","Hearing this, Gao Min did feel a bit tempted and agreed.","Honestly, she genuinely felt very comfortable around this younger sister. Whether it was handling affairs or other matters, she was very considerate. Gao Min could also sense that her sister's affection for her came from the heart.","Yet, she always felt as if her sister was perpetually shrouded in a layer of mist, making it hard to see her clearly.","The two sisters, along with Yun Cheng and others in their party, soon arrived at the river fish restaurant Liu Yutong had recommended.","There were quite a few places serving river fish in this night market area. The shop Liu Yutong chose was one Gu Yebai and the others had taken her to before.","The storefront wasn't large, but it was an old establishment with over a decade of history. The decor looked a bit dated, but the place was kept very clean.","By the time they arrived at the restaurant, the peak dining hours had already passed, leaving the place rather quiet.","The proprietress clearly knew Liu Yutong and warmly led them to a table by the window.","\"Sis, see if you'd like to add anything else?\"","After ordering the house specialties, Liu Yutong handed the menu to Gao Min and deftly began rinsing the tableware with hot water.","Gao Min took the menu, her eyes scanning over it before adding a stir-fried seasonal vegetable dish and a serving of crab roe tofu.","\"That's enough. It's not good to eat too much in the evening.\"","While waiting for the food, Gao Min noticed Liu Yutong was still fiddling with a badge and couldn't help but ask, \"I've seen you playing with this the whole way. Does it have some special meaning?\"","Liu Yutong paused for a moment, pointing at the badge in her hand. \"This? I borrowed it from a friend to take a look. I found it interesting and haven't returned it yet. He's not in a hurry for it anyway.\"","Gao Min: \"...\"","Is he really not in a hurry? Or is he just too afraid to ask you for it back?","\"It doesn't look like an ordinary accessory.\"","\"I've been holding onto it precisely because I haven't quite figured it out yet. What do you think it looks like, sis?\"","Gao Min took the badge. It felt heavy in her hand, with a cool, metallic texture.","She examined it carefully under the light. The badge had an ancient and peculiar design, made of a material that was neither gold nor bronze. For the moment, she couldn't tell what it was made of.","Especially the ferocious wolf's head at the center, encircled by thorns, exuded an aura of fierce and solemn lethality. It made her feel that the badge's former owner must have been a person of extremely high status.","Beyond that, she couldn't discern anything else.","\"I can't tell its origin either, but one thing is certain: it's an old piece with some years on it.\"","Just as she was about to hand it back to Liu Yutong, she suddenly noticed a detail. In the shadowed folds of the wolf's jawbone, there was a very small hole, its diameter looking to be less than 2 millimeters.","\"Wait, what's this?\"","\"You mean this little hole? I noticed it a long time ago. Lots of old crafts have pinholes like that, it's pretty normal, right?\"","Gao Min shook her head. She lifted the badge again, adjusting the angle so the overhead light shone on the edge of the tiny aperture.","\"Take another, closer look?\"","Liu Yutong leaned her head closer. With the light reflecting at that specific angle, she could vaguely see that the hole's interior actually had tiny, regularly arranged serrations.","\"This doesn't look like an ordinary pinhole.\"","\"Its internal structure is too precise. This looks more like a micro lock, crafted with extremely high skill, requiring a specially made key to open.\""]},{"number":525,"title":"Chapter 525: 525. Encountering a Classmate Again by Chance.","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong never expected that after playing with that badge for so long and finding nothing unusual, her sister Gao Min would immediately discover something new about it.","\"Requires a special key? So you're saying there might be something hidden inside?\"","\"It's possible.\"","Gao Min nodded gently, analyzing based on her police experience: \"This kind of design is usually meant to protect extremely important items, like a custom-made chip or some kind of coded message. The fact that it needs a special key to open also suggests the contents are quite valuable.\"","\"Also, you generally can't force this kind of thing open. It likely has a self-destruct mechanism inside; if you break it open by force, you'll destroy whatever's in there.\"","\"Of course, it's also possible we're overthinking it, and there's nothing inside at all.\"","Liu Yutong nodded thoughtfully, but she had a feeling it wasn't empty; something was definitely hidden inside.","This feeling mainly stemmed from a piece of news she had seen in her previous life.","Though exactly what might be hidden inside remained unknown.","But at least it let her know this item was worth keeping.","Just then, a server approached carrying a steaming plate of steamed knife fish, its tempting fresh aroma instantly filling the air.","Liu Yutong put the badge away and picked up her chopsticks. Once the dish was on the table, she first picked up a piece of fish for Gao Min: \"Sister, try this. The knife fish here is really delicious.\"","Gao Min didn't stand on ceremony either and took a bite of the fish.","\"The flesh is tender and melts in your mouth. It really is quite good.\"","\"Right?\"","The two chatted as they ate.","Liu Yutong had originally planned to take her sister shopping tomorrow and visit some sights around Da Nan Cheng, but Gao Min politely declined, wanting to investigate the case as soon as possible.","This was quite in line with her usual style.","Liu Yutong could only say they'd make plans next time. As she picked up her teacup, her gaze inadvertently swept past the glass window, and she suddenly froze.","\"Why is she here too?\"","Gao Min also followed her line of sight.","Not far away, in front of an open-air bar stall, a young girl wearing a cheap suit dress and heavy makeup was laboriously trying to sell beer to passersby.","\"Do you know her?\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"Yes, she's my high school classmate. But it's so late; why isn't she back at school, and instead working a part-time job here?\"","Gao Min: \"Lots of students work part-time jobs to support their studies these days. Don't make a fuss.\"","As she said this, she subconsciously glanced at her sister again, thinking to herself: Not everyone is a freak like you, achieving financial freedom as a freshman with billions to your name.","Liu Yutong didn't know what her sister was thinking. If she did, she might have retorted, 'Who do you think you're looking down on, sis?'","\"It's mainly that I find it a bit strange.\"","\"Just last week, I saw her working a part-time job at a coffee shop near the university district. Now she's come to the night market street to sell beer in the evening. Doesn't that mean she's working at least two jobs?\"","\"Is that so? Well, hearing you say that, your high school classmate really is quite hardworking. Attending classes during the day and working two part-time jobs. Is her family situation difficult?\"","\"An ordinary working-class family, but I don't think it should be so bad that she has to push herself this hard.\"","Before the words had fully left her mouth, two men with a sleazy air staggered over to Fang Yaqiong. One of them reached out to grab her arm.","\"Hey little sister, have a few drinks with us! We'll buy however much you're selling!\" a young man with a crew cut said, reeking of alcohol. His hand had already wandered dishonestly to Fang Yaqiong's waist.","Fang Yaqiong pushed him away in a panic: \"Sir, please let go. I'm just here to sell beer. I don't drink with customers...\"","This displeased the two men.","\"Playing innocent, are you?\"","\"Dressed like that and standing here, aren't you just waiting for men to hit on you? Don't be ungrateful when we're giving you face!\"","\"Exactly! What decent girl would be out selling beer at this hour of the night? Clearly you're selling yourself, so stop pretending to be respectable!\"","The crew-cut guy said this and then yanked her hard towards him: \"Have a few drinks with us brothers tonight. You won't be short-changed.\"","Fang Yaqiong was in no way willing to comply and struggled desperately: \"Let me go! I'm not... let me go!\"","Seeing that the soft approach wasn't working, the crew-cut guy simply resorted to threats: \"Let me be straight with you. My buddy runs security for this bar. You'd better be cooperative...\"","Before he could finish, an enraged roar suddenly erupted from not far away.","\"Damn you bastards! Let her go!\"","A handsome young man with dyed blond hair charged over like an angry lion, landing a fierce punch squarely on the crew-cut guy's cheek.","With a thud, the crew-cut guy clutched his face, howled in pain, and fell to the ground, two of his teeth flying out.","\"Son of a bitch! You dare hit us!\"","Seeing this, the other thug swung his fist at the blond-haired young man's head.","The crew-cut guy, having recovered somewhat, grabbed an empty beer bottle from a nearby table and also lunged at the blond-haired young man.","The three of them immediately became entangled in a brawl.","\"Be careful!\" Fang Yaqiong screamed.","The blond-haired young man clearly had some experience in fighting and a mean streak, actually holding his own against two opponents.","He first dodged the crew-cut guy's attack, simultaneously accurately seizing his wrist and twisting it hard. The crew-cut guy cried out in pain, and the bottle fell from his hand, shattering on the ground. Then he grabbed the other guy by the neck, kneed him in the stomach, followed by an elbow strike to his back, directly knocking him to the ground.","The entire fight lasted less than a minute before both thugs were lying on the ground, moaning.","\"Get lost! If I see you again, I'll finish you off!\"","The two thugs scrambled away from the scene, not even leaving behind a parting threat.","Only then did the blond-haired young man turn to look at the shaken Fang Yaqiong, instinctively reaching out to touch her face.","\"Are you okay?\"","Fang Yaqiong wiped her tears haphazardly. Instead of thanking him, she pushed him away forcefully. \"Who told you to hit them? Can't you ever solve problems without violence?\"","\"They were bullying you!\"","\"I could have handled it myself! Don't you know you'll get into even bigger trouble like this? Brother Hu has been looking for you, and now you're fighting again...\"","\"I don't care about that anymore! If he wants to come, let him come. At worst, I'll fight him to the end!\"","Hearing this, Fang Yaqiong's eyes were filled with pain and disappointment. \"Lin Bin, look at what you've become? Fighting, brawling, mixing with the underworld... You weren't like this before! You disappoint me, you know that?\"","Lin Bin's temper flared up too. \"I wasn't like this? Then what can I do? Can I go back? I've been expelled from school, I've served time! Can I just pretend none of it ever happened? Tell me!\"","\"Tell me!!!\"","Fang Yaqiong looked at Lin Bin, who was like a beast on the verge of going berserk, and was left speechless.","In the end, she said nothing, turned, and walked back towards the stall, preparing to continue selling drinks.","But just as she picked up her serving tray, Lin Bin suddenly reached out and slapped it from her hands.","\"Haven't I told you? Don't take night shifts anymore, don't work these evening jobs! Why won't you listen to me?!\"","Fang Yaqiong's anger was now fully ignited. She snapped her head up to glare at him. \"Why should I listen to you?! Lin Bin, who are you to me? My boyfriend? We broke up ages ago! What right do you have to tell me what to do?!\"","\"I...\" Lin Bin was left speechless by her questions.","\"Or is it because we were high school classmates? Or because you're now a dropout with a criminal record, a petty thug?\"","\"Lin Bin, what can you do besides fight and cause trouble? You can't even support yourself, and you want to control me? With the money you extort from those girls? I find it disgusting!\"","\"Fang Yaqiong! Say that again, you bitch!\" Lin Bin took a menacing step forward, his tall frame almost completely engulfing her.","\"I said it's disgusting! I'd rather smile and sell drinks here than take your dirty money!\"","The muscles in Lin Bin's face twitched violently until rage completely consumed his reason. He abruptly raised his right hand, swinging it toward Fang Yaqiong's face.","Fang Yaqiong didn't flinch. She just stared at him, wide-eyed.","Yet, the slap never landed.","Not because Lin Bin held back, but because a powerful hand seized his wrist in a tight grip.","The owner of that hand was Yun Cheng.","Before either Lin Bin or Fang Yaqiong could react, a familiar voice came from behind Yun Cheng.","\"Hitting a woman?\"","\"Lin Bin, it's been a year. You've really amounted to something now.\"","................"]},{"number":526,"title":"Chapter 526: 526. The Experience of Lin Bin.","paragraphs":["When Lin Bin saw it was Liu Yutong, his expression changed. He instinctively lowered his head, avoiding her gaze.","At the class reunion after high school graduation last year, he had declared with great ambition that he would become the most successful person in their class and buy himself a BMW with his own money after graduation.","But now?","That determination, that soaring spirit, was long gone.","All that remained was a head of dyed blond hair, a cheap T-shirt, and the fresh injuries on his arm from the recent fight—a picture of utter wretchedness.","Looking at Liu Yutong again, she seemed even more radiant than she had been at graduation.","\"Lin Bin, long time no see,\" Liu Yutong spoke up.","Lin Bin ignored her, violently trying to wrench his arm free from the grip of Yun Cheng.","\"Let go of me, damn it!\"","Even though he used all his strength, he still couldn't break free; Yun Cheng's strength was far beyond his.","\"Did you hear me? Let go!\" Lin Bin strained again, his anger turning to humiliation.","Yun Cheng's hand didn't budge an inch, his gaze merely fixed on him coldly.","\"Let him go.\"","Only when Liu Yutong spoke did Yun Cheng release his grip.","Lin Bin shot a glare at this cold, stern young man whose strength was monstrous, then without even a goodbye, turned and ran.","Yun Cheng started to chase after him, but Fang Yaqiong's voice stopped him.","\"Don't chase him. Let him go.\"","Yun Cheng instinctively looked toward The Young Lady. Liu Yutong nodded at him, signaling to listen to Fang Yaqiong, and only then did he relent.","Watching Lin Bin disappear down the street without a backward glance, Liu Yutong couldn't help but feel a pang of emotion.","The change was simply too drastic.","In high school, Lin Bin had been the class heartthrob, clean-cut with a scholarly air about him, the typical good student.","Zhao Zhu, whom Liu Yutong had later sent to prison, had even pursued him back then.","Later, Lin Bin also got into a university here in Da Nan City. Besides him, their classmate Fang Yaqiong and a few other students from No. 2 High School also got into universities here.","Originally, everyone thought these No. 2 High students, including Lin Bin, would become the most successful among their graduating class.","But in just one year, Lin Bin had completely changed. With his non-mainstream blond hair, ripped jeans, a T-shirt sporting a bold skull print, and what seemed like tattoos on his arms, he had turned into the spitting image of a street thug.","And the hostility in his eyes just now was clearly the look of someone frequently involved in fights and brawls.","Also, the relationship between Lin Bin and Fang Yaqiong seemed unusual.","As everyone knew, Liu Yutong was never one for gossip.","\"Yaqiong, what on earth is going on? How did Lin Bin end up like this?\"","\"And, is there something going on between you two?\"","Last time she and Fang Yaqiong had met, it was only briefly, with no time for a proper chat.","Fang Yaqiong bit her lip, her eyes reddening again. Perhaps because she had encountered an old friend, she didn't hold back.","\"Let's talk on the way back. I need to head back to campus.\"","Actually, her earlier stubbornness had been for Lin Bin's benefit; she was about ready to return to school anyway.","\"Alright, it's been a while since I've gone for a walk anyway. Let's chat as we walk.\" Liu Yutong wasn't lying; she genuinely missed those days of strolling around.","Back in the village, she loved walking from the east end to the west end with her village friends, back and forth. Someone would have a phone with flashing LED lights, playing DJ music downloaded from the internet, and the group would chat aimlessly until it was time for everyone to go home.","When she went to school in the county town, every weekend she would also meet up with classmates to walk around the town and chat.","It wasn't that they were particularly bored; it was just the way things were in those days. Besides internet cafes, there weren't many entertainment options, and phones were practically just bricks aside from making calls.","Fang Yaqiong shouldered her backpack and glanced again at the people behind Liu Yutong. \"Should your friends head back first...\"","Yun Cheng immediately said, \"No need. We enjoy walking too. Don't mind us.\"","The two other female members of the Wanlong Hui also nodded.","Fang Yaqiong thought it a bit strange that Liu Yutong always had 'friends' following her wherever she went, but she didn't dwell on it.","So, she, Liu Yutong, and Gao Min walked ahead, chatting as they made their way toward the university.","Yun Cheng and the two other women followed behind them.","Further back, a Maybach and two brand-new vans with tinted windows trailed them at a distance.","\"Lin Bin's parents run a small business here too. It's... well... wholesale women's underwear.\"","Fang Yaqiong blushed slightly when she said this, as they had nearly become her in-laws.","Liu Yutong and Gao Min showed no particular reaction upon hearing about Lin Bin's parents' underwear wholesale business.","Making money is making money. As long as it's legal, there's nothing to be ashamed of.","\"Later, because of overstocking, Lin Bin's parents ran into financial trouble. They took out a loan they couldn't repay. To help his family pay off the debt, Lin Bin, through an introduction, took a part-time job at a small loan company.\"","\"At first, he just worked as a customer service rep. Later, his boss saw he was sharp and got him involved in some loan issuance business. The commission was pretty good, so he kept at it until... until that incident happened.\"","\"What incident?\"","\"About six months ago, a female university student jumped from the top of the school library. It was later discovered she had taken out a loan off-campus, from the very company Lin Bin worked for.\"","\"After the police got involved, they found the company was involved in illegal lending, and Lin Bin got dragged into it. For his alleged involvement in violent debt collection, he was detained for three months.\"","\"The school expelled him to quell the public outcry. Right after he got out of detention, he was beaten up by the girl's family. His boss, Brother Hu, also demanded he pay compensation—five hundred thousand. It was after all that he seemed to completely change, picking up smoking, drinking, fighting, mixing with the wrong crowd...\"","Liu Yutong hadn't expected Lin Bin to have gone through so much. No wonder the hostility around him felt so heavy.","\"And what he said earlier about Brother Hu...\"","\"Brother Hu is the behind-the-scenes boss of that company. His company was investigated, and he had to pay five hundred thousand in compensation to the student's family. Brother Hu put that debt on Lin Bin's head.\"","Gao Min suddenly frowned and asked, \"Then why are you still working here? This has nothing to do with you, right? It's dangerous for a girl like you in a place like this. Don't tell me you owe them money too?\"","Gao Min knew of many cases in which university students, lured by \"premature consumption\" (consuming beyond their means), became trapped in usurious loans, and she had even dealt with some of them herself.","In the end, countless such students, unable to repay, spiraled into ruin. She really had no patience for that kind of student.","Of course, she despised those illegal loan companies even more, the ones that drove people to utter destitution.","Fang Yaqiong felt a sudden, inexplicable flutter of panic at her question, as if facing a police officer.","\"I... I don't.\"","\"I just feel guilty towards him... Back when I was sick and had surgery, he helped me, took care of me. I just want to save up some money to help him pay off his debt.\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong and the others finally understood how these two had gotten together.","\"Does he know about it?\"","Fang Yaqiong shook her head. \"I never told him, and besides, we've already broken up.\"","\"I originally thought that after we parted ways, he would turn over a new leaf. I never expected he would become even more of a scoundrel.\"","\"Regardless, once the money is paid back, we'll be square, and that will be the end of it between us.\""]},{"number":527,"title":"Chapter 527: 527, Sister, Are You Omnipotent","paragraphs":["\"Five hundred thousand is no small sum. For a student like you, saving that much through part-time work would take forever. And the legality of that debt itself is questionable. That Brother Hu's actions are clearly illegal; you don't actually have to repay it at all,\" Gao Min couldn't help but say after hearing her story.","Fang Yaqiong: \"I know it's illegal, but... Lin Bin, I'm afraid those people will cause trouble for him again.\"","Hearing this, Gao Min immediately got angry: \"How dare they! If they dare lay a finger on him, I'll make sure they rot in jail!\"","Fang Yaqiong was taken aback by Gao Min's vehement reaction.","She thought to herself, this doesn't directly concern Gao Min, does it?","Besides, the situation around here is complicated; sometimes calling the police doesn't even help. Those people are lawless thugs.","Still, she was very grateful to this older sister who, meeting for the first time, was so protective of her.","\"Thank you, Sister Gao Min.\"","Unconsciously, they had already reached the university gate.","\"You can just see me off here, Yutong, Sister Gao Min. Thank you,\" Fang Yaqiong said sincerely.","Although confiding in them couldn't solve the practical problem, she did feel a weight lift off her chest after speaking up.","\"Head back now, and be careful,\" Liu Yutong said.","\"Okay! Bye!\" Fang Yaqiong waved goodbye to them.","\"Bye!\"","Watching Fang Yaqiong turn and walk through the school gate, Liu Yutong and Gao Min also prepared to leave. Their car was already waiting by the roadside.","Just as Fang Yaqiong had walked about ten meters inside the campus, she suddenly remembered something and hurriedly turned around to run back out.","She didn't want Lin Bin to know about the things she had said today, so she wanted to ask Liu Yutong and the others not to tell him.","However, just as she ran back to the school gate, the scene before her stunned her.","A black luxury sedan with the iconic double-M hood ornament was parked in front of Liu Yutong and the others.","The young man who had been accompanying them, his expression cold and stern, very respectfully opened the rear door for Liu Yutong and Gao Min.","Liu Yutong and Gao Min bent down and got in one after the other. After the young man closed the door, he took the front passenger seat.","As for the two women in black who were with him, they walked towards another minivan that had pulled up behind.","The moment the minivan's side door slid open, she saw several young men inside wearing identical black clothes.","Fang Yaqiong stood there dumbfounded at the school gate, watching the vehicles drive away. Only after they disappeared from her sight did she remember she had forgotten to ask them.","But now, her mind was occupied with even more questions.","Just who was Liu Yutong, her high school classmate?","Going out with a luxury car and what seemed like people protecting her in the shadows... Could she be the young lady of some wealthy family?","But how could that be?","She knew Liu Yutong's background—she was from the countryside, and her family circumstances were very ordinary.","Fang Yaqiong's mind involuntarily recalled the last time she ran into Liu Yutong at the coffee shop in the university district.","Back then, although Liu Yutong was dressed simply, her whole demeanor was calm and composed, clearly different from the slightly immature students around her.","She just had too much on her mind at the time to think much of it.","Now, she seemed to understand.","No wonder, after their long separation, she always felt an invisible chasm between her and Liu Yutong. She originally thought it was her imagination.","Liu Yutong had clearly stepped into a world she couldn't even imagine, leaving her and their classmates far behind.",".............","In the car.","\"Yutong, why didn't you let me ask her where that company is?\" Gao Min was somewhat puzzled.","As a police officer, encountering something like this, she naturally wanted to help if she could. At the very least, she wanted to go warn that gang, tell them not to go too far.","Moreover, that company seemed to be involved with a death, making it even more impossible for her to ignore.","Liu Yutong: \"No need to ask, I know where it is. Also, sister, don't think I don't know what you're planning.\"","Gao Min was caught off guard: \"What am I planning?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Sister, it's good that you have a sense of justice. I wish all police officers were like you; then the world would be peaceful.\"","\"However, some things even you can't solve.\"","Gao Min felt a bit indignant and was about to retort.","Liu Yutong directly took a USB drive from her bag and handed it to her.","\"Here!\"","Gao Min was startled for a moment, took the USB drive, and looked at Liu Yutong questioningly: \"What's this?\"","\"Evidence of some illegal lending.\"","Liu Yutong briefly explained its contents: \"Mainly some student loan information. Among them, some are marked with special collateral, involving... well, some compromising photos and videos...\"","She had gotten this from Brother Pao last time and hadn't handed it over until now. It was perfect to give to her sister Gao Min.","Gao Min: \"...\"","She wasn't sure if it was her imagination, but she found that whenever she was with her sister Liu Yutong, she always had this feeling of [Merit +1, Merit +1]... constantly popping up above her head.","Just think of something, and it appears.","Was there anything her sister couldn't get her hands on?","\"Yutong, the evidence you mentioned alone isn't enough. Is there anything else? Like account books or something.\"","Liu Yutong gave her a sidelong glance: \"Sister, you're getting greedy. You're not the upright police officer who liked to rely on herself anymore.\"","\"Also, do you think I'm omnipotent?\"","Gao Min almost replied, Aren't you?","\"Don't talk nonsense. I was just asking casually. Even if there isn't any, I'll investigate and find it myself.\"","\"Fine, if there isn't, there isn't. Thank you anyway. If we can take down this tumor, I'll treat you to a meal.\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong said: \"Really? Then I won't stand on ceremony.\"","Gao Min: \"Of course it's true, but I can't afford anything too expensive. I'm not as wealthy as you.\"","\"By the way, how are you so sure that Brother Hu's gang and the company in this USB drive you gave me are the same group?\"","Liu Yutong: \"I investigated. I was originally planning to do...\"","\"Planning to do what?\" Gao Min suddenly became alert.","Was her sister about to do something big again? Like wiping them all out in one go?","Don't say it; it really would fit her character.","Liu Yutong immediately changed her tune: \"Ahem... nothing. I was originally just going to give you a surprise, to make sure your trip to the South City wasn't for nothing.\"","Gao Min looked at her suspiciously: \"Really?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Sister, you can doubt anyone but your own sister, right? You're really hurting my feelings. Besides, didn't you investigate too? Is my Wanlong Hui a legal, legitimate company?\"","\"What model taxpayer enterprise, Pearl City's Youth Entrepreneurship Pioneer, Police-Civilian Friendly Unit, Acts of Bravery Award...\"","As Gao Min listened to her sister list Wanlong Hui's honors one by one, even though she knew everything she said was true, she just couldn't shake the feeling that something was off.","And it wasn't just her; many people felt the same way.","It was clearly a legitimate, award-laden star enterprise, yet it exuded a peculiarly 'dark' vibe from top to bottom.","Perhaps it was just a preconceived impression.","A few days later.","With matters in South City nearly wrapped up, Liu Yutong was preparing to return to Pearl City to make arrangements for the university's anniversary celebration.","Before she could even set off, she received two important messages in quick succession.","One was that Master Jiu was hunting down the Tianyan Gang, seemingly searching for something.","The other was that a young foreigner had sent someone to request a meeting with her.","Meanwhile.","During her investigation of the case, Gao Min received a plea for help from someone.","It was Fang Yaqiong.","The two had exchanged contact information purely because Gao Min had visited her again to gather information and had revealed her own identity.","On the phone, Fang Yaqiong was frantic, on the verge of tears: \"Sister Min, Lin Bin stole something from Brother Long. He's been caught and they're going to beat him to death.\""]},{"number":528,"title":"Chapter 528: 528, What a coincidence.","paragraphs":["After receiving the call, Gao Min immediately went to find Fang Yaqiong. The two arranged to meet near the university district.","However, when Gao Min arrived at the agreed location and waited for about five minutes, Fang Yaqiong was nowhere to be seen.","Being a police officer, a sense of foreboding instantly welled up in her heart. She immediately took out her phone and dialed Fang Yaqiong's number.","\"Hello, the number you have dialed is powered off.\"","Powered off?","Fang Yaqiong should have kept her phone on at a time like this. How could it be off?","Could something have happened?","Gao Min scanned her surroundings. The university district was bustling with people. Could someone really be bold enough to attempt a kidnapping in broad daylight?","Without wasting any time, she quickly ran to a nearby convenience store, described Fang Yaqiong's appearance to the cashier, and asked if they had seen a girl matching that description. Not getting the information she wanted, she immediately turned and ran towards the gate of Fang Yaqiong's university.","As she ran, she tried calling Fang Yaqiong's phone again. It was still off.","Next, she dialed Liu Yutong's number.","\"Yutong, Fang Yaqiong might be in trouble. We agreed to meet, but she didn't show up, and her phone is off!\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong on the other end of the line couldn't help but frown slightly.","\"Sis, what exactly happened?\"","Gao Min quickly recounted the events at a rapid pace.","It turned out that Fang Yaqiong had earlier received a call from an unknown number. The caller claimed to be one of Brother Long's men, said they had Lin Bin, and demanded that Fang Yaqiong hand over something Lin Bin had stolen, or they would kill him.","Fang Yaqiong had even heard Lin Bin's screams over the phone. In her panic, she thought of Gao Min, as she later found out Gao Min was a police officer.","\"Does Fang Yaqiong know where the item is?\"","\"She said she doesn't know. Lin Bin never told her. But the other party didn't believe her and threatened that if she didn't hand it over, Lin Bin would die. Then the call was cut off, and when I tried calling back, it was switched off. I suspect they used Lin Bin to threaten her into acting alone and forced her to turn off her phone to prevent her from calling the police.\"","\"Of course, it's also possible she was kidnapped by Brother Long's people.\"","\"Right now, I'm heading to her university first, then to the police station. But with her phone off, I have no target. It'll be hard to find her quickly.\"","After listening, Liu Yutong on the phone suddenly remembered the information she had just obtained.","Perhaps this was a good opportunity.","\"Sis, Nan City isn't that big. I guess they're holding Lin Bin in one of their establishments. Why not just go and look?\"","\"It's not as easy as you say. Without confirmation, it's hard to get a search warrant. Even with one, without a clear target, where do we start searching? And what if he's not in one of their places? Wouldn't that just tip them off?\"","\"What can we do? Tough luck for them, then.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Ah, don't worry about that. Who says you need a search warrant to search? Leave it to me.\"","\"Yutong, you...\"","Before Gao Min could finish, Liu Yutong hung up the phone.","Gao Min stared at her phone emitting the dial tone, her mind growing increasingly chaotic.","\"What does my sister mean?\"","\"Could she be planning to take people and turn their establishments upside down? That would be illegal! Would I have to arrest her then...?\"","She was conflicted.","Of course, she still hoped her sister Liu Yutong wouldn't use such violent methods; otherwise, she would truly be in a difficult position.","Gao Min's guess was completely correct. Liu Yutong indeed planned to directly take people and turn over all of Brother Long's—more accurately, Master Jiu's—establishments.","Of course, she intended to do it reasonably and legally.","Her real goal was to confirm whether Master Jiu had actually obtained the key, and incidentally, see if she could rescue Lin Bin.","The reason she suspected the key might be with Master Jiu was that she had received a plea for help from Liu Hao's underling, saying his boss was cornered.","Liu Yutong had found it strange at the time. Why was Master Jiu targeting Liu Hao so intensely? He had already taken Liu Hao's territory. Was it necessary to drive him to the brink?","That didn't make sense.","Later, she learned from that green-haired underling that Master Jiu wanted to seize an antique key that Liu Hao had somehow acquired from some unlucky fellow.","Talk about a coincidence.","If that key was really the one she was looking for, it would be a huge windfall.","Even if it wasn't, using the Lin Bin incident, coupled with the evidence of crimes she already had on Master Jiu's gang, she could take them down in one fell swoop.","After hanging up on her sister, Liu Yutong directly said to her assistant, Su Mansu, \"Tell Jesse to wait.\"","Before Gao Min called her, Su Mansu had relayed a message that a foreigner named Jesse wanted to pay her a visit.","The referrer was Manager Li from Pearl City, the true owner of that emblem.","If Liu Yutong had been half-convinced about the emblem's origins before, now, between the key possibly appearing in Liu Hao's possession and this Jesse wanting to visit her, she was almost certain the rumors were probably true.","\"Okay, boss.\" Su Mansu went to notify him.","Just as Liu Yutong stepped out of the hotel entrance and headed towards her parked car, a slightly urgent voice came from the side.","\"Miss Liu, wait!\"","Liu Yutong paused and looked at the newcomer.","It was Jesse, a young foreign man with blond hair and blue eyes, his face clearly showing anxiety.","\"Wait, Miss Liu, just give me a few minutes...\"","Su Mansu quickly stepped forward, blocking Jesse. \"Mr. Jesse, I'm sorry, the boss doesn't have time right now.\"","But Jesse was persistent, still trying to get past, only to be blocked again by Su Mansu. \"Mr. Jesse, the boss is unavailable now. Please...\"","Just then, a sudden change occurred.","A hotel doorman, taking advantage of everyone's attention being diverted by Jesse, suddenly launched an attack!","A cold glint flashed from his sleeve as he pulled out a dagger, aiming straight for Liu Yutong's back!","Seeing this, Su Mansu couldn't help but cry out, \"Look out!\"","Yun Cheng and the others reacted instantly, moving to intercept.","Jesse's reaction was a beat slower. Just as the assassin struck, he happened to have gotten around Su Mansu and was rushing towards Liu Yutong.","His mind was completely focused on wanting to get that emblem.","But just as he coincidentally ran up to Liu Yutong, Su Mansu suddenly shouted. He instinctively turned his head to look back and saw a gleaming dagger coming straight for him, now less than ten centimeters away.","He wanted to dodge, but it was too late.","Three Chinese characters involuntarily flashed in his mind: I'm done for!"]},{"number":529,"title":"Chapter 529: 529, The Garrulous Jess","paragraphs":["\"Help!\"","Just as Jesse thought he was about to meet his bloody end in this foreign land, a dark figure suddenly appeared before him.","It was Yuncheng.","With his left hand, he shoved Jesse aside while simultaneously launching a flying kick at the knife-wielding assassin.","\"Thud!\"","A heavy, dull thud echoed. The assassin had no time to react, was viciously kicked, and slammed into the hotel's revolving glass door.","Before the assassin could even catch his breath, two female members of the Wanlong Hui, who had been protecting Liu Yutong all along, pounced on him from left and right like tigers.","One hammered the back of his neck with an elbow like a sledgehammer, while the other drove a knee into the small of his back. Then, with a forceful push of both hands, she pinned the assassin firmly to the ground, subduing him instantly.","Shoved by Yuncheng, Jesse fell onto his backside. He didn't have time to worry about the assassin's fate; instead, he frantically patted his own chest and abdomen. Only after confirming he was unhurt did he let out a long sigh of relief.","When he turned to look towards the assassin, he saw the man lying face down on the ground, already completely subdued.","The entire process had taken only two or three seconds.","So fast! Unbelievably fast!","\"Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!\"","\"That was brilliant!\"","After scrambling to his feet, Jesse excitedly spread his arms, intending to give his savior Yuncheng an enthusiastic hug, but was stopped by Yuncheng's icy glare.","Rebuffed, he then turned his gaze to Liu Yutong, gesturing animatedly to express his gratitude.","\"My God! Angels! The beautiful Miss Liu! And you, these masters of Eastern martial arts! Thank you for saving my life!\"","\"I almost thought I was going to meet my maker! It must have been my uncle, that damned bastard, who sent the assassin! He just won't let me go!\"","\"Miss Liu, thank you! A thousand thanks! You and your people, you saved my life! Truly! I, Jesse Collaro, the legitimate heir of the Collaro family, will forever remember this debt!\"","\"Miss Liu, I hereby declare that you have henceforth earned the most sincere friendship of the Collaro family, I swear! When I return to Sicily someday to reclaim what is rightfully mine, all of Italy... no! All of Western Europe! You, Miss Liu Yutong, will be the most honored friend of our family! From now on, for anything at all, just one phone call, whether it's black or white, the Collaro family will go all out! Whoa! Just imagine, what a powerful alliance that will be!\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","This guy must be a chatterbox, blabbering non-stop, his words rapid-firing like a machine gun.","If her foreign language skills weren't fairly good, she might not have caught what he was saying.","Besides, anyone with eyes could see the assassin was targeting her, yet this foreigner thought it was an attempt on his own life and was now trying to sell her a grand fantasy... too bad she wasn't buying any of it.","\"Mr. Jesse, I'm glad you're alright.\"","\"Alright! Of course I'm alright! With you and your amazing martial arts masters around, how could anything happen to me!\"","\"Miss Liu, I never expected to be targeted so soon after arriving in Dragon Country. Could you take me under your wing, as you say in Dragon Country... protect me. I can represent the Collaro family and form an alliance with you. You'd definitely make a huge profit!\"","\"Believe me, Miss Liu, my influence far exceeds your imagination! Although my uncle is temporarily managing the family now, there are still many old-timers loyal to my father within the family. With them, I can eventually replace my uncle and take back control! When that day comes, I will repay today's favor a thousand, no, ten thousand times over! Whoa! The thought of that scene is just thrilling!\"","However, Jesse's seemingly passionate and grandiose promises received no response from anyone.","Far from being thrilled, most people present couldn't even be bothered to give him another glance, mainly because most didn't understand him.","And those who could understand looked at him as if he were a fool.","Someone even felt tempted to say to him: \"Mr. Jesse, here on Dragon Country's turf, you might as well just make a wish to the young mistress directly. She might be able to grant it for you right away.\"","Liu Yutong remained polite: \"Mr. Jesse, I have matters to attend to now. As for the trouble you mentioned, I believe you can handle it yourself.\"","With that, she turned to get into the car.","At that moment, several young men in black got out of a van, dragged away the now completely subdued assassin, and dealt with him.","Seeing Liu Yutong about to leave, Jesse grew anxious.","He couldn't let such a formidable protector slip away.","\"Wait! Miss Liu, please give me one more minute, no, thirty seconds!\"","\"Isn't there an old saying in your Dragon Country: 'More friends, more paths.' Especially since I am the eldest son of the Collaro family. Although I'm temporarily... well... that's not important. What matters is that I will definitely become the head of the Collaro family!\"","\"With just our cooperation, when that time comes, I will be your most steadfast ally!\"","Just as Jesse was about to shamelessly try to follow her, Yuncheng directly stepped between Jesse and the car door.","Jesse sized up the stern young man again, his mouth still running a mile a minute, trying to cozy up to him.","\"Whoa! Hey there, cool martial arts dude, don't be so serious. We're friends, comrades-in-arms. We fought side by side just now, although you did most of the fighting and I did most of the lying down... but regardless, our friendship has been tested by blood, right?\"","\"How about we follow your Dragon Country custom and become sworn brothers? You be the big brother, I'll be the third brother!\"","Yuncheng's face remained expressionless, mainly because he didn't understand what this guy was babbling about.","Seeing he couldn't persuade Yuncheng, Jesse craned his neck and shouted towards Liu Yutong, who was already seated in the car: \"Miss Liu, please take me under your wing, let me follow you, anywhere is fine, I can carry your bags!\"","\"Miss Liu, Miss Liu...\"","Yuncheng, driven to the end of his patience by the annoyance, simply raised his fist.","Jesse put on an exaggerated expression again: \"Whoa! So cool! That fist is as big as a sandbag...\"","Before he could finish, he saw Yuncheng's fist shoot straight towards his face, stopping just one centimeter from the tip of his nose. The accompanying gust of wind instantly blew the hair off his forehead.","The noisy chatter ceased abruptly.","Even though the punch hadn't connected, Jesse still felt a sharp pain in his nose bridge, and cold sweat dripped down his cheek.","Yuncheng coldly spat out one word: \"Scram!\"","This time, Jesse understood. He obediently took a few steps back: \"Goodbye!\"","Then he decisively turned around and ran for it."]},{"number":530,"title":"Chapter 530: 530. Sky Eye Brother in a Desperate Situation.","paragraphs":["Under a relatively hidden bridge pier by the river in Da Nan City.","Several green-haired youths huddled around a bonfire, staring with eager eyes at the small fish grilled to a golden brown, swallowing their drool.","They were none other than the members of the Sky Eye Gang, who had been hunted for days and nights by Master Jiu's men.","The once-boastful green-haired youths, who had talked big about growing stronger, were now a sorry sight, covered in dust and grime. Their hair, unwashed for days, was matted into greasy strands. Combined with their dyed green hair, they looked like several wilted leeks that had been rolled in mud.","Gang leader Sky Eye Brother Liu Hao flipped the charring fish while cursing angrily: \"Damn it, that old bastard Master Jiu is going too far! He chased us all the way from the East District to the West District, driving us from the arcade to this godforsaken place! Back in the day, when I fought that she-devil from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, I wasn't this pathetic! Ah, who knows when we'll be able to make a comeback.\"","\"Boss, circumstances are stronger than men!\"","\"Including you, boss, our gang only has five members left standing. The others all scattered and ran. Should we just surrender...\" one of the underlings said.","\"Shut up! Surrender? Surrender to what? They've made me suffer so much, I'll never surrender!\"","\"Don't lose heart either. Victory and defeat are common in war. A real man knows when to bend and when to squat! What our Sky Eye Gang stands for is not backing down! We fight to the bitter end!\"","As soon as Liu Hao finished speaking, his stomach betrayed him with a loud, ungrateful gurgle.","His stomach's protest triggered a chain reaction, and the others' stomachs started rumbling too.","The youngest underling beside him burst into tears with a wail.","\"Boss, I... I want to go home to my mom... Her braised pork is so delicious... Waaah...\"","\"Crybaby! No backbone!\"","Liu Hao slapped the back of the underling's head, nearly knocking him into the fire.","\"Remember, we are the Sky Eye Gang! Even if we die, we die gloriously! Crying and sniveling like a bunch of women, aren't you ashamed?!\"","\"But... women nowadays are really tough!\"","\"Yeah, I think being a woman is pretty good too. That she-devil you always mention, boss, she's a woman, right? She's super powerful, rides in luxury cars every day, has countless underlings, a huge entourage... Look at us...\"","Thrown off by their digression, Liu Hao suddenly remembered Liu Yutong's impressive display of power. It was definitely the most imposing, the coolest scene he had ever witnessed.","If he could be as powerful as her, maybe even dying would be worth it...","\"Pah! Pah! Pah! What the hell are you guys talking about? Real men can rise to the top too!\"","\"Now, let's eat!\"","Liu Hao carefully took down the skewer of grilled fish, blew on it, and after feeling it had cooled a bit, began distributing their first proper meal in three days.","\"Come on, brothers, I'll share the fish. After we eat our fill, we'll discuss how to get back at those bastards!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the four remaining green-haired heads immediately crowded around. Their eyes were glued to the small fish weighing less than half a pound—the very fish they had snatched from an angler by the river who had been fishing for three days straight with only this one catch.","\"I'm a man who's always fair.\"","Liu Hao placed the fish on a plastic bag spread on the ground and began the allocation: \"Watch closely. Me, your boss, the core, the center of our Sky Eye Gang, I must eat the fish body.\"","After saying this, he tore off the fish body and placed it in front of himself before continuing to assign portions to the others.","\"Xiao Ge, you're always full of sneaky ideas. Perfect, you eat the fish head to nourish your brain.\"","\"Ah Ju, you're the one who snatched the fish from that unlucky angler. You performed a great service, so you get the fish tail.","\"Mushroom Head... you just get this wooden skewer. Suck on it for the flavor.\"","\"As for Little Green... you're the last to join the Sky Eye Gang, the youngest, still growing. Just smell the aroma, that'll be good for you.\"","Ah Ju: \"...\"","Little Green: (ಥ_ಥ)!","Boss, the smell really doesn't fill you up!","With the distribution complete, Liu Hao, with a tragic sense of resolve, began eating the most sumptuous meal he'd had in three days. As he ate the fish meat, he looked toward the distant riverbank at the rows of neatly seated, well-equipped anglers lined up like an army and made a concluding remark.","\"Who would have thought the fish resources in the river are so poor now? Dozens of people squatting here like they're clocking in for work, fishing for three days, and not a single scale to show for it! Looks like they need to ban fishing for eight or ten years!\"","Just as Liu Hao finished his complaint, a dense patter of footsteps suddenly sounded from the slope above.","\"There! Under the bridge pier! Those green-haired guys are right down there!\"","Liu Hao and his crew looked up to see the unlucky angler they had robbed of his fish that evening, leading down over twenty thugs armed with steel pipes and clubs.","Moreover, the other side had split into two groups, flanking them left and right, perfectly blocking Liu Hao and his men in.","Liu Hao's face instantly changed color. He swallowed the remaining fish meat in one gulp, pointed at the other side, and cursed: \"You sons of bitches! It was just one fish! You actually dared to rat us out! It's not like I wasn't gonna pay you back later!\"","The unlucky angler wasn't listening at all, saying excitedly: \"Is this just about one fish?! That was my dignity, fishing for three days and three nights before I finally caught it, and you bastards snatched it the moment it came up! Do you know how awful that felt? You have to give me an answer today!\"","\"Brothers, you gotta teach these heinous green-haired turtles a good lesson!\"","\"Got it, now scram!\"","\"Right away!\"","The angler happily left.","The leader of the thugs, a man called Brother Jun, stepped in front of Liu Hao and the others: \"Run? Why aren't you running now? That angler said some guys with hair like glow sticks stole his fish. We guessed it was you lot, and sure enough, it is!\"","The five members of the Sky Eye Gang turned ashen.","In his heart, Liu Hao cursed the angler's ancestors for eighteen generations. How could there be such a petty person in this world, actually ratting someone out over a single fish.","Although he knew he was probably done for today, he absolutely could not show weakness with his words, and he couldn't lose his imposing manner either!","\"Don't think you're hot stuff just because you have more people. Okay, you are hot stuff, but don't say I didn't warn you! If you know what's good for you, get lost now. Otherwise, when my backup army arrives, I'll have you wiped out to ashes!\"","His only hope now was that the underling he had sent earlier to call for reinforcements might be of some use.","After all, he had helped that she-devil out of a tight spot once. Shouldn't she return the favor and help him out once?","But to be honest, he had zero confidence. In his view, that she-devil was also a particularly unscrupulous person.","Like back in Wushui County. As the saying goes, Jianghu matters are settled within the Jianghu. What kind of gangster fight involves calling the police?","But that she-devil just had to be dishonorable, teaming up with the cops to retaliate against him, even turning his own underlings against him. Utterly shameless!","What's more, they had some history of their own.","If he weren't truly at the end of his rope, he would never have asked that she-devil for help.","Of course, to increase the incentive for her to support him, he had also instructed his underling to convey that he might have something Master Jiu would be interested in.","Although he didn't even know what use that key he had swiped back then would be.",".........","Seeing his remaining lackeys all panicking, Liu Hao tried to pump them up once more.","\"Brothers, don't be afraid! Backup is definitely coming!\"","Hearing him say this, the lackeys all forced themselves to look composed and spoke to the thugs in front of them.","\"Th-that's right! Our boss has a big shot backing him, y-you'd better watch out!\"","\"Yeah! Our boss knows countless brothers, he could easily call over hundreds of people!\"","\"Y-you better not come any closer, o-or I'll call my mom, you know. My mom's a real scold, she can curse for three hours straight without repeating herself.\"","\"......\"","The thugs on the other side, seeing these pathetic-looking guys still daring to threaten them, burst into laughter.","\"Have these guys lost their minds?\"","\"Backup? Calling your mom? Mama's boys, huh? Hahahaha... that's hilarious!\"","\"Get 'em!\"","As soon as the words were spoken, the group rushed forward all at once.","Seeing them charge, Liu Hao and the others completely lost their nerve.","\"Y-you stay back! I'm warning you! When I lose it, I even hit myself!\"","\"You're forcing my hand! I'm really gonna call for help now!\"","He then grabbed a piece of burning wood from the campfire and held it high.","\"One signal flare shot into the sky, brings a thousand troops and ten thousand horses... Ow, ow, ow! It hurts! I'm dying! I'm dying!\"","In the blink of an eye, Liu Hao and his last four lackeys were all taken down, subdued, and had their hands and feet tied up.","The leader, Brother Jun, took out his phone and made a call.","\"Got them.\"","\"Good. Once we have the item, I'll make sure they're permanently silenced!\"","Hearing this, Liu Hao, pinned to the ground, felt his heart sink.","Could it be that his life was really about to end today?","Brother Jun hung up the phone and walked over to Liu Hao, who was squirming on the ground. He crouched down.","\"Where's the thing? Hand it over!\"","Liu Hao struggled to lift his head. \"I can give you the thing, but can you let me make a call? Just to let someone know I'm safe?\"","Brother Jun thought for a moment, then took out his phone. \"Give me the number. Don't try anything funny.\"","Liu Hao nodded and recited a phone number. After the call connected, he took a deep breath. His tone suddenly became unusually serious, even carrying a depth of feeling he'd never had since entering this line of work.","\"Hello, is that Ah Zhen? It's me, your Hao-ge.\"","\"There's something I've wanted to tell you all these years. Actually... I really like you!\"","There was a moment of silence on the other end of the line, followed by an extremely sullen voice.","\"This isn't Ah Zhen. This is Qiangzi!!!\"","\"Ah? Sorry about that, Qiangzi. Could you please pass on what I just said to your wife? Thanks!\"","\"Your mother...\"","Click... beep beep beep...","Liu Hao decisively hung up the phone. He looked up at Brother Jun again and said fiercely, \"This old man's final wish is fulfilled. If you want the thing, I don't have it. If you want this worthless life, I've got one!\""]},{"number":531,"title":"Chapter 531: 531. A Dark Cloud.","paragraphs":["\"Nothing but a worthless life? Fine, then I'll grant your wish today. Let's see just how worthless this life of yours is!\" Brother Jun said viciously.","Upon hearing this, Liu Hao slowly closed his eyes, already resigned to his fate.","It had come to this, and that Demoness still hadn't arrived. It seemed all hope was truly lost.","Images of his glorious... no, his humiliating gangster life involuntarily surfaced in his mind.","Back in the day, he was the notorious top dog on the Internet Cafe Street in Wushui County. But then, Liu Yutong led a crew that gave him a brutal beating and had him thrown straight into the slammer.","Later, he drifted from Pearl City to Great South City, wandering from place to place. Every time his dream of making it big and getting stronger began to sprout, it was stillborn. And now, he was in a truly desperate situation.","Thinking of this, a wave of desolation washed over his heart.","\"Oh, boundless heavens, why do you treat me so harshly!\"","\"Think of me, Liu Hao, I've been around the underworld all these years, I'm somewhat of a figure. Suppressed by the Demoness, hunted by Master Jiu... who else has had such experiences? Yet in the end, I'm still going to fall in this godforsaken place under a bridge.\"","\"I refuse to accept this!!!\"","At that moment, his few underlings couldn't hold back their tears either.","\"Wah... Boss, in our next life, I'll still follow you. Just... try not to let us go hungry all the time, okay?\"","\"Boss, if I'm not dead yet, I promise I'll burn more paper money for you.\"","\"Boss, have a safe journey!\"","\"...\"","Brother Jun and his gang of thugs grew impatient listening to these guys wailing.","\"Enough! Enough! Stop your damned howling! 'Boundless heavens'? The heavens don't have time for a worthless piece of trash like you! Brothers, let's teach them a good les...\"","Before the word \"lesson\" could leave his mouth, a sudden change occurred!","\"Look over there! Those anglers... it looks like they've all caught fish! They're all standing up!\" one of the underlings suddenly exclaimed, pointing towards the riverbank.","His words made some of the fishing enthusiasts in the crowd immediately turn their heads.","\"Really? Is it true?\"","\"Holy shit, are those 'air force' guys that excited? Did someone hook a monster fish over a meter long?!\"","\"Damn, did those 'air force' guys all get lucky today? Look how pumped they are, they're about to fling their rods away!\"","\"Man, I really wanna go cast a line too!\"","Even the tied-up Liu Hao couldn't help but crane his neck to look.","\"Damn, are there really fish in this river? If only I'd gone fishing myself.\"","He was now filled with regret. If they hadn't been lazy and gone fishing themselves, they wouldn't have been ratted out by that damn angler.","Of course, the main reason was that seeing so many people getting skunked, they didn't want to waste their time.","Stealing is way faster than fishing!","Just then, one of the thugs seemed to notice something odd.","\"Something's not right, Brother Jun. Look at their movements... it doesn't look like they're fighting a fish. It looks more like they're backing away?\"","\"What do you know? It must be a monster fish pulling hard. They're in a tug-of-war with it, tsk tsk... judging by the commotion, it's gotta be at least fifty pounds!\"","\"Fifty pounds? Bullshit! I've fished at this spot before. If a fifty-pounder comes out of here, I'll eat this steel pipe right now.\"","\"Hey, so many people are standing up, but why isn't anyone using a landing net? They're all just opening their mouths without making a sound, looking like they've seen a ghost.\"","\"Maybe there really is a ghost?\"","\"Don't talk nonsense! There's no such thing as... whoa, holy crap!\"","Everyone's movements froze. The noise died instantly, and their pupils widened in shock.","They saw the anglers who had been fishing by the river were now hastily grabbing their gear and running away.","It wasn't that they had actually seen a ghost, but they had seen something even more terrifying.","After the anglers fled in panic, Brother Jun and the others finally saw the scene they would never forget for the rest of their lives.","The once relatively quiet riverbank was now, at some unknown time, covered in a stretch of pure black. It felt as if a dark cloud had fallen to the ground.","When they finally saw clearly what the black mass was, they all gasped sharply.","People.","A dense, countless sea of figures dressed in black!","All of them were wearing identical black suits, and on the left chest of each was a dragon emblem. There were so many of them, the end of the line couldn't be seen.","Just the sight of this formation was enough to suffocate a person with its oppressive weight.","At the forefront of this dense black mass stood three people.","On the left was Yun Cheng. On the right were two female members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, also dressed in black formal attire.","Standing in the center was a very young woman wearing a black trench coat, whose aura seemed incredibly powerful.","The thugs who had been so cocky just moments ago now felt their entire bodies go rigid.","Some of them had seen this kind of formation before, but seeing it again still made them tremble instinctively.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society, again!","Except for Liu Hao, the other four members of the Sky Eye Gang were seeing this terrifying scene—akin to a top-tier gang's entrance in a movie—for the first time. They all began to stammer.","\"B-Boss... wh-who are all these people? They're so scary!\"","\"Wait! Look at their chests, the dragon! Is this the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, the one Boss mentioned, that Demoness's crew? Boss, you're done for, another enemy's here!\"","\"Boss, did you break some heavenly law? Why are your enemies each more menacing than the last? You're really dead this time! The coffin lid won't even be able to contain you!\"","\"Boss, don't be afraid! When they come over, I'll kneel and beg them. I'll beg them to leave your body intact, not to throw you in the river for the fish.\"","Liu Hao: \"???\"","Listening to his underlings curse him like this, he finally couldn't take it anymore and yelled, \"Shut the hell up, all of you! A bunch of clueless idiots! This is the backup I called for! Backup! They're the people I summoned! If you keep spouting nonsense, I'll throw you into the river to feed the fish first!\"","The four underlings instantly fell silent, but the expressions on their faces clearly showed they still didn't quite believe it.","Boss, have you gotten so hungry you're hallucinating and talking nonsense now?","On the other side, the thugs led by Brother Jun had palms slick with cold sweat gripping their steel pipes.","Just the sight of the other side standing there motionless was oppressive enough to make them want to cry for their mothers.","Brother Jun forced himself to appear calm, took a step forward, and mustering his courage, shouted towards the sea of black, \"Friends from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, this is a private matter between us and these green-haired punks. We'd appreciate it if you'd step aside!\"","Liu Yutong didn't even acknowledge him. Instead, she looked at Liu Hao and the others. \"Is the item still there?\"","Seeing himself ignored, Brother Jun felt furious inside but didn't dare show it.","\"Friends from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, are you really willing to break with us over these worthless green-haired trash? You should think carefully about the cost...\"","\"Enough chatter!\" Liu Yutong said coldly.","As soon as the words left her mouth, Yun Cheng, standing on Liu Yutong's left, immediately moved.","A moment later.","Thud!","Brother Jun was sent flying backward, crashing hard into the concrete wall of the bridge arch, nearly foaming at the mouth."]},{"number":532,"title":"Chapter 532: 532. The Overjoyed Sky Eye Guy in Tears","paragraphs":["Silence!","Deathly silence!","All the thugs were completely dumbfounded, each one feeling their scalps go numb and their souls nearly fleeing in terror.","They hadn't seen clearly at all how Yun Cheng made his move just now. They only saw him approach Brother Jun, and then Brother Jun simply flew into the air.","A man weighing nearly two hundred pounds, just flying like that.","What the hell kind of person is this?!","\"Clatter!\"","\"Clang!\"","Someone, no one knew who started it, dropped their weapon first. The remaining thugs hurriedly threw down their clubs and steel pipes, clasped their hands behind their heads, and obediently squatted on the ground.","\"Spare us, please spare us, brothers of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","\"We were wrong, we'll never dare again!\"","\"We're just trying to scrape by, please let us go like we're nothing!\"","\".........\"","Liu Yutong didn't even glance at these thugs begging for mercy with their heads in their hands. She walked straight up to Liu Hao.","\"You didn't give them the item, right?\"","Liu Hao snapped back from the shock of moments ago, internally ranting wildly: \"Damn! Yun Cheng's show-off act deserves a perfect score from me! This guy hasn't changed, still not acting human!\"","Actually, when he was bragging to his little brothers before, he used Yun Cheng as the benchmark. That guy really is terrifyingly fierce.","Ranting aside, his reply wasn't slow in the slightest.","\"No, no, no, absolutely not! Miss Liu, rest assured, I'd rather give up this worthless life of mine than hand the item over to these scum! I hid the key. I'll take you to get it right now.\"","Liu Yutong signaled to another Ten Thousand Dragons Society member beside her.","That member immediately understood, walked up to the group of thugs, and urged, \"All of you, stand up! Stand up!\"","\"Pick up your weapons, all of them, hurry up!\"","Although the thugs didn't know what they were planning, they didn't dare disobey or cause trouble. Looking at the dense crowd of men in black surrounding them, they knew their twenty-plus people weren't even enough to fill the gaps between their teeth.","Trembling, they each picked up their weapons and then waited obediently for the next instruction.","\"You lot, go drag those green-haired ones over here.\"","The thugs: \"???\"","Did they hear that wrong?","What did that mean?","Were they supposed to teach those green-haired guys a lesson? Do those guys have a grudge with the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? But aren't you, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, the reinforcements the green-haired guys called?","Though utterly confused, they still complied.","This sudden turn terrified Liu Hao and his crew.","\"Hey, no, no, Liu Yutong, you can't do this! You can't be this heartless! I even helped you out of a tight spot once!\"","\"And... and... don't you want that key anymore?\"","\"Heartless! So heartless!\"","\"Boss, your social circle is too dangerous! Weren't they supposed to be reinforcements?\"","\"Mom! Save me! I'm never mixing with this crowd again. The people I meet keep getting shadier and shadier, boohoo...\"","Brother Jun, who had just recovered his senses, was also muttering to himself.","\"What act is the Ten Thousand Dragons Society putting on? Are they making us do it? Can't they do it themselves? Do they want to use us as the knife, then double-cross and silence us all? Damn! That's too ruthless!\"","\"Bro, I'm kinda scared!\"","\"Me too...\"","Just then, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society member giving orders spoke again.","\"Everyone, get in position now.\"","Then he pointed at a thug holding a machete, gesturing for him to stand behind Liu Hao: \"Right, raise the machete and hold it against his neck...\"","Liu Hao: \".....\"","Are you for real?","Then this Ten Thousand Dragons Society member proceeded to direct the other thugs to take positions and strike poses one by one.","\"You, yes, you, grab that green-haired guy's arms from behind, look fiercer.\"","\"You few, surround the other three green-haired ones... right... form an encirclement, raise your weapons too, look fierce, like vicious demons from the northeast?!\"","\"As for the one who just woke up (Brother Jun), you're in pretty good shape, huh? Come on, you stand at the very front, right there, that spot.\"","\"........\"","\"That's it, that's more like proper gangsters.\"","\"Good! Perfect pose! Everyone hold it right there!\"","Amidst the utterly bewildered expressions of Brother Jun's thugs and the looks of utter despair on Liu Hao and his crew's faces,","Several Ten Thousand Dragons Society members holding cameras stepped forward, clicked away taking several photos of them, then looked down and tapped a few things on their devices.","After confirming everything was fine, they gave an OK sign.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society member who had been giving orders nodded and walked up to Liu Yutong.","\"Miss, evidence secured. Armed kidnapping, caught red-handed!\"","Liu Hao: ???","The thugs: ???","Heaven's Eye Gang lackeys: ???","What?!","\"Arrest them!\" Liu Yutong said crisply.","As soon as the words left her mouth, the crowd of Ten Thousand Dragons Society men in black swarmed forward all at once. They looked like they were scrambling for credit, their eyes practically glowing green.","It's been a while since we got a 'Righteous Deed' commendation banner. Feels weird not having one.","Now we finally have a chance!","A few seconds later.","All the thugs were howling, lying on the ground, tears of grievance falling everywhere.","\"What kind of messed-up world is this?!\"","\"This is too much!\"","Immediately after, Yun Cheng used a small dagger to cut the ropes binding Liu Hao and his crew.","\"Congratulations on your rescue!\"","Liu Hao: \".......\"","Heaven's Eye Gang lackeys: \".......\"","Although they really wanted to grumble inwardly about the working style of these men in black, when they saw the packs of instant noodles being handed out, all their resentment instantly vanished into thin air.","The Heaven's Eye Gang lackeys hugged the instant noodles, devouring them frantically. Looking at the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members now, their eyes had transformed from initial fear to fanatical worship.","\"Bo... Boss! That she-de... ahem, Miss Liu really is the reinforcements you called! You really weren't lying to us!\"","\"I knew the boss's plans were flawless! This was definitely all part of the boss's scheme, right...\"","\"Enough said, I just feel so happy right now!\"","\"Instant noodles are so delicious!!!\"","Liu Hao had no time for his lackeys' hindsight flattery. Munching on instant noodles, he eagerly tried to sidle up to Liu Yutong to get chummy.","However, he had only taken two steps when Yun Cheng's icy gaze swept over him.","Though he didn't speak, the look in his eyes was clearly a warning—keep your distance.","Liu Hao immediately slammed on the brakes, giving an awkward smile, not daring to advance further.","\"I... I'll take you to get the item right now, right now.\"",".................","\"Hehe, Miss Liu, see, the item is perfectly fine, just waiting for you to collect it.\"","Liu Hao pulled the packaged key out from under a plank of wood, proudly showing off his achievement to Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong took the key and examined it.","The key wasn't exposed; it was protected by a metal key case that was one size larger. Opening it revealed the actual key inside, which was particularly small and exquisitely crafted.","Liu Hao had always been curious about why both Master Jiu and Liu Yutong were so interested in that object. He stood to the side, grinning foolishly, not leaving, hoping to hear what Liu Yutong might reveal about it.","Unfortunately, he was disappointed.","Liu Yutong had no intention of disclosing the item's origins in front of outsiders and simply put it away.","Liu Hao could only withdraw his gaze, crestfallen.","Holding the item, Liu Yutong turned and got into the car, giving Yun Cheng a quiet instruction.","Yun Cheng nodded and once again approached Liu Hao and his men, who were still standing there dumbfounded and unsure of what to do.","\"Don't say the young lady didn't give you a chance. Gather your men and prepare to take over Master Jiu's establishments.\"","Liu Hao's eyes instantly widened. \"R-really?\" he asked excitedly.","\"On the condition that you don't get involved in HDD. Remember that!\"","\"I remember! I remember! Thank you, Brother Yun! Thank you, Miss Liu! Thank you!\"","After delivering the message, Yun Cheng turned and left coldly.","It wasn't until the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members, dark as a storm cloud, had withdrawn that Liu Hao snapped out of his daze, weeping for joy!","\"Hahaha... My Heavenly Eye has made it!\"","\"Brothers! Gather everyone from the gang! Our era has arrived!\""]},{"number":533,"title":"Chapter 533: 533. Breaking News","paragraphs":["\"Miss, are we really going to hand over Master Jiu's territory to Liu Hao and his gang?\"","\"If one Master Jiu falls, a second, a third will pop up. Since we're not getting involved in the affairs of these underworld figures, letting Liu Hao's people take the territory is better than seeing a second Master Jiu appear.\"","\"Understood. I've already warned them.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Liu Yutong took out that key again, fished the wolf emblem from her bag, and then carefully inserted the key into the tiny lock.","With an almost inaudible click, the key slid in smoothly, a perfect fit.","A moment later.","Holding the storage certificate from Ruishi Bank, Liu Yutong smiled.","This trip was truly worth it.","Although she didn't know what was inside the bank's safe deposit box, it was certainly something of great value.","Then she handed the certificate to Yun Cheng, who was sitting in the passenger seat.","\"Take a look.\"","Yun Cheng took it, examined it carefully, but didn't recognize it. \"Miss, what is this?\"","Liu Yutong explained, \"A storage certificate from Ruishi Bank, and it should be the highest level of confidentiality at that.\"","Yun Cheng was taken aback upon hearing this. Although he wasn't very knowledgeable about such things, hearing the words \"Ruishi Bank\" gave him a rough idea that this item must be extremely valuable.","\"Miss, should we arrange for someone to retrieve the item first? Keeping it at Ruishi Bank might not be entirely safe either.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Have Ma Da bring Ji Yu over, then arrange visas for them. Retrieve the item first and see if there's anything useful.\"","\"Remember, it must be done secretly and discreetly.\"","This kind of task definitely required reliable people to handle. After thinking it over, Ma Da was the most suitable. Originally, she had considered going herself, but a different thought suddenly occurred to her.","Now that the certificate was retrieved, the emblem and key were pretty much useless to her.","Perhaps they could be put to use.","Yun Cheng: \"Alright, I'll contact Ma Da right away and have him come over.\"","After giving these instructions, Liu Yutong added, \"Once the people are arranged, start the search immediately.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\" Yun Cheng responded.","Just then, Liu Yutong suddenly received a text message from an unknown number.","[Liu Yutong, a parting gift for you!]","After reading the message, an intense feeling of foreboding instantly surged within her, and her eyes turned cold.","When she tried calling back, the number was already switched off. She immediately guessed it was probably a disposable, untraceable SIM card.","Phone cards at this time weren't like later ones that required real-name registration. You could buy one at any convenience store, making the source very hard to trace.","\"What's wrong, Miss?\" Yun Cheng also noticed her unusual state.","\"I...\"","Before Liu Yutong could finish, her phone rang again. It was Gao Min calling.","\"Yutong, how are things on your end? Have you found anyone?\"","\"I've already arranged for people to search. I'll let you know as soon as we find them.\"","\"Yutong, I know you've definitely called in people, but please don't act impulsively, don't start a fight with the other party. Without solid evidence, that's illegal. Just let me know as soon as you find them, and I'll get there with my team as fast as I can.\"","\"Don't worry, Sis, I'm a law-abiding citizen. We never do anything illegal. We just caught a group of criminals, actually. Once we find Lin Bin and the others, I'll hand them over to you.\"","Gao Min on the other end of the line: \"...\"","She was at a loss for words.","No matter the situation, whenever she contacted her sister Liu Yutong, a tag of [Merit +1] would inevitably refresh above her own head.","It was just absurd!","Could this girl have some kind of special constitution?","But now wasn't the time to dwell on that. Finding the people was the priority.","\"Yutong, my earlier assessment might have been too optimistic. Fang Yaqiong is likely being held captive too. I'm heading towards the west side of the city based on the clues, hoping to find...\"","Before Gao Min could finish her sentence.","Suddenly!","An extremely sharp screech of brakes came through the phone.","The sound was so piercing that Liu Yutong instinctively pulled the phone away from her ear.","Immediately after—","BANG!!!","A deafening crash erupted from the speaker of Liu Yutong's phone.","After the crash, the phone speaker was instantly filled with chaotic static noise.","Liu Yutong froze completely.","Since her rebirth, she had encountered countless major situations. Apart from initially being unaccustomed to the way Yun Cheng and his associates communicated and resolved problems, once she got used to it, hardly anything could cause such a strong emotional fluctuation in her.","This time, she was genuinely frightened. Especially her eyes, which momentarily held a vacant, lost look.","\"Sis?\"","Liu Yutong called out tremulously into the phone.","No response.","Only that unsettling static noise.","\"Sis! Answer me!\"","\"Sis!!!\"","Liu Yutong suddenly shouted loudly, startling both the driver and Yun Cheng in the car.","\"Miss!\" Yun Cheng also realized something must have happened to Gao Min.","\"Turn around!\"","\"Head to the west side of the city, fastest speed possible!\"","\"Xiao Liu, step on it!\" Yun Cheng immediately shouted.","The driver didn't hesitate, wrenching the steering wheel and flooring the accelerator, speeding towards the west side of the city.","The originally large black convoy was instantly left behind by the Maybach.","The vehicles behind reacted and accelerated to catch up.","\"Miss, was Miss Gao in a car accident?\" Yun Cheng's voice also trembled slightly as he asked.","Gao Min's status in his heart was second only to Liu Yutong's.","Liu Yutong had closed her eyes, trying her best to calm her emotions.","\"Yun Cheng, find her first. We must confirm that my sister is alright.\"","Then she handed her phone to Yun Cheng.","\"Call Gu Yebai. No matter what method he uses, he must find out who this number belongs to!\"","Yun Cheng only needed one glance at the text message to immediately conclude that Gao Min's accident was likely no coincidence.","It was premeditated murder! A provocation aimed at the Miss!","\"Miss, rest assured, I will definitely dig out the culprit!\"","Yun Cheng's voice sounded calm, yet it carried an intimidating, murderous aura.","For the entire journey.","Yun Cheng was almost constantly on the phone, his anxiety palpable, but he forcefully suppressed it, not letting it show.","He feared his own emotions would affect the Miss, who was trying to rest with her eyes closed.","An unknown amount of time passed.","Suddenly, Yun Cheng's other phone rang. He answered swiftly, listened for a few moments, and his eyes abruptly sharpened.","\"Miss, we've found it! Three kilometers ahead, intersection of Binjiang Road and Fenglin Street. There's a crash site, confirmed to be the taxi Miss Gao was in!\"","Liu Yutong's eyes snapped open. \"The situation?\"","\"The scene... is gruesome. The taxi was hit head-on by an out-of-control container truck. The truck driver fled the scene, we're pursuing him. The taxi is almost completely crushed...\"","Yun Cheng didn't dare continue.","\"My sister...\"","\"Verifying... it's being verified right now.\""]},{"number":534,"title":"Chapter 534: 534. A False Alarm","paragraphs":["\"Exact location!\"","\"About two hundred meters south of the intersection!\"","\"Hurry!\"","\"Yes!\"","The black Maybach carrying Liu Yutong accelerated once more, swerving onto Binjiang Road almost in a drift.","By now, police lights were already flashing at the accident scene.","The moment Liu Yutong got out of the car, she rushed toward the scene like a madwoman.","Just as she reached the perimeter of the police cordon, she saw the horrifying sight.","A massive container truck lay diagonally across the center of the road, its front end severely mangled.","Beneath it was a taxi, most of its body crushed into a heap of scrap metal, the model barely recognizable from the remaining color and the wreckage of its rear.","Rescue workers were cutting through the twisted vehicle with tools, but anyone seeing this scene would understand there was absolutely no chance of survival for anyone inside.","\"Young Mistress!\"","Yun Cheng hurriedly got out of the car to chase after her. While pursuing the Young Mistress, he also saw the gruesome scene, and his heart sank completely.","But he had no time for grief. He quickly gestured to the Wanlong Hui members gathering around, signaling them to control the perimeter of the scene and ensure the Young Mistress's safety.","Just as Liu Yutong tried to cross the police line, she was stopped by an officer.","\"Miss, you can't go past here!\"","\"Let me through! My sister might be in that car!\"","\"I'm sorry, you cannot pass. Please move back to a safe distance!\"","\"Young Mistress! Don't go over there! It's dangerous!\"","Just as Liu Yutong tried to charge the cordon again, Yun Cheng, who was right behind her, grabbed her arm.","He absolutely couldn't let the Young Mistress go over and cause a disturbance, hindering the firefighters' rescue efforts.","Moreover, there was leaked fuel on site, posing additional risks.","\"Let me go! Yun Cheng, let go of me! My sister is in there! She might be in there!\" Liu Yutong struggled desperately, tears streaming uncontrollably down her face.","The usually composed, cool, and powerful Young Mistress was now crying like a helpless child.","She didn't dare imagine if Gao Min was really inside that pile of scrap metal...","\"Young Mistress, you can't go!\"","\"Young Mistress, calm down!\"","\"Young Mistress...\"","Besides Yun Cheng, others were also trying to persuade her.","\"Yu... Yutong...\"","Amidst the chaos, a trembling voice drifted into Liu Yutong's ears from behind.","Hearing this voice, Liu Yutong suddenly fell silent. Tears still clung to her long lashes. She even held her breath, afraid that the sound she just heard was merely a hallucination born from overwhelming grief.","Then, she slowly turned her head, her vision blurred with tears, and looked toward the source of the voice.","On the somewhat dimly lit greenbelt behind the sidewalk, a disheveled figure in a light-colored shirt was sitting on the grass, hugging her knees.","It was none other than Gao Min.","Liu Yutong broke free from Yun Cheng's grip and ran toward the huddled figure on the lawn.","The closer she got, the clearer it became.","It was Gao Min!","She was alive! She wasn't in that car!","When Liu Yutong reached Gao Min's side, she didn't say a word. She simply knelt down and pulled her into a tight embrace.","Gao Min's body, which had been trembling uncontrollably, noticeably relaxed in her younger sister's arms.","Strangely, her sister's presence instantly gave her a sense of security, and she wasn't as terrified as before.","\"It's okay now, Sis, it's okay...\"","\"I'm here, it's okay, it's all over...\"","Burying her face in her sister's shoulder, Gao Min burst into loud sobs.","She was afraid she would never forget the sight from earlier; it was the first time she truly felt death was so close.","It was truly horrifying!","A moment later.","Gao Min's emotions gradually calmed, only to be replaced by a rising sense of shame.","She was the older sister!","As the older sister, as a police officer, to have cried in her younger sister's arms, and in front of so many Wanlong Hui members... how utterly embarrassing!","\"Yutong, I'm fine now.\"","\"I just got a bit scared from the fall when I jumped out of the car.\"","As she said this, there was a hint of relief in her voice. Fortunately, the car had slowed down for a red light at the time; otherwise, her injuries would definitely not be as minor as just scrapes and bruises.","\"Sis, how can you say you're fine? You have so many scrapes. We're going to the hospital immediately for a full check-up!\"","\"Yun Cheng, get the car ready!\"","\"Yes, Young Mistress!\"","Gao Min actually wasn't too keen on going to the hospital, especially after seeing the large number of men in black surrounding her sister.","\"The person hasn't been found yet. I'll just apply some antiseptic. I have the contact information for the local police here, please don't do anything rash...\"","Liu Yutong cut her off directly: \"Sis, leave all that to me. You don't need to worry. One hour at most, I will definitely find the person.\"","\"Take my sister to the hospital.\"","Gao Min: \"...\"","Then, she was forcibly placed on a stretcher by several Wanlong Hui members and loaded into an ambulance.","\"Young Mistress!\"","Yun Cheng reported the latest news: \"The people Young Master Gu contacted have sent me a message. The last signal appeared near the Tian Shang Club.\"","Without a second thought, Liu Yutong said: \"Then notify everyone to head to the Tian Shang Club.\"","Yun Cheng: \"But won't that delay finding your classmate, the one Miss Gao mentioned we should look for?\"","Liu Yutong: \"No. As long as we find Master Jiu, we'll find Lin Bin and the others.\"","Hearing this, Yun Cheng immediately understood.","Wasn't that loan shark, Brother Long, one of Master Jiu's underlings?","Once they found Master Jiu, that gang would naturally have to hand over the person.","Also, Gao Min's car accident might very well have been arranged by them.","That bastard must pay!","Little did he know, Master Jiu was also in a panic at this moment. He felt he had been set up, or more accurately, dragged into trouble by association.","By the time he got the news and wanted to send people to capture that man and woman, it was already too late. The two had already boarded a plane through certain means and left the country.","..........."]},{"number":535,"title":"Chapter 535: 535, Ya Ya","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong stood in place, watching as several black cars escorted the ambulance away. Only then did she turn around, preparing to get into her car and leave.","However, just as she reached the car door, a child's tearful voice caught her attention.","\"I want my daddy! Grandma, let me go! I want to go find Daddy! Daddy is lying there so cold...\"","Liu Yutong's steps halted, and she looked towards the source of the sound.","Outside the police tape not far away, a little girl of about four or five years old, her hair tied into two crooked little pigtails, was being held tightly by an elderly woman.","The little girl's face was red from crying, her beautiful big eyes brimming with tears. Her small hands kept reaching towards the figure that had just been lifted from the driver's seat by the rescuers and covered with a white cloth.","\"Daddy! Daddy! Get up!\"","\"Daddy...\"","The elderly woman holding the little girl also had red-rimmed eyes. Clutching the child tightly to prevent her from rushing over, she choked back sobs as she comforted her, \"Yaya, don't cry, don't cry... Daddy is tired, he's asleep...\"","\"You're lying! Daddy would never sleep on the ground! Daddy promised to bring me a little cake tonight! Daddy never lies to Yaya!\" The little girl pounded the woman's arm with her tiny fists, crying even harder.","\"Daddy, get up! Yaya doesn't want cake anymore! Yaya wants Daddy! Daddy, please get up!\"","\"...........\"","Those childish cries of \"Daddy\" were like icy knives, piercing the hearts of every bystander present, including Liu Yutong's.","It seemed she suddenly realized that she wasn't entirely without responsibility for what had happened to this child's father.","After sending someone to briefly inquire with the elderly woman, she learned that the little girl had no other close relatives left; she had become a complete orphan.","The elderly woman was the girl's neighbor. She had brought Yaya to see her father one last time after learning of the accident.","Usually, when the girl's father was out driving his taxi, he would entrust the child to her care. The woman's grandson and Yaya were classmates in kindergarten. The two families had grown close because of the children. Coupled with the woman's kind heart and pity for the father-daughter pair, she often helped pick up and drop off Yaya.","Now, with Yaya's father gone, the child would either be sent to an orphanage or placed with a slightly closer blood relative like an uncle or aunt.","But according to the woman, Yaya's relatives never associated with them; looking down on them for being poor and fearing they would be a burden, they had long since kept their distance.","Yaya's mother had passed away years ago from cancer, leaving behind a large debt that the girl's father had spent many years driving a taxi to repay.","Not long after that, however, Yaya's father was diagnosed with stomach cancer, said to be caused by irregular eating and sleeping habits.","He had no intention of treating it. He only wanted to save as much money as he could in his remaining days for his daughter, so her future wouldn't be too difficult...","The member of the Wanlong Society reporting this to Liu Yutong couldn't hold back his tears by this point.","\"Miss, that little girl has really had it too hard!\"","After listening, Liu Yutong also couldn't help but turn her head away.","\"Yun Cheng!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Give to that child anonymously...\"","Liu Yutong initially wanted to say she would donate some money to the child to ensure she would never have to worry about food and clothing, but the words stopped at her lips.","Then, she made a decision.","She walked directly over to the girl who was still crying and fussing, whom even the police officers couldn't calm down.","Perhaps because of the cool, powerful aura she carried, the voices of the surrounding onlookers unconsciously lowered.","Even the neighbor comforting Yaya noticed this suddenly approaching young woman of exceptional presence and became flustered.","Mainly because this woman was followed by a group of men in black, which was rather intimidating.","Liu Yutong crouched down in front of the little girl, looking at her tear-streaked face.","Yaya also seemed to sense something different about this suddenly appearing beautiful older sister. Shrinking slightly into the neighbor's embrace, her sobs quieted a little.","Liu Yutong extended a hand and said gently, \"Yaya, Daddy has gone to a very faraway place and can't come back to be with Yaya for a while. Would Yaya be willing to come with me?\"","\"I can take you to the amusement park, buy you lots and lots of dolls, and cake.\"","Yaya looked at her through teary, blurred eyes, her little mouth quivering, then looked again in the direction of the ambulance.","\"Daddy...\"","Liu Yutong wasn't impatient. She kept her hand outstretched, waiting for the little girl to decide.","If this child was willing to come with her, then she would take her in. If she wasn't willing, then she would fund her through university.","Yaya looked once more towards her father being loaded into the vehicle, then looked back at the gentle, beautiful sister before her. After a moment of hesitation, she slowly raised her small hand and placed it in Liu Yutong's palm.","Liu Yutong smiled faintly, stood up, and took her hand.","\"Yaya, let's go.\"","Before leaving, she also looked once more towards the ambulance and whispered, \"Rest easy. Your princess will have me from now on.\""]},{"number":536,"title":"Chapter 536: 536. It's so dark outside","paragraphs":["\"Wait! Miss, you can't just take the child away like this!\"","Seeing Liu Yutong about to leave with the little girl, the Auntie grew anxious.","Hearing the commotion, a police officer quickly walked over and said sternly, \"Ma'am, please stop. According to procedure, the child now needs to be placed temporarily with the relevant authorities. You cannot take...\"","Before he could finish, a member of the Wanlong Hui stepped forward, blocking them.","\"Officer, this is Ms. Liu Yutong, the chairwoman of our Wanlong Hui Group. We will take in this child. If you have any questions, you can speak with our company's lawyer. Here is the card.\"","As he spoke, he handed over a business card.","The officer: \"...\"","The Auntie: \"...\"","Are rich people always this overbearing?","However, when they saw Ya Ya getting into a luxurious-looking Maybach with the girl of extraordinary bearing, they gave up the thought of reclaiming the child.","This was perhaps for the best for the child.","Even if they kept the child, the result would be sending her to an orphanage. The Auntie couldn't adopt the child herself; she had her own family. Since this seemingly very wealthy girl was willing to take in the little girl, it was the best possible outcome.","As for the paperwork, it was surely no issue for someone of her stature.","The onlookers had basically learned of Ya Ya's plight from the Auntie and had been worrying about what would happen to her.","But when they saw this seemingly very wealthy stranger actually take Ya Ya in, they couldn't help but discuss.","\"See that car? A Maybach! I heard it costs over ten million fully loaded.\"","\"Wow, that expensive!\"","\"The money is one thing, look at this entourage, those men in black following behind. An ordinary rich person doesn't have this kind of presence. That girl is so young, yet her aura is overwhelming. She must come from an unusual family.\"","\"I think I just heard someone over there say... something about a Wanlong Hui?\"","\"The name sounds a bit unconventional, but it must be a big company. That child has fallen into a nest of blessings following her.\"","\"Yeah, being able to ride in a car like that, protected by people like that, is a thousand times better than going to an orphanage. At the very least, she'll be clothed and fed for life, with someone to look after her.\"","\"Ah, a bitter start leads to a sweet future.\"","\"Anyway, it's good she has a place to go. I hope this little girl grows up free from illness and disaster, smoothly and well.\"","...","Inside the car.","After chatting and getting familiar along the way, Ya Ya had stopped crying.","Children her age have a vague concept of death, and their attention is easily diverted.","Now she sat quietly in the seat, her little hands holding a small cake that had just been bought for her, taking small bites. Her big, dark grape-like eyes had regained their sparkle.","\"Sister, does the very faraway place where Daddy went have cake to eat?\"","Liu Yutong's heart ached slightly. She gently wiped the cream from the corner of Ya Ya's mouth with a wet wipe and said, \"Yes, there is. There's endless sweet cake there. Daddy can eat as much as he wants.\"","\"Really? But... but what if Ya Ya misses Daddy? When will he come back?\"","\"Daddy... he has become the brightest star in the sky.\"","\"When Ya Ya misses Daddy, just look up at the stars and blink at them. Daddy will see it. He will smile at Ya Ya from the star and bless Ya Ya to grow up safe, sound, and happy.\"","\"Daddy can see if I blink?\"","\"Of course he can. But it's too late today; Daddy has already gone to rest.\"","\"Okay then...\"","\"Sister, your car is so big and so pretty.\"","\"Does Ya Ya like it? From now on, sister will often take Ya Ya out in this car, okay?\"","\"We can go to the park with lots of little animals, go to the beach where you can dig in the sand, and sister will buy Ya Ya a big house full of dolls...\"","\"Really? But that would cost lots and lots of money, right?\"","\"Daddy said you shouldn't take things from others casually, earning money is very hard... He had to drive his car for a long, long time to buy Ya Ya one little cake.\"","\"Daddy also said, you must always pay back what you owe others... Sister, Ya Ya... Ya Ya doesn't want a doll house anymore, just one little doll is enough. When Ya Ya grows up, I'll earn money to buy you... um, one, two, three, four... six dolls! And also, lots of yummy cakes for sister to eat!\"","Hearing Ya Ya's words, Liu Yutong was deeply moved. What a sensible child.","\"Sister believes you can definitely do that. But for now, Daddy has gone to rest on the star. He specially asked me to buy you many dolls and take you to many fun places. You have to accept these gifts, so Daddy will be happy up in the sky, understand?\"","Ya Ya looked at Liu Yutong, not fully comprehending, and whispered to confirm, \"Will Daddy really be happy?\"","\"Yes, he will be very, very happy!\"","\"So, Ya Ya just needs to focus on growing up happily. Eat whatever you want to eat, tell sister whatever you want. That's Daddy's and sister's wish, okay?\"","Ya Ya nodded vigorously. \"Mhm! Ya Ya will be good. Ya Ya will be happy!\"","Just then, Yun Cheng's voice came from the front seat.","\"Miss, we've arrived.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong rolled down the window. It was now raining heavily outside.","Ya Ya, who had been happily licking the cake cream, instinctively turned her head to look outside and let out a soft \"Oh!\" \"Sister, it's so dark outside!\"","When she got a clearer look, she couldn't help but say, \"Wow! So many, many brothers in black!\"","Outside, a dense crowd of men in black stood in the heavy rain, surrounding the building ahead bearing the sign \"Heavenly Club\" so tightly that not a drop could get through.","Each of them held a black umbrella. The formation was extremely intimidating. For nearly five hundred meters around, almost no other people could be seen; they had all been scared off.","However, Ya Ya had already seen similarly dressed people around Liu Yutong earlier, and these were also the ones who had brought the cake, so she wasn't afraid. Instead, she proactively waved her little hand out the window.","\"Hello, brothers in black!\"","\"It's raining, don't get wet and catch a cold.\"","Some of the nearby men in black, whose expressions had been stern, couldn't help but smile upon hearing this voice and waved back at her.","Getting a response, Ya Ya said excitedly, \"Sister, they waved back at me.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Really? That means they like Ya Ya too.\"","\"Right!\" Ya Ya laughed, her eyes curving into crescents.","Yun Cheng also couldn't help but chuckle. \"Miss, this kid has potential.\"","Liu Yutong smiled, gently stroked Ya Ya's hair, and instructed, \"Ya Ya, sister needs to get out to take care of something. You be good and stay in the car with the driver brother. You can count. Count to one hundred, and sister will be back, okay?\"","\"Okay! Ya Ya is really good at counting!\"","Ya Ya immediately became serious, her little mouth starting to murmur, \"One, two, three...\"","At the same time, the car door was respectfully opened by a man in black waiting outside.","Then, another man in black almost simultaneously took half a step forward the moment the door opened. With a swift swish, he opened a black umbrella, perfectly shielding the area above the car door from the rain.","Just as Liu Yutong stepped out of the car and stood under the umbrella,","she saw that the countless men in black under their dense array of black umbrellas surrounding the entire clubhouse all bowed their heads slightly toward her direction in unison.","\"Young Mistress!!!\" — hundreds of voices.","The deafening roar instantly drowned out the pouring rain and all surrounding noise."]},{"number":537,"title":"Chapter 537: 537. There are a lot of people","paragraphs":["The commotion at the Sky Club naturally did not escape the notice of certain interested parties.","Months ago, when members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society first appeared in Danan City, they had already caught the attention of some local power players.","At that time, these observers weren't quite sure of their purpose, thinking they were just there to pick a fight with Master Jiu.","In the underworld of Danan City, Master Jiu was undoubtedly one of the most senior figures. He commanded the largest number of men, controlled the most entertainment venues, underground gambling dens, and gray-market territories, and his network of connections was vast and complex. Calling him the local overlord was no exaggeration.","Although in recent years he had become somewhat overconfident, growing increasingly greedy and offending many people, his foundation was solid. Everyone believed that even if the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, coming from Pearl City, wanted to move against him, it would be a pyrrhic victory for both sides, with neither gaining much.","But the scene unfolding before them completely shattered that perception.","What era was this? How could anyone dare to gather such a large crowd to cause trouble?","Of course, setting aside the sheer audacity of it, the scale of this mobilization was undoubtedly the largest and most intimidating spectacle they had witnessed since entering this world.","Neither Master Jiu nor they themselves could easily muster such a force.","In a hotel not far from the Sky Club.","Several of Danan City's prominent figures were sitting by a window, drinking tea.","From their floor, looking down a few hundred meters away, was the dense crowd of Ten Thousand Dragons Society members, though from their angle, all they could see was a continuous sea of black umbrellas.","After their underlings spotted the Ten Thousand Dragons Society mobilizing earlier that day, they had come to this restaurant diagonally opposite the Sky Club and booked this window-side private room specifically to see for themselves what the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was really made of.","Naturally, most of them didn't believe the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would actually dare to cause trouble directly at someone else's establishment.","As the saying goes, this was the 21st century, and they were on the mainland.","Unless your backing was powerful enough to ignore the rules, causing a major incident would never end well.","They also believed that the young lady who had built the Ten Thousand Dragons Society to such a size while remaining unscathed should have that awareness.","However, when they actually saw the dense crowd of black-clad figures surrounding the Sky Club, they all fell silent.","Had they grown old?","Or did the young people nowadays simply not know the meaning of the word \"fear\"?","What they didn't know was that scenes like this had happened countless times before in Pearl City.","\"Old Chen, it seems we all misjudged the situation,\" a man in an elegant suit and glasses couldn't help but sigh. \"We thought it would be a fierce clash of titans, but it turns out to be a crushing force.\"","The man called Old Chen stared at the black mass of people below and said slowly, \"It's not that we misjudged. It's that this young lady of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society never intended to play by the usual rules from the start. I feel this isn't just about seizing territory; she's here to set down the law.\"","Another slightly portly man nearby clicked his tongue upon hearing this. \"Set down the law? For Old Geezer Jiu? Or for us locals here in Danan City?\"","\"I think it's for both.\"","\"I think so too.\"","\"They say a strong dragon cannot suppress a local snake, but this bunch seems to have never taken that saying to heart. How arrogant!\"","\"They have the capital to be arrogant. You try gathering five or six hundred people. Can you do it?\"","\"I certainly can't. I'd be afraid of getting rounded up by the authorities.\"","\"Hahaha... You two cowards, with such timid hearts, and you used to be part of this world.\"","\"Lao Song, don't laugh at us. If you had this many people, and in this day and age, would you dare to so brazenly bring them out to smash someone else's place? Would you dare?!\"","\"I wouldn't! So what? Am I proud of it? Am I boasting?\"","\"Damn, you really have no shame!\"","\"Is it that we've gotten old? Or are the younger generation regressing? I really don't understand it anymore.\"","\"Tsk tsk... What a display, what a show of force! Old Geezer Jiu is probably done for this time!\"","\"Master Jiu has overreached in recent years, his appetite too big, offending many people. The Ten Thousand Dragons Society's move probably suits a lot of people's wishes. I just never imagined she'd use the most direct, most domineering method.\"","\"That's exactly what's most frightening about these young people nowadays. They pay no heed to social niceties or conventions; they just charge in headfirst. If this battle truly finishes off Master Jiu, who in Danan City would dare defy the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?\"","\"Exactly! Having such an overbearing ruler come to Danan City isn't good news for us either.\"","\"Ah, the new generation replaces the old. From now on, Danan City will be the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's domain. We'll all have to learn to keep our heads down.\"","\"Who cares? I've long since washed my hands of that life anyway. I just won't provoke them in the future.\"","\"Right now, I just want to know what expression Old Geezer Jiu has on his face in his office. It must be priceless! Hahaha!\"","\"...\"","Top floor of the Sky Club.","Master Jiu was currently in his office with the club's general manager, also his top confidant, discussing how to deal with the potential threat from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","He was especially alarmed after learning that the couple who had been in his office earlier had been so brazen as to target Liu Yutong's sister—he only found out later that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's young lady had an older sister.","This terrified him.","He had just reconciled with her through the city's richest man's mediation, and now another incident had occurred.","Almost all the setbacks he had suffered in recent years were caused by the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. He would love nothing more than for Liu Yutong herself to meet misfortune. If those two could have taken care of Liu Yutong, he'd probably be so happy he'd run naked in the streets.","But if only Liu Yutong's sister came to harm, that would be the absolute worst outcome for him.","That woman would surely go mad.","In any case, why cause trouble now of all times? At least wait until he had transferred his assets and gotten hold of that thing from Green Hair before stirring things up, right?","After getting the news, Master Jiu immediately sent men to capture the man and woman, intending to give Liu Yutong an explanation. But he was a step too late; they had already boarded a plane and left the country.","No need to guess, he would definitely face Liu Yutong's wrath.","Master Jiu had just finished listening to the general manager's report on the status of asset consolidation and plans to placate the woman who might come knocking.","BANG!","A subordinate stumbled into the office in a panic.","\"Boss! Boss! It's bad! The... the building... it's surrounded!\"","Interrupted abruptly, Master Jiu's temper flared. \"What's all the panic? Get a hold of yourself! Who dares to cause trouble at my place? Take a few men and send them packing! Why bother me with such a trivial matter?!\"","Having been in the underworld for over a decade, he had seen all sorts of storms. The occasional drunk causing a scene or some foolhardy punk coming to pick a fight was commonplace.","Just deal with it.","\"But Boss... it's not like that!\"","The younger brother stammered, \"Not a few! It's... it's so many! A huge crowd of people! A dense, black mass of them! They've blocked the front door, the back door, every exit of our club! All dressed in black!\"","\"Is it the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?\"","Master Jiu sprang to his feet, asking with a hint of panic, \"Is it that woman from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? She actually dares to come? How many did she bring?\"","He still held onto a sliver of hope, thinking the other side wouldn't dare be too brazen, wouldn't bring too many people.","After all, these days, large-scale gatherings are a major taboo.","And if you gather a large crowd to smash someone else's establishment, that's a taboo within a taboo.","Unless your backing reaches the heavens, there's absolutely no escaping the iron fist from above.","In all his years in the underworld, he himself had rarely gathered over a hundred people.","Too many people make you a big target, and even if you send out a lot, you have to split them up, making it easier to scatter if needed.","Just like when they grabbed those Green Hair guys before, they acted in batches too.","Of course, doing it this way has its downsides—it's easier for people to slip away.","The younger brother was on the verge of tears, holding up two fingers, then thinking better of it, just frantically gesturing with his hands.","\"There are so many people! At least... at least this many! No, no, you can't even count them all, boss, we should run!\""]},{"number":538,"title":"Chapter 538: 538. The phone call cannot get through.","paragraphs":["\"Are there a lot of people?\"","Master Jiu's eyelid twitched violently. He walked silently to the window and looked down. His heart instantly sank to the pit of his stomach.","The street was eerily silent, not a single car in sight. Of course, even if there were cars, no one would dare drive onto this street now. Who wouldn't be terrified by a spectacle like this?","Below, a dense mass of black umbrellas spread across the entire street like a dark cloud.","Underneath each umbrella stood a figure clad in a uniform black suit.","Not a sound was made, yet the sense of oppression was overwhelming.","\"This... this is fucking...\"","Master Jiu's voice trembled as he spoke. \"Has Liu Yutong gone mad? What does she think she's doing with so many people? Didn't I already settle things with her?!\"","After the initial shock, a surge of rage instantly flooded his heart.","He had dominated the South City for decades. When had anyone ever dared to bully him like this, right at his doorstep?","\"Damn it! This is too much!\"","\"This is going too far!\"","Master Jiu turned around and kicked over the coffee table in front of him. \"Do they really think I, Master Jiu, am made of clay? Call the men! Now! Immediately! Get all our brothers here! Let's see if her Ten Thousand Dragons Society men are tougher, or if my blades are sharper!\"","\"Today, I'll fight her to the death!\"","\"Boss, we... we called!\"","\"We contacted everyone we could! But... but our men are scattered across all the different venues. We can't possibly gather this many on such short notice! And... and with the rain so heavy outside, the phones aren't getting through...\"","Master Jiu: \"???\"","\"Phones aren't getting through? What does that have to do with the rain?\"","Underling: \"I think they either don't dare to come, or they've been... been taken down.\"","Of course, he didn't voice the other thought: a lot of their brothers were currently sitting behind bars. Their manpower was nowhere near what it used to be.","\"Useless! A bunch of useless trash!\"","After cursing, Master Jiu calmed down again.","He was, after all, a seasoned player. Anger hadn't completely clouded his judgment.","A head-on confrontation would definitely be a losing proposition right now.","After adjusting his emotions, he began to mobilize the network of connections he had built up over more than a decade.","\"Phone! Get me my phone!\" Master Jiu roared.","The general manager immediately handed over his private cell phone.","Master Jiu quickly dialed the first number—a certain deputy director in charge of security for this district.","The phone rang for a long time before it was answered.","\"Hello? Old Jiu, what is it?\"","\"Director Wang! Save me, Director Wang!\"","\"My club is surrounded by a gang of thugs! Hundreds of them! It's complete lawlessness! You have to send men over immediately! Otherwise, something terrible is going to happen!\"","There was a few seconds of silence on the other end, followed by an apologetic voice.","\"Old Jiu, we've received some reports about this situation as well. But you see, with this weather, mobilizing police force is quite difficult. And currently, the other side is merely gathered; there hasn't been any substantive conflict. It's not appropriate for us to intervene rashly. How about you keep observing the situation? Stay calm, don't do anything impulsive. Wait until daylight, then we'll see...\"","\"Wait until daylight?\"","\"By daylight, my place will be torn down! Director Wang, you can't just...\"","\"Ah, my phone's running out of battery, I can't hear you clearly. Let's leave it at that. I'll contact you later after I charge it a bit.\"","Before he could finish, the other party hung up directly.","Listening to the busy tone from his phone, Master Jiu was stunned.","What?","He just hung up like that?","Such blatantly illegal activity, and they won't even do anything about it?","Unwilling to give up, Master Jiu dialed several numbers of guys he usually called brothers, who hadn't taken few benefits from him.","Without exception, these calls were either busy, had poor signal and were inaudible, or were just like Director Wang—full of various excuses and evasions. They spouted bureaucratic nonsense about the other side having permits, gatherings not being illegal, needing to follow procedures, waiting until he was done for before they could act, and so on.","If he was done for, how would he even call the police then?","Wouldn't it be far too late by then?","Could it be that this is what they mean by 'brothers in heart, but the phone never connects'?","When he finally processed this, a chill ran through his heart.","What kind of background did this Liu Yutong have, to so easily neutralize all his connections?","But he still refused to give up. He dialed the last number—Huang Yu, the city's richest man.","Huang Yu, hearing of Master Jiu's predicament on the other end of the line, was also furious.","Not furious that Master Jiu's venue was about to be raided, but furious that he, himself, had been ignored by a mere young woman. He had just mediated a settlement not long ago, and now she was turning around to move against his business partner. Wasn't this a slap in his face?","Moreover, if something really happened to Master Jiu, he would be affected too, especially financially. He had already been summoned for a talk by the leadership once.","\"This girl has no idea how high the sky is or how thick the earth is. Hold on, I'll contact someone to resolve this.\"","The influence of the richest man was not to be underestimated either. He knew plenty of connections, and his relationships were far beyond what someone like Master Jiu could compare to.","Hearing this, Master Jiu was about to breathe a sigh of relief when he suddenly heard a huge commotion from downstairs. He panicked instantly.","\"Mr. Huang, how long do I need to hold on for?\"","\"Hmm... tomorrow at the latest. People need their rest too, you know.\"","\"???\"","Master Jiu, phone in hand, rushed back to the window and stared down intently.","Finally, he uttered three words into the phone: \"Fuck your mother!\"","..............","The rain continued to fall.","The cold raindrops hammered against the countless black umbrella canopies, producing a dull, thudding sound.","The originally dense crowd of black-clad figures began to lean and part towards a central point, clearing a passage wide enough for a person to walk through.","Then, the gazes of all the black-clad figures snapped in unison towards the black Maybach that had just come to a stop.","As a woman stepped out of the car, everyone immediately bowed in greeting.","\"Young Mistress!\"","In that instant, only one thought remained in Master Jiu's mind.","This woman... is terrifying!","This wasn't his first time dealing with Liu Yutong's Ten Thousand Dragons Society, but he had never been as shaken as he was today, with her forces literally at his gates.","He had never imagined that someone could run the underworld so formally, with such discipline, such cohesion.","More organized than the organized crime!","Perhaps sensing his gaze.","Liu Yutong happened to look up towards the upper floor. Master Jiu's heart constricted violently.","Did she notice him peeking?","Before he could think further, he saw the woman raise her hand, pointing in the direction of his club. Her red lips parted slightly, uttering two icy words.","\"Smash it.\""]},{"number":539,"title":"Chapter 539: The 539th Chapter, The Eagle Elder's Finale","paragraphs":["Downstairs, the massive, dark crowd of people sprang into action the moment Liu Yutong gave the command.","\"Smash it!\"","\"Take down anyone who dares to stand in our way!\"","\"Charge!\"","\"...\"","A massive number of men in black donned yellow hard hats they had prepared in advance. Wielding special weapons like large fire axes and demolition hammers, they charged toward the Tianshang Club.","As soon as they reached the club's entrance, a portion of the men in black skillfully used umbrellas to cover the security cameras around the area. Immediately after, a cacophony of crashing and smashing echoed through the air.","The two majestic stone lions at the entrance.","\"Smash them!\"","The glass front doors.","\"Smash them!\"","The marble walls and Roman columns.","\"Smash them!\"","In short, anything that displeased the eye or was within easy reach did not escape its fate and was completely destroyed.","However, despite unleashing a storm of destruction upon the club, they were surprisingly polite. They even dispatched a specific team to evacuate the innocent patrons inside.","\"Go! Everyone out! We're suspending business for rectification and renovations!\"","\"What? When will it reopen? You're asking the wrong person. You have to ask the boss here. We're only responsible for the demolition!\"","\"...\"","Meanwhile.","\"Re... Reporting to the boss! Something huge has happened downstairs! Those men in black really forced their way in!\" A subordinate wearing a security uniform stumbled and crawled into the office.","A surge of furious anger flared up in Master Jiu's heart. The enemy was already at the fucking gates, did he really need this guy to report it?","\"Speak!\"","\"Down... Downstairs! Those men in black pulled out... pulled out the heavy hardware!\"","Heavy hardware?","Could that crazy bitch Liu Yutong actually dare to use guns?","Has she completely lost her mind?!","\"What heavy hardware? Are they shotguns?\"","\"Well, no... but they have hydraulic cutters, sledgehammers, and... and hammer drills!\"","Master Jiu: \"???\"","General Manager: \"???\"","Wait, what the hell? Are they here to seek revenge or to demolish the building?","Master Jiu hurriedly ran to the exclusive security room on the top floor. The scene of flashing blades and bloody combat he had imagined didn't appear, mainly because his subordinates and security guards couldn't hold the line at all.","The most crucial point was that the other side seemed to have come prepared. Only a sea of black could be seen on the monitors, with nothing else visible. However, through the clanging and buzzing sounds echoing from the stairwell, they could still feel the ferocious destructive power. Combined with the real-time reports from his subordinates over the walkie-talkies, they could vividly picture the scene unfolding downstairs in their minds.","The efficiency of the men in black from the Wanlong Syndicate was extremely high. Not only did everyone wear hard hats, but they were also divided into dozens of small squads.","Some were responsible for evacuating the crowd, some specialized in clearing out and subduing the thugs and security guards inside the club, some set up caution tape to prevent falling debris from hitting anyone, and other teams acted like professional construction crews. Wielding hydraulic shears, sledgehammers, power drills, and other tools, they mercilessly smashed the club's glass doors, marble floors, walls, and gilded decorations.","If it weren't for the black outfits they were wearing, they would genuinely look like a professional demolition team.","Listening to the reports, Master Jiu felt entirely numb. They were actually going to completely tear down his fucking club!","One must know that the renovations for this club alone had cost nearly a hundred million, making it incredibly luxurious. If it was all smashed to pieces, the losses would be disastrous.","\"Crazy! This woman is absolutely crazy!\" Master Jiu clutched his chest, feeling like he was about to have a heart attack.","But the people downstairs continued their real-time reports.","\"Boss, this is bad! They've finished smashing the first floor and are charging up to the second!\"","\"Boss, the bar counter and the supermarket section on the second floor have been smashed! All the liquor was hosed down with the fire hydrant! The 1982 Lafite! They sprayed it like tap water!\"","\"Boss, they're on the third floor! The water wall in the Crystal Palace VIP room was smashed through with a sledgehammer, and the water is spilling out! It's flooded! Everything is flooded!\"","\"Boss, the equipment in the third-floor casino...\"","\"What happened to the casino equipment?!\"","\"They actually didn't smash this, but they put official seals on everything, saying something about these being their performance metrics?\"","\"Performance metrics?\"","Before Master Jiu could even react, another bombshell of news arrived, hitting him so hard it made his head spin.","\"Boss, they've emptied out the finance office! The safes, the documents, they even packed up our finance staff and carried them away!\"","Master Jiu was truly panicking now. He yelled into the walkie-talkie, \"Stop them! Hurry! Send people to stop them!\"","\"We can't stop them, Boss! They have too many people! We can't hold them off at all!\"","\"Boss, why don't we just surrender? In eighteen years, we'll be reborn as real men again!\"","\"Boss, I'm injured. Can we still get workers' compensation?\"","\"Boss, how about you settle this month's wages for us first?\"","\"Boss? Boss? Are you still there?\"","\"May the whole family of anyone who withholds wages drop dead!\"","\"...\"","Listening to this, Master Jiu's blood pressure skyrocketed. He smashed the walkie-talkie onto the ground, his vision turning black in waves.","He had been in the underworld for more than half his life; what kind of scenes had he not seen?","But this bandit-style demolition and smashing, and even kidnapping the finance personnel, was truly a first for him.","Was this Liu Yutong a devil?!","The general manager still had a bit of reason left and suddenly shouted, \"Boss! Hurry! We need to escape through the secret passage we left! As long as we make it out alive, we can always make a comeback!\"","Because their club was involved in some illegal businesses, they had specially built a secret passage to make it easier for guests to flee during police raids for gambling or prostitution.","Master Jiu jolted. That's right!","The club had specifically built an emergency passage. After going down to the basement, a quick turn would lead to a relatively narrow alley behind the club.","Unable to spare another moment to mourn the loss of the club, the few of them hurriedly packed up the important documents, gold, and other valuables in the office. They called a few reliable confidants to follow them and made their escape.","He had never been this wretched in his entire life. As he ran, he cursed all eighteen generations of Liu Yutong's ancestors in his heart.","Fortunately, this passage in the club was hidden well enough, and they didn't run into anyone from the Wanlong Syndicate on their way down.","Just as they were about to reach the final hidden door leading to the alley, Master Jiu couldn't help but stop in his tracks. He looked back at the club that was about to be reduced to ruins, a flash of absolute resolve crossing his eyes.","\"Liu Yutong, you forced my hand. Worst comes to worst, we'll die together!\"","Liu Yutong bringing so many people to smash up the club had cost him tens of millions at the very least. As long as he spent a massive amount of money to expose this incident to the public, that woman would definitely be in deep trouble.","Once such an extremely egregious incident created public uproar, it wouldn't be something that could be suppressed just because someone wanted it to be.","In short, as long as it could be exposed, no leader, no matter how powerful, would be able to protect that Liu Yutong.","\"Let's go!\"","Having made his decision, Master Jiu forcefully pushed open the small exit door that was camouflaged as a trash can. But the moment he poked his head out, the group of men instantly froze.","The rain was still falling.","In front of the secret passage's exit, a row of Wanlong Syndicate members stood neatly in formation, holding black umbrellas.","Leading them was a gentle-looking young man wearing gold-rimmed glasses. He held no weapons in his hands, only a single file folder.","\"Master Jiu, sorry to keep you waiting. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Zhao Tianyi, the chief attorney of Tianyi Law Firm. Regarding the demolition of your club, we need your cooperation to sign off and confirm that our demolition work has been thoroughly executed, and that there was no stalling on our part.\"","\"Agreement? What agreement? I never signed any damn thing!\" Master Jiu roared as he finally snapped back to his senses.","\"Look at you. If your memory is failing with age, you really should take some supplements. How could you forget something so important? Why don't you think back carefully? A while ago, you had dinner with Richest Man Huang and our Young Lady. Didn't you sign an agreement then? It was made in duplicate, so you should have a copy yourself.\"","\"Think hard.\"","Prompted by Zhao Tianyi's reminder, Master Jiu's eyes suddenly widened. He did remember it now.","Some time ago, he had indeed signed a contracting agreement regarding renovation and demolition. At the time, he couldn't fathom why Liu Yutong wanted him to sign such a thing. He merely assumed she knew about the real estate project he and Richest Man Huang were working on and wanted a piece of the pie from the renovation contracts, so he signed it.","Of course, he didn't have much of a choice. If he hadn't signed, Liu Yutong would never have agreed to a truce.","Looking back on it now, this was entirely premeditated!","That woman was far too vicious and calculating!","Seeing him fall silent, Zhao Tianyi added, \"Of course, taking into account the emotional distress the demolition process may have caused you, and in accordance with the supplementary clauses of the agreement you signed, we are willing to pay the compensation in full.\"","With that, he pulled a check from his folder and handed it over.","Master Jiu took the check. Glancing at it, he saw the amount glaring back at him: One Yuan.","They smashed a club he had spent nearly a hundred million to renovate, and the compensation was a single yuan?","He looked up at Attorney Zhao's thoroughly detestable smile. Suddenly, a sweet metallic taste coated his throat as a surge of blood rushed up.","\"You... all of you... Pfft!\"","Master Jiu pointed a trembling finger at Attorney Zhao before violently spewing a mouthful of blood. His vision went black, and he fell stiffly backward, losing consciousness.","Zhao Tianyi stared expressionlessly at the collapsed Master Jiu and waved a hand at the men in black behind him. \"Master Jiu got a little too emotional and fainted. Take him back and properly 'treat his illness.' Remember, we are law-abiding citizens; we must demonstrate humanitarian care.\"","\"Understood!\"","Two men in black stepped forward. Grabbing one ankle each, they roughly dragged Master Jiu out of the alley like a dead dog.","It wasn't that they were doing it on purpose; they simply weren't strong enough to carry him.","Zhao Tianyi then took out his phone and dialed a number, his tone turning respectful.","\"Young Lady, everything is taken care of on my end. It is all strictly legal and compliant. You can give a proper account to whoever comes asking.\"","\"Good!\"","Amidst the pouring rain.","Following a tremendous crash from within, the signboard of the Tianshang Club finally gave way under the strain and plummeted to the ground with a resounding boom!"]},{"number":540,"title":"Chapter 540: 540、Is Lord Condor Dead","paragraphs":["The moment the sign of the Tian Shang Club came crashing down, the several bosses watching from a private room in a distant restaurant collectively drew a sharp, cold breath.","\"He actually had it demolished? Even the sign was taken down. This is about completely uprooting Master Jiu!\"","\"Ruthless! This method is too ruthless!\"","\"It seems we all severely underestimated this young lady's methods and audacity. She really dared to do this!\"","\"Madmen! Everyone in the Wan Long Hui is a complete madman!\"","\"No, no, I need to call my men for a meeting immediately. From now on, when you see anyone from Wan Long Hui—no, anyone in a black suit—you all steer clear. Don't you dare provoke them!\"","\"I need to hold a meeting too. These people... I truly cannot afford to mess with.\"","\"Thank god I washed my hands of this business. From now on, whoever wants to mix in these circles can go ahead!\"","\"........\"","They discussed the matter with lingering fear for a while.","Just then, a junior brother they had sent to gather information knocked and entered the private room, his face filled with terror as he reported the latest news.","\"Something huge happened at the Tian Shang Club! The Wan Long Hui people are too fierce... they completely flattened Master Jiu's stronghold!\"","\"Mm, we saw. What are the specifics?\"","\"Master Jiu's Tian Shang Club was completely smashed to rubble. The losses are no less than seventy or eighty million!\"","\"Those people are too savage!\"","\"We're not blind. Can you tell us something we don't know?\" one boss finally interrupted impatiently. He'd been spouting nonsense all this time.","Only then did the junior brother notice that the bosses here had a perfect view of the club's entirety. What he had said was indeed useless.","But he immediately remembered a piece of news he had just received.","\"Yes, there's new news. Just now, my distant cousin's second uncle's neighbor passed by an alley behind the club. He said he saw the club's owner, Master Jiu.\"","The men immediately became serious. \"Master Jiu escaped?\"","The junior brother shook his head. \"He didn't get away. Said he was cornered right there by those Wan Long Hui men in black.\"","\"My distant cousin's second uncle's neighbor said Master Jiu was done for right then. He was beaten until he vomited blood, then just gasped and passed out. Later, the Wan Long Hui people dragged him away like a dead dog. He also said when Master Jiu was dragged out, his face was deathly pale, not a sound from him. Chances are nine out of ten he's gone!\"","Before his words faded, another boss's phone rang. It was a call from his subordinate, corroborating the news.","\"Boss, Wan Long Hui is too ruthless, even more vicious than we were back in the day. We absolutely must not offend them from now on. It's terrifying!\"","\"Get to the point!\"","\"Master Jiu is probably really gone. My buddy saw him being dragged out of the alley with his own eyes, face covered in blood. Definitely not okay. He also overheard the men in black saying something about 'humanitarianism,' probably meaning they're going to handle Master Jiu's... final arrangements.\"","\"That's one thing Wan Long Hui does with some propriety, at least they'll take care of the body.\"","\"Boss, we really have to be careful from now on.\"","Everyone: \"........\"","After hanging up, deathly silence fell over the private room, broken only by the bubbling of the hot pot.","The men looked at each other, seeing fear and retrospective dread in each other's eyes.","\"We still underestimated Wan Long Hui. Originally thought they wouldn't dare be so brazen in broad daylight... no, on a night like this. Never imagined they'd actually finish off Master Jiu.\"","\"Tell me, what kind of powerful backing does Liu Yutong have behind her to dare do something this outrageous? If it were me, even at my most arrogant and reckless ten years ago, I'd never dare casually off someone. Getting caught means eating a lead peanut.\"","\"Stop talking. From today, Da Nan City belongs to the Liu family. We'd all better watch our step.\"","Everyone present nodded silently, each deciding to go back and... well, not enshrine Liu Yutong's portrait, but definitely put her at the very top of the absolute \"do-not-provoke\" list.","................","On the other side.","Liu Yutong was listening to Gu Yebai ramble on about the pressure he was facing because of her.","\"Sis Yutong, you have no idea. Word that I helped you smooth things over got to my old man's ears. What you guys did was way too big! In my opinion, if you catch someone, take them to a deserted place and do whatever. But you just brazenly smashed the place up right there. My dad is really angry.\"","\"He says this matter must be accounted for to him, but how am I supposed to account for it?\"","Right then, Yaya, sitting in the back seat of the car, stretched out her tiny, tender hand, holding a small roll of transparent tape.","\"Big brother, you don't even have any tape? I have some here, you can have it.\"","Gu Yebai took the tape, utterly confused, and turned to look at Liu Yutong. \"Just... just give me this tape? To go directly and seal my dad's mouth with it? Wouldn't that be suicide? Besides my mom, who in this world has the guts to do that...\"","Liu Yutong was caught between laughter and tears. \"Don't worry, I will definitely give you an account.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth.","Zhao Tianyi had someone bring over the signed contract. When Gu Yebai saw the contents of the contract, he couldn't help but give Liu Yutong a thumbs up. \"As expected of Sis Yutong. Brilliant!\"","\"Now my dad will have nothing to say.\"","Liu Yutong: \"I told you we are a legitimate company, only doing legitimate business, never engaging in illegal activities. Why don't you believe me?\"","Hearing this, Gu Yebai glanced out the window at the dense crowd of men in black who had finished their tasks and were now boarding vehicles one after another. He thought to himself, \"I'd like to believe... but this scene makes it really hard to believe!\"","But now that he had the \"account\" in hand, he could go back and report to his old man.","Only after Gu Yebai left did a large number of police officers begin to arrive on the scene.","Far from arresting any of the men in black who had just participated in the demolition, they directly sealed up the Tian Shang Club with official notices and took all the club employees and hoodlums away for investigation.","The scene looked as if they had come specifically to clean up after Wan Long Hui.","This final act left the bosses who had just walked out of the hotel speechless once more.","After a long while, someone finally spoke.","\"Let's go home and sleep. The sky... has turned dark.\""]},{"number":541,"title":"Chapter 541: 541. Unexpected News, Setting Sail Soon","paragraphs":["Master Jiu had just woken up and found himself lying in a hospital, but it terrified him instead.","Because directly in front of him, rows of cold storage cabinets were clearly arranged.","\"This... this is the morgue?\"","\"Are the people from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society planning to give me the full package service, sending me off directly?\"","\"How utterly ruthless!\"","After realizing the situation, Master Jiu shuddered, abruptly sat up, and scrambled towards the door, shouting, \"Help!\"","\"Help! Let me out! I'm alive! I'm not dead!\"","\"........\"","Just as he was on the verge of breaking down, the iron door suddenly creaked open from the outside.","Several men wearing the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's signature black suits stood at the doorway.","The leader was a fat man, and behind him followed an exceptionally tall giant. Master Jiu recognized both of them; his first setback, even having his head shaved bald, was thanks to them.","\"Master Jiu, awake? I thought you were reluctant to wake up. If you really hadn't woken up, there'd be a spot here just for you.\"","Master Jiu: \"You wouldn't dare! In broad daylight, if you really kill me, you will definitely........\"","Ma Da: \"Oh ho, threatening me?\"","\"Brother Ma hasn't exercised in a long time. Grab him, put the vest on him!\"","As soon as the words fell, the nearby men in black swiftly moved into action.","Two men in black pinned Master Jiu down from left and right, while another took out a specially made chest protector from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society and put it on him.","\"Ah... Ma Da... You dare! Your Ten Thousand Dragons Society is lawless, you'll get your retribution sooner or later....\"","\"Ah-da!\"","\"You really dare... Ma Da, do you believe I...\"","\"Ah-da!\"","\"Stop! All of you stop! I know Chief Wang...\"","\"Ah-da!\"","\"I have connections with Richest Man Huang. If you beat me, he won't let you off...\"","\"Ah-da!\"","A few minutes later, Master Jiu suddenly felt something was off.","\"Huh... why can I still withstand it?\"","He clearly felt Ma Da was using a lot of force, and he did feel pain, but the pain was within bearable limits.","Ma Da threw several dozen punches in a row, sweat dripping down, and seeing that Master Jiu not only didn't beg for mercy but instead seemed to be getting more spirited, he instantly felt insulted.","\"Which factory made this vest? The quality is terrible! Refund! Must get a refund!\"","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society members looked at each other, their eyes involuntarily drifting towards Ma Da's round belly, thinking, \"Could it be that Brother Ma's strength isn't enough?\"","Of course, they didn't dare say this to his face, only promising to have a factory specially customize a vest that would let Brother Ma feel the joy too.","Master Jiu almost couldn't hold back, nearly laughing out loud.","He figured it out; it wasn't the vest's problem, it was that this fat guy was too weak.","Ma Da saw Master Jiu actually dared to laugh at him and was thoroughly enraged. He directly said to the giant behind him, \"Ji Yu, you do it.\"","Ji Yu immediately walked up to Master Jiu and raised a fist.","Master Jiu looked at Ji Yu's fist, which was bigger than his own head, and the smile on his face froze instantly, cold sweat breaking out immediately.","\"No, no, no, it'll kill a man!\"","\"Big brother! It really will kill a man!\"","\"I was wrong! I was wrong!\"","\"I'll tell everything, I really will tell everything......\"","\"Ah!\"","\".........\"","To save his own skin, Master Jiu practically poured his heart out, confessing all his shady dealings.","Because just now, Ji Yu had used only ten percent of his strength and sent him flying several meters, slamming heavily into a cold storage cabinet. He happened to see an open cabinet next to him and almost vomited, his psychological defenses instantly collapsing.","Ma Da listened while signaling the nearby man in black responsible for recording to hurry up and take notes.","Half an hour later.","\"Anything else?\"","\"Probably not, right?\"","\"Think carefully. If you can't think properly, you'll sleep here tonight. This place is never short of beds anyway.\"","\"No! Please no!\"","Master Jiu didn't want to stay there for one more second. The corpse he saw just now could only be described as mutilated; it was too terrifying.","Then he racked his brains to think of any bad deeds he had done, and actually remembered one.","\"Yes... there's one more. About nine or ten years ago, someone from Pearl City came over. He seemed to have killed someone, paid a lot of money to use my old sea route back then, and was sent out overnight... to... to the Western Continent.\"","\"What did you say?!\"","Suddenly!","A woman with her arm bandaged rushed in through the door. It was Gao Min.","\"What was that person's name? What did he look like?!\"","Master Jiu was startled by Gao Min's reaction but honestly said, \"That... that man seemed to have a scar on his face, looked quite fierce. He paid a lot of money, demanded to leave immediately, so I arranged for him to board a fishing boat to international waters and then transfer to another ship...\"","\"Specific time, location, who was the contact person back then? Speak quickly!\" Gao Min asked agitatedly, \"Speak quickly!!!\"","Ma Da saw her losing control and quickly stepped forward to hold her back: \"Officer Gao, calm down. Ask questions slowly, can't rush.\"","After saying that, he backhanded punched Master Jiu: \"Ah-da!\"","\"Hurry up and speak! Dragging your feet, tell Officer Gao who it was! Speak quickly!\"","\"Still not talking?! Ji Yu, teach him a lesson!\"","Master Jiu: \"???\"","What the... it's been so many years, at least let me think about it?","\"Hey hey... I'm thinking, I'm thinking... Ah! You beasts!!!\"","\"........\"","...........","In the VIP hospital room.","Liu Yutong walked in slowly, holding a cup of warm milk.","Gao Min was sitting on a chair by the window, gazing at the nightscape of Danan City, her eyes somewhat vacant.","\"Sister, have some milk, warm yourself up.\"","Liu Yutong placed the milk on the table in front of Gao Min, then pulled over a chair for herself and sat beside Gao Min.","Gao Min turned to look at her: \"Yutong, am I very useless?\"","Liu Yutong held Gao Min's hand: \"Sis, you mustn't say that. Sooner or later, you will personally arrest that murderer.\"","After settling Ya Ya, she had come straight to the hospital and learned an unexpected piece of news from Ma Da: Master Jiu might know clues about Gao Min's father.","It's just that the result wasn't too good; he had fled overseas. Finding someone overseas isn't easy.","She even felt somewhat speechless; why do all the enemies seem to have fled overseas? Is the foreign moon that much rounder? Including the two main culprits who nearly killed her sister, they also escaped abroad.","Little did she know, from those people's perspective, at least you can see the moon abroad; staying here you'd only see darkness...","It seems going abroad is inevitable sooner or later.","Gao Min: \"But it's been almost ten years now. It's a vast world of people, not to mention it's overseas. If that person is in a country without an extradition treaty, I won't even be able to arrest him...\"","Liu Yutong comforted her, \"Don't worry, sis. As long as he's still alive, as long as he's somewhere on this planet, we will definitely track him down!\"","Gao Min looked at this sister, a few years younger than herself yet already a formidable figure in her own right, with a surge of complex emotions.","She knew Liu Yutong rarely made empty promises; what her sister set her mind to, she seemed to accomplish without fail.","Though she felt a twinge of shame—needing help from her younger sister to catch a criminal—her heart was deeply moved nonetheless.","\"Yutong, thank you.\"","\"If it weren't for you, I might never have caught my father's killer.\"","\"No need for such words between us.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"You're my sister. Your business is my business. I'll expedite the process; it won't be long before the Wanlong Society sets sail!\"","Outside the window, the rain had gradually ceased without them noticing.","A faint light began to seep through the eastern horizon, signaling that this long night was finally nearing its end.","Gao Min gave a soft murmur of agreement and rested her head on Liu Yutong's shoulder, feeling a long-lost sense of peace and warmth.","Perhaps apprehending the culprit would still take some time, but at least she was no longer facing it alone.","She also held firm to the belief that the truth would eventually come to light.","Because she had a sister with seemingly limitless reach..."]},{"number":542,"title":"Chapter 542: 542. Farewell.","paragraphs":["The next day.","Liu Yutong arranged for someone to help Gao Min complete the hospital discharge procedures. Gao Min was relatively fortunate, having only suffered scrapes and bruises without any bone fractures. After a comprehensive check-up confirmed she was fine, she was cleared to leave the hospital.","Moreover, she had work waiting for her to handle... or more accurately, credit waiting to be claimed.","First, the hit-and-run driver who had fled had been apprehended. This wasn't particularly surprising, as Liu Yutong had already put in a word with Gu Yebai and his associates.","With the combined efforts of a strong police force and members of the Wanlong Hui in pursuit, the driver had no chance of escape.","Once caught, he was temporarily held in a makeshift holding area next to the hospital morgue. Like Master Jiu, he confessed voluntarily and provided related evidence.","Just like that, Gao Min found herself somewhat bewilderingly bestowed with the title of a people's police officer who had \"bravely sustained injuries and made meritorious contributions to solving the case.\" Upon returning, she was guaranteed at least a Third-Class Merit, possibly even a Second-Class Merit.","If not for her young age and short time on the force, the accumulated credit from her merits alone would be more than enough for a promotion to District Bureau Chief.","Having resolved the matters concerning Gao Min, Liu Yutong, along with Yaya, prepared to bid her final farewell to Yaya's father before returning to Mingzhu City.","Back in Mingzhu City, a backlog of matters awaited her attention: the imminent opening of the first Wanlong Shopping Plaza, the Series B financing for Wanhui Youxuan, the school anniversary event, and so on.","She wouldn't have any free time in the short term.","After breakfast, Liu Yutong picked up Yaya, who had spent the night at a hotel, and first went to the cemetery to pay respects to Yaya's parents. Since Yaya's family essentially had no contact with relatives, there was no need for a formal memorial service; everything was kept simple.","In the cemetery, a gentle breeze whispered by.","Liu Yutong held Yaya's hand as they stood before a newly erected tombstone.","\"Yaya, say goodbye to your mom and dad.\"","Yaya clutched a rabbit plush toy in her arms, a birthday gift from her father.","Then she earnestly bid farewell to her parents.","\"Daddy, Mommy, Yaya is here. I brought the little bunny Daddy bought for me too. It's been bathed and smells nice.\"","\"Mommy, look, I've memorized Sister Tongtong's phone number, 158... umm... I'm still memorizing the rest.\"","\"Daddy, I brushed my teeth by myself at the hotel yesterday, I didn't ask Sister for help... I want to be a brave child, so Yaya hasn't cried these past few days...\"","\"I'll tell you a secret, Sister bought me a new schoolbag, a pink one, because I'm going to school in Mingzhu City.\"","\"I'll also eat well, drink milk every day, and when I grow up, Yaya can come see you by myself.\"","\".......\"","After saying her goodbyes, Liu Yutong took her hand and turned to leave. Only then did the tears Yaya had been holding back well up and spill over. She waved her little hand towards the tombstone behind them.","\"Goodbye, Daddy. Goodbye, Mommy...\"","............","Yaya's home was located in an old six-story residential complex in a somewhat suburban area of Danan City. It was an old house left by Yaya's grandparents, later passed down to her father. Although it only had two bedrooms and a living room, it was worth several hundred thousand yuan nowadays.","Of course, the house hadn't been worth much in the past due to its relatively remote location. If not for the rising property prices in recent years, Yaya's father might have sold it long ago to pay off debts.","However, this area had development potential in the future. Old residential complexes like theirs were likely candidates for demolition and redevelopment, in which case compensation of several million yuan wouldn't be a problem.","As Liu Yutong led Yaya to the foot of their building, they ran into the neighbor auntie from apartment 502 across the hall.","\"Hello, Granny!\"","\"Yaya, you're back?\"","This neighbor auntie was the kind-hearted one who had taken Yaya to the scene of her father's accident a few days prior. In truth, she had regretted it afterward—how could she have taken a child to such a scene?","Fortunately, the child had good fortune and was taken in by a wealthy person.","Liu Yutong also politely expressed her thanks: \"Auntie, thank you for always looking after Yaya.\"","\"Ah, it's nothing. Yaya is like my own granddaughter. Her father was busy with work, so I was often the one picking her up from and dropping her off at kindergarten. This child is so sensible; every time I brought her back, she'd fish out a little candy from her pocket that her teacher had given her as a reward for me...\"","Halfway through, the auntie suddenly realized: \"Are you here to pack up their things?\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"Yes, I plan to take Yaya back to Mingzhu City.\"","Although reluctant to see Yaya go, the auntie knew this was the best outcome for her. She then warmly led them upstairs.","\"Come on, come on upstairs first. Yaya's home is 501. Their lock is a bit old too; you have to lift it up a little to turn it open...\"","\"Oh, do you need help packing? I have large woven bags and cardboard boxes at home...\"","Liu Yutong shook her head: \"Thank you, Auntie, but that won't be necessary. I brought some people with me.\"","Only then did the auntie notice the seven or eight figures in black who had appeared behind them at some point.","\"Well... just call if you need anything. Yaya, you must come visit Granny when you're on holiday, okay?\"","Yaya nodded vigorously: \"I will miss Granny. When I learn how to write, I'll write letters to Granny.\"","\"Good, good...\"","The auntie turned away, wiping her eyes. \"Then Granny won't disturb your packing. Just knock if you need help, alright?\"","Liu Yutong thanked her again: \"We appreciate your trouble!\"","After the exchange, Liu Yutong took Yaya, opened the door, and entered the apartment.","Having been unoccupied for several days, a thin layer of dust had settled in the rooms, lending a sense of quiet desolation.","Yaya hugged her rabbit plush tightly, her big eyes looking around the familiar yet somehow strange home. She whispered, \"Sister, the house is a little dirty.\"","\"It's okay, we'll clean it up.\"","Liu Yutong patted her head and said to the Wanlong Hui members behind her, \"Be gentle. Focus on packing Yaya's and her parents' photos, albums, Yaya's certificates of merit, and items of sentimental value. Leave the furniture and other large items as they are.\"","\"Yes, Young Miss!\"","Everyone immediately set to work, dividing tasks and beginning to pack.","Liu Yutong sat on the sofa with Yaya, flipping through a photo album filled mostly with pictures of Yaya growing up—from her hundred-day photos to her first birthday, everything was there. As they looked and chatted, their laughter grew louder.","Not long after, Yun Cheng and Ma Da arrived.","They had come to say goodbye to Liu Yutong.","One was about to head to BS Province, the other was going abroad."]},{"number":543,"title":"Chapter 543: 543. Relatives Who Want to Take Advantage of a Childless Family.","paragraphs":["\"Ma Da, for this trip abroad, you must remember, once you obtain the item, you must protect it well. Whatever it is, it must be brought back intact.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\"","\"Yun Cheng, I've already arranged for the special 2-billion fund to be transferred. Uncle Zhu is looking after things on the BS side, so the procedures should be easy to handle. Since you're overseeing operations there, aside from the matters related to Wanlong Plaza and Wanlong Supermarket, you must also ensure proper supervision of the schools we donated and are building. If there's any problem with even one school's construction, it will cause significant negative impact on our Wanlong Hui Group.\"","\"If anyone dares to cut corners, you know what to do, right?\"","\"Understood! Our Wanlong Hui is a legitimate company!\"","\"Hmm!\"","\"...........\"","Afterwards, Liu Yutong discussed the relevant details with them meticulously.","Meanwhile, at the home of their neighbor, Auntie Zhang, in apartment 502 across the hall.","Auntie Zhang had just put the groceries she bought into the kitchen when her son, Huang Daqiang, walked out of the bedroom yawning to use the bathroom. He had worked the night shift and only returned in the morning.","\"Mom, I thought I heard some noise across the hall just now? Did someone come to 501?\" Huang Daqiang asked through a yawn.","\"Yes, Ya Ya is back, along with the young lady who adopted her. They brought people to pack things up, saying they're taking Ya Ya to live in Pearl City.\"","Auntie Zhang sighed: \"Ah, that child Ya Ya, her fate is truly bitter... Thankfully, she met good people.\"","Hearing this, Huang Daqiang's eyes shifted. He walked over and lowered his voice: \"Mom, is it that very young and pretty girl you mentioned last time?\"","Auntie Zhang nodded: \"Yes, why?\"","Huang Daqiang: \"Mom, I think this is a bit fishy. Why would such a young woman specifically adopt a burden like Ya Ya? You know the situation with Ya Ya's family.\"","Auntie Zhang was taken aback: \"What do you mean?\"","\"This old apartment, for instance!\"","Huang Daqiang wore an expression that said \"how can you not understand\" and continued: \"Although our neighborhood is a bit remote, it's still an apartment, worth at least two or three hundred thousand, right? And that car accident involving Ya Ya's dad, the driver was caught, so there must be some compensation money, right? That adds up to quite a sum.\"","\"Ya Ya is so young, she's now the sole heir. That apartment, that compensation money, wouldn't it all go to that woman? Those people, I'd say eight or nine out of ten, are after that. They call it adoption, but in reality, they're after Ya Ya's assets.\"","Listening to her son's analysis, Auntie Zhang also felt there might be some truth to it. But when she came to her senses, she immediately flared up, jabbing her son's forehead hard: \"What nonsense are you spouting?!\"","\"What filthy thoughts do you have in your head all day? That young lady is clearly not an ordinary person! Her demeanor, her entourage, does she look like someone lacking a few hundred thousand or a million? I think she genuinely cares for Ya Ya! That day at the accident scene, you didn't see the way she looked at Ya Ya, like looking at her own little sister. If you keep making up stories, I'll tear your mouth shut!\"","Huang Daqiang shrunk his neck from the scolding but still wasn't convinced: \"You can't judge a person by their appearance. These days, what won't people do for money? Mom, let me tell you, yesterday afternoon there were a few people sneaking around downstairs asking about Ya Ya's family, really detailed questions too, like who else is in the family, whose name is on the apartment deed, and so on.\"","Auntie Zhang immediately became alert: \"What kind of people?\"","Huang Daqiang shook his head: \"Don't know them. They didn't look like good people, all of them sharp-faced and shifty-eyed.\"","\"I was just about to leave for work, and they asked me if I knew Ya Ya. I deliberately said I didn't, and they left. I figure they're probably some distant relatives from Ya Ya's dad's side or her mom's side, who heard about Ya Ya's dad's accident and, thinking Ya Ya is young, want to take advantage and grab the family assets.\"","Auntie Zhang's heart sank.","Both of Ya Ya's parents were only children, and the older generation was gone too, but there were indeed some distant relatives who had long stopped keeping in touch.","The reason was simple: they were afraid of being asked for money and looked down on them for being poor.","For them to suddenly show up now, they definitely had ill intentions.","\"These people are truly wicked!\"","\"When Ya Ya's parents were alive, they never offered a bit of help. Now that they're gone, they're eyeing their property.\"","\"Exactly!\"","Huang Daqiang: \"So I'm saying, the people across the hall might also be...\"","\"You're still saying it!\"","Auntie Zhang glared at him: \"Go do your business! Less gossiping!\"","Huang Daqiang went to the bathroom sullenly.","The more Auntie Zhang thought about it, the more uneasy she felt. Although this matter had nothing to do with her, she had watched Ya Ya grow up after all. Coupled with her sense of justice acting up, she felt uncomfortable all over.","After thinking it over, she decided to go across the hall and warn that young lady, so Ya Ya wouldn't really be taken away.","After all, legally speaking, Ya Ya's relatives would indeed have a stronger claim to custody than someone with no blood relation.","However, as if on cue, the very thing she feared happened.","Just as Auntie Zhang thought about going to the opposite door to talk, a clamor of voices and footsteps suddenly came from the stairwell.","\"This is the place, 501. I told you! Someone's definitely here, Ya Ya must be back!\"","\"Hurry! Don't let that girl be taken away by someone else. She's a descendant of our Jing family, she should be raised by us, the Jings!\"","Auntie Zhang's heart immediately skipped a beat, and she quickly opened her door.","She saw five or six people coming up the stairs. Leading them were a couple around fifty years old. The man was dark and thin, wearing a tank top and loose shorts. The woman had permed wavy hair and wore bright red lipstick.","Following behind them were a few slightly younger men and women, each wearing an expression of impatient eagerness.","They were none other than Ya Ya's father's elder brother, Jing Fu, and his wife, Wang Jinhua—Ya Ya's almost estranged uncle and aunt—along with their son, daughter-in-law, and others.","Ya Ya's surname was a rather uncommon one: Jing. Her given name was Yao.","\"What are you doing?\" Auntie Zhang stepped out, blocking the stairway.","Wang Jinhua put her hands on her hips, sizing up Auntie Zhang: \"Well, look who it is, it's Sister Zhang. We're here to pick up our Ya Ya, to take her home. What are you, an outsider, blocking the way for?\"","\"Take Ya Ya home?\"","Auntie Zhang spoke without any courtesy: \"What kind of family are you to Ya Ya? When Ya Ya's parents were alive, we wouldn't see you once all year. Now that they're gone, you show up? I think you're a weasel paying New Year's respects to a chicken—harboring no good intentions!\"","Ya Ya's uncle, Jing Fu, darkened his face: \"Sister Zhang, that's not right to say. No matter what, I am Ya Ya's father's own elder brother, her proper uncle. Her parents are gone, who will take care of her if not us elders? Should we just let her be taken away by some shady characters?\"","\"Exactly!\"","Wang Jinhua shrilly chimed in, \"We've heard all about it! Some woman from who-knows-where wants to take Yaya away. Who knows what she really is? What if she's a child trafficker? Our Jing family's child cannot be left to drift out there. Where's Yaya? Bring her out, she's coming with us! And this house needs looking after too; we can't let outsiders get their hands on it for nothing!\"","\"Move!\" she said, stepping forward to push Auntie Zhang aside.","Auntie Zhang stood her ground. \"Not a chance! Yaya's already been properly adopted by a decent family who treats her very well. We don't need your fake concern here. Seems to me you're just after Yaya's family house and that compensation money!\"","\"Bullshit!\"","A slovenly young man pointed at Auntie Zhang and cursed, \"You old hag, don't be so ungrateful! This is our family's business, what right does an outsider like you have to interfere? Get lost! Or I'll make you sorry!\"","Auntie Zhang shot back, \"Who are you calling an old hag? Where are your manners? This is my doorstep, I'll stand here if I want to, what's it to you? Go ahead, try and hit me!\"","\"You're all grown adults trying to snatch a child's property! Is there no law anymore?!\"","\"The law? I am the law!\"","Jing Fu, emboldened by their numbers, started throwing his weight around. \"Today, we are taking Yaya, no two ways about it! And hand over the keys to this house! For all we know, you're in cahoots with that woman, trying to swallow up our Jing family's property together.\"","\"Yeah! Hand over Yaya! Hand over the keys!\"","The others joined in the shouting. Just as a shoving match was about to break out, Huang Daqiang, who had heard the commotion from the toilet, rushed out pulling up his pants, fuming with anger.","\"What's going on! What's going on! Looking for a fight? Picking on people right at their own doorstep?!\"","\"Let me tell you something, don't think you can bully people just because there's more of you! I know plenty of folks. Keep this up, and I'll make a call to get my people down here!\"","Yaya's cousin, Jing Hu, burst out laughing upon hearing this.","\"Hahaha! You? Getting your people?\"","\"You have any idea who you're talking to? I'm from the streets! You know Scarface from XX Street? That's my boss! I can have dozens of guys here with one phone call. You'd better wise up and get lost!\""]},{"number":544,"title":"Chapter 544: 544. Just kowtow three times and that'll be enough.","paragraphs":["Huang Daqiang's face instantly changed the moment he heard the name Scarface.","This guy was entrenched in the factory district of the southern suburbs. Rumor had it he ran a roller rink and had quite a fierce reputation in that area. He liked to bully anyone he took a dislike to and was a genuine street thug.","Seeing Huang Daqiang back down, Jing Hu shoved him aside.","\"Get lost! Stop being a nuisance here! Coward!\"","Huang Daqiang was pushed so hard he almost crashed into the wall, but he didn't dare fight back. Instead, he hurriedly pulled back his mother, who was still trying to step forward and argue. \"Mom, no, don't confront them. Let it go. This isn't even our family's business anyway.\"","Before Auntie Zhang could say anything, Yaya's uncle and his group had already reached the door of apartment 501 and started pounding on it loudly.","\"Open up in there! Hand over Yaya! Or we'll call the police and report you for child trafficking!\"","\"Come on! Open the door now!\"","Inside the apartment, Liu Yutong and the others had already heard the commotion outside.","\"Yuncheng, Ma Da, you two go ahead with your own tasks. I'll handle this.\"","But Ma Da quickly interjected, \"No way! Miss, I'm going abroad for quite a few days this trip, and I haven't had a chance to show off... ahem, to spread the positive energy of our Wanlong Society. Let me handle this, let me.\"","With that, he turned around and opened the door directly.","Outside, Yaya's uncle and his family, who were just about to continue banging on the door, were startled and instinctively took a step back.","They saw a slightly chubby young man standing in the doorway, with several other young men in black suits behind him.","The chubby guy looked at them and started cursing without any courtesy.","\"Yap, yap, yap, what the hell are you yapping about?\"","\"Making such a racket in broad daylight, disturbing the peace! Have you got no manners?!\"","Yaya's uncle and the others were completely dumbfounded by this sudden torrent of abuse from the young man.","Once they recovered, they got angry too.","\"Who are you? Watch your mouth! I'm Yaya's biological uncle! Here to take my niece home! Who the hell do you think you are, trying to stop us?\"","\"Biological uncle?\"","Ma Da let out a scornful laugh. He used his pinky finger to dig in his ear, then blew on his fingertip, almost sending earwax flying into their faces. \"Where were all you relatives when Yaya's parents were around and needed help? Now they're barely gone, and you come sniffing around like you caught a scent? What are you, dogs?!\"","\"You!\"","Yaya's uncle, Jing Fu, flushed red with anger. His wife, Wang Jinhua, immediately stepped forward and shrieked, \"How dare you insult us! We are Yaya's closest family in this world, recognized by law! Who knows what you shady people are doing holding onto the child? Maybe you want to traffic her! Get out of the way! Or we'll call the police!\"","\"Call the police?\"","Ma Da acted as if he'd heard something hilarious. He turned his head and grinned at his black-suited companions behind him. \"Brothers, they say they're going to call the cops!\"","\"Hahaha...\"","\"Go ahead, call them if you dare!\"","\"I'd like to see if Officer Friendly will take your side.\"","\"Let me tell you this, punk. Yaya is under our Miss's protection now. She's taking full responsibility for everything concerning the girl. If you're scheming for the child or the property, you'd better drop that idea right now. Get the hell out of here, all of you! One more word of nonsense, and I'll make you fly!\"","As soon as Ma Da finished speaking, the several black-suited men behind him cooperatively cracked their knuckles, producing crisp popping sounds.","Yaya's uncle's family were all bullies who only picked on the weak. They couldn't help but take another step back.","Despite their earlier bravado, facing these few men in black suits who looked very much like gangsters, their aura weakened considerably, and they grew somewhat timid.","However, their delinquent-looking son, Jing Long, young and hot-headed, was the first to step forward.","He had just been bragging to Huang Daqiang about knowing some tough gangsters. If he got intimidated by some strange fat guy now, he'd lose all face.","He had to deal with these black-suited guys no matter what.","\"Hey, fatso, who the hell do you think you're scaring? You think wearing a black suit makes you hot stuff? Let me tell you, I know this area. You know Scarface? The boss over at the roller rink? That's my big brother! Believe it or not, I can make one call and he'll bring dozens of guys over here!\"","\"Scarface? What kind of stray cat or mangy dog is that? Never heard of him.\"","\"Kid, if you want to call someone, you'd better do it now. Otherwise, I'm afraid you won't get the chance later.\"","After saying this, Ma Da turned his head and spoke into the apartment, \"Miss, please wait a moment. I'll just clean up some trash first. I promise it won't take too long.\"","From inside the room, Liu Yutong gave a faint \"Hmm\" of assent, granting silent permission.","She understood perfectly well that sometimes, reasoning with low-level thugs like these was useless. You had to use rules they understood to settle things.","Jing Long was thoroughly enraged by Ma Da's arrogant attitude. He immediately pulled out his knock-off phone and made a call.","\"Hey! Scarface! It's Little Long! Yeah, over at Happiness Community. Ran into some clueless tough guys... yeah, wearing black suits, acting all high and mighty... bring more guys. Don't worry, there'll be benefits for sure!\"","After hanging up, Jing Long felt much more confident. He pointed at Ma Da, \"Just you wait, fatso. Scarface is bringing his men right over. Don't you dare run if you've got the guts!\"","Ma Da: \"Don't worry, I promise I won't run. I'll wait for the people you called.\"","\"Let's go, wait for them downstairs. I want to see what kind of character this 'Scarface' really is.\"","\"Escort them downstairs. The Miss dislikes noise.\"","\"Yes, Brother Ma!\" The men immediately stepped forward.","\"Hey, hey, hey! What do you think you're doing?\"","\"Assault in broad daylight!\"","\"You... you just wait, you'll get yours soon! My son called for backup, you just wait!\"","\"Ah!!!\"","\"...\"","There was no way Yaya's uncle's family could match Ma Da and his crew. They had no power to resist and were forcibly dragged downstairs.","Upstairs.","Auntie Zhang and her son Huang Daqiang were watching this scene, extremely nervous.","First, they were nervous about whether the black-suited guys would be too rough. Second, they were nervous about Scarface, who might arrive soon.","\"Mom, that kid really called Scarface. That guy really does have a bunch of reckless young thugs under him who fight like they don't care about their lives. Shouldn't we call the police?\"","Auntie Zhang was also hesitant because calling the police might not be good for Yaya, since that family were technically her relatives.","\"Maybe let's wait and see a bit longer? Miss Liu and her people aren't ordinary folks.\"","She also remembered what she saw at the car accident scene that day. The number of those black-suited men seemed far greater than this, not even a fraction of them were here.","Not long after.","From the closed-off road on the south side of the residential complex came the roar of motorcycle engines and the sound of many footsteps.","More than twenty hoodlums, dressed like delinquents and wielding steel pipes and cleavers, appeared on the scene in a formidable group, led by a young man with two fierce-looking knife scars on his face. The leader was none other than Scarface.","Jing Long, who had been crouching on the ground covering his head, immediately stood up excitedly when he saw the reinforcements had arrived. He pointed at Ma Da, \"Scarface! That's the fatso right there!\"","\"I dropped your name, but this damn fatso not only refused to show any respect, he even said you were some nobody and that he'd make you fly if you dared show up!\"","Scarface, a cigarette dangling from his mouth, stepped forward with a menacing look, sizing up the mere seven or eight men in black behind the fat man.","Although they looked somewhat familiar, he couldn't quite place them and didn't give it much thought.","\"Fatso, nice suit. Which outfit are you with? Tell me your boss's name. If I know him, I might go a little easier on you later.\"","Ma Da, hands in his pockets, sauntered forward a couple of steps until he stood right in front of Scarface. His seemingly harmless appearance now carried an inexplicable sense of pressure.","\"Scarface, right?\"","\"Do you watch TV? Or read the news online?\"","\"What's your point?\"","\"No point, really. I just wanted to say that TV and the internet are always reporting about how the world needs peace, how our social environment needs harmony and stability. I think they make a good point.\"","\"So, today, I want to resolve this peacefully.\" Ma Da pointed at Scarface, then at himself.","Scarface, thinking he was about to back down, laughed. \"What? Trying to beg for mercy?\"","Ma Da wagged a finger. \"NO! NO! NO! You've got it wrong.\"","\"What I mean is, you, and all the men you brought, kneel down right now, kowtow three times to me, Brother Ma, apologize, and say 'Sorry, Brother Ma, we were wrong.' Then we can consider this matter settled. How about that?\"","The lackeys behind Scarface burst out laughing upon hearing Ma Da's words.","\"Hahahaha... Is this damn fatso out of his mind?\"","\"Kneel and kowtow to him? Who the hell does he think he is!\"","\"I'm dying, is this fatty here to tell us jokes?\"","Scarface viciously threw his cigarette butt to the ground and crushed it under his foot, pointing at Ma Da's nose as he cursed, \"You damn fatso, are your eyes not working? Can't you see how many brothers I have behind me? You actually dare to tell me to kneel and kowtow to you, you motherf—... you absolutely deserve it!\"","Thump!","\"Big brother, see how promptly I kneel? Can we... can we still talk about harmony?\"","After uttering this plea on his knees, Scarface looked around at the dense crowd of black figures that had materialized and swallowed hard.","There were so many of them, it was as if they had dyed the entire street block black!"]},{"number":545,"title":"Chapter 545: 545. Leaving the Great Southern City.","paragraphs":["Upstairs.","Huang Daqiang witnessed this scene and couldn't help but swallow hard.","Just moments ago, he had been urging his mother to call the police. He never expected the situation to change so completely in the blink of an eye.","Looking at the dense crowd of black figures on the street, the midday sun, which had been fairly bright, seemed to dim at a visible rate.","That silent, oppressive feeling was so intense that even Huang Daqiang, on the fifth floor, felt almost suffocated.","After a long pause, he finally managed to utter a sentence.","\"Mom, it's starting to rain. Should we bring in the laundry first?\"","\"O... okay.\"","Meanwhile.","On their knees on the ground, Brother Scarface and his men were sweating profusely.","It wasn't until this massive crowd of black-clad figures appeared that they suddenly remembered exactly who these people were.","—The Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","Scarface had always thought he was ruthless enough, hardly fearing even the well-known gang bosses of Danan City.","But the group before him was on a whole different level of ruthlessness, far beyond his own.","They had all heard rumors about the fate of the infamous Master Jiu from the Sky Club.","It was said Master Jiu had offended a group of people in black suits. In the end, over twenty of his establishments were raided, and his headquarters clubhouse was literally reduced to rubble in broad daylight by those same black-clad figures.","Rumor even had it that Master Jiu himself was \"dealt with\" right on the street.","Lawless and utterly terrifying!","Even more terrifying was the background of this group. Despite the huge incident, they emerged completely unscathed. On the contrary, they heard that the police had rounded up all of Master Jiu's men, essentially cleaning up the mess for the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","The more you thought about it, the more horrifying it became!","\"Boss, boss, sir... ahem! Grandfathers, have mercy!\"","Scarface crawled forward a couple of steps, banging his head heavily on the concrete ground three times in succession.","\"This lowly one has eyes but failed to see! This dog has a lowly gaze! I didn't know the esteemed grandfathers of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were here! I was wrong! I truly know I was wrong!\"","The twenty-something hoodlums behind Scarface were equally terrified. While they usually acted tough following Scarface, facing this group—who seemed even more \"societal\" than regular gangsters—their courage had completely deserted them.","\"Grandfathers of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, spare us!\"","\"We'll never dare again!\"","\"Grandfathers! We'll kowtow! We apologize! We want harmony!\"","At this moment, they all wished they could tear Jing Long, that troublemaker, to pieces. How could he have provoked these living embodiments of the King of Hell?","They were all terrified of ending up like Master Jiu.","\"Alright, alright, enough with the weeping and wailing like you're at a funeral. How annoying!\"","Ma Da waved his hand dismissively. \"Our Ten Thousand Dragons Society is a legitimate company. Making it sound like we'd kill you or something—that's illegal.\"","\"Knowing the law and not breaking it is our company's consistent principle.\"","Scarface hurriedly agreed, \"Yes, yes, yes, what the grandfather says is right. The grandfathers of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society clearly look like particularly righteous individuals, full of moral integrity!\"","After saying this, he instinctively glanced at the surrounding black-clad figures, who looked even more like movie gangsters than actual gangsters.","The hell kind of legitimate company is this?","What legitimate company goes out with hundreds of people in black suits?","What legitimate company can wipe out a big shot like Master Jiu, him and his whole operation?","And \"knowing the law and not breaking it\"?","Yeah right, you crafty fatso, you're full of it!","If I hadn't been smart and knelt down fast enough, my fate would probably be the same as Master Jiu's.","\"Fine. Seeing as your apology seems somewhat sincere, Brother Ma won't hold it against you.\"","\"However...\" Ma Da glanced at Yaya's uncle's family, kneeling there trembling.","Scarface understood immediately. \"Brother Ma, I get it, I get it.\"","Ma Da, of course, wouldn't leave them any leverage, not even verbally: \"After we leave, you do what you were gonna do, alright? Remember, do it well! Do it slowly! Do it step by step!\"","\"Yes! Grandfather Ma! We will definitely follow your instructions and do it well! Slowly! Step by step!\" After saying this, Scarface looked at Jing Long and revealed a sinister grin.","That look alone nearly scared the piss out of Jing Long's family.","Just as they were crying and begging for mercy, Ma Da suddenly turned and walked towards the side gate of the residential compound to greet someone.","They saw Liu Yutong, holding little Yaya's hand, walk out.","The moment they appeared, every single black-clad figure on the entire street bowed in unison.","\"Young Miss!\"","The sheer scale and the thunderous sound of their voices directly scared Brother Scarface and his men, who had just gotten up, into kneeling back down with a thud.","Scarface cautiously looked at the woman of extraordinary bearing before him, feeling particularly shocked.","The Young Miss of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was so young, unbelievably young!","Yet the aura she carried was even stronger than the fat man's from before, significantly stronger.","Yaya was still holding her rabbit plushie. Her beautiful big eyes saw so many adults kneeling on the ground, and she couldn't help but ask curiously.","\"Sister, why are they kneeling on the ground? Is it New Year?\"","Hearing Yaya's words, a faint smile appeared on Liu Yutong's cool, elegant face.","\"It's not New Year. They're just playing a game about recognizing their mistakes.\"","Yaya: \"So if they recognize their mistakes, does that mean they're good children?\"","\"Yaya is exactly right. Only by making them deeply recognize their mistakes will they seriously correct them.\" As Liu Yutong spoke, her gaze swept lightly over Yaya's uncle's family.","That one glance made that family's hearts grow even colder with fear.","Yaya nodded, not fully understanding. She actually didn't recognize her uncle's family at all, because from the time she could remember, she had never met them.","They had always been avoiding her family.","Now, even if her uncle's family wanted to acknowledge this little girl, they wouldn't know how to begin, let alone dare to with all these black-clad figures surrounding them.","They could only swallow their bitterness.","Liu Yutong picked Yaya up and walked towards the Maybach parked by the roadside.","A black-clad figure had already respectfully opened the car door.","\"Young Miss, take care!\"","\"Young Miss, take care!\"","Yun Cheng and Ma Da each bid farewell to the Young Miss.","Apart from some Ten Thousand Dragons Society members escorting Liu Yutong back to Pearl City, the majority of the personnel remaining in Danan City also shouted in unison.","\"Young Miss, take care!\"","At that moment, a man and a woman carrying gifts got out of a car at the main entrance of the residential compound.","They were Liu Yutong's classmates, Fang Yaqiong and Lin Bin.","After Master Jiu was captured, his underlings were gradually rounded up, and Lin Bin was finally rescued.","Later, they learned from Gao Min that Liu Yutong had helped a great deal. Upon hearing that Liu Yutong was about to return to Pearl City, Lin Bin, against his doctor's advice, left the hospital and rushed over, wanting to thank her in person.","However, the moment they stepped out of the car, they were met with this shocking scene and froze on the spot.","The girl they remembered from class—once inconspicuous and introverted—now stood like a queen, surrounded by a crowd of intimidating black-clad figures.","The change was so drastic it was as if they didn't know her anymore.","\"Lin Bin, should we... should we still go over?\"","Lin Bin watched as Liu Yutong, holding the child, got into the car worth millions. His throat felt dry.","\"Forget it, she and we... no longer belong to the same world.\"","In the end, they still didn't have the courage to go over. They just watched that black motorcade depart, and only after it had vanished from sight did they slowly speak.","\"Thank you, Liu Yutong!\"",".............."]},{"number":546,"title":"Chapter 546: 546, The New Students Who Stick Together.","paragraphs":["At the end of September, a slight chill of early autumn was in the air.","The once somewhat quiet university town had regained its bustle. Since the Olympics had been held this year, the familiar tune of \"Beijing Welcomes You\" still drifted through the streets and alleys.","Currently, the military training for freshmen at the various universities in the town was nearly over.","As the freshmen gradually became familiar with their campuses and the surrounding university town area, many began to get restless. Especially the freshmen from the vocational college next to the University of Finance and Economics and from the University of Food and Economics, their boldness grew, their actions became more and more flamboyant, and their attitude increasingly arrogant.","Now, on weekends, whenever you saw students gathering in groups near the snack street or school gates, nine times out of ten they were freshmen.","Freshmen, new to everything, did indeed tend to form cliques more easily than the upperclassmen. This was especially obvious at schools with relatively lax management like the vocational college and the University of Food and Economics.","Their reason for banding together was simple.","If they didn't stick together, how could they stand up to those seniors who pulled rank?","If they didn't stick together, what would they do if they got into a conflict with street punks outside?","In short, if you didn't want to get pushed around, you had to stick together.","It was Saturday. As soon as the holiday began, a crowd quickly gathered at the east gate of the vocational college, diagonally across the street from the University of Finance and Economics. There were both guys and girls. Compared to the students from the University of Finance and Economics, this group clearly had a more thuggish air about them.","Most of the guys had long, side-swept bangs, occasionally blowing aside the hair that covered their left eye. The girls mostly sported big, puffy perms, and their clothing and style were very mainstream.","As soon as this group of students with their flashy hairstyles gathered, they started passing out cigarettes. Perhaps because their numbers had grown, bolstering their confidence, someone couldn't help but vent the frustrations that had been building up since enrollment.","\"Fuck his mother! Yesterday I ran into some dumbass senior who cut right in front of me in the cafeteria line. I called him out on it, and the bastard just glared at me, saying I, a freshman, didn't know the rules. What fucking rules! He's just relying on being a year ahead, thinking he can bully a newbie like me!\"","\"Brother Qiang, that's nothing!\"","A short guy with a bowl cut, his bangs so long they almost covered half his face, leaned in and said, \"The night before last, I went to the internet cafe for an all-nighter. Some sophomore from the neighboring school's time was up, I wanted the machine, he wouldn't give it up, and instead of leaving, he told me to get lost. Goddamn it! If it weren't for the fact they had more people, I would've kicked his ass right then and there!\"","\"Damn! Binzi, you just backed down like that? You should've fought him! What's there to be afraid of! There are so many of us now!\"","\"Yeah! How can us guys from the vocational college take that kind of disrespect? We wouldn't be able to show our faces anymore!\"","Brother Qiang put a fresh cigarette in his mouth, and the bowl-cut guy hurriedly lit it for him. He took a drag and slowly exhaled, saying, \"That's exactly why relying on just a few of us scattered individuals won't work. Haven't you seen those bastards from the University of Food and Economics? Last week at their school's back gate, over twenty of them ganged up on one guy, just over some girl, and sent a lone senior straight to the hospital. Now the freshmen over there can practically walk sideways!\"","\"Brothers, to be honest, back in my county's No. 5 High School, I was the one who called the shots. I even started a gang called the Azure Dragon Gang back then, had over fifty members, and I was the boss. Before coming here, I was the one overseeing the arcades near our school. No one, inside or outside the school, dared to mess with me.\"","\"Brother Qiang, that's badass!\"","\"Brother Qiang, I had no idea you had such a legendary past. If we were from the same place back then, I'd have wanted to follow you.\"","\"Yeah, Brother Qiang!\"","\"...\"","\"Alright, alright, no need to dwell on past glories, that's all in the past now. Coming to Pearl City for university, we don't have any foundation here. Better to keep our heads down and behave.\"","\"Yesterday, downstairs at my dorm, I just looked at a senior sister a few times too many, and I almost got surrounded by a few sophomore seniors. Damn, it's so frustrating!\"","\"If this were back home, could I take that? I'd make those guys kneel down and call me grandpa!\"","\"No helping it. The situation's against us. Who told us freshmen are new here and easy to bully.\" Brother Qiang said this while deliberately sighing.","Sure enough, hearing Brother Qiang's words, the group's emotions were immediately stirred up.","The short guy with the bowl cut was the first to jump out, viciously throwing his half-smoked cigarette to the ground.","\"Fuck! Brother Qiang, you can put up with this?!\"","\"What's so great about being an upperclassman? They've just been in school a few years longer! What gives them the right to act so high and mighty!\"","A girl with heavy smoky eye makeup, holding a cigarette between her fingers, spoke up, \"Exactly! If the freshmen from the University of Food and Economics can swagger around, why do we have to act like grandsons? Brother Qiang, you were the top dog before. You should take the lead!\"","Right after, another guy with hair dyed in streaks of yellow and red, looking like a puffed-up rooster, said excitedly, \"Brother Qiang, to be honest with you, back at my XX High School, I was also the top dog. I had over twenty brothers back in the day. Who at the internet cafes and pool halls around the school didn't offer me a cigarette? If my family hadn't forced me to come here for school, I'd still be the baddest dude on my block!\"","\"Holy shit! Brother Ji, never knew you were that badass too!\"","\"He's not the only badass one! A lot of us here used to be legends!\"","\"For real?\"","\"At my county's No.3 High, there weren't really any gangs, but I never backed down from a fight. Even the jocks at my school got beaten into submission by me! Coming to this shitty place and having to act like a grandson? I ain't having it! Brother Qiang, just say the word, and I'll be the first to charge!\" Another burly guy started recounting his own resume.","\".........\"","One after another, people kept stepping forward to talk about their glorious pasts, using this method to show they weren't cowards either, that they had guts.","Even some of the girls claimed they were famous 'big sisters' at their schools back in the day.","In short, every single one of this group had an extraordinary past, each one a formidable figure who had 'been in the game.'","As for how much of it was true, that was anyone's guess. It's not like you could go investigate their old schools back in their hometowns, right?","And nobody really cared if it was true or not. After all, when you're out here, the face you show is the face you make for yourself.","Brother Qiang looked at the impassioned crowd, secretly laughing to himself, but on the surface, he maintained his deep, thoughtful demeanor.","\"Looks like all you brothers and sisters are made of the right stuff! But what can a few of us alone accomplish? Why are the freshmen over in the Agriculture and Economics department so tough? Isn't it just because they banded together early? But we're still just a scattered mess right now... Sigh!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the crowd immediately started responding.","\"Brother Qiang, then let's band together too! Let's form a club, with you as the boss! Bring back the glory of your old Green Dragon Gang!\"","\"Yeah! Form a club! Damn it, let's see who dares to glare at me then! From now on, us guys can collect protection money, and the girls... uh, the girls gotta have an intimidating aura too!\"","\"Form a club!\"","\"Form a club!\"","\"........\"","The crowd chanted in unison."]},{"number":547,"title":"Chapter 547: 547, Longmen","paragraphs":["Once the mood was set, it naturally came time for someone to suggest a name for the club.","\"Brother Qiang, I've already thought of a name for the club. Let's call it 'Buried Love Clan'! How domineering, how melancholic! It totally fits our vibe. We'll be the premier nobility of the University District.\"","\"Buried Love? What does that even mean? Sounds weird. I think 'War Hall' is way more badass!\"","\"You don't know shit! This is what's trending! Buried Love—burying love, focusing on our cause! Get it? Can you even write in Martian script?\"","\"Shorty Wang, have you played too many damn video games? What's the point of giving a club some gaming clan name?\"","\".......\"","Brother Qiang raised his hand to quiet them, putting a stop to the naming session that was about to devolve into infighting.","\"Brothers, calm down. The name can be discussed later. The key is we need to have that ambition! Think about it, if those freshmen from the Grain & Economics College can make something of themselves, why can't we? Our Vocational College is full of hidden talents. Wasn't everyone here a somebody back in their hometown?\"","\"Like Brother Ji, former top dog at XX School!\"","\"Brother Niu, the one-on-one champion of County No.3 High!\"","\"And you, you, you... I can see it, none of you are ordinary folks!\"","With Brother Qiang piling on the flattery like this, these eighteen or nineteen-year-old non-mainstream youths immediately felt their blood boiling, feeling like they had finally found their tribe.","\"You flatter us, Brother Qiang!\"","\"Brother Qiang is right!\"","\"If we unite, we'll be unstoppable!\"","\"Crush the Vocational College, flatten the University District!\"","\"Grow big and strong, achieve new glory!\"","Seeing the fervor was about right, Brother Qiang spoke up again, settling the club name.","\"So, I propose we officially establish the club today! Let's call it 'Dragon Gate'! It symbolizes the carp leaping over the dragon gate. We, this group of flood dragons, will eventually leap over everyone and dominate the University District!\"","\"What do you think, brothers?\"","\"Dragon Gate? That name works!\"","\"Good! That name has authority!\"","\"I think it's pretty good too. Way better than names like 'Ten Thousand Dragons', 'Black Dragon', or 'Nine Dragons' from those novels. Those are just dragons, but we're the Dragon Gate they have to leap over. Clearly way cooler!\"","\"I agree! Brother Qiang really knows how to pick a name.\"","\"I agree too!\"","\"From now on, we are Dragon Gate!\"","\"..........\"","With the name decided, the next natural step was to roughly plan the club's direction.","Brother Qiang already had ideas on this point.","\"Our first step is to consolidate the freshman power within our Vocational College. Once that's done, we'll deal with the upperclassmen. Anyone who doesn't submit, we beat them until they do! Second step, suppress those freshmen from the Grain & Economics College. Can't let them get ahead. We need to show them who's the real boss of the University District freshmen! Third step, naturally, is to deal with the other schools—Science and Tech University, Finance University... In short, we want every school to tremble at the mere mention of our Dragon Gate name!\"","\"As long as we walk these three steps steadily, we can eat whatever we want on Snack Street, play whatever we want in the internet cafes. See someone we don't like? We'll use our fists to reason with them!\"","\"By then, we'll be the underworld overlords of the University District! All those damn seniors, all those punks, they'll be trash! We'll do whatever we want!\"","Such domineering words instantly sent the group's enthusiasm soaring to its peak.","\"Dragon Gate rules!\"","\"Brother Qiang rules!\"","\"Flatten the University District!!!\"","\"..........\"","With the announcement of the new club's formation, these Vocational College freshmen suddenly felt immensely confident, instantly inflated, as if the heavens were first, and they were second.","The security guards at the school gate and the passing senior students looked at these freshmen arrogantly shouting slogans. After a moment of surprise, peculiar expressions appeared on their faces.","Truly, newborn calves aren't afraid of tigers.","Do these freshmen really think they can just form a group and become kings of the school, of the University District?","They should really do their homework on why, in the entire University District, even in Pearl City, aside from the Righteous Union Society, there isn't a single decent club.","That's because of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","And the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's headquarters is located not far from the University District.","These seniors could almost foresee the future fate of these freshmen, yet not a single one stepped forward to warn them.","On one hand, they wanted to see them make fools of themselves.","On the other hand, they also knew that freshmen at this age, like newborn calves, are prone to arrogance. And, of course, they found them irritating.","So let them run headfirst into a wall. Otherwise, they'll never know how high the sky is or how thick the ground is.","The freshmen also noticed the strange looks from some passing seniors and couldn't help but ask, \"Why are those old-timers looking at us like that? Feels like they're laughing at us.\"","Brother Ji, standing next to them, flicked his bangs and interjected, \"Pfft! Isn't it obvious? They're jealous! They probably wanted to do the same back in their day, start a club, but didn't have the guts. Now they see us setting up, and it pisses them off!\"","\"Brother Ji is right. We're doing what they couldn't back then. Of course they're pissed off and look at us sideways.\"","They'd been at school for almost a month and had done some asking around. For instance, the upperclassmen at their school didn't have clubs, and it was the same at other schools—no one had any.","So they roughly came to a conclusion: those seniors weren't united enough, not driven enough, or lacked a big brother who could carry the banner to unite them. That's why they were so scattered and disunited.","Without unity, how could you possibly run a club?","The truth was, it wasn't that the seniors didn't want to form clubs. It was that all those clubs had been forcefully flattened by a certain woman.","Besides, so much time had passed, and large-scale fights had almost completely disappeared from the University District. Everyone gradually grew accustomed to this way of life, so tales of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's past deeds were rarely mentioned anymore.","After all, constantly bringing up the same old thing gets boring!","This is why the freshmen had no clue about the real situation in the University District.","They might have heard of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, but they probably genuinely thought it was just the 'Ten Thousand Dragons Supermarket' in the University District.","A legitimate... supermarket in their eyes.","In any case, they were quite happy with this situation. At least they believed it was very advantageous for them. If those seniors had already formed clubs, it would have been much harder for them freshmen to gather like this.","Heaven was helping them, giving them the chance to grow big and strong!","\"Don't worry about how they look at us. We'll do our own thing.\"","\"Once we've consolidated the Vocational College, beaten the Grain & Economics freshmen into submission, and swept through the other universities, then our Dragon Gate will be the sole authority in the University District!\"","\"We'll show those seniors a fact: times have changed! What the seniors didn't dare to do, our Dragon Gate will do! The banner the seniors didn't dare to carry, our Dragon Gate will carry!... Daring to fight, daring to strive—that's Dragon Gate!\"","\"Dragon Gate rules!\"","\"Dragon Gate rules!\"","\".........\""]},{"number":548,"title":"Chapter 548: 548. Checking Out Beauties at the University of Finance and Economics","paragraphs":["\"Longmen is awesome! Brother Qiang is awesome!\"","\"Longmen is awesome! Brother Qiang is awesome!\"","\".........\"","Brother Qiang looked at these brothers and sisters cheering for the gang he had started, feeling equally excited. He felt like he had reached the peak of his life. He could already picture the scene in the near future: him leading the vast ranks of the Longmen brothers, dominating the university district, invincible wherever they went.","That must be incredibly cool, right?","Brother Qiang took one last deep drag from his cigarette butt, threw it on the ground, and stamped it out. Then, with high spirits, he waved his hand grandly.","\"Let's go!\"","\"We'll first go inspect our future turf at the snack street. And for all expenses today, it'll be... it'll be... well... we'll split the bill!\"","\"Oh!!!\"","The whole noisy group marched toward the snack street.","Once at the snack street, perhaps too excited from just forming their gang, they spent money like bandits raiding a village. They ate skewers, drank bubble tea, and some even carried bottles of beer, drinking as they ate.","Don't ask why they weren't eating in the shops—there were no seats.","\"Boss, ten skewers, extra spicy! Make it quick. From now on, this street is under the protection of us, Longmen!\"","\"This bubble tea is good. Boss, one pearl milk tea for everyone! We'll split the bill!\"","\"Why didn't you add sausage to my fried noodles? Don't you believe I'll smash your crappy stall?\"","\"What are you looking at? Never seen a gang activity before?!\"","\"If you want to join our Longmen, you gotta pay the membership fee first!\"","\"..........\"","The arrogant behavior of Brother Qiang and his crew left the snack street vendors and other students speechless.","Seriously, where did this bunch of idiots come from, shouting and making such a racket?","But by now, these first core members of Longmen were completely immersed in their own world, automatically interpreting all those glances as awe and fear toward them.","As the vocational college freshmen, full and satisfied, were about to find an internet cafe to play games, they ran into a few very pretty girls, instantly catching their attention.","\"Well, well, these chicks aren't bad!\"","\"Indeed, quite pretty. Which school are they from?\"","\"They look like they might be from the Medical University?\"","\"Not bad, really not bad! How great would it be if I could find such a pretty girl to be my girlfriend.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the few female members in their group were displeased.","\"What are you talking about? Those girls aren't as good-looking as you say. Haven't you seen real beauties?\"","\"When it comes to looks, it's the girls from our vocational college who are better. For example, Guigui is much prettier than those girls.\"","\"Exactly, the vibe of those girls just now was merely passable.\"","\"Someone like Guigui is the beauty in my mind.\"","\"That's more like it.\"","\"Hmm... I still think those girls from just now were more pure-looking.\"","\"Get lost!\"","\"..........\"","While they were still arguing about whether the girls from their vocational college were better-looking or the girls from the Medical University they just saw were, a passing student couldn't help but interject:","\"If you're asking which school has the best-looking beauties, you have to look at the University of Finance and Economics!\"","These words immediately struck a chord with other passing students nearby.","\"That's right. Have you country bumpkins never seen real beauties? The girls at the University of Finance and Economics are the true beauties! The top-tier beauties of our university district are all there. What's more, the University of Finance and Economics even produced a female celebrity—that Xue Linna who just got popular after releasing her album recently. She's from there, isn't she?\"","\"Xue Linna is indeed good-looking and has that vibe, being a minor celebrity after all.\"","\"Besides Xue Linna, there's also the number one campus belle at the University of Finance and Economics. I really can't find anyone else to match her aura... she's just a tiny bit terrifying...\"","\"..........\"","The rebuttals, even disparaging remarks, from those passing students reached the ears of the Longmen members. Especially the female members led by Guigui—their faces instantly darkened.","What do you mean by that!","Intentionally putting us down, is it?","Never mind whether those bookworm girls from the University of Finance and Economics are really that good-looking, but can they be as genuine as us?","You have no taste at all!","Brother Qiang and the others were also a bit annoyed. Putting down the girls of their Longmen was like slapping them in the face.","However, this did pique their curiosity.","\"Let's go! I wanna see for myself just how pretty these University of Finance and Economics girls are, to make them brag so hard.\"","\"Yeah! Let's go check it out!\"","\"I don't believe they can be prettier than our Sister Guigui!\"","\"Maybe they're all dinosaurs, and they're just full of hot air!\"","\"Let's go! Camp out at the entrance of the University of Finance and Economics! See what that so-called number one beauty looks like, and how terrifying she is!\"","\"..........\"","Hearing this, Guigui immediately raised her head like a proud rooster. She had always been confident in her looks, especially with her current non-mainstream style—she was practically the epitome of fashion trendiness.","But she still had a stubborn urge in her heart to see with her own eyes what this so-called number one beauty of the university district actually looked like.","The group soon arrived at the roadside by the south main gate of the University of Finance and Economics.","The University of Finance and Economics was indeed somewhat different from other schools. Its main entrance looked tidier and quieter. And unlike other schools, there weren't any delinquent-looking hoodlums hanging around.","\"Gotta say, the University of Finance and Economics is quite clean.\"","\"What clean? It looks dead and lifeless, totally lacking personality. Our school is better.\"","\"Where are the beauties? I don't see any.\"","\"We just got here. They probably haven't come out yet. We'll know if we wait a bit longer.\"","And so, they gathered in a cluster right there on the sidewalk by the school gate, starting to brazenly scrutinize every girl entering or leaving the University of Finance and Economics, commenting freely.","\"This one's okay, just a bit short.\"","\"The one in the skirt has nice legs.\"","\"The one who just passed looks a bit like... like that celebrity, what's her name? Can't remember.\"","\"Give me a break. I think they're just average, not even as good-looking as those Medical University girls from earlier.\"","\"Where's the promised number one beauty? Haven't even seen a shadow!\"","\"It really was all just boastful talk!\"","\"........\"","The bunch of them didn't know how many packs of cigarettes they had smoked there on the sidewalk by the school gate, and they still hadn't seen many that caught their eye.","Of course, this was also because they had raised their own expectations somewhat, making them pickier than usual.","Their behavior also annoyed the students of the University of Finance and Economics as they came and went. Hadn't it been almost a year? Yet there were still hooligans daring to gather and loiter at the school gate. Didn't they know there was a rule banning hooligans from the entrance to the University of Finance and Economics?","Just then, a male student who looked like a student cadre walked over, warning them with a serious expression: \"Hey, you're not from the University of Finance and Economics, are you? Outsiders aren't allowed to gather here, especially people like you. Break it up now.\"","Brother Ji, hearing this, was displeased and immediately retorted: \"What's it to you? Is this road yours? Are we blocking your way? You sure like to overstep!\"","The guy frowned and said, \"It's not about whose turf this is. It's an unspoken rule! If you don't leave now, someone will come and make you leave, and it won't be so polite then!\"","\"Rule? Who made that rule?\"","Brother Qiang found it laughable. Was there any rule in this university district that their Longmen group didn't know about?","Seemed like it was time to make an example of someone.","\"Kid, you're getting a bit too cocky! If it weren't for the fact that we're right at your school's gate, you wouldn't even be standing here talking to us.\"","\"Go ahead and call whoever you want. We'll be right here waiting. Let's see who dares to lay a finger on us!\"","Seeing that this bunch was completely unreasonable, the guy pointed at them. \"Fine. Consider yourselves warned. You just wait!\"","As soon as he turned around, Brother Qiang and his crew gave him the middle finger.","\"Pfft, who does he think he's scaring?\"","\"We're not leaving today, no matter what. I want to see what this Finance University crowd is really capable of!\""]},{"number":549,"title":"Chapter 549: 549. Awe-Inspiring Honor","paragraphs":["The group of freshmen from the vocational college spoke with genuine confidence.","First, they had over thirty people on their side, both guys and girls, plus their non-mainstream dyed-blonde look. Most ordinary people really wouldn't dare to mess with them.","Second, their gang was newly formed, currently at its most united and also most inflated stage, just itching to find someone to make an example of. If the other side dared to call people to fight them, that would be the perfect chance to establish their reputation.","They were also quite familiar with this finance university, knowing it had almost no real troublemakers; most students were very well-behaved. They wouldn't have the guts to do anything to them even if you gave them a few.","In short, one phrase summed it up: The advantage is ours!","Brother Qiang and the others waited a few more minutes. Seeing that no one was showing up at the school gate, they grew even more brazen!","Whenever a female student from the finance university passed by, they would whistle at them, infuriating the girls walking past.","Their judgment was indeed correct. These ordinary students, especially the girls, even if harassed, would mostly just swallow their anger. No one dared to actually step forward and confront them.","Occasionally, a few male students shot angry glances their way, but they were all met with the gang's arrogant stares. Seeing how outnumbered they were, the other side could only walk away in stifled frustration.","\"Pfft, boring! Thought the people from Finance U were so tough, but this is it? Not even one dares to make a sound.\"","\"Yeah, a bunch of cowards and weaklings!\"","\"Sister Guigui, see? The folks at Finance U are just like that. None of those girls who just passed can compare to you!\"","The girl called Guigui, upon hearing this, blew a smoke ring with great haughtiness.","\"I'd say it's more about the intimidating power of our 'Dragon Gate' gang. The Finance U people simply don't dare to speak up.\"","\"Absolutely right!\" The others strongly agreed.","They were now imagining leading their brothers to run rampant through various universities in the future. Some of them were already grinning from ear to ear.","This gang life really has prospects!","After causing another few minutes of commotion, once the initial excitement wore off, they started to feel bored too.","\"Brother Qiang, looks like that's all for today. Should we pull out? Find an internet cafe to keep battling!\"","\"Yeah, Brother Qiang, squatting here is pointless. We haven't even seen a shadow of that so-called number one beauty. Let's just go.\"","Brother Qiang was about to nod and order a retreat, as squatting here was indeed dull.","But before he could speak, he saw several student union members come out of the Finance University gate. They went to a bulletin board next to the security booth and started putting up notices and posters.","The content was roughly about the upcoming university's 50th-anniversary celebration, along with some guest lists, for early publicity.","After all, for milestone anniversaries like the 50th, the university took it very seriously and had started contacting various people well in advance.","By then, notable alumni and various high-ranking officials would attend, and the stage setup would be the grandest in years.","Some passing Finance University students were immediately drawn over. At first, there were only two or three, but soon, more and more people gathered to look, letting out waves of exclamations.","\"No way! Is this for real?!\"","\"The lineup for this anniversary celebration is this strong? So many big shots are coming?\"","\"Oh my god, Classmate Liu's resume is insane...\"","\"As expected of Classmate Liu...\"","\"Classmate Liu is really coming back to be the student representative speaker? Isn't she always on leave handling her business outside, rarely coming back to campus?\"","\"Duh! This is the 50th-anniversary celebration. So many big-shot alumni are returning. How could Classmate Liu possibly miss it.\"","\"Classmate Liu is truly amazing. So capable and so beautiful. I've never seen such a perfect girl in my life.\"","\"That's right. Classmate Liu is the pride of our Finance University!\"","\".........\"","After their exclamations, some Finance University students noticed the vocational college freshmen still loitering by the roadside outside the gate. They pointed at the group and changed the subject.","\"I heard Classmate Liu might come back today.\"","\"Really? I've never seen Senior Liu before. I'd really love to see her in person.\"","\"Hey, what do you think would happen if that bunch happened to run into Classmate Liu?\"","\"Probably piss their pants!\"","\"Hahaha.......\"","\"........\"","Brother Qiang and his crew saw the Finance University students making a fuss over there and laughing heartily in their direction. Their curiosity was piqued.","\"What the hell are they doing over there? All that noise!\"","\"Seems like they posted some notice? Look how excited they are! Hey, they even dare to point at us!\"","\"I think I heard something about 'Classmate Liu.' Who's Classmate Liu?\"","\"Dunno. Could it be their school's number one beauty?\"","\"I think I've heard the name. Looking at how excited they are, probably that 'Classmate Liu' is about to show up, right?\"","Brother Qiang was also very curious, but to maintain his boss's cool demeanor, he didn't go over himself. Instead, he sent Brother Ji and Guigui with a few others to investigate, while he waited in place with the rest of the brothers.","Of course, if all thirty-plus of them went over, the security guards would definitely chase them away, maybe even call the police.","\"Go see what's really going on.\"","\"Alright! Brother Qiang, we'll go check it out and report back.\" With that, Brother Ji and the others swaggered over.","Soon, they arrived at the bulletin board and saw the content.","[Finance University 50th Anniversary Celebration Notice]","Below were detailed lists of proposed distinguished alumni representatives from various fields, and the introduction and photo of the sole current student representative.","They weren't particularly interested in those incredibly impressive big shots, mainly feeling the distance was too vast.","Quickly, their eyes were drawn to the name at the very top under [Student Representative] and the color photo beside it.","The girl in the photo wore a simple white shirt, her hair in a ponytail. Her face bore no makeup at all, yet her natural beauty was breathtaking. Moreover, her eyes held a cool, noble aura, completely different from the rebellious vibe Guigui and the other girls had. It was a stunning beauty that felt almost untouchable, carrying a sense of distance!","Brother Ji and the others, who had just been boasting that Guigui was prettier than all the Finance University girls, instantly fell silent.","Including Guigui herself, who, upon seeing the girl in the photo, subconsciously touched her own exaggerated afro and felt a sense of inferiority for the first time.","If this girl were just pretty, that would be one thing. But what shocked them even more was yet to come.","The three characters [Liu Yu Tong] below the photo were very eye-catching.","[Liu Yu Tong, sophomore at the School of Business Administration, Finance University, outstanding student representative of our university...]","After a brief introduction came her wall of honors.","[National Scholarship Recipient]","[University Special Grade Scholarship Recipient]","[Advanced Individual in Social Practice]","[Outstanding Student Cadre]","[Outstanding Student Entrepreneur]","[Campus Star]","[Triple-A Student (Excellent in Character, Academics, and Health)]","[Mingzhu City Safety Guardian]","[..........]","The resume was incredibly long, with dozens of entries, practically making Brother Ji and the others' eyes glaze over.","After finally finishing it, Brother Ji instinctively cursed.","\"This... is this even human?!\"","\"It's the first time I've ever seen a student with so many honors. That's just insane!\"","\"I roughly know what most of these honors are about, but what's this 'Pearl City Safety Guardian' thing? Does anyone know what that is?\"","\"No idea! Could it mean Pearl City became safer because of her?\"","\"Hahaha... that's hilarious. If that's really the case, then she's way too impressive, right?\"","\"..........\"","Just as they were laughing heartily, a cold voice sounded from behind them.","\"You guys aren't from Finance University, are you? You have ten seconds to disappear. Otherwise, none of you are leaving!\""]},{"number":550,"title":"Chapter 550: 550, Betting, Want to Outdo Others","paragraphs":["\"Which school are you guys from? I'll give you ten seconds to disappear, or you won't be leaving at all!\"","Upon hearing this, Brother Ji was first taken aback. He turned to see a girl in a black uniform, with an imposing presence, staring coldly at them.","Their first reaction wasn't fear, but rather to start teasing her.","\"Gotta say, this chick is pretty hot.\"","\"We've been staking out this place for a while, and she's the best-looking one by far.\"","\"Hey, girl, don't be so serious. Wanna hang out with us?\"","The girl in black remained expressionless. \"Five seconds left.\"","\"Ooh, feisty, are we?\"","Far from being intimidated, Brother Ji and his crew grew even more excited.","\"Do you even know who we are? The Dragon Gate! Heard of it? From now on, we call the shots in the university district!\"","The girl in black: \"Three seconds.\"","Just then, three young men, also dressed in identical black uniforms, approached from not far away.","Brother Ji and his friends noticed them too.","It had to be said, the uniforms were seriously cool, especially the dragon-element emblem on the chest, which looked particularly domineering.","\"Hey, is that the university uniform for Finance University?\"","\"Not sure, but it's really stylish. I kinda want a set myself.\"","\"I feel like I've seen this uniform somewhere before... I think I've seen some seniors at our school wearing it.\"","\"Really? Our school has uniforms like this too?\"","\"........\"","While they were discussing, the three newcomers had already run up to the girl in black.","\"Sister Xin!\"","\"Sister Xin!\"","The girl addressed as Sister Xin had just counted to the final number.","\"One!\"","\"You've run out of chances.\"","Then she said to the three Dragon Society members, \"Throw these guys out!\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the three Dragon Society members moved. Brother Ji and the other boys didn't even have time to react before they felt the world spin, then found themselves lying on the ground, and the next moment, they were dumped by the roadside.","Only Guigui, the girl, was left, staring dumbfounded at the unfamiliar girl before her.","Before she could even process what happened, she felt a sharp pain in her scalp. The other girl had grabbed her hair, yanking her away from the school gate, dragging her all the way to where Qiangge and the others were, and shoved her forward.","Fortunately, Qiangge caught her in time, or she would have surely fallen.","\"Qiangge, look at her! She's such a bully!\" Seeing Qiangge, Guigui seemed to find her pillar of support and started complaining tearfully.","Before Qiangge could say anything, the girl in black spoke again.","\"All of you have violated the rule against gang gatherings at the Finance University gate. You must accept punishment!\"","The Dragon Gate members were instantly furious. How audacious!","Throwing their people right in front of them and still daring to threaten them? Were they looking for death?","If they did nothing now, how could they ever establish themselves in the university district again?","Even if the person in front of them was a girl, they wouldn't go easy on her.","\"Fuck your mother! You dare touch our Dragon Gate people?\"","\"Beat them to death! You really think we're pushovers!\"","\"If we don't teach this bitch a lesson today, our Dragon Gate might as well pack up and leave the university district!\"","\".........\"","Amidst the rising anger, the thirty-plus crowd pressed forward in unison, a chaotic brawl seemingly on the verge of breaking out.","\"Everyone, stop!\" Qiangge roared, stretching out his arm to block the crowd.","\"Qiangge! They're bullying us like this, can you just take it?\"","Qiangge ignored them because he noticed that this girl remained completely unfazed even facing their large group. He suspected she might have some backing and wanted to probe her background first.","\"My name is Xu Qiang, a freshman from the Vocational College. May I ask, miss, which... which 'path' do you walk?\"","He had already categorized Yu Xin as someone from the underworld, given her aura and manner, which really didn't seem like an ordinary student.","Yu Xin said coolly, \"I don't walk any 'path.' I won't repeat myself. You'd better put your hands on your heads and squat down now to accept punishment.\"","Seeing the girl in black still acting so arrogantly, Xu Qiang was thoroughly enraged.","\"Miss, you're way too arrogant!\"","\"My brothers and I have staked our claim today. I'm their leader!\"","\"I don't care what forces existed in the university district before, but from today on, there will be new rules here, and that's us, the Dragon Gate!\"","\"You dared to mess with our Dragon Gate people, don't blame us for being impolite!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the few Dragon Society members who had just arrived were first stunned, then burst into loud laughter.","\"Hahahaha... You bunch of misfits staking a claim?\"","\"Are freshmen these days so ignorant of their own limitations?\"","\"Oh my, I'm dying of laughter... wanting to set rules in the university district...\"","\"Really, it's been a long time since I've seen such reckless fools.\"","\"Gotta say, the name they picked is pretty audacious, huh? Dragon Gate? Clearly trying to leap over us!\"","\"Got guts! Admirable! Admirable!\"","\"..........\"","The Dragon Gate crew, seeing these people in black not only ignore their threats but also dare to mock them so brazenly in public, felt both humiliated and furious.","\"Fuck! Are you looking to die?\"","\"Say that again if you dare!\"","\"Believe it or not, we'll finish you off right now!\"","\".......\"","Xu Qiang's face grew darker and darker. With over thirty of his brothers standing here, these people still dared to laugh and look down on them?","Fine, fine, fine! We'll use you lot to establish our authority then!","They only had four people. We have over thirty. By any measure, the advantage is ours!","\"Since you're asking for trouble yourselves, don't blame us for being impolite!\"","\"Surround them all!\"","More than thirty non-mainstream thugs immediately swarmed forward, completely surrounding Yu Xin and the three members of the Dragon Society.","The Dragon Society members, who had been laughing just moments before, instantly turned serious.","Well, well! It's been so long since anyone actually dared to lay hands on us?!","\"What, want to fight?\" Yu Xin said.","\"Scared?\"","Xu Qiang smirked triumphantly. \"Kneel down and apologize now, and we might consider going easy on you.\"","The group of Vocational College freshmen behind him, who had been stewing in anger, immediately started shouting in unison.","\"Kneel! And we might spare you!\"","\"Kneel! And we might spare you!\"","\"Kneel! Kneel!\"","\"......\"","Meanwhile.","The students and security guards at the Finance University gate were watching from a distance. They clearly saw Yu Xin and the others at a disadvantage, yet no one called the police.","Instead, everyone got instantly excited as if watching a show.","\"Whoa! Here it comes! The main event is about to start!\"","\"These guys probably have no clue who they're dealing with, right?\"","\"Hey, do you think these punks will actually dare to lay a hand on the Dragon Society people?\"","\"Probably not... unless they're truly tired of living.\"","\"Placing bets, placing bets! Odds are one to two for kneeling and apologizing within five minutes, one to five for kneeling and apologizing in ten minutes or more.\"","The reason for setting such long times was mainly because they hadn't seen other Dragon Society members arrive yet. It would take at least a few minutes for them to get here, right?","What none of them knew was that even without anyone notifying them, part of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's forces were already on their way here and would arrive shortly.","For no other reason than that the young lady had returned today.","Some high-ranking members with status and core members who had free time were sure to come welcome her, even if the young lady had told them not to. They would still come.","It was a matter of attitude.","Yu Xin's appearance at the school gate was no coincidence; she was waiting for someone.","Including Li Xiaohui, who was busy with her club, was also on her way.","As soon as the betting pool opened, everyone eagerly placed their bets.","\"I bet a pack of spicy strips on ten minutes. Go big or go home—maybe I won't have to buy spicy strips all semester.\"","\"I'm betting on five minutes.\"","\"I'm betting on five minutes too.\"","\"........\"","Seeing that most people were betting on five minutes, someone couldn't help but voice a different opinion.","\"Hey, how come you all have so little faith in these outsiders with dyed hair?\"","\"What, you actually think these guys stand a chance? If they don't kneel within five minutes, I'll eat my words!\"","\"Not exactly. I just think these guys don't even seem to recognize the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's black suits—probably a bunch of reckless fools. Reckless fools fight fiercely, even desperately, you know?\"","\"Bro, what's your point?\"","\"I'm betting on one minute!\"","\"Can we add another option? Kneeling within one minute, with twenty-to-one odds?\"","\"..........\"","On the other side.","Yu Xin looked at the surrounding dyed-haired hoodlums ready to throw down and sneered.","\"Good, very good!\"","\"In Pearl City, no one has ever dared to make someone from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society kneel. You're the first.\"","\"Relying on numbers, are you? Then let's see who has more people!\""]},{"number":551,"title":"Chapter 551: 551. Cruel Punishment.","paragraphs":["Upon hearing the name \"Wanlong Society,\" Xu Qiang and the others felt their hearts skip a beat as an ominous feeling welled up inside them.","They remembered now. The name did sound familiar. Wasn't it almost identical to the name of that Wanlong Supermarket? The only difference was that the other party had added the word \"Society\" to it.","The name \"Wanlong Society\" definitely sounded like some sort of underworld gang.","But they still had one lingering doubt: hadn't they heard that there were no gangs in the University Town?","Just as they were brimming with confusion...","Suddenly!","Someone pointed at the nearby intersection and cried out in shock.","\"Holy shit!!! That's a lot of cars!!!\"","Xu Qiang and the others instinctively looked in the direction he was pointing.","On the main road of the University Town, a massive fleet of black cars was driving toward them in a formidable procession.","\"What... what is going on?\"","\"Why are there so many cars? This is terrifying!\"","The convoy pulled up by the road in front of the Finance University gates. The car doors opened almost simultaneously, and figures dressed in black uniforms filed out one after another.","The previously bright and sunny sky seemed to be instantly enveloped by an invisible dark haze with the appearance of this group.","The men in black silently converged toward their location. There were so many of them that they couldn't even be counted at a glance. Most conspicuously, every single one of them had a dragon-shaped badge embroidered on their chests.","\"Who... who are these people?\"","\"A r-real mafia, right?\"","\"So scary!\"","\"Why do the logos on their clothes look a bit familiar to me?\"","\"Yeah, they do look familiar.\"","Everyone's gaze involuntarily shifted to the four men in black they had originally surrounded in the middle.","In an instant, they were scared out of their wits!","Oh, for crying out loud!","They had provoked actual gangsters!","\"I think I'm suddenly having low blood sugar, my vision is going dark. Someone help me to the supermarket to buy some candy.\"","\"I... I have asthma. Cough, cough, cough... I forgot my medicine. Help! Take me to the hospital!\"","\"Oh my, my phone is ringing!\"","Brother Ji suddenly pulled out his phone and pretended to make a call. \"Hello? Mom! What? Grandma is critically ill? Okay, okay, okay! I'm coming back right now!\"","Saying that, he tried to slip away, but a short, skinny guy grabbed him in a tight hug. \"Don't go alone, bro! Our grandma can't die! Let me go with you to see her!\"","\"Take me too! Your grandma is my grandma. I have to go see her!\"","\"...\"","The excuses this group came up with were each more tragic than the last.","Yu Xin finally couldn't stand watching it anymore and said coldly, \"Are you done acting?\"","The scene instantly fell silent.","Brother Ji raised his hand weakly. \"Um... could we call 'cut' and get a do-over?\"","Yu Xin completely ignored him.","By now, the Dragon Gate crew was completely surrounded by over a hundred men in black.","This made them panic even more.","Even though they had over thirty people, they were all just freshmen this year. How could they compare to these men in black suits standing before them, who looked more gangster than actual gangsters?","They could only pin their final hopes on their newly acknowledged boss, Xu Qiang.","\"Boss, what do we do?!\"","\"Boss, say something!\"","\"Boss...\"","Being shouted at by them like this, Xu Qiang immediately grew frantic.","\"Who's your boss! Who's your boss! I'm warning you, don't just call me that!\"","\"I'm not some underworld boss! I'm a straight-A student, an outstanding Youth League member, a progressive youth, and a future pillar of the nation! How could I be your boss?\"","\"If any of you calls me boss again, I'm seriously calling the cops!\"","Yu Xin couldn't be bothered to watch them wail. \"Drag them all away and teach them a lesson!\"","As soon as her voice faded, Xu Qiang and the others instantly dropped to their knees in unison and begged for mercy.","\"Spare my life, miss! I'm just a passerby!\"","\"We just came to the gates of the Finance University to look at pretty... I mean, to admire the difference between an undergraduate university like this and our vocational college! We didn't know there were rules here.\"","\"Right, right, right! We just wanted to see the difference.\"","\"Miss! I'm actually your long-lost biological brother! Mom told me to come find you before she passed away!\"","\"...\"","\"Stop making a racket.\"","Yu Xin's head was throbbing from their noise. \"Get up. The sun is a bit too harsh here.\"","Hearing this, Xu Qiang and the others were immediately overjoyed, thinking the other party was going to let them off the hook. Just as they were about to say thank you, they heard Yu Xin point to a row of plane trees on the nearby sidewalk and say, \"The sun is too harsh here. Go kneel under those trees over there, it'll be cooler.\"","The Dragon Gate crew: \"...\"","Well, aren't you just too kind!","They didn't dare to disobey, so they could only walk with their heads bowed to the trees Yu Xin had pointed out, and then neatly knelt down in two rows.","Some had indeed thought about running away, but seeing so many men in black glaring at them like tigers eyeing their prey, they immediately gave up the idea.","They didn't want to die just yet.","After they had all knelt properly, a few men in black brought over a thick stack of the \"Pearl City University Town Code of Conduct\" and handed one to each of them. Then, they brought out a stack of prepared exam papers, densely packed with printed questions.","\"The exam begins now. The maximum score is 100 points, and the passing mark is 90. Those who fail...\"","The young man in black acting as the examiner paused and pointed to a nearby van with privacy film on the windows. \"Those who fail will be sent to the van for private tutoring.\"","Hearing this, everyone hurriedly and frantically flipped open the code of conduct.","Opening it wasn't the issue, but they almost fainted when they did. This ridiculous code of conduct was a full two hundred pages long?!","\"Is... is this meant for human beings to memorize?\" Brother Ji was on the verge of tears.","The examiner in black consoled him, \"Don't worry, we are very humane. Considering this is your first offense, as long as you memorize the first fifty pages, you'll be able to pass.\"","Hearing this, Xu Qiang raised his hand. \"Big bro, um... can it be an open-book exam?\"","The man in black sneered. \"What do you think?\"","Xu Qiang: \"Definitely not. I was just asking.\"","Just then, an even more ruthless move came.","A few more men in black walked over carrying two cases of ice-cold cola and handed a can to each of them.","\"Seeing how hot you guys are, we're treating you to some cola.\"","Although it was September, the temperature was still over thirty degrees Celsius, so it was quite hot.","Seeing how considerate the other party was, Xu Qiang and his gang were deeply moved. Just as they were about to say thanks, they saw a group of men in black walk over, take out steel needles, and pierce a tiny hole in the bottom of each cola can. Then, they used strings to hang the cans from the tree branches, positioned exactly above the kneeling crowd.","These guys were completely bewildered, having no idea what these men in black were trying to do.","Only then did the examiner in black explain the purpose of the colas. \"The rules are simple. You need to memorize the code of conduct while drinking the cola. If even a single drop of someone's cola falls on the ground, ten more pages will be added to their exam!\"","Everyone: \"!!!\"","Damn it, have a heart!","They suddenly thought of the ancient idiom about scholars tying their hair to roof beams to stay awake while studying. Except, what was suspended above their heads was dripping cola, which was even more miserable!","Thus, a bizarre spectacle appeared under the plane trees on the sidewalk outside the gates of the Finance University.","Over thirty youths sporting alternative fashion knelt in a row, frantically memorizing the rulebooks in their hands while desperately licking the cola dripping from above their heads.","\"Article One of the University Town Campus Civility Code... ah... no public... ah... ah... ah...\"","\"Article Two, no gathering to cause a disturbance... ah... ah... ah... prohibited... ah...\"","\"Article Eighteen... ah... ah... thugs are forbidden to... ah... gather... ah... or loiter... ah... at the entrance of the Finance University... ah...\"","\"Article Thirty... ah... help me... I can't remember the rest!\"","\"Mom... ah... I don't want to study... ah... anymore... ah ah... I want to... go... ah... go home!\"","\"......\"","Xu Qiang, the boss of the Dragon Gate gang, was desperately keeping his mouth open to catch the cola being poured down his throat while reciting the rules, utterly miserable and wanting to weep but having no tears left.","\"Defeated before the battle even began... Dragon Gate is doomed!\"","\"The waters of this University Town are too deep, too murky! I want to go home to my mom!\"","Time ticked by. Just as they were on the verge of being tortured half to death, the surrounding group of men in black suddenly sprang into action.","They turned in unison toward the campus gates and swiftly fell into formation, lining up in several neat rows. The imposing display looked as though they were preparing to welcome someone important.","Even the Finance University students, who had been enjoying the spectacle at the gates, let out gasps of surprise.","\"What is going on?\"","Before Xu Qiang and his men could figure out what was happening, a luxurious black Maybach sedan appeared in the distance, gliding smoothly into their line of sight."]},{"number":552,"title":"Chapter 552: 552. The Terrified Vocational College Freshman.","paragraphs":["\"What's going on? What exactly happened?\"","\"Holy crap, a car just pulled up, and it's a Maybach! That thing must be worth at least ten million, right?!\"","\"A big shot is here!\"","Watching the approaching car and the reaction of the men in black, Xu Qiang and his group almost forgot they were supposed to be memorizing the rules.","The Maybach slowly came to a halt at the school gate.","All the men in black lined up neatly to welcome the arrival, and even the girl in black from earlier stood respectfully by the car door.","The car door was slowly opened by one of the men in black.","To the surprise of Xu Qiang and his friends, the person who stepped out was not the kind of underworld boss they had imagined, nor was it some elderly tycoon. Instead, it was an incredibly young girl dressed in black, who looked to be about the same age as them.","Furthermore, this girl also had a dragon-shaped emblem on her chest, but hers was an accessory made of crystal, fully highlighting her difference from the rest of the people in black.","Before Xu Qiang and his group could even guess who this girl was, the multiple rows of people in black immediately bowed and respectfully greeted her in unison.","\"Eldest Miss!\"","With over a hundred people greeting her, the momentum was incredibly massive. The scene was absolutely comparable to the classic entrances of mafia bosses in movies, delivering an extreme visual impact.","Xu Qiang and the others were completely dumbfounded.","\"Wait, isn't... isn't that the campus belle of the University of Finance and Economics?\"","\"Isn't she the top student from the bulletin board? How did she become a mafia princess?\"","\"What the hell, who could have ever seen this coming!\"","That student who had won countless honors on the bulletin board, the campus belle of the University of Finance and Economics, was now surrounded by a group of men in black, looking like a mafia queen.","The beautiful campus belle was actually a gang's Eldest Miss?","Isn't this contrast way too huge?","Then, they couldn't help but look at themselves kneeling under the tree, memorizing rules. Suddenly, they felt that sometimes the gap between humans is truly larger than the gap between a human and a dog.","Look at her, that was what it truly meant to run the streets. At best, they were just clowns!","Meanwhile.","The crowd gathered at the school gate instantly boiled over with excitement upon seeing Liu Yutong.","Let alone the freshmen, even the seniors hadn't seen Liu Yutong around campus for at least half a year. However, even if she wasn't at school, she still received every single honor she was due.","Now that they saw her in person, some students from the University of Finance and Economics grew excited.","\"My God, it really is Liu Yutong who came back!\"","\"Wow! Isn't this grand entrance a bit too exaggerated?!\"","\"It really is her. She looks even better than in her photos!\"","\"She's so incredibly cool!\"","At this moment, many girls truly understood what it meant for a woman to be just as formidable as a man. Looking at Liu Yutong's aura and entourage, she was simply cool beyond words.","Some of the bolder freshmen couldn't even resist asking for her autograph.","\"Senior, look over here!\"","\"Senior, can I get an autograph?\"","\"...........\"","After stepping out of the car, Liu Yutong quickly noticed Xu Qiang and his group kneeling in a row, opening their mouths to catch dropping cola. She raised her eyebrows slightly.","\"What is going on here?\"","Yu Xin immediately stepped forward and said, \"Sister Yutong, it's a bunch of freshmen from the vocational college. They call themselves the Dragon Gate and want to establish their turf in the university town.\"","\"Dragon Gate?\"","\"Do they want to leap over the dragon gate?\"","Liu Yutong looked again at Xu Qiang and the others kneeling on the ground, and said indifferently, \"Since they love playing gangsters so much, take good care of them. Don't we have people at the vocational college?\"","\"We do. I will arrange it.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Liu Yutong then turned to Yang Xin and the rest. \"Let's all have a meal together tomorrow. Dismissed.\"","\"Yes, Eldest Miss!\" the crowd replied in unison.","Just as Liu Yutong was about to turn around and leave, a loud and boisterous voice suddenly rang out behind her.","\"Wow! Sister Yutong, you're finally back!\"","A girl wearing a hoodie and covered in all sorts of weird and quirky little accessories practically lunged at Liu Yutong the moment she got out of the car, giving her a huge bear hug.","\"Sister Yutong, I missed you to death!\"","Looking at the jingling items on her body, Liu Yutong asked, \"Xiaohui, why do you have so many accessories hanging off you?\"","\"These are custom-made figures! Since our Purple Dragon Club was just established, I thought about making a mascot. I ended up making quite a few. Sister Yutong, you're just in time to help me see which one is the best!\" Li Xiaohui said excitedly.","Liu Yutong always found making this kind of choice to be a major headache, so she said, \"Just pick whichever one you like.\"","\"Alright then.\"","It was only then that Li Xiaohui noticed Xu Qiang and the others kneeling in a row not far away, along with the cola suspended above their heads. It was as if she had discovered a whole new world.","\"Wow! Is this some new kind of performance art? A modern version of extreme study torture?\"","When Yu Xin explained the reason to her, Li Xiaohui's eyes immediately lit up.","\"I'm good at this! Let me proctor the exam, let me proctor!\"","Then, she excitedly walked over to Xu Qiang and his group. As soon as she opened her mouth, she scared them half to death.","\"Everyone must copy the school rules one hundred times. You can crawl back only when you are finished.\"","Xu Qiang and the others: \"!!!\"","Why don't you just beat us to death instead!","Naturally, Liu Yutong wasn't going to waste her time on a bunch of freshmen. After saying her greetings, she entered the school. She even smiled and greeted her fellow schoolmates, not acting aloof or unapproachable at all.","Actually, after being around her for so long, many people at the University of Finance and Economics knew Liu Yutong's personality. She didn't put on any airs when she was normally at school and was quite easy to get along with.","If this had been last year when she first became famous, they probably wouldn't have even dared to speak to Liu Yutong.","\"Senior Liu is way too cool! She's totally my idol!\"","\"This is what a true big shot looks like! Excellent grades, beautiful looks, and such a commanding presence! It's seriously too cool!\"","\"Those punks actually wanted to establish their turf in front of Classmate Liu? What a joke!\"","\"They've definitely learned their lesson this time!\"","\"........\"","After enduring several hours of torment, Xu Qiang and his group were finally freed from their misery and allowed to leave.","It was just that when they left, most of them had jelly legs.","It wasn't entirely because their legs were numb from kneeling; it was more because they were terrified.","Earlier, many of them had failed the exam and were invited into a small black van for private tutoring.","But they all knew very well, could that really be called tutoring?","Sure enough, without exception, every person who came out after going in for tutoring had a terrible complexion and unfocused eyes. They looked weak and feeble, as if their bodies had been completely hollowed out.","Furthermore, they all gritted their teeth and absolutely refused to say what kind of cruel torture they had experienced inside.","Of course, their refusal to speak only scared the living daylights out of those who hadn't entered the small black van. Every single one of them mustered up a hundred and twenty percent of their focus to memorize the rules, just so they could suffer a little less.","It wasn't until the sky had turned completely dark that they were finally allowed to leave.","However, Xu Qiang and the others didn't feel much relief. Instead, every one of them was fraught with worry. Especially after this experience, they finally understood why there were no gangs in the university town.","With such a ruthless Ten Thousand Dragons Association existing here, who the hell would dare to form a gang!","Only later did they find out just how ruthless the Wanlong Gang's track record truly was. They had thrown people off buildings, offed others... But the scariest part was that the men in black they saw today were just a fraction of the Wanlong Gang's total numbers.","One could only imagine how terrifying the Wanlong Gang really was!","Also, they mentally cursed out all the upperclassmen who had deliberately kept this information from them.","It was completely out of line!","\"Brother Qiang, what do you think those guys are planning? They registered all of our personal information just now. They even asked for our home addresses, blood types, and if we have any history of genetic diseases.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone froze. A bad feeling welled up in their hearts.","A moment later.","Someone finally voiced what they were all thinking.","\"I... I heard, just rumors, mind you! I heard that some under... underground syndicates like to run highly lucrative businesses. A gang as massive as the Wanlong Gang definitely needs to make serious money to feed all its brothers. Think about it. Besides prostitution, gambling, and drugs, what other business brings in massive profits?\"","The exact same thought popped into everyone's minds at once: Human organ trafficking.","\"Hiss...\"","\"N-no way, right?\"","\"Why wouldn't it be? Otherwise, why would they bother registering all our information for no reason? I bet they are going to use our data to find medical matches, and the moment they find a buyer, they will...\"","He didn't finish his sentence, but everyone understood exactly what he meant.","Recalling the ruthless behavior of those men in black, along with the chilling aura of the eldest miss, Liu Yutong, the more they thought about it, the more plausible this theory seemed.","\"Oh my god!\"","A guy with dyed blond hair simply started wailing out loud.","\"I'm dropping out! I want to go home!\"","\"I want to go home too! I'm not going to school anymore!\"","\"Help! I don't want my kidneys harvested! Mingzhu City is way too shady!\""]},{"number":553,"title":"Chapter 553: 553. The Meeting After Returning.","paragraphs":["Evening.","Liu Yutong had dinner at school and rested in her dormitory.","Li Xiaohui chatted with her about the current situation of the club she had started.","Currently, the Purple Dragon Club had only formed one CrossFire gaming team. However, this team could only participate in minor tournaments because, so far, the official CrossFire organizers had not yet established a standardized professional league system.","The club could only compete in sponsored events like city leagues and the WCG. Given the current development trend, it was highly unlikely for the club to turn a profit within the next few years; instead, it would require continuous financial injection.","When Li Xiaohui reached this point, she looked a bit anxious. After all, she knew very well that it seemed inappropriate to let the company keep burning money just for the sake of her own hobby.","After listening to her account, Liu Yutong naturally expressed unconditional support. She told Li Xiaohui to just go for it and not to worry about the funding.","Li Xiaohui was so moved that she was just short of hugging Liu Yutong and pledging to devote her life to her.","Sister Yutong, Fang Haoran and the others have recently been looking into some other games. They mentioned that Dao... Dao something... anyway, the game is quite competitive. I heard that many tournaments for this game have already been held abroad. Even though it is a mod based on Warcraft, its competitive depth is pretty good.","Is it DotA?","Yes, yes, yes! That is the one!","Li Xiaohui nodded hastily. There are already some online tournaments in the West. Although the scale is not large, the prize pool is much higher than the CrossFire city leagues. I heard that some wealthy second-generation heirs in the country are privately organizing tournaments with exceptionally high prize money. Fang Haoran and his team went to an offline exhibition match last week, took second place, and got a share of five thousand yuan in prize money.","Five thousand? Can grassroots tournaments offer that much? Liu Yutong asked.","Yeah, and that was just a small tournament. Rumor has it that a boss over in the Magic City is organizing an even larger-scale event, and the champion prize could reach fifty thousand.","This prize amount was absolutely nothing compared to the prize pools of various gaming tournaments in later generations, but right now, it was enough to ignite the passion and motivation of many gaming enthusiasts.","However, the gameplay is much more complex than CrossFire. It has a steep learning curve for newcomers, and it is hard for spectators to understand what is going on.","Sister Yutong, do you think this game has a promising future?","Even though Li Xiaohui knew perfectly well that Liu Yutong rarely played games and was not as passionate about them as she was, she still could not resist asking for her opinion.","Because in her eyes, Liu Yutong was omnipotent.","Liu Yutong was indeed not a hardcore gamer, but Li Xiaohui had certainly asked the right person. She was well aware of the general trajectory of how things would unfold.","For instance, she knew that the release of Dota 2 would spawn an entirely new professional esports ecosystem. Or that League of Legends, a game already in development and expected to launch in the second half of next year, would become the future overlord of the PC MOBA genre.","Since Li Xiaohui and her team had already stumbled upon it, making early preparations would not be a problem at all.","You can pursue this project. Xiaohui, you should actually pay special attention to this MOBA genre of games; its future development potential is immense.","Having received Liu Yutong's approval, Li Xiaohui instantly perked up again.","Okay, okay.","I will definitely keep a close eye on it!","................","The next day.","The temporary headquarters of the Wanlonghui Group.","Except for Yun Cheng and Ma Da, who were absent due to work commitments, basically all the executives who could make it were present.","Recently, the Wanlonghui Group had undergone massive changes.","First, the Wanlonghui Group had established a new property management company. All future operations related to the Wanlong Shopping Center would fall under its umbrella, with Yun Cheng holding a concurrent post as its head. Furthermore, the first Wanlong Shopping Center was about to open, with the grand opening scheduled for October 1st, the National Day holiday.","The physical Wanlong Supermarkets had not seen much change; all their expansions were synchronized with related properties like Wanlong Plaza. However, the supermarket division had launched an online shopping channel that supported multi-warehouse shipping. This was essentially creating an online, self-operated supermarket platform capable of instant delivery.","At present, there were no plans to develop it into a comprehensive online mall like Dongdong.","The internet cafe and restaurant businesses were systematically opening new branches alongside the group's related industries. At the same time, the internet cafe division had spun off its milk tea service and established a brand-new milk tea brand, Wanlong Tea.","This brand had already expanded to over a dozen branches, advancing more or less in step with the other industries. In the future, this milk tea brand would consider adopting a direct-sales plus franchise model for broader expansion.","Wanlong Logistics was still developing steadily, though it continued to operate at a loss. Its employee count was also gradually becoming the highest among all the subsidiaries in the entire group.","Over at Wanlong Technology, the main focus remained on Wanhui Select, which was about to undergo its Series B funding round. The valuation for this round of financing would exceed two billion.","The reason for such strong momentum, apart from the excellent data, was that Yu Xin had explained to the investors the future prospects of Wanhui Select on mobile platforms.","Mobile platforms were gradually starting to gain attention. In particular, the innovations of the Fruit phone from across the ocean had allowed visionary businessmen to see that mobile would undoubtedly become a crucial direction for future development.","Yu Xin also proposed the idea of establishing a mobile phone department to lay the groundwork early.","Hearing Yu Xin's proposal, Liu Yutong suddenly had a mischievous thought: what if she brought out the exterior design of the wildly popular 4 phone from her previous life ahead of time?","Developing proprietary phone hardware and software would definitely lag behind foreign countries in the short term, so they could only make assembled phones. However, they could certainly hire someone to design the exterior first.","If they actually managed to produce a phone before Fruit released the 4, using an exterior design they had patented in advance, the Fruit company would probably be completely dumbfounded, right?","Who would be the copycat then?","When the time came, they might even be able to hype up the buzz and genuinely get the mobile phone project off the ground.","At this thought, Liu Yutong hardly hesitated and nodded in agreement. We can set up the company first. Yu Xin, you can concurrently act as the head for now. We can recruit personnel slowly, but we can start by bringing in some talent in exterior design.","Understood, Yu Xin nodded.","She then reported another piece of news, which was that there had been progress regarding the acquisition offer she had made to Degao Maps on behalf of the Wanlong Group.","Degao has relented, but their asking price is a bit high. They want four billion.","Four billion is too high. Three point two billion at most. If they do not agree, they can forget about going public.","Understood!","Currently, Degao Maps was planning an IPO, but Liu Yutong had no intention of giving them the chance to go public. She knew very well that the growth of such electronic maps would be limited even if they went public, and in the future, they would inevitably have to align themselves with a major capital backer to survive comfortably.","Since that was the case, it was better to acquire them early.","If the other party disagreed, she naturally had her ways of obstructing their listing process.","All she had to do was explain the pros and cons to the venture capital firms backing Wanhui Select, and they would be more than happy to throw a few obstacles in Degao Maps' path. After all, those investors were eagerly waiting for Wanhui Select to go public. The expectations and importance they placed on Wanhui Select far exceeded their interest in some so-called map company.","Especially once they realized the massive benefits that integrating Degao Maps into the Wanlonghui ecosystem would bring to Wanhui Select, they would undoubtedly rush to have an earnest heart-to-heart with Degao's founding team, making absolutely certain to nip their IPO dreams in the bud.","After her morning meetings wrapped up, Liu Yutong spent the afternoon immersed in reviewing documents and approving funds.","In just a single afternoon, the funds approved by her signature alone exceeded five billion yuan. It was the true definition of spending money like water.","Fortunately, the financial foundation she had built up previously was solid enough to sustain such a massive investment.","Just as Liu Yutong finally finished signing off on all the required project documents, her assistant, Su Mansu, knocked on the door and walked in.","\"Boss, President Lin Muyang has invited you to meet at his company. He said that he has already brought over the person you wanted to see.\"",".............."]},{"number":554,"title":"Chapter 554: 554. Arrangement.","paragraphs":["Hearing Su Mansu's report, Liu Yutong raised an eyebrow.","Lin Muyang moved quite fast. He actually managed to coax the person over. In that case, she definitely had to meet him.","She didn't want to easily let go of a talent like Zhang Dalong.","Liu Yutong quickly got ready and took Su Mansu with her to the company Lin Muyang had founded.","The car stopped at the base of a high-end office building in the city center.","Soon, they reached the eleventh floor and stepped out of the elevator.","As soon as the elevator doors opened, the eye-catching company logo could be seen on the wall: Longkan Vision, the full name being Longkan Vision Information Technology Co., Ltd.","This name was chosen by Lin Muyang himself. It seemed to borrow the Dragon character from the Wanlong Association. After all, based on the shareholding ratio, Liu Yutong was the major shareholder.","Because Su Mansu had contacted them in advance, Lin Muyang was already waiting at the door with several core executives.","Upon seeing Liu Yutong, Lin Muyang immediately smiled and stepped forward to greet her. \"Yutong, long time no see. This is your first time visiting our company, right?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"It is indeed the first time. It seems President Lin has managed the company quite well.\"","\"Hello, Chairwoman Liu!\"","\"Hello, Chairwoman Liu!\" Several top executives of Longkan Vision hastily greeted Liu Yutong.","They were also extremely surprised inwardly. They hadn't expected the big boss of the company to be even younger than President Lin. She looked like she might not even be twenty years old yet.","After Liu Yutong nodded to them one by one in acknowledgment, the group went straight into the reception room.","This visit wasn't for a formal meeting; it was mainly just for a casual chat.","At this time, in the reception room, Zhang Dalong was already sitting there waiting.","As he drank his tea, he wondered what kind of person the distinguished guest President Lin had introduced to him would be like.","To be honest, he had never seen anyone as shameless as President Lin.","A few days ago, President Lin visited the research and development company where he worked. As soon as they met, Lin spouted a whole bunch of mystical nonsense.","\"President Zhang, I specially asked a master to observe the astrology and fortune. He found that a new star has been dim recently, and it corresponds exactly to you, President Zhang. You are approaching forty, yet your brilliance remains obstructed. It truly is a pity, a great pity.\"","Zhang Dalong was nearly forty. Although he had some achievements, he considered himself stuck in a mediocre position, neither high nor low, without much fame. Even though the email project he was currently in charge of had the largest market share, he still wasn't qualified to enter the company's core management level. He needed to create an even more influential product to get there.","He thought about it over and over again but still couldn't find a clear direction.","Big Goose's current momentum was also very good. Especially with the empowerment of their chat software, their gaming sector was gradually growing larger, and it seemed there was no place for him to put his skills to use.","Moreover, his personality was somewhat introverted and straightforward. He wasn't good at socializing. Being a programmer by background, he was used to staying up late and thinking alone, which was why he had fallen into a dead end.","Therefore, Lin Muyang's opening remark really did bluff Zhang Dalong a bit, making him instinctively ask that question.","\"What does that mean?\"","Lin Muyang had prepared his pitch long before he came.","\"The master said that this tribulation cannot be broken by human effort alone; it requires the advantage of location. Pearl City in the north is a very good place. The purple aura comes from the east, there is a winding hidden dragon vein passing through, and even more so, a noble benefactor...\"","\"Speak plainly!\"","\"It means I want to invite you to take a trip to Pearl City. I'll cover all your airfare, food, and accommodation. If you don't come with me, I'll block the entrance of your company every day. Are you going or not? Give me an answer.\"","Zhang Dalong was thus half-threatened and half-coaxed into coming. The main reason was that he knew Lin Muyang had connections with the leaders in Pearl City, so he simply did him a favor, taking the opportunity to see if there really was a dragon in Pearl City.","The result, however, disappointed him. He didn't see any dragon at all.","In addition, he was used to staying in fast-paced big cities in the south. In his eyes, Pearl City was just an old, dilapidated, and small place that truly held no attraction for him.","Only later did he learn that someone else actually wanted to meet him.","Going around in such a big circle just to meet someone, he really didn't know how to judge this guy Lin Muyang.","The door to the reception room was pushed open.","Lin Muyang walked in, accompanying a very young girl.","The girl had clear eyes and a composed pace, seemingly carrying an indescribably powerful aura around her.","\"President Zhang, sorry to keep you waiting!\"","Lin Muyang introduced her to him, \"This is the Chairwoman of the Wanlong Association Group, and also the major shareholder of our Longkan Vision, Ms. Liu Yutong.\"","Hearing this, Zhang Dalong was visibly stunned for a moment.","He had thought this girl was Lin Muyang's assistant, as she was just too young. He never expected her to be the major shareholder, let alone the Chairwoman of this Wanlong Association company.","To be the chairwoman of a group at this age was indeed impressive!","Likewise, he seemed to understand what kind of dragon Lin Muyang meant when he mentioned the dragon in Pearl City.","It presumably referred to this Wanlong company, right?","\"Hello, Chairwoman Liu.\"","\"President Zhang, I've heard so much about you. Please, have a seat.\" Liu Yutong smiled and shook his hand, gesturing for him to sit down.","After they took their seats, Lin Muyang livened up the atmosphere by chatting about topics related to the internet industry. The focus of the conversation was the chat software of the company where Zhang Dalong worked, as well as the project Zhang Dalong was in charge of.","\"President Zhang, FOXmail is an extremely excellent product. From it, I can see your profound understanding of user experience. I have no doubt at all that you are a top-tier product manager.\"","\"You flatter me, Chairwoman Liu,\" Zhang Dalong said modestly. He seemed to have guessed the purpose of her meeting with him.","When ordinary people paid attention to the email service he created, they would usually mention the name Big Goose Email. However, she brought up the email project he had worked on at the very beginning of his entrepreneurial journey. This clearly had a deeper implication.","\"I believe President Lin has also mentioned to you that our Wanlong Group has Wanlong Technology under its umbrella, and we are currently vigorously developing our internet business. We are in great need of a talent like you.\"","\"We are currently planning a brand-new, epoch-making product that will make communication between people even more convenient. I believe you are fully capable of taking the helm of this project.\"","Liu Yutong was already very straightforward at this point; she was just short of explicitly saying: I want to poach you to work on instant messaging!","But when Zhang Dalong heard that she wanted to do instant messaging, his first reaction was that she was a very well-packaged scammer.","Doing instant messaging now to compete with Big Goose? No normal person would do that unless they had lost their mind.","Of course, he definitely wouldn't say such words out loud. By the same token, he was completely disappointed with this meeting.","\"Thank you for your high regard, Chairwoman Liu. However, my current job is very stable, and I also have some new projects to follow up on. I don't have any thoughts of leaving for the time being...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Su Mansu suddenly interrupted their conversation.","\"Boss, the private room has been booked. We can go eat now.\"","Liu Yutong nodded and stood up. \"It's just about time for a meal. President Zhang, why don't we go to my restaurant and try our local specialties?\"","Naturally, Zhang Dalong wouldn't decline a meal, so he readily agreed.","He was thoroughly satisfied with dinner that night. It was, without a doubt, the most appetizing meal he had eaten since arriving in Mingzhu City. The signature dish, small fish potstickers, was nothing short of a culinary masterpiece.","After dinner.","Zhang Dalong planned to take a casual stroll around Mingzhu City by himself, mentioning that he intended to head back the next day.","A guy like him was never particularly fond of socializing anyway. While hanging out with Liu Yutong and her group was certainly easy on the eyes, it just wasn't as relaxing as being on his own.","Naturally, Liu Yutong wasn't about to let him wander around aimlessly by himself. He was a guest from afar, and it was imperative that he be properly entertained.","She subsequently called Zhang Tao over and gave him a few specific instructions.","\"Zhang Tao, take Mr. Zhang for a proper tour around Mingzhu City so he can experience our local culture and customs. You must make sure Mr. Zhang feels our hospitality, understand?\"","\"Understood, Eldest Miss! Don't you worry. I guarantee Mr. Zhang will find this trip worthwhile!\"","Zhang Tao was a veteran of the Wanlong Syndicate. He had taken over the reins from Li Xiaohui to become the head of their internet cafe operations, and he was a highly reliable guy.","After everyone parted ways.","Zhang Tao sized up Zhang Dalong and began to analyze him in his head.","The guy standing before him looked like your typical tech nerd. He had a somewhat dull personality, and his listless demeanor suggested he was used to staying up late working overtime. What was truly outrageous, however, was that he didn't even seem interested in the Eldest Miss's offer to recruit him.","In Zhang Tao's eyes, the Eldest Miss was practically a goddess. How could anyone not be tempted when a goddess personally extended an invitation?","The problem had to lie with him.","Could it be that he was just getting older and lacked the fiery passion of the youth?","If that was the case, then he just needed a little excitement to awaken his primal instincts and fighting spirit. He needed to be shown just how thrilling and exhilarating it was to run with the Wanlong Syndicate!","Zhang Dalong felt a chill creep up his spine under the young man's intense gaze. Unable to hold back, he finally asked,","\"Um... buddy, where exactly are we going?\"","Zhang Tao threw an arm around his shoulder and said enthusiastically, \"Brother, the Eldest Miss left you in my hands, so you can rest easy! I promise I'll have everything lined up perfectly for you!\"","Zhang Dalong was just about to tell him there was no need to go to such trouble, but before he could get the words out, Zhang Tao pointed straight ahead and dragged him forward. \"Brother, let's go!\""]},{"number":555,"title":"Chapter 555: 555, Transformation.","paragraphs":["Half-pushed and half-pulled by Zhang Tao, Zhang Dalong got into a black car—a literal black sedan.","A few minutes later, they arrived at a hair salon.","While Zhang Dalong looked completely bewildered, Zhang Tao spoke directly to the owner, \"Boss, give my brother the most popular hairstyle right now.\"","Zhang Dalong: ???","\"No... no, I think my current hair is just fine...\"","\"Hey, since we're already here, just go with it. Listen to me, you can't go wrong.\"","Zhang Tao urged the owner again, \"Hurry up!\"","\"Alright, Brother Tao, just watch me.\"","Before Zhang Dalong could even react, the enthusiastic owner pressed him down into the barber chair.","\"Little brother, there's really no need. At my age...\"","\"Bro, trust me!\"","Zhang Tao took out his phone, tapped it skillfully a few times, and pulled up a picture.","\"Do it exactly like this! Like that guy in the movie Crazy Stone, yeah... yeah... just that kind of vibe. A bit of personality, but not too exaggerated.\"","The owner leaned over to take a look and immediately made an OK gesture. \"Brother Tao, don't you worry. I guarantee I'll give this big brother a whole new look!\"","It didn't take long for Zhang Dalong's conventional black side-part to disappear, replaced by a slightly fluffy, choppy yellow hairstyle with a few streaks of red highlights at the front.","To be honest, the hairstyle itself wasn't bad; it was even quite trendy. But on the head of the nearly forty-year-old Zhang Dalong, it looked completely out of place no matter how you looked at it.","Looking at his reflection in the mirror—seeming ten years younger yet incredibly unfamiliar—Zhang Dalong was speechless for a long time.","I just came for a nice trip to Pearl City, so how did I end up as a blond punk?","\"How about it, bro? Mind-blowingly handsome, right?\"","Zhang Tao patted his shoulder proudly. \"Let's go, next stop. I'll take you to experience the nightlife of our Pearl City.\"","Zhang Dalong tried to struggle but was once again dragged and shoved into the black car by Zhang Tao.","The car twisted and turned before parking on a neon-lit street in the city center.","As soon as they got out, deafening music blasted from all directions. Moreover, the streets were bustling with young people dressed in alternative fashion, getting ready to go to karaoke or hit the dance floor.","Zhang Tao led the newly coiffed Zhang Dalong straight toward the nearest bar.","Just as they reached the entrance, three girls with alternatively styled blond hair spotted Zhang Dalong, whose hairstyle completely mismatched his age. They paused for a moment before teasing him, \"Yo, Uncle, coming out clubbing at your age? Your hair is pretty trendy. Is it your first time here?\"","Zhang Dalong's face instantly turned red. He wished he could pin Zhang Tao to the ground and rub his face in the dirt right then and there.","When it came to bars, the city he lived in had far more than Pearl City. But he had a quiet personality; usually, he would at most sit in a cafe or a lounge bar, and had almost never set foot in such a noisy nightclub.","Many programmers with STEM backgrounds were basically like this—they didn't really like loud, bustling places.","But look at him now—his hair was styled so avant-garde, and Zhang Tao had even forced a fake stud onto his ear. It was so alternative, it was downright absurd!","Seeing Zhang Dalong blush, the three girls actually found this uncle rather cute and took the initiative to hold out their fists.","\"Uncle, fist bump!\"","Zhang Dalong froze for a second before hurriedly extending his fist to bump theirs.","\"Hahaha... Uncle, you are way too cute!\" The girls were amused by his clumsy demeanor.","\"Let's go, Uncle. See you inside!\" With that, they giggled and walked into the bar.","Watching their retreating figures, Zhang Dalong sighed, feeling that he was indeed a bit out of touch with this world.","Honestly, sometimes he completely failed to understand why young people nowadays liked these alternative trends. From his current perspective, being alternative was just pure rebellion.","But other people rebelled when they were sixteen, seventeen, or eighteen, nineteen years old. As for him, he was rebelling at nearly forty. Who could handle that?","After entering the bar, Zhang Tao familiarly found a booth and sat down. After ordering drinks, he looked at the lively atmosphere around them and couldn't help but sigh with emotion, \"It's been a long time since I last came here. This time, I can finally go clubbing openly and honestly.\"","Hearing this, Zhang Dalong instantly knew that even if this guy wasn't married, he at least had a partner. It turned out he had completely become this guy's wingman and tool.","Damn it, just wait, I'll snitch to your partner later!","\"Brother Long, since we're already here, go down and move around a bit. Just sitting here is so boring.\"","Zhang Dalong hurriedly shook his head. \"No, no, I really don't know how to do this.\"","\"Oh come on, you don't need to learn it. Just flail around and dance however you want.\"","\"Let's go, get hyped!\"","Zhang Tao without another word dragged him straight onto the dance floor.","Zhang Dalong couldn't resist at all and was forced to dance along. However, his body was a bit uncoordinated; his arms and legs seemed to have minds of their own.","Just as he was about to give up and slip back to his seat, a crisp voice came from behind him.","\"Hahaha... Uncle, are you doing a zombie dance?\"","Zhang Dalong turned around and saw it was one of the girls who had fist-bumped him at the door. His old face flushed red once again.","\"I haven't really danced much.\"","This girl had quite an outgoing personality and volunteered to teach him. \"Come, come, come, I'll teach you!\"","\"Relax, move your shoulders. Right, I didn't mean shrug them. Then raise your hands above your head... Get hyped!\"","\"I can't, I can't anymore. Uncle, you are truly a piece of work.\"","\"Hahaha...\"","\"Forget it, forget it. I really can't dance. You guys have fun.\" Zhang Dalong finally conceded defeat and wanted to retreat to the booth.","The girl glanced at the booth where Zhang Dalong and his friend were sitting. Her eyes lit up, and she took the initiative to ask.","\"Uncle, do you still have room over there? Can my sisters and I come over and sit for a bit?\"","\"Huh? That wouldn't be appropriate, would it?\"","Zhang Tao chimed in with an assist at this moment. \"Come on over, beauties, take a seat. Our booth is plenty spacious.\"","The girl didn't stand on ceremony and immediately called her other two sisters over.","Zhang Tao's booth became lively with the addition of the extra people.","In another luxurious booth not far away, a young man whose attire suggested he came from a wealthy family was staring at Zhang Dalong and his group with a gloomy expression.","The outgoing girl who had just struck up a conversation with Zhang Dalong was originally with them. She had left because of a minor argument, and he hadn't expected her to run off to someone else in the blink of an eye—and to a somewhat tacky-looking middle-aged uncle sporting blond hair, no less.","The young man suddenly felt he was losing face and gave a look to a lackey beside him.","The lackey understood. He immediately jogged over and said to the outgoing girl, \"Xiaoya, Young Master Ming is calling you guys back. The birthday cake is about to be served over there. Stop throwing a tantrum.\"","Xiaoya and her friends didn't even think about it and rejected him outright.","\"We're not going. We're having a great time chatting with the uncle here, so we won't interrupt your fun.\"","\"Yeah, chatting with the uncle is way more interesting than being with you guys.\"","\"Exactly, exactly. And the uncle is so cute, he won't lose his temper either.\"","The lackey's expression soured upon being rejected. He turned to Zhang Dalong and threatened, \"Hey, old man, these girls are friends invited by our Young Master Ming. It is not very appropriate for you to do this, is it?\"","Zhang Dalong had not thought much of it initially, but the man's tone rubbed him the wrong way. He replied bluntly, \"They came over of their own free will. I didn't force them.\"","Zhang Tao sneered from the side and chimed in, \"What? The ladies don't want to hang out with you guys, so you are going to drag them away by force? Get the hell out of here!\"","The lackey's face flushed with anger and embarrassment at the sharp rebuke. He dropped a harsh \"Just you wait\" before turning around and going back."]},{"number":556,"title":"Chapter 556: 556, Brother Long is paying for everyone's drinks tonight","paragraphs":["After the lackey returned, he immediately leaned into the ear of Zhao Ming, a second-generation rich kid with some money, and whispered a few words, adding fuel to the fire.","Zhao Ming's face instantly darkened.","He originally just wanted to call his female companion back, but he didn't expect that middle-aged blond punk to be so capable as to actually steal her away.","Wasn't this a slap in the face?","So, he personally led a few friends and aggressively marched over to Zhang Dalong.","\"Hey, old man, aren't you a bit too old to be hanging out in bars? Don't say I didn't warn you, but at your age, your body can't handle partying this hard.\"","\"If you know what's good for you, hurry up and roll back home to babysit. This isn't a place for you.\"","His friends behind him chimed in with their own mockery.","\"Yeah, old man, look at yourself. Is it really appropriate for someone your age to be out clubbing?\"","\"There are so many of you but you only ordered a few bottles of beer. Trying to pick up girls while being so cheap, aren't you embarrassed?!\"","\"Xiaoya, look at your terrible taste. You leave the Ace of Spades over here with our Young Master Ming, and run off to squeeze together with a stingy, beer-drinking old man? How pathetic!\"","\"Broke loser! Just get the hell out of here!\"","\"...\"","Hearing these insulting words, even an honest man like Zhang Dalong couldn't bear it anymore.","A bunch of little brats, who did they think they were talking to?!","If nothing else, he still had a net worth of over ten million. The company he originally founded was acquired by Big Goose for a good ten million, not to mention his subsequent salary was not low either. He only ordered beer simply because he couldn't handle hard liquor.","Now, being insulted by a few wet-behind-the-ears kids much younger than him, anyone would get angry.","He was just about to snap back when the girl sitting opposite him, Xiaoya, stood up first.","\"Zhao Ming, what are you showing off for? You think having some filthy money makes you so great?! This is called being low-key and having depth, understand?!\"","\"Depth? Hahaha...\"","Zhao Ming turned around and pointed at the large screen behind the DJ, which was currently displaying the names of the top three spending customers of the night. Zhao Ming's name was prominently listed. Although he was third, it was still a huge flex.","\"This is fucking power! Understand? Only broke losers talk about depth!\"","\"Old man, aren't you good at pretending? Don't you have depth? Alright! If you're really that awesome, why don't you get on the leaderboard and show me? Forget about first place, if your fucking spending tonight can even make it to the top three, I'll write my name, Zhao Ming, upside down!\"","As soon as he said this, his lackeys behind him immediately started clamoring as well.","\"Exactly! Young Master Ming is a real man! Money talks!\"","\"Get on the board, old man! Let us open our eyes and see how much your depth is worth!\"","\"I'm afraid even if he pawned his entire outfit, it wouldn't even be enough to cover a fraction of Young Master Ming's bill, right? Hahaha...\"","\"Young Master Ming is the best!\"","Zhao Ming was extremely smug from the flattery. He crossed his arms and looked at Zhang Dalong.","\"Well? If you can't do it, then get the hell out! This place isn't somewhere broke losers like you can afford.\"","Zhang Dalong couldn't take it anymore. With a loud bang, he slammed the table and stood up.","He was already quite depressed today about having his hair dyed blond. Now, having done nothing at all but being humiliated like this, his anger completely exploded.","\"Little boy, don't push your luck!\"","Zhao Ming: \"I'm pushing my luck? You stole my girl and you're still sitting here pretending to be a big shot. Old man, if you don't have the cash, then get lost!\"","Xiaoya: \"Zhao Ming, show some respect when you speak. Who is your girl? I have absolutely nothing to do with you!\"","Zhao Ming: \"Good, very good. It seems you guys are dead set on going against me.\"","\"Call the manager over here!\"","\"Zhao Ming, what are you trying to do?\"","\"Naturally, I'm inviting you broke losers to get out.\"","\"You...\"","Xiaoya was just about to say something when the bar manager hurried over and asked respectfully, \"Young Master Ming, is there anything you need?\"","Zhao Ming pointed at Zhang Dalong and the others: \"If I buy another 88,888 Divine Dragon Set, can you throw these broke losers out for me?\"","The manager was initially quite happy hearing the first half of the sentence, but the second half made his face stiffen.","It wasn't that he didn't want to, but doing so would be bad for the business's reputation.","\"Young Master Ming, look, we're running a business here. How can we drive our guests out? How about I give you another fruit platter on the house to help you cool off?\"","Zhao Ming shoved the manager aside and pointed right at Zhang Dalong's nose: \"I'll add another Divine Dragon Set! Today, either they get out, or I'm taking everyone to another club! You choose!\"","The surrounding music had stopped at some point, and everyone's eyes were looking over here.","It seemed like there was some drama to watch!","The manager was out of options. After all, he couldn't afford to offend a big client like Zhao Ming, so he had no choice but to prepare to ask Zhang Dalong and his group to leave.","\"Everyone, I'm sorry, please...\"","Right at this moment, Zhang Tao, who had been watching from the sidelines, stood up and interrupted him.","\"If you dare say a single word about kicking us out, you won't need to keep this place open anymore.\"","Manager: \"...\"","Zhang Tao walked directly in front of Zhao Ming and looked him up and down: \"I thought you could pull off some huge flex, but it turns out this is all you're capable of?\"","Zhao Ming showed no weakness: \"What? You, a mere lackey, want to play the hero?!\"","Zhang Tao ignored him and turned to ask Zhang Dalong: \"Brother, want to play something thrilling?\"","Zhang Dalong was actually getting ready to leave. He was long past the age of acting on impulse, and naturally wouldn't fight to the bitter end with a kid over a decade younger than him.","There was no meaning to it.","But Zhang Tao clearly had no intention of leaving, and for some reason, upon hearing Zhang Tao's words, Zhang Dalong suddenly had an ominous premonition in his heart.","\"What... what are you trying to do?\"","Zhang Tao looked at the bar manager again and asked: \"Please tally up the total consumption of the entire club tonight.\"","The manager was stunned: \"Sir, what are you...\"","He still had some discernment and could tell that this person was not ordinary. Otherwise, when the other party just said that line about shutting down their bar, he would have directly called security over.","Zhang Tao smiled faintly, his gaze sweeping across the entire club. Finally, he pointed at Zhang Dalong and shouted loudly.","\"Everyone, all the expenses tonight will be paid by my Brother Long!!!\"","As soon as these words came out, the bar instantly went dead silent for three seconds.","Then, the whole place erupted in an instant!","\"Holy shit! Buying out the whole club?!\"","\"Brother Long is a total badass!!!\"","\"Thank you, Brother Long!!!\"","\"Brother Long, you are my father!!!\"","\"Brother Long, I love you!!!\"","\"...\"","Zhang Dalong: ???","No, what are you doing? What the hell are you doing?!","Who wants to foot the bill!","Seeing that Zhang Dalong was so agitated he couldn't even speak, Zhang Tao smiled and asked: \"How about it, brother, thrilling or not? Does it feel good?!\"","Zhang Dalong roared in his heart: Thrilling my ass! Damn it! You really are a beast!","Although his net worth was not low, that was merely his net worth. The cash he currently had on hand was only around two million. This single move would probably wipe out most of it. His heart was bleeding.","When Zhang Tao saw Zhang Dalong's face turn red, he thought he was excited and felt extremely proud of himself. The task given by The Young Lady could be considered complete, right?","\"Brother, don't just stand there in a daze, let's drink!\"","Zhang Dalong saw that it was past the point of no return. Especially after seeing the admiring looks from the people around him, he had a change of heart. The money was already spent, so wouldn't it be a total waste to act all bashful now?","With this in mind, he simply threw caution to the wind. He stood up abruptly, raised the beer bottle in his hand, and shouted to the cheering crowd, \"Tonight, we don't go home until we're drunk!\"","Even he was startled by his own roar.","Soon, there was a response.","Seeing that Brother Long had spoken, the DJ on stage grabbed the microphone and roared.","\"BarCelO—n!!! Listen up, everyone!\"","\"Let's give our loudest screams and most enthusiastic applause to the most generous, most handsome man tonight, Brother—Long!!!\"","\"Everybody stand up!\"","\"Let me hear your voices! One! Two! Three! Thank you, Brother Long!!!\"","\"Thank you, Brother Long!!!\"","The deafening shout from hundreds of people in unison was like a tsunami, making Zhang Dalong's head spin, but it also made the blood in his veins boil.","He had lived for nearly forty years and had never experienced anything like this.","The DJ pumped up the music again and improvised a rhythmic hype track.","\"Yo, yo, yo! Look at the booth over there, who is spreading the joy!","All that calm and low profile, tonight we destroy!","Brother Long drops the ultimate trump card,","Buying out the whole club, he goes that hard!","This! Is power! This! Is dominance!","Let me see your hands, follow the rhythm, and scream for Brother Long! Brother Long is—a legend!!!\"","\"Brother Long is—a legend!!!\"","\"Brother Long is—a legend!!!\"","Driven continuously by the DJ, the crowd's frenzy rose higher and higher in waves.","People kept surging forward to toast Zhang Dalong, shouting, \"Brother Long is mighty! Brother Long is generous!\"","Xiaoya and her friends had all become his fangirls, surrounding him and shouting excitedly.","\"Mister! You are way too handsome!\"","\"Mister! From today on, you are my idol!\"","\"I've never seen such a baller scene in a club before!\"","\".........\"","It had to be said, they had completely misjudged him.","They hadn't expected this seemingly cute older guy to actually be such a heavy hitter.","Zhang Dalong went from being unaccustomed and at a loss at the beginning, to completely letting go now. Surrounded by the crowd, he copied the young people and pumped his arms vigorously in the air.","Looking at the crowd going crazy for him below, and listening to the deafening cheers, an unprecedented thrill welled up inside him.","Finally, unable to hold back, he let out another loud shout.","\"Awesome! Awesome! AWESOME!!!\"","This roar released years of pent-up frustration and officially declared that tonight, he, Zhang Dalong, was the sole king of this place!","On the other side.","Zhao Ming and his crew were already long gone.","Although he had some money, spending over a million to treat the entire club was beyond his means, so he could only slip away in disgrace.","It wasn't until past one in the morning that the wild party finally came to an end.","Just as Zhang Dalong braced himself to swipe his card for the bill, the manager informed him that someone had already paid.","He instinctively looked at Zhang Tao.","\"This money...\"","Zhang Tao waved his hand. \"This little bit of money is nothing, The Young Lady will reimburse it. Let's go, brother, onto the next round!\"","\"The next round will be even more thrilling!\"","Zhang Dalong: \"......\""]},{"number":557,"title":"Chapter 557: 557. Zhang Dalong's First Experience in a Group Fight.","paragraphs":["Zhang Dalong seemed to have guessed what the other party was thinking, but he just felt that doing so was a complete waste of money. It would be better to just throw the money at him; maybe then he would actually be tempted.","Just when he thought Zhang Tao would take him to some more exciting venue to have a good time, to his surprise, the guy simply brought him to the late-night snack street for some skewers.","Now he was starting to doubt himself.","Could it be... it really wasn't what he thought?","Well, that was truly a shame.","However, when the skewers were served and he saw the ten large lamb kidneys on the plate, he started feeling suspicious again.","No, no, he was a decent man. He absolutely could not go to those shady places.","Zhang Tao had no idea what he was thinking and directly shoved two skewers of kidneys into his hands: \"Brother, eat up! You'll only have strength after you're full!\"","Zhang Dalong did actually love eating roasted lamb kidneys. After taking them and finishing one skewer, he still couldn't hold back and asked: \"Are there... really more activities for us later?\"","Zhang Tao nodded: \"Of course there are! The Young Lady said we have to make sure you have a blast, so tonight I must risk my life to accompany you, a true gentleman!\"","Hearing this, Zhang Dalong secretly thought to himself, 'Sure enough, this kid really is a bit of a playboy.'","\"Then... little brother, aren't you afraid your girlfriend will get angry?\"","Zhang Tao: \"Why would she get angry? I already told her this is all work arranged by The Young Lady, and she even told me to work hard at it!\"","Zhang Dalong: \"...\"","What kind of weirdos are these people!","\"Are the cops strict around here?\"","Hearing this, Zhang Tao thought about it seriously: \"The police here are still very responsible. Especially when we make a call, they arrive in just a few minutes. Their response is very fast.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"???\"","\"You guys are looking for thrills and you actually take the initiative to call the cops?\"","Zhang Tao: \"What else? Doing this kind of thing always ends up with having to explain everything to the cops anyway. Isn't that perfectly normal?\"","Zhang Dalong was crying tears of despair in his heart. Is this really normal? Who on earth goes out to find hookers and actively calls to report it to the cops?","Or is this guy completely lawless and in cahoots with the cops? Otherwise, how could he dare to do something like this?","Just what kind of people does the Ten Thousand Dragons Association train!","Zhang Dalong finished his skewers with a heavy heart and stood up.","\"I've made up my mind. I can't go. I can't do this thrill-seeking stuff!\"","Zhang Tao looked at him in surprise: \"But everything is already arranged.\"","\"Even if it's arranged, I can't! This is a matter of principle!\"","\"It's too late. You can't leave now.\"","\"What do you mean? Are you trying to abduct an innocent man?\"","\"What abducting an innocent man? What are you talking about? Why can't I understand you?\"","\"Aren't you just going to find a hook...\"","Before Zhang Dalong could finish his sentence, he saw a group of weapon-wielding thugs appear at the end of the street, running aggressively toward them.","\"There they are! Don't let them get away!\"","Zhang Tao stood up and patted Zhang Dalong on the shoulder: \"Brother, see, I told you. This round will definitely be more exciting than the last one.\"","\"Look, they're here!\"","Only then did Zhang Dalong realize he had gotten the wrong idea. However, seeing so many thugs surrounding them, he didn't even have time to feel embarrassed and hurriedly asked: \"Wait, did you know all along that they would come looking for trouble?\"","Zhang Tao nodded: \"Yeah, it's just like the tropes in novels. You don't even have to guess to know that after you slapped that guy's face in the bar, he would definitely bring people to get his revenge.\"","The man leading the group was none other than that rich kid from the bar, Zhao Ming.","Zhang Dalong panicked: \"If you knew, why didn't you say so earlier! Let's run, hurry!\"","Zhang Tao shook his head: \"NO! NO! NO! Running away is not the style of our Ten Thousand Dragons Association!\"","After saying that, he pulled out his own telescopic baton and shoved it into Zhang Dalong's hands: \"Brother, take this to defend yourself. Prepare for battle!\"","Zhang Dalong looked at the short, small telescopic baton in his hand, and then looked at the more than twenty thugs holding baseball bats and steel pipes across from them. His face turned green.","Damn it, have a heart!!!","What the hell can a crappy baton defend against?!","Zhang Tao, however, had already started doing warm-up exercises, saying to Zhang Dalong at the same time: \"Brother, just charge in without worrying. I will protect your safety.\"","Zhang Dalong: Do you think I'd believe that?","You are just one person, and there are more than twenty people on the other side. How are you going to protect my safety?","\"Brother, remember the slogan of our Ten Thousand Dragons Association.\"","\"What slogan?\"","\"Forget about life and death, if they provoke you, just fight!!!\"","\"I'll fight your...\"","Before Zhang Dalong could spit out his curse, Zhao Ming on the opposite side had already shouted arrogantly.","\"Hey! That Blond Uncle! Now you know fear? If you obediently kneel down and kowtow three times to me right now, and then lick my shoes clean, maybe I'll be in a good mood and only break one of your legs.\"","Hearing this, Zhang Dalong's stubborn temper, typical of a STEM guy, flared up.","\"You... you little brat! Don't you know how to respect your elders and care for the young! I... I'm warning you, I've trained before! Foshan Shadowless Baton, ever heard of it? If you know what's good for you, get out of here!\"","As soon as he said this, the thugs opposite them immediately burst into loud laughter.","\"Hahaha... Young Master Ming, he said he practiced the Shadowless Baton. I've only ever heard of the Foshan Shadowless Kick. This is the first time I've heard of the Foshan Shadowless Baton.\"","\"Uncle, what you practiced is probably the third set of radio calisthenics, right?\"","\"Hahaha...\"","Zhang Tao was also amused, but he encouraged him verbally: \"Brother, great momentum! Later, just focus on hitting that Zhao Ming. To catch the bandits, first catch the ringleader!\"","\"Catch my ass! I couldn't even catch the square-dancing aunties in our neighborhood!\"","Zhang Dalong was completely in despair. He swore that as soon as he got into the hospital, the first thing he would do was call to arrange a hospital transfer.","These people from the Ten Thousand Dragons Association were all lunatics! He didn't want to stay a single day longer.","Zhao Ming stopped talking nonsense and pointed his steel pipe at Zhang Dalong and Zhang Tao.","\"Beat them to death for me!\"","Sooner said than done, at the exact moment the thugs rushed forward waving their weapons, Zhang Tao immediately charged to meet them.","His movements were extremely fast; after all, his time training in the Ten Thousand Dragons Association wasn't for nothing. In the first encounter, he cleanly took down the two people rushing at the very front.","At the same time, Zhang Dalong only felt his vision blur. Before he could see what was going on, a baseball bat was fiercely smashing toward his face.","Terrified, he closed his eyes and blindly swung the telescopic baton forward.","Bang!","With a loud crash, the expected pain did not appear. Zhang Dalong cautiously opened one eye and was shocked to find the thug with the baseball bat screaming on the ground three meters away.","\"I... I hit him?\" Zhang Dalong looked at the telescopic baton in his hand in disbelief.","Is it really this awesome?","\"Stand behind me and don't move around.\"","Right at that moment, a strong and resonant voice rang in his ears.","Only then did Zhang Dalong notice that, at some point, an unfamiliar young man with a buzz cut had appeared beside him.","He didn't have time to ask the other party's name and obediently hid behind him as told.","Then, he witnessed the most brutal and thrilling scene he had ever seen in his life.","This buzz-cut youth was like a god of death, actually taking him along as he charged forward. Wherever they passed, a large swath of thugs fell to the ground. He was simply so fierce he didn't seem human.","It even sparked his courage. An unprecedented thrill surged through his entire body. Unable to hold back, he grabbed the expandable baton again and swung it around wildly, even providing his own sound effects.","\"Take that! Hi-yah! Wacha!\"","Two minutes later.","After Zhang Tao finished off the last standing thug, he looked over at Zhang Dalong, who was still frantically unleashing a barrage of attacks on the empty air. He couldn't help but call out, \"Bro! Bro! Hold on a second, the fight is over.\"","Only then did Zhang Dalong stop, panting heavily. He opened his eyes and saw people lying all around him. A surge of pride instantly welled up in his heart, and he couldn't help but blurt out,","\"I knew I was a total badass! I actually took down this many guys?!\"","Chu Yang, standing nearby, chimed in, \"Yeah, yeah, you're definitely a badass!\""]},{"number":558,"title":"Chapter 558: 558, Sworn Brotherhood","paragraphs":["\"Get lost!\"","With a loud shout from Zhang Tao, Zhao Ming and the thugs he had hired scrambled to their feet, limping away in a pathetic retreat.","Zhang Tao then walked up to Zhang Dalong and gave him a thumbs up. \"Bro, you are truly amazing! That Chaotic Cloak Staff Technique of yours was absolutely brilliant!\"","Praised like this, and combined with the effects of the alcohol he had consumed tonight, Zhang Dalong instantly felt as if he were floating on air.","In his thirty-something years of life, this was the first time he had ever felt so incredibly awesome!","\"Ah, it was nothing special. It's mostly just that these little brats couldn't take a beating.\"","Zhang Tao said, \"Bro, I truly admire your skills. I feel like we're old friends at first sight, and I only regret we didn't meet sooner. Why don't we become sworn brothers right here and now? From now on, we'll share our blessings and face our hardships together!\"","Still immersed in the illusion that he was a martial arts master, Zhang Dalong's blood boiled with excitement, and he agreed with heroic flair. \"Let's do it! We definitely have to! I, Zhang Dalong, acknowledge you as my little brother!\"","Terrified that he might go back on his word, Zhang Tao immediately grabbed two skewers of grilled meat, handed one to Zhang Dalong, and kept one for himself. \"With the heavens above...\"","Before he could finish, Zhang Dalong interrupted him.","\"Hold on!\"","\"Bro, what's wrong?\"","Zhang Dalong grabbed another skewer and handed it to Chu Yang, who was watching the show from the sidelines. \"Brother, your skills are pretty good too. Let's all three of us become sworn brothers.\"","Chu Yang was speechless.","How childish is this!","But he didn't refuse, because he knew that The Young Lady valued this man highly, and he also knew exactly what Zhang Tao was trying to do.","In the end, he silently accepted the skewer.","And so, the three of them stood in front of the barbecue stall, facing the moon in the sky, and began their sworn brotherhood ceremony.","\"With the heavens above and the earth below, I, Zhang Tao.\"","\"Chu Yang!\"","\"Zhang Dalong!\"","The three of them chanted in unison, \"Hereby become sworn brothers! From this day forth, we share life and death, fortune and misfortune! If we break this oath, may lightning strike us down!\"","Having said that, the three of them immediately shoved the skewers into their mouths and stripped the meat off in one bite.","The sense of ceremony was there, though the meat had been sitting out for a while and had gotten a bit cold, making it less appetizing.","\"Good brother!\"","\"Good brother!\"","\"Good brother!\"","The three of them hugged each other, and the ceremony concluded.","As if suddenly remembering something, Zhang Tao said to Zhang Dalong, \"Oh, right, bro. Since we're sworn brothers now, we're basically family. No problem with that, right?\"","Zhang Dalong replied, \"No problem.\"","Zhang Tao continued, \"Then my other thousand or so brothers and sisters are also your brothers and sisters. No problem with that either, right?\"","Zhang Dalong replied, \"No problem.\"","Right after he said that, he felt something was off. Could it be that he had drunk too much and was hearing things?","Over a thousand brothers and sisters? That sounded absurd.","It had to be an auditory hallucination. Yes, absolutely.","Zhang Tao went on, \"Bro, it's like this. I just remembered something very important I need to tell you, regarding the rules among our brothers and sisters.\"","\"What rules? Tell me, brother!\" Zhang Dalong still didn't take it seriously.","Zhang Tao's eyes suddenly narrowed as he smiled and said, \"It's nothing much, really. Just one sentence that everyone has to abide by.\"","\"Anyone who betrays The Young Lady or betrays the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang shall suffer three knives and six holes.\"","The smile on Zhang Dalong's face instantly froze.","\"What... what the heck did you just say?\"","Zhang Tao explained, \"It means exactly what it sounds like. If anyone betrays The Young Lady and our brothers and sisters, they have to be stabbed straight through three times, creating six holes. It's a rule passed down from our ancestors, mainly to remind the brothers at all times that the loyalty to The Young Lady and the camaraderie among our brothers and sisters are weightier than Mount Tai!\"","\"Don't worry, bro. The brothers and sisters of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang are exceptionally united. Since our founding, we've never actually executed this gang rule. It's just a formality to remind everyone to value loyalty. Since you're our brother now, naturally you have to follow it too, right?\"","Zhang Dalong: \"!!!\"","Wait a minute! He was an outstanding programmer who obeyed the law, paid his taxes on time, and didn't even dare to copy company code. How did he inexplicably end up boarding a pirate ship like this?","This was a freaking mafia, wasn't it?!","He desperately wanted to ask if he could back out and cancel the sworn brotherhood.","But looking at Zhang Tao's somewhat hypocritical smile, and Chu Yang's seemingly calm but actually murderous gaze, he forcefully swallowed his words.","These two, along with him, had managed to take down that group of thugs, so they were definitely very strong. He was afraid he wouldn't be able to beat them on his own.","Just as Zhang Dalong was internally debating whether to call the police and report that he had been coerced into joining a gang...","Suddenly!","A taxi pulled up, and an alternative-looking girl with dyed blonde hair stepped out.","It was the girl Zhang Dalong had met at the bar earlier, Xiaoya.","\"Xiaoya, why are you here?\"","\"Uncle, Uncle, run quickly! Zhao Ming is bringing people to beat you up,\" Xiaoya said, panting heavily.","Hearing this, Zhang Dalong didn't take it seriously at all. \"I thought it was something serious. Don't be afraid, Xiaoya. That kid already came by just now. He brought over twenty guys, and we still chased them off.\"","Xiaoya replied, \"No, Uncle, this time is different! He called his older cousin over. His cousin goes to the sports academy in the north of the city, and he brought a huge gang of his classmates. There are at least forty or fifty of them.\"","Mingzhu City did indeed have a sports academy. Although its reputation was somewhat inflated and it wasn't located in the university town, but rather in the north of the city near some vocational schools.","However, even if their reputation was inflated, the physical fitness of those sports academy students was definitely not something ordinary thugs could compare to.","\"Forty or fifty people? And they're from the sports academy?\"","Zhang Dalong's face instantly turned pale, and he turned to glance at Zhang Tao and Chu Yang.","He saw Zhang Tao frowning slightly, seemingly assessing the situation, while Chu Yang's expression remained exactly the same as before, without any change.","Looking at their postures, he guessed that these two newly sworn brothers of his were planning to face them head-on.","The three of them could handle the twenty-plus thugs from before, but now the number had doubled, and they were all from the sports academy. Who could possibly beat that?","Zhang Dalong was just about to tell them to make a run for it.","When several minivans appeared in their line of sight, braking sharply and stopping by the side of the road.","Immediately after, a massive, dark crowd of people piled out of the vehicles. Leading them was Zhao Ming, whose face was still bruised and swollen from the earlier beating. Standing next to him was a muscular young man wearing a sports tank top, who was presumably his cousin from the sports academy.","Their escape route was completely blocked off by this group.","Supported by another person, Zhao Ming stood at the very front of the crowd with a sinister grin. \"Damn it! You think you're so great just because you can fight? Today, I'm going to drown you in sheer numbers! Let's see how many of us you can take on!\"","Zhang Dalong hadn't expected this guy to be so vindictive, returning so quickly after just being beaten down once.","Looking at these young men with their much sturdier builds, he could already envision the miserable scene of himself surrounded and brutalized by dozens of burly sports students.","No, this wouldn't do! He was definitely going to croak!","At this thought, Zhang Dalong suddenly spun around, rushed over to Zhang Tao and Chu Yang, and tightly grabbed their hands.","\"My two brothers! The oath we just swore to the moon with the meat skewers, does it still count?\"","Zhang Tao was a bit bewildered by his sudden burst of passion and nodded instinctively. \"Of course it counts!\"","\"Good!\"","Zhang Dalong shook Zhang Tao's hand vigorously: \"Since that counts, you guys definitely won't leave me behind, right? We share our hardships, that's what you just said!\"","Seeing his panicked expression, Zhang Tao chuckled: \"Brother, put your mind at ease. For us in the Wanlong Society, every word we say is set in stone. We agreed to live and die together, so we will absolutely never abandon a single brother. Let alone forty or fifty of them, even if a hundred show up, we brothers will face them together!\"","Chu Yang nodded: \"Yeah, as long as he stands, you stand.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"...\"","Why didn't those words offer a single shred of reassurance?","But at this point, he had no other choice. He could only pin his hopes on the three of them working together to fight off this mob.","He was just a manager who wrote code, yet now he had to throw down with dozens of muscleheads from a sports academy. This script was all wrong!","Boarding this pirate ship of the Wanlong Society was way too intense!","\"Blond old geezer, and you two fools with a death wish! Let's see where you run this time! Cousin, it's them. Beat them to a pulp! I'll withdraw the fifty grand for you later!\"","\"OK!\"","That sports academy cousin cracked his knuckles, his fierce gaze locking onto Zhang Dalong's trio.","An all-out brawl was on the verge of breaking out."]},{"number":559,"title":"Chapter 559: 559: More Than Just Black.","paragraphs":["\"Brother, are you sure you won't back out?\" Zhang Tao confirmed once again.","\"If you back out, Brother Chu and I will leave immediately. We absolutely won't force you.\"","\"I won't back out, I won't back out! Whoever goes back on their word is a coward!\" Zhang Dalong said hastily.","At this point, worrying about whether he had boarded a pirate ship was completely meaningless. His life was more important; he needed to cling to these two capable fighters first.","Xiaoya looked at the aggressive crowd opposite them and was extremely anxious. She shouted to Zhang Dalong, \"Run, quickly! I called the police before I came over. Once the cops arrive, everything will be fine!\"","Hearing that Xiaoya had actually called the police, Zhao Ming was instantly furious.","\"You stinking bitch! I gave you face and you threw it away! Just now in the bar you were making eyes at that blond old geezer, and now you're tipping them off. Just you wait!\"","\"Cousin, tell the boys to get them!\"","The cousin from the sports academy didn't waste time either, directly raising his hand: \"Get them...\"","Right at this critical moment.","Vroom! Vroom! Vroom!","A low, roaring sound of engines suddenly erupted in their ears.","It wasn't just one car, but a whole fleet!","Immediately after, from the intersection at the other end of the late-night snack street, countless blinding white headlights suddenly pierced through, illuminating the originally dim street as bright as day.","Under everyone's astonished gazes, one, two, three... dozens of uniform black sedans appeared in rows, completely surrounding those few dilapidated vans.","The car doors opened almost simultaneously.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Five young men dressed in crisp black suits stepped out of each black sedan. When all the black-clad young men gathered and walked towards them, it was like a black tide that instantly engulfed half the street.","At a rough glance, there were definitely over a hundred people.","This lineup, this grand display, was even more shocking than the Axe Gang's entrance in the movies!","Zhao Ming, his cousin, and the dozens of sports academy students were all dumbfounded. They froze in place, not daring to move a muscle.","\"Is... is this the Wanlong Society?\"","\"Why... why are they here?\"","The reputation of the Wanlong Society in Pearl City was thunderous. Absolutely no one in the underworld dared to challenge them, because those who had grudges against the Wanlong Society were basically either whacked or imprisoned. It was just that absurd.","Now that the Wanlong Society had suddenly arrived, it was definitely not a good thing.","Could it be...","Zhao Ming and his group instinctively looked at Zhang Tao and the other two, who had calm expressions on their faces.","No... it couldn't be, right?","It wasn't just them who were scared silly; even Zhang Dalong was almost scared out of his wits.","\"What is going on? Did I transmigrate into a movie?\"","People always said that southern cities and Port City were actually the most chaotic places in the country, with the most gangsters and a bunch of large and small syndicates, but a syndicate with this kind of formation had never appeared before.","He had only seen the scene in front of him in a movie theater a few years ago. When he watched that Axe Gang movie back then, the scene of a group of men in black making their entrance was indeed very shocking and oppressive.","Now, he was actually seeing a scene that only existed in movies with his own eyes.","What kind of place was Pearl City, anyway?","It was too terrifying!","Right at this moment, a man in black who looked like the leader jogged over to Zhang Tao and Chu Yang, bowing slightly. \"Brother Tao, Brother Yang, the eldest miss ordered that the scene must be kept clean and the speed must be fast.\"","Zhang Tao nodded and waved his hand casually. \"Got it. Clear the area, and don't scare my newly sworn brother.\"","The leader acknowledged the order, turned to face the group of terrified sports academy students and Zhao Ming, and coldly spat out a single word.","\"Clear!\"","Just a single word, but it sounded like a thunderclap.","\"Yes!\"","Over a hundred men in black moved instantly!","There was no shouting, nor was there any chaos, only efficient and ruthless action.","The black torrent instantly engulfed the dozens of sports academy students who had long lost their will to fight. In almost the blink of an eye, the previously aggressive students fell down in swathes like harvested wheat, screaming in agony.","Zhao Ming and his cousin still wanted to resist, but under the absolute crushing weight of numbers and strength, they were instantly taken down by several men in black and pinned to the ground, unable to move.","The entire process was so fast it was suffocating!","In less than a minute, the battle, or rather, the one-sided cleanup, was over.","In the middle of the street, all that remained were the sports academy students lying all over the ground, along with Zhao Ming and his cousin, who were firmly pinned down.","Zhang Dalong was dumbfounded.","This is too damn ferocious...","Zhang Tao slowly walked up to Zhao Ming, who was pinned to the ground, crouched down, and gently patted his pale face with a barbecue skewer. Smiling, he said, \"Little brother, do you understand now? You can't just act tough whenever you want. There are some people you just can't afford to provoke. Next time you go out, bring your brain with you.\"","After saying that, he stood up and said to the leader, \"Handle this according to the rules. Teach these kids a lesson they won't forget.\"","\"Understood!\"","Only then did Zhang Tao turn around and return to the still-dazed Zhang Dalong. He said proudly, \"Brother, what do you think? Our brothers are pretty decent, right? I told you we'd share our blessings and our burdens. Since you volunteered to join us, the brothers definitely wouldn't just stand by and watch when you're in trouble. See, didn't they show up?\"","\"Isn't that super loyal?\"","Zhang Dalong nodded blankly.","But in his heart, he was wailing: \"This Wanlong Society really is a mafia gang! I'm no longer clean!\"","Is it still not too late to quit the gang?","The next scene completely refreshed his worldview once again.","He saw that after the men in black quickly controlled everyone, they began an efficient but extremely bizarre cleanup operation.","First, someone used black balloons to block the security cameras on the nearby streets. Immediately after, several men in black quickly took out various professional equipment from their cars.","Yes, professional equipment!","He watched as they carried high-definition video cameras and began filming the miserable scene from multiple angles and in all directions. Meanwhile, others swiftly shoved machetes and steel pipes into the hands of the sports academy students who were pinned to the ground, including Zhao Ming and his cousin.","The whole picture looked exactly as if Zhao Ming and his group were instantly subdued while holding deadly weapons and about to commit a crime.","Right after that, they started sending people around to collect evidence. After all, Zhao Ming had indeed led people to besiege Zhang Dalong and the others, so witnesses were easy to find. The most crucial part was that these witnesses were also very \"willing\" to testify.","After all the work was done.","The leading man in black expressionlessly walked up to Zhao Ming and his cousin and read out their charges.","\"According to Article 293 of the Criminal Law, the crime of picking quarrels and provoking trouble, if the circumstances are severe, shall be punished by fixed-term imprisonment of not more than five years, criminal detention, or public surveillance. Our Wanlong Society is merely helping the police secure evidence in advance, proving that your actions have met the standard of severe circumstances.\"","\"Furthermore, you have repeatedly gathered a crowd to assault the victims with weapons, threatening their lives, which adds to your crimes. We are acting as good Samaritans stepping up bravely for a just cause, cooperating with the police to crack down on illegal criminal gangs.\"","Zhao Ming: \"???\"","Sports academy students: \"???\"","Damn it! This is blatant framing! Is there no law anymore?!","\"I'm innocent!\"","\"I am innocent!\"","\"......\"","Zhang Tao chuckled from the sidelines and explained, \"See that, bro? This is what you call being professional! Everything is about evidence and following protocol! What we just did falls perfectly under standard self-defense, assisting the police in subduing a criminal suspect.\"","Chu Yang chimed in, which was rare for him, \"Exactly. The nearby security cameras are broken, making us the sole eyewitnesses. Plus, we have complete video footage of the scene. The evidence is rock solid.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"!!!\"","This Wanlong Syndicate... not only could they fight, but they apparently knew the fucking law too?","He was now absolutely certain that the shady ship he had boarded was far more complex than just a simple underworld gang......"]},{"number":560,"title":"Chapter 560: 560. Can a Club Have Such Good Benefits","paragraphs":["After the trouble with Zhao Ming and the sports school gang was resolved.","Zhang Tao, following custom, prepared to introduce this talent highly valued by The Young Lady to the brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Society. After all, someone who could make The Young Lady willing to spend a million to recruit must have extraordinary qualities.","\"Let me introduce you all to Zhang Dalong, Brother Long.\"","As soon as Zhang Tao finished speaking, over a hundred men in black shouted in unison.","\"Brother Long!\"","Zhang Dalong was a bit stunned by this imposing display. Him, Brother Long?","Absurd! It was simply too absurd!","How did a mere programmer like him suddenly become a big brother?","But strangely enough, he actually somewhat enjoyed the feeling.","No wonder those guys on TV all wanted to be underworld bosses. Competing to be the big brother, even if it meant risking fishing without a helmet—this feeling was indeed pretty exhilarating.","Just as Zhang Dalong was immersed in the thrill of having boarded this pirate ship, a timid voice spoke up beside him.","\"U-uncle, I-I'm sorry!\"","\"I... I didn't know you were a big boss of the Wanlong Society.\"","Zhang Dalong turned his head at the sound, only to see obvious fear in Xiaoya's eyes. She regretted chatting up the older man in the bar; otherwise, she wouldn't have caused so much trouble.","She hadn't been afraid when she came to tip him off, nor when she saw Zhao Ming bringing people over to pick a fight, but seeing this group of men in black, she was truly terrified.","The Wanlong Society had a resounding reputation in the underworld of Mingzhu City. It could even be said that the mere mention of their name made people pale in fear. They were simply not on the same level as ordinary street thugs.","Seeing Xiaoya's reaction, Zhang Dalong suddenly realized that he was now completely past the point of no return on this dark path.","Just look at how terrified the poor girl was.","\"Um... Xiaoya, let's just consider today's matter settled. It's best if you go to those messy bars less often in the future.\"","His original intention was out of concern, feeling that such places were full of shady characters and it was easy for a young girl to get into trouble.","But when these words reached Xiaoya's ears, they took on a completely different meaning.","She felt that this was Zhang Dalong warning her.","\"Yes, yes, yes, Brother Long, you're absolutely right! I will definitely go less in the future! No, I won't go anymore!\"","Zhang Dalong was somewhat speechless as he said, \"Alright, it's getting late. Hurry home, and be careful on your way.\"","\"Okay, Brother Long, I'll head home right now. Goodbye, Brother Long!\" Xiaoya fled as if she had been granted a pardon, turning around and running away.","Zhang Tao laughed, \"Let's go, brother. The show is over, the fighting is done, the brothers have been introduced, so it's time for us to head out too.\"","Zhang Dalong looked at the dense crowd of men in black before him, and the two newly sworn brothers beside him, and let out a long sigh.","It seemed there was absolutely no getting off this pirate ship now.","......","The next day.","Zhang Dalong woke up in the apartment Zhang Tao rented. Last night, he had stayed in the guest room of Zhang Tao's home.","As soon as he walked out of the room, he smelled the delicious aroma of food.","On the dining table in the living room, a spread of plain porridge, side dishes, and fried eggs was already laid out. An unfamiliar woman wearing an apron, who looked gentle and delicate, was walking out of the kitchen carrying bowls and chopsticks.","\"Brother Zhang, you're awake? Does your head hurt? Come have something to eat to line your stomach.\"","Zhang Dalong looked at the unfamiliar woman before him, a bit bewildered. \"You... who are you?\"","He had indeed blacked out a bit last night. After experiencing such thrilling scenes yesterday, coupled with the aftereffects of the alcohol, he had fallen into a groggy sleep in the car. Finally, he was brought back by Zhang Tao and settled in the guest room, so he didn't know this woman at all.","\"I am Ah Tao's girlfriend. You can just call me Xiaojuan.\"","Zhou Juan'er served him a bowl of porridge and said, \"Brother Tao went to the hospital early this morning. He specifically instructed me to get you something to eat when you woke up.\"","\"Thank you, I won't hold back then.\"","Zhang Dalong sat down somewhat awkwardly. Looking at the breakfast on the table, his stomach began to rumble. He was truly hungry, so he picked up the bowl of porridge and started eating, praising Xiaojuan's cooking skills as he ate.","\"Xiaojuan, why did Zhang Tao go to the hospital so early?\"","\"To accompany his dad for a check-up. His dad got sick. Although the surgery was very successful, he still needs regular check-ups.\"","Zhang Dalong nodded. Especially after knowing that Zhang Tao's father's illness was related to a tumor, he thought to himself that this guy was quite a filial son.","Usually, having a seriously ill elderly person at home was a torment for both the patient and the entire family. Many originally happy families had been dragged down and ruined by a major illness.","He suddenly somewhat understood why Zhang Tao had joined the Wanlong Society and gone down this path. In a small city like Mingzhu City, how could an ordinary salary be enough to support his father's medical expenses? He was most likely forced into a corner by reality before turning to the underworld.","Looking at the very cheerful girl in front of him, Zhang Dalong suddenly felt that Zhang Tao was at least lucky to have found such a virtuous girlfriend who didn't mind that he had a sick father at home.","He hesitated for a moment but couldn't hold back, asking indirectly, \"Xiaojuan, you and Zhang Tao have been together for quite a while, right? Do you know about his work?\"","Zhou Juan'er nodded. \"I do, we met at the company, after all.\"","\"Company?\" Zhang Dalong was taken aback.","\"Yeah, the Wanlong Society Group!\"","Zhou Juan'er said with a hint of pride in her tone, \"I work at a supermarket under the Group. Although I'm not a core member like Ah Tao, I'm already very satisfied.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"Core member? What's that?\"","Zhou Juan'er explained: \"Our company is divided into regular employees and core employees. If you see someone wearing a black suit with the company logo on their chest, that's a core member.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"Is there anything special about these core members?\"","Zhou Juan'er thought for a moment and said: \"Double salary, fully paid social insurance and housing fund, full reimbursement of all medical expenses for the employee and their family members, annual company-paid vacations for the family, various gifts and bonuses during holidays, which the family members also receive, and...\"","Zhou Juan'er listed a whole bunch of benefits, leaving Zhang Dalong, a programmer, completely dumbfounded.","Wait, is this really an under... underworld syndicate?","The benefits are way too good, aren't they?!","No wonder this girl didn't seem stressed at all when talking about Zhang Tao's father's illness. The company took care of everything, so where would the pressure come from?","He finally knew why Zhang Tao, Chu Yang, and those men in black always had a fanatical look in their eyes whenever they mentioned Liu Yutong. With a boss like that, who wouldn't be dead set on being loyal?","Could it be that the Wanlong Society was actually a legitimate company?","Zhang Dalong's curiosity was piqued.","Anyway, Zhang Tao had said that he was already a member of the Wanlong Society and couldn't leave. Rather than passively accepting it, it would be better to take the initiative and see what this seemingly dark syndicate was really like.","\"Um, sister-in-law, are you going to work today? I don't have anything to do anyway, so could I go with you to see where you work?\"","Zhou Juan'er agreed without a second thought.","\"Of course! If you want to take a look, Brother Zhang, then come with me. The supermarket where I work is just nearby. It only takes five minutes to walk there.\""]},{"number":561,"title":"Chapter 561: 561. The Company That Overturned Zhang Dalong's Worldview.","paragraphs":["After breakfast, Zhang Dalong followed Zhou Juan'er out the door.","Being a low-profile pragmatist, he had always believed that seeing was believing, and only firsthand experience was truly reliable. This was why he had suddenly decided to tag along with Zhou Juan'er to investigate the businesses owned by the Wanlong Society.","Upon arriving at the supermarket, Zhang Dalong experienced a kind of shopping he had never encountered in the South.","Next to every item, alongside the standard price tag, sat a detailed information disclosure card. It clearly listed the product's wholesale price, gross profit margin, origin traceability, and even the purchasing agent's name and contact information. There were also thoughtful recommendations attached; for instance, noting that a certain snack, while delicious, had a high sugar content and should be consumed in moderation.","Zhang Dalong even witnessed a stock clerk patiently helping an elderly woman compare the ingredient lists of two different soy sauces. The clerk gently explained which one was healthier, speaking to her with the same warmth and respect one would show their own grandmother.","Furthermore, the supermarket offered a plethora of complimentary convenience services. These included free phone calls, charging stations, tea, microwave access, first-aid kits, temporary pet boarding, and even free repairs for small home appliances, all manned by dedicated staff.","Moreover, he could tell that the employees here genuinely loved their jobs from the bottom of their hearts.","One look at their benefits made it easy to see why.","For instance, they offered perks he had never even heard of before, such as the \"Grievance Bonus\" and \"Unhappy Leave,\" with real-life examples proudly displayed on the notice board.","In one case, an employee had strictly followed service protocols and stood their ground, only to face unreasonable scolding from a customer. The company not only publicly cleared the employee's name but also awarded them the Grievance Bonus.","Right next to it was a template for a leave request. The notes explicitly stated that if an employee was feeling down or emotionally unwell, they could apply for a paid Unhappy Leave, and their supervisor was required to approve it.","\"Is this... is this really a supermarket?\" Zhang Dalong felt as if his decades of life experience had been completely turned upside down.","The benefits at his current employer, Big Goose Company, were already quite impressive. Yet, compared to the overwhelming sense of happiness and belonging exuded by the staff here, they still seemed to fall woefully short.","And to think, these employees were merely working ordinary, entry-level service jobs.","\"It sure is!\" Zhou Juan replied, her hands skillfully organizing the shelves as she spoke with pride. \"Our boss said that employees should be able to work with dignity, and customers should be able to shop with dignity. Everything is clearly priced and completely transparent. We never want anyone to second-guess their purchases or feel cheated.\"","Seeing the exact same look of absolute adoration in Zhou Juan's eyes that he had seen in Zhang Tao and Chu Yang's, Zhang Dalong's curiosity only deepened.","Just what kind of organization was this Wanlong Society?","After finishing his tour of the supermarket, Zhang Dalong went off on his own to inspect other businesses owned by the Wanlong Society, including an internet cafe, a restaurant, and a bubble tea shop.","Without exception, every single one of these establishments exuded a level of cleanliness, standardization, and profound human warmth that was incredibly rare to find in other companies.","After a full day of exploring, Zhang Dalong found himself back downstairs at the temporary headquarters of the Wanlong Group. Gazing up at the company logo, a look of anticipation crept onto his face, one that even he himself failed to notice.","What would it really be like to work under that legendary Eldest Miss?","...","When he saw Liu Yutong again, Zhang Dalong got straight to the point.","\"Liu... um... Eldest Miss, I need to make a trip back home.\" After saying the words, he actually felt quite apprehensive.","After all, she had gone to great lengths, even using some rather unconventional methods, to recruit him. Now, asking to leave right after their very first meeting, would she think he was trying to back out? Would she try to stop him?","However, Liu Yutong's reaction completely caught him off guard. She didn't hesitate for even a second before giving a crisp, decisive nod.","\"Alright. I'll have someone drive you.\"","She didn't ask a single question about why he was going back or whether he might never return, acting as if she was absolutely certain he would come back to her.","This extraordinary level of trust and grace made Zhang Dalong realize, once again, just how remarkable the young leader of the Wanlong Society truly was.","\"Thank you, Eldest Miss. I will return as soon as possible.\"","On the way to the airport, Zhang Tao was the one driving Zhang Dalong.","Zhang Tao barely said a word during the drive. Compared to his demeanor the night before, it was like night and day; he seemed incredibly displeased.","It wasn't until the car merged onto the highway that the familiar intro of a Cantonese song began playing through the car's speakers.","\"Commanding the winds and clouds, I roam freely while the masses look up to me~","Commanding the winds and clouds, I never need to look back~\"","Zhang Dalong froze. The tune was all too familiar, it was the theme song from the classic Hong Kong triad movie Young and Dangerous.","However, what was playing wasn't a full movie clip, but a montage of edited scenes and familiar lines.","\"When you're out in the underworld, you gotta keep your word. If you say you're gonna kill his whole family, then you kill his whole family!\"","\"The rules of our syndicate dictate that anyone who steps out of line must suffer the punishment of three knives and six holes...\"","\"He who betrays his brothers shall be executed by all!\"","Zhang Dalong: \"...\"","He suddenly understood why Zhang Tao had been giving him the silent treatment the entire ride. So he was using this to send a not-so-subtle message?","How ruthless!","\"Ahem... I... I'm just going back to handle my resignation paperwork and pack my things. I'll be back real soon.\"","Zhang Tao finally turned his head, flashing a bright, toothy grin as he laughed. \"I know that, brother! I have absolute faith in you. After all, we're sworn brothers.\"","\"Oh, by the way, do you want me to send a few of my boys down to Yangcheng to help you move? I know your home address, after all.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"...\"","Like hell I believe you!","For the remainder of the drive to the airport, Zhang Dalong lost count of how many times he was forced to watch those edited clips on the MP4 player. He was on pins and needles the entire time; every second felt like an eternity.","It wasn't until he finally stepped out of the car that he could breathe a sigh of relief, hurriedly dragging his luggage into the airport terminal.","Watching his panic-stricken retreat, Zhang Tao couldn't help but burst into laughter before turning the car around and speeding away from the airport.","Meanwhile.","Not long after Zhang Dalong arrived back in Yangcheng, Yu Xin spent 5.2 million yuan over in Magic City to acquire a company called Six Minutes. Immediately after the buyout, she packed up the entire development team and relocated them to Pearl City.","The average person had probably never even heard of this company's name.","However, they were the creators of a famous social game that countless people had played.","—Veggie Stealing Farm."]},{"number":562,"title":"Chapter 562: 562. Oh no The boss led us into a ditch","paragraphs":["Yangcheng.","\"Boss, you weren't kidnapped, were you? Why would you choose to go to a godforsaken place like Mingzhu City?\"","\"Yeah, if it weren't for you telling us, we wouldn't have even heard of this city's name.\"","\"Boss, is the work pressure here too much? How about we all sign a petition to get you a long vacation so you can properly relax?\"","\"Did some headhunter trick you with a ridiculously high salary? It's a trap, it's all a trap! Boss, you absolutely cannot fall for it!\"","\"...\"","Zhang Dalong was in charge of the research and development work here in Yangcheng, with about thirty people under him. With their boss suddenly leaving, his subordinates were naturally surprised and even a bit in disbelief.","\"Stop making wild guesses, this is my own choice.\" Zhang Dalong silently added in his heart, \"Yeah, right!\"","To be honest, having worked at Big Goose Company for a few years, he didn't really want to change his environment. Pony Ma thought highly of him, and it wasn't like he wouldn't have the chance to take over better projects in the future.","The problem was, he had somehow inexplicably become a member of the Wanlong Society. Those people were so gangster-like; he really didn't dare to cross them.","Zhang Tao had dropped such obvious hints before. Although he believed the other party wouldn't actually do anything to him, what if they did?","Besides, that new boss truly had an extraordinary bearing. In some aspects, he even felt that the man's charisma was far stronger than that of his own boss, Pony Ma.","\"My flight is at three o'clock the day after tomorrow. You guys can come visit me in Mingzhu City in the future, and I'll definitely show you a good time.\"","\"Boss, do you really have to go?\" the crowd asked, still not ready to give up.","Zhang Dalong nodded. \"Yes, I have to go. If you are willing to come with me, that works too. I can arrange jobs for you with incomes no lower than what you make now.\"","At these words, the entire R&D department fell silent.","After all, in the internet industry, the environment and prospects were undoubtedly better in big cities. Going to a city they had never even heard of before, unless it was for retirement, was something an average person simply wouldn't consider.","In their eyes, their boss Zhang Dalong had likely been duped by some small company.","Of course, not everyone thought this way; some were tempted.","This temptation wasn't because the new company attracted them, but because Zhang Dalong had mentioned the extremely low cost of living there. If their income remained the same, they would definitely live much more comfortably than in Yangcheng.","For example, a salary of ten thousand a month was completely different in a tier-one city compared to a tier-three city.","In a tier-one city, that kind of income still made you a corporate slave, but in a tier-three city, you might just live like an emperor.","Although this example was a bit exaggerated, the fact remained that the same income truly allowed for a much more comfortable life in a smaller city.","Over the next two days, Zhang Dalong acted extremely calm, even a bit heartless. No matter how much his superiors tried to make him stay, he just listened politely, not explaining, not arguing, and not yielding.","In short, he was determined to leave.","In the end, he even took twelve subordinates who had been with him for a long time. This was truly unexpected, as it accounted for nearly half the manpower of the Yangcheng R&D department.","However, this was also understandable. The latest news from Mingzhu City had arrived: the benefits offered were even better than what they had here, with a 20% increase in base salary. Coupled with the lower cost of living compared to Yangcheng, it was indeed enough to attract some employees whose hometowns were in the north.","Plus, following a familiar boss like Zhang Dalong wasn't necessarily a bad thing.","The news of Zhang Dalong's resignation naturally reached Big Goose's boss, Pony Ma. It was also through this that he learned the unfamiliar name of the Wanlong Society Group.","\"Did you find anything?\"","Pony Ma asked the assistant standing beside him without looking up from the report in his hands.","The assistant hurriedly handed over a document. \"Mr. Ma, I found it. The Wanlong Society Group is registered in a small city called Mingzhu City. The businesses they're involved in are basically all in the real economy, such as retail supermarkets, food and beverage, entertainment, and so on, leaning towards local industrial investments. It should be a local comprehensive enterprise group.\"","Pony Ma took the document, quickly scanned through it, and frowned slightly.","Zhang Dalong was a technical talent. The guy's understanding of distributed systems and user experience was top-tier in the country.","To be honest, he really couldn't bear to see this kind of person leave.","However, everyone has their own ambitions, and he couldn't force him to stay. Moreover, the email business was basically mature now, so Zhang Dalong's departure wouldn't have any impact on it.","It was just that the enterprise the other party was going to was a traditional industry company, which surprised him greatly.","What a waste of talent!","\"Everyone has their own ambitions. Since he chose this path, we can only wish him well. What a pity...\"","In Pony Ma's eyes, Zhang Dalong's departure was tantamount to a fierce tiger returning to the mountains... no, it was a whale stranded in the shallows; he was destined to achieve little in the future.",".............","A few days later, at Great Nancheng Airport.","Led by Zhang Dalong, the twelve former Big Goose employees, along with some of their family members, walked out of the airport behind him, their hearts filled with longing for their future lives.","Originally, they imagined that the airport pickup would, at most, consist of the company sending a minibus. But when they saw the scene outside the airport, they instantly stood frozen on the spot.","In the temporary parking area outside the airport, there was a uniform fleet of over twenty brand-new black Mercedes-Benz cars, and standing next to each car was a young man dressed in a black suit.","In addition to that, there were over twenty more young men in black suits lined up in two rows at the exit, waiting as if expecting some VIP.","This formation and this level of ostentation were no less impressive than a mafia godfather's entourage in the movies.","\"Oh my goodness, Boss! Look over there! What's going on? Are they shooting a movie? Is the Godfather sequel filming here?\"","\"It doesn't look like they're filming a movie; I don't see any cameras. And look at how straight those guys are standing and how fierce their eyes are. With that kind of aura, they're definitely real gangsters.\"","\"An entire fleet of black Mercedes-Benz, all S-Class too. How much money must that cost? What a huge flex!\"","\"Why don't we leave through a different exit? It might be some big boss coming out, and it wouldn't be good if we accidentally blocked their way.\"","\"Huh, they're looking over at us...\"","Just as these former Big Goose employees were trembling with fear and preparing to get out of the way.","Suddenly!","The dozens of men in black waiting in line uniformly turned their gazes toward Zhang Dalong and shouted in unison.","\"Respectfully welcoming Brother Long's return!!\"","The employees and family members behind Zhang Dalong were instantly dumbfounded.","When they finally snapped out of it, they all looked at Zhang Dalong.","\"Brother... Brother Long? Are they calling you? Boss, since when did you become a mob brother?\"","\"Boss, didn't you say the company you were joining was a legitimate business? How did you end up in the underworld?\"","\"Um... is it still possible to go back now? I don't want to go to Mingzhu City anymore.\"","Originally, they had followed Zhang Dalong because of the great benefits, but no one said anything about joining the mafia!","What's more, they were all programmers; they weren't good at fighting at all!","It's over! We're doomed! The boss dragged us straight into a ditch!","Zhang Dalong was actually quite startled by the grand display himself. Not knowing how to explain it, he could only mumble a vague excuse, \"Uh, it's just the company culture. When in Rome, do as the Romans do.\"","Just then, a young man in a casual suit with a bright smile walked over. It was Zhang Tao.","\"Brother, you must be tired from the trip!\"","Zhang Tao stepped forward and gave Zhang Dalong a warm hug. Then, looking at the somewhat nervous group of former Big Goose employees behind him, he greeted them with a friendly smile.","\"You all must be the elites Brother Zhang brought along, right? Welcome, welcome! You must be exhausted from the journey! I'm Zhang Tao, and I'll be taking care of your reception today as well as your upcoming arrangements.\"","\"Please get in the cars, everyone. The Young Lady has prepared a welcome banquet for you at Pearl City.\""]},{"number":563,"title":"Chapter 563: 563, Astonishing The Third Promotion Ceremony.","paragraphs":["The twelve former Big Goose employees and their families were ushered into a fleet of luxury Mercedes-Benz sedans by the group of men in black, feeling completely dazed.","It wasn’t until the cars began to pull away slowly that they dared to whisper among themselves in low voices.","When did our boss get mixed up with the underworld? Wanlong Society doesn't sound like the name of an internet company.","Don't ask me, I have no idea. I just want to know if this new company is actually legitimate.","Maybe the name is just for show? Didn't the boss say our new employer is a woman? A woman can't be a mob boss, right?","Exactly. I've never even heard of a female mob boss. These guys in black are probably just actors hired to put on a grand display.","If that’s the case, the new boss certainly went through a lot of trouble. She definitely scared me, though.","We're already here, so we might as well make the best of it. Let's not overthink it.",".........","Two hours later.","The group followed the reception staff into a five-star hotel. By this point, their nerves had actually calmed down quite a bit. However, the moment they stepped into the second-floor ballroom, they were so stunned they couldn't move another inch.","The massive ballroom was packed with countless men in black. A rough estimate put the number at no less than a thousand.","The sheer, terrifying pressure of the scene made their legs go weak.","Had they taken a wrong turn and stumbled into a summit for a massive crime syndicate?","Once they confirmed they were in the right place, only one thought remained in their minds: We're finished. We've boarded a pirate ship—the kind that sails straight into the deep ocean the moment it hits the water, without even providing life jackets!","Even Zhang Dalong himself was startled by the incredibly exaggerated scale of the event.","Was it really necessary to call out over a thousand people for a welcome banquet?","This was beyond ridiculous!","Everyone, please don't be nervous! We’re all on the same side. Relax, your seats have already been arranged. This way, please, Zhang Tao said, leading them to a table near the front.","Like little lambs that had wandered into a pack of wolves, the former Big Goose employees and their families could only follow instructions and sit at a round table near the front, too tense to even breathe.","As Zhang Dalong was about to sit down with them, Zhang Tao stopped him. Brother, your seat is over there.","He pointed toward the very front of the ballroom, to the only head table.","Zhang Dalong nodded and, forcing himself to remain calm, walked over to the head table and sat down.","Yu Xin, Li Xiaohui, and the others welcomed him warmly. They had already heard from Liu Yutong that this man was a great talent.","If Liu Yutong described someone as a great talent, they had to be extraordinary. Yu Xin even knew that the acquisition of the Six Minute company in Shanghai a while back was merely to pave the way for the project Zhang Dalong was about to lead.","It was clear just how significant the project must be for the Young Miss to place such importance on him.","Inside the ballroom, a thousand people were seated in absolute silence.","Time ticked by, and just as the solemn atmosphere was reaching its peak...","Suddenly!","The ballroom doors were slowly pushed open by two men in black.","Without any warning—","Whoosh!","The thousand men who had been seated stood up simultaneously, their gazes snapping toward the entrance.","Seeing this, Zhang Dalong and his former Big Goose colleagues scrambled to their feet in a panic, staring nervously at the door, having no idea what was happening.","In the absolute silence, the crisp click of high heels began to echo. The sound alone carried an invisible weight of authority.","Soon, against the backlight of the doorway, a slender silhouette came into view.","The newcomer wore a custom-tailored black suit for women. The color wasn't a flat, dull black, but a deep charcoal with subtle, dark patterns. She looked very young, likely not even twenty. Her skin was as fair as jade, and her features were as exquisite as a lady from an ancient painting.","Most striking of all were her eyes—clear and bright, devoid of any youthful playfulness, containing only a calm, piercing authority that seemed to see through everything.","Her beautiful long black hair wasn't styled into an elaborate updo but flowed naturally over her shoulders. A simple platinum hairpin in the shape of a dragon was tucked behind her ear, echoing the striking gold dragon badge pinned to her chest.","As this extraordinary young woman walked fully into the ballroom...","The next second.","The thousand men in black bowed slightly in unison and greeted her loudly.","Eldest Miss!!!","The roar of a thousand voices made the very ceiling of the ballroom tremble and resonate.","The hearts of the former Big Goose employees nearly leapt out of their throats at the sound of that title.","They would have to be fools not to realize who had arrived. This was their new boss.","Although they had known their new boss was a woman, seeing her in person allowed them to truly feel her incomparable and powerful aura.","So cool!","Liu Yutong walked straight toward the main stage. As she passed the head table where Zhang Dalong sat, her gaze lingered on his face for less than half a second. She gave a slight nod, acknowledging him.","That casual glance made Zhang Dalong’s heart skip a beat, as if he had been struck by an invisible force. His entire body felt a tingling sensation.","Liu Yutong stepped onto the stage and turned to face the thousand silent, core members of the Wanlong Society.","She didn't pick up a microphone. She simply raised her hand and pressed it down slightly.","Sit.","Whoosh!","The thousand men in black sat down in perfect unison. Only a few newcomers were a bit clumsy, looking out of place in their haste.","Liu Yutong stood on the stage, her calm gaze scanning the room. Her stunning face betrayed no emotion.","Today, there are two main items of business.","First, to welcome our new colleagues.","Second, to hold the third core member promotion ceremony of the year.","As her words fell, the members of the Wanlong Society, especially the probationary members, were instantly filled with excitement.","It was finally their turn!"]},{"number":564,"title":"Chapter 564: 564. The Frenzied Live Scene.","paragraphs":["As Liu Yutong announced the commencement of the third core promotion ceremony of the year, Yu Xin stepped onto the stage and picked up the microphone.","Brothers and sisters, please be quiet!","The entire venue fell silent instantly.","Today is an extraordinary day for the Wanlong Society. We are not only warmly welcoming new colleagues but also witnessing a group of outstanding brothers and sisters formally promoted to core members of our Wanlong Society, to walk hand-in-hand with us and forge a brilliant future!","After strict assessment and evaluation by the company, the following members have deeply understood and identified with the mission of the Wanlong Society. They possess outstanding abilities and are loyal and reliable, fully meeting the standards for core membership. The list has been finalized and approved by The Young Lady.","Now, those whose names I call, please come to the stage!","Li Ming, Wang Haitao, Sun Xiaoli, Chen Gang...","As Yu Xin called out the names one by one, those mentioned were beyond excited, stepping out from the audience and onto the stage.","The black suit!","That was the attire everyone in the Wanlong Society Group dreamed of. Today, they finally had the chance to wear it!","Soon, about three hundred people had gathered on the stage.","Zhang Dalong and the others looked at the three hundred or so people on stage, then instinctively looked back at the countless tables of black-clad men. They thought to themselves: Are all these people still not enough?","If this continues, the underground forces of the entire planet might all turn into black-clad men...","Just then, Yu Xin's voice rang out again.","The final one, and the most special one of this promotion ceremony!","He, though a newcomer, possesses extraordinary talent and limitless potential. His joining will open a new chapter for the Wanlong Society. Nominated personally by The Young Lady and approved unanimously by the entire senior management...","Yu Xin's gaze shifted to Zhang Dalong below the stage, announcing each word with emphasis: Zhang! Da! Long!","Buzz!","Zhang Dalong felt a roar in his head, standing there dazed. Him? A core member? How was that possible!","Brother Long, get up there! Zhang Tao, beside him, gave him a smiling nudge.","The banquet hall's spotlights instantly focused on Zhang Dalong, as over two thousand pairs of eyes turned toward him in unison.","Even his former Big Goose colleagues behind him were stunned.","It wasn't that they didn't realize the importance of being promoted to a core member; one only had to look at the reactions of the people on stage.","Their boss had become a core member of the Wanlong Society right after arriving—what did that mean?","It meant their boss had hidden himself damn deep in his daily life!","He looked so honest and simple, yet he had been part of the underworld for a long time.","Truly, one cannot judge a book by its cover!","Zhang Dalong was practically led onto the stage in a trance, standing at the very front of the three hundred-plus new core members, feeling completely out of place.","Liu Yutong walked up to him and took a neatly folded, high-quality black suit uniform and a red-covered book from the attendant.","Engineer Zhang, welcome to the core of the Wanlong Society.","As she spoke, she solemnly handed the black uniform—the symbol of core membership—and the red book to Zhang Dalong.","Work hard in the future!","Zhang Dalong took them instinctively. He opened his mouth to say something but found he couldn't utter a single word, only managing a clumsy nod.","At that moment, someone in the audience took the lead and shouted: Brother Long!!","Immediately after, the entire venue roared in unison.","Brother Long!!","Brother Long!!","Brother Long!!","...","The frenetic atmosphere instantly infected everyone present, and they all began to shout together.","Zhang Dalong, however, became even more nervous. Being held in such high regard wasn't necessarily a good thing; if he didn't produce results later, there was no telling how he might be dealt with.","It wasn't until Yu Xin, smiling beside him, handed the microphone to him and signaled with her eyes that he should say something that he snapped out of it.","Uh... thank you... thank you, The Young Lady. Thank you, everyone.","I... my name is Zhang Dalong. I'm just a coder. I'm not good at speaking. In the future, I will use my expertise to repay The Young Lady's trust. I will do my best to complete the projects given to me... uh... that's... that's all.","His speech was very brief and even a bit clumsy, but in such a setting, it seemed exceptionally sincere and down-to-earth.","Everyone, let's have a round of applause!","Instantly, thunderous applause erupted throughout the hall.","Yu Xin took back the microphone: The promotion ceremony continues!","The ceremony was basically the same as before. The three hundred-plus prospective core members lined up to receive their clothing from Liu Yutong one by one. After receiving their items, each person held their clothes and book in one hand and struck their chest with their fist with the other.","The Young Lady!","Greetings, The Young Lady!","The Young Lady, I will study diligently and strive to achieve the unity of knowledge and action!","I will resolutely fulfill my duties as a core member, execute The Young Lady's orders, and carry out company decisions!","I am willing to struggle for the great cause of the Wanlong Society for the rest of my life!","Ready at any time to sacrifice everything for the company and The Young Lady!","Never betray!","...","Liu Yutong also wore a constant smile, encouraging every person.","Work hard!","Keep it up!","...","These impassioned speeches and frenzied expressions once again shocked the former Big Goose employees.","To be honest, if they hadn't seen it with their own eyes, it would be hard to imagine that there was still a company in this society with such strong cohesion.","It just felt like something was off.","Time passed bit by bit.","As the last new core member received their clothes and book, Yu Xin announced directly: Congratulations to everyone on officially becoming core members of the Wanlong Society!","Instantly, thunderous applause and cheers erupted from below the stage. All the black-clad members stood up to send their warmest congratulations to their newly promoted companions.","After Zhang Dalong changed into the suit like the other new core members, his heart was filled with mixed emotions.","The clothes were indeed handsome, but he feared that from now on, he was completely bound to this giant ship known as the Wanlong Society.","There was no turning back..."]},{"number":565,"title":"Chapter 565: 565. Start with Weibo.","paragraphs":["Tossing and turning all night, sleep was hard to come by.","Early the next morning, Zhang Dalong ordered a cup of coffee from the hotel to clear his head.","He hadn't slept well at all last night, not only because he had personally witnessed the most extraordinary scene of his life the day before, but also because he had spent the entire night reading the Criminal Law.","Yes, the Criminal Law!","He could understand the company issuing work uniforms, but the move of handing out Criminal Law books was something he truly couldn't comprehend.","Could it really be that they wanted him, a man nearing forty, to go pick fights with people, so he'd know in advance whether he'd end up behind bars?","He finally understood why the men in black from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society that night were so professional.","Most companies would just have a legal department, focusing mostly on commercial law. But the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? Everyone studied law, and it was Criminal Law.","It was utterly absurd!","After downing the coffee, Zhang Dalong finally regained some of his energy.","Just then, the dedicated phone line in the room rang.","It was Su Mansu, the Young Mistress's assistant, informing him that the Young Mistress wanted to see him in the executive lounge on the top floor.","What was coming had finally arrived.","Zhang Dalong changed into his black suit and, without even bothering with breakfast, headed for the elevator.","The executive lounge on the top floor was quiet, with an expansive view overlooking the streets of Pearl City just beginning to stir.","Liu Yutong sat alone by the window, a half-finished cup of coffee in front of her.","Today, she was dressed in light grey casual wear, shedding some of yesterday's sternness and gaining a touch of elegant simplicity, but her eyes remained just as bright and sharp.","\"Young Mistress!\" Zhang Dalong greeted her.","\"Sit.\"","Liu Yutong raised a hand, gesturing for Zhang Dalong to take the seat opposite her.","Dispensing with small talk and pleasantries, she got straight to the point: \"Engineer Zhang, how did you rest last night?\"","\"It was... alright, thank you for your concern, Young Mistress,\" Zhang Dalong replied, feeling somewhat awkward.","\"You must have many questions in your mind about why I went to such great lengths to recruit you.\"","\"President Lin must have mentioned some things to you, right?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Zhang Dalong nodded, not hiding anything. \"Yes, Young Mistress. I spoke with President Lin and have also thought about it myself. The Ten Thousand Dragons Society already has the 'Wanhui Youxuan' internet product under its umbrella, which shows you place great importance on the internet. And in the internet field, currently the biggest entry point and barrier is undoubtedly social networking. Domestically, the synonym for social networking is my former company, Big Goose. I'm guessing the Young Mistress wants me to lead a social networking project to challenge Big Goose's dominant position.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, her eyes full of appreciation. \"Talking with a smart person saves so much trouble. It seems I didn't pick the wrong person.\"","But Zhang Dalong wasn't very confident. \"Young Mistress, to be frank, if it really is this project, I don't have much faith. Big Goose's user base, the stickiness of its relationship chains, and its brand recognition have already formed a near-monopolistic moat. Although I was only in charge of the email product, I understand very well the importance of user experience and distributed systems. It's extremely difficult to break through that.\"","He left one more thought unspoken: This was an almost impossible mission, like a mantis trying to stop a chariot!","After listening to Zhang Dalong, Liu Yutong picked up her coffee and took a sip.","\"A very rational analysis, befitting someone with a technical background.\"","\"However, Engineer Zhang, you guessed wrong.\"","\"Guessed wrong?\"","\"Correct.\"","\"I never once considered having you challenge Big Goose head-on. That would be too foolish, like an egg striking a stone. At least at this stage, there's no chance of winning.\"","\"Engineer Zhang, you must know about Twitter, right?\"","As soon as Zhang Dalong heard this, he immediately understood what kind of platform the Young Mistress wanted to build.","\"I've heard of it. You want to build a social platform similar to Twitter's model?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"That's one way to understand it, but it can't be mere imitation. What we want to build is a microblogging platform that fits the national conditions of Dragon Country and can more deeply integrate with the social habits and information consumption patterns of our people.\"","Just as Big Goose built a closed social circle based on acquaintance networks, what we want to build is a weak-tie network based on interests, information, and celebrity influence—an open public forum for discourse. That is Weibo.","\"Microblogging, Weibo...\"","Zhang Dalong's mind raced, and soon everything became clear.","Yes! Why stubbornly fight to the death on the battlefield of instant messaging? We could completely open up a new front.","\"But as far as I know, there seem to have been similar attempts domestically already, like Fanfou, Taotao, these...\"","\"They're insignificant, not worth worrying about,\" Liu Yutong directly pronounced the death sentence on these platforms.","Zhang Dalong was somewhat surprised by her words—surprised by the Young Mistress's confidence. Wasn't it too arbitrary to dismiss those platforms so easily?","Liu Yutong directly stated the reasons she didn't favor those platforms: \"They're too niche, too confined to tech circles or small communities, lacking sufficient appeal to the masses. More importantly, they lack a clear business model and an understanding of the macro environment. We are different.\"","\"The Ten Thousand Dragons Society possesses offline resources and execution capabilities beyond your imagination. Take Wanhui Youxuan as an example. Currently, our Wanhui Youxuan is about to undergo its Series B financing. When that happens, it will completely cover all first and second-tier cities in the country, and third and fourth-tier cities will be rolled out after the financing.\"","\"Engineer Zhang, can you guess how many delivery riders Wanhui Youxuan has now?\"","As the country's first group-buying platform, although limited by technology (ordering was still only possible via phone and web pages), Wanhui Youxuan's scale was already nothing to scoff at.","Since Zhang Dalong hadn't looked into it deeply, he could only answer honestly, \"I really couldn't guess.\"","Liu Yutong gave him the answer directly: \"Currently, Wanhui Youxuan's platform handles a stable daily average of over 800,000 orders. However, due to technological and consumption habit limitations, food delivery only accounts for about 30%, roughly 240,000 orders.\"","\"To support the instant delivery needs of those over 200,000 daily orders, we've built a massive delivery team. The total number of full-time and part-time riders currently contracted with Wanhui Youxuan has already exceeded 100,000 people, spread across the thirty-plus cities where we've launched our service.\"","Zhang Dalong did a quick mental calculation. A daily average of 800,000 orders was an absolutely staggering number for this era, sufficient proof of Wanhui Youxuan's user base and market penetration.","And that 100,000+ rider figure was even more terrifying—though, of course, the costs would be equally 'touching.'","Wanhui Youxuan's losses definitely wouldn't be small.","But as long as Wanhui Youxuan could develop healthily, there would naturally be plenty of capital willing to foot the bill.","Zhang Dalong had to admit he had somewhat underestimated the Ten Thousand Dragons Society before. He truly hadn't expected this traditionally 'black-tinted' enterprise to play the internet project game so well either.","He also completely understood the source of Liu Yutong's confidence.","Once the Weibo product was developed and launched, the company's over 100,000 riders, hundreds of thousands of partner merchants, and millions of daily active users could all become the initial seed users and promotion channels for Weibo.","This is something that small platforms like Fanfou and Taotao, which operate purely online and rely on word-of-mouth, simply cannot compare to. It's a completely asymmetric advantage, a veritable case of overwhelming superiority!","Even looking across the entire country, platforms capable of driving this kind of traffic are few and far between. Big Goose is one of them, though so far, there's been no news of Big Goose planning to launch a microblog.","Even if Big Goose actually developed one, there would be an inherent conflict. After all, Big Goose is built on a network of acquaintances—a closed social circle—which naturally resists this sort of relatively open platform.","\"Engineer Zhang, do you still think we are starting on the same starting line as Fanfou and the others in developing our microblog?\"","\"I understand now, Miss!\"","Zhang Dalong stated solemnly, \"This project has tremendous potential. I will give it my all!\"","\"Excellent.\"","Liu Yutong immediately assigned him a task: \"Regarding the specific product concept, team assembly, and technical architecture, you have five days to produce a proposal that satisfies me.\"","\"I want to see the product begin internal testing within two months. Money is not an issue; whatever amount is needed will be provided. However, you will need to recruit the talent yourself, and you have the final say on compensation packages.\"","\"When the product is launched, I will give you a substantial reward.\""]},{"number":566,"title":"Chapter 566: 566, How Does the Young Lady Know Everything","paragraphs":["After the meeting at the hotel concluded, Zhang Dalong threw himself into the development of the Weibo project with almost obsessive dedication, barely stopping to eat or sleep.","The original plan was to have a proposal ready in five days, but in the end, he delivered it in just two.","Of course, this proposal wasn't completed by him alone; the team members he brought with him also contributed significantly, assisting with data collection, co-developing the framework, and so on.","Liu Yutong sat on the sofa, carefully reviewing the proposal document. She read quickly, her fingers pausing slightly at key points as she pondered.","As time ticked by, Zhang Dalong grew increasingly nervous.","He had no idea whether the Young Miss was satisfied with the proposal he and his team had prepared, as she hadn't uttered a single word since receiving it.","To him, this didn't seem like a good sign.","Just as Zhang Dalong was beginning to grow anxious, Liu Yutong finally spoke.","\"Engineer Zhang, thank you for your hard work. While I don't fully understand the overall framework and technical details of the proposal, it feels very professional and logically structured.\"","She started with affirmation, allowing Zhang Dalong to relax slightly.","\"However, from a user experience perspective, I have a few rough ideas. You can hear them out.\"","\"Young Miss, please go ahead,\" Zhang Dalong immediately adopted an attentive posture.","Although he knew the Young Miss wasn't versed in these technical matters, the foresight she had shown in their last conversation meant he wouldn't dare underestimate her in the slightest or be perfunctory with her.","\"It's like this. In the current proposal, the main way for users to interact with content they find interesting is through comments. I find that a bit monotonous.\"","\"For example, if I see a very interesting topic, I might not have much to say in a comment, but I still want to express that I saw it, that I like it, or that I agree. In such cases, could we design a simpler action? Let's call it a 'Like.' No need to input any text, just a light tap to leave a mark, letting the poster know someone appreciates their content and allowing later viewers to intuitively see how popular that content is. What do you think?\"","At that time, neither blogs nor platforms modeled after Facebook had a 'like' mechanism. But as someone who had lived through it before, she knew full well how powerful this little feature would become.","Whether it was the later Weibo or various short-video platforms, none could do without this feature, because it intuitively reflected the popularity of content and thus stimulated user engagement and interest.","After hearing the Young Miss propose this feature, Zhang Dalong's eyes instantly lit up.","Technically, implementing this feature wasn't complicated; it essentially involved adding a counter association in the database. However, the underlying concept of social driving forces and the quantification of content popularity was incredibly novel.","Just as the Young Miss said, adding such a positive feedback mechanism could indeed greatly enhance users' sense of participation and boost the efficiency of content dissemination.","\"Young Miss, you're amazing. This is a fantastic idea. I'll revise it as soon as I get back.\"","Afterwards, Liu Yutong discussed several other features with him.","In short, she tried to pour out everything she remembered from her previous life.","These things might have seemed ordinary to her, but to Zhang Dalong's ears, they were anything but. Just from this one conversation, he felt his mind was nearly bursting with inspiration.","The Young Miss's grasp of user psychology and the patterns of social dissemination was simply astonishing, making one feel as though she could foresee the future.","Of course, that was an exaggeration.","In any case, the more he conversed with the Young Miss, the more he admired this girl nearly twenty years his junior.","In all his life, he had never met a woman so intelligent and full of ideas.","No wonder she could start from scratch and single-handedly build the vast enterprise that was the Wanlong Hui.","Another day passed.","An even more comprehensive proposal document was once again placed before Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong couldn't help but admire Zhang Dalong's execution efficiency; it was remarkably high.","Moreover, in the proposal revised in such a short time, she could hardly find any flaws. Of course, she automatically ignored the technical aspects she didn't understand.","This also proved that the person she had poached was indeed worth the effort.","So worth it!","\"Excellent. This proposal far exceeds my expectations. Proceed according to this plan; the project is officially launched. The company will fully support resources and personnel. Whatever you need, coordinate directly with Yu Xin.\"","\"Thank you, Young Miss! I will get Weibo up and running as soon as possible.\"","Just as Zhang Dalong was about to leave with the proposal document, Liu Yutong called him back.","\"Oh, Engineer Zhang, tomorrow is National Day. You can all take the normal holiday.\" She meant they didn't need to work so hard and should balance work and rest.","\"No, Young Miss. I've asked for everyone's opinion, and they've all chosen to work overtime.\"","Zhang Dalong's words weren't meant to show how hard his team was pushing themselves; it came from a genuine desire to work overtime. And it was completely voluntary from everyone, with no coercion.","Mainly, because they felt they had just arrived in a new environment empty-handed, with no projects or achievements to their name, everyone naturally hoped to prove their value as quickly as possible.","Liu Yutong didn't insist but made a guarantee.","Since everyone has this mindset, then proceed as you wish. I'll have the logistics department arrange meals and all necessary support for everyone during the holiday. Overtime will be paid at three times the standard rate in accordance with regulations, with bonuses calculated separately.","\"Thank you, Young Miss!\" Zhang Dalong expressed his gratitude again.","\"Also, tomorrow our Wanlong Hui's first shopping plaza is opening. Would you like to come and join the festivities, maybe cut the ribbon?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Zhang Dalong quickly shook his head. \"No, no, I don't want to go anywhere right now, Young Miss. May I make a request?\"","Liu Yutong seemed to have already guessed what he was going to ask and said directly, \"From now on you don't need to attend meetings unless they're important. You and your team can set your own working hours. If you want to sleep in, sleep in. There's no need to clock in or undergo attendance checks.\"","Zhang Dalong: \"...\"","Goodness! The Young Miss must be the worm in his stomach! She even knew what he was thinking.","Actually, he didn't know that in her previous life, there were rumors he had once called Pony Ma to ask for leave from a meeting simply because he couldn't be bothered to attend, and Pony Ma had no choice but to agree.","Because Liu Yutong understood his character, she decided to lift the restrictions altogether, giving him complete freedom.","The effect was obvious.","Zhang Dalong was also deeply moved. In his many years of professional career, this was the first time he had encountered a boss who trusted him so unreservedly.","In the following days, Zhang Dalong and his original team from Da'E effectively went into a state of complete isolation to carry out development work.","Consequently, the project's pace far exceeded expectations.","Not long after Zhang Dalong left, Su Mansu came in to report that Ma Da and Ji Yu had landed and were expected to arrive in Pearl City in about two hours.","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong perked up. She was eager to see what exactly Ma Da had managed to retrieve."]},{"number":567,"title":"Chapter 567: 567, Necklace, Photo, Bond.","paragraphs":["Two and a half hours later, there was a soft knock on the office door.","Led by Su Mansu, a travel-worn Ma Da and Ji Yu walked in one after the other. Ji Yu was carrying a black combination briefcase.","\"Eldest Miss, we’re back.\"","Liu Yutong rose from behind her desk and walked over to the lounge area, motioning for them to take a seat.","Su Mansu picked up the purple clay teapot from the table, poured tea for the three of them, and then quietly slipped out of the office.","\"It’s been hard on you. How did it feel, going abroad for the first time?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Ji Yu, still maintaining his usual blunt and honest demeanor, scratched his head and said, \"The food over there is terrible. I don't ever want to go back.\"","Liu Yutong chuckled. \"Was it really that bad?\"","At those words, Ma Da couldn't help but start venting.","\"Eldest Miss, it wasn't just bad; it was truly awful! For the first two days, I thought the cheese and bread were quite novel. But by the third day, I started wondering if foreigners have stomachs made of iron. Every single meal was either bread with meat, meat inside bread, or some kind of mushy paste. I spent half a day looking for a bowl of hot noodle soup and couldn't find one anywhere. I finally found a restaurant claiming to serve 'Oriental flavor,' but they brought out this sticky, sickeningly sweet mess they called fried noodles. I almost thought the cook had used sugar instead of salt.\"","Liu Yutong couldn't help but laugh. \"Couldn't you have found a nicer restaurant? I gave you plenty of travel funds, didn't I?\"","\"Hehe, mostly we just couldn't bear to spend it. Things are ridiculously expensive over there.\"","\"Eldest Miss, you have no idea how high the prices are. One bottle of water costs as much as a whole case back home. That bowl of nonsense fried noodles cost me nearly fifty euros. I did the math—that’s enough for twenty bowls of top-tier beef noodles back in Pearl City, with two meat-filled buns on the side,\" Ma Da added.","Ji Yu nodded beside him. \"And it didn't even taste good!\"","Liu Yutong waved her hand dismissively. \"Alright, alright, I know you suffered. I’ll have the hotel prepare a feast for you later to make it up to your stomachs.\"","\"Thank you, Eldest Miss!\" the two replied in unison.","Ma Da gestured for Ji Yu to place the briefcase on the table. \"Eldest Miss, should we open it now?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Open it.\"","Ma Da immediately entered the code. With a crisp click, the lid sprang open.","Inside the case were several well-preserved manila envelopes containing documents. Besides those, there were three gold bars and an exquisitely beautiful necklace. The pendant of the necklace was a red diamond weighing a staggering 11.28 carats, nestled within a dragon-scale clasp.","The reason Liu Yutong knew it was a red diamond was because of the description included in the packaging. The necklace was named \"Dragon’s Dawn.\" The centerpiece was an extremely rare natural red diamond; the original rough stone weighed 23.06 carats, and even after cutting, it remained a massive 11.28 carats.","If she remembered correctly, the largest known natural red diamond in the world wasn't even this big.","She vaguely recalled a news report about the world's largest natural red diamond being exhibited abroad. That stone was less than 6 carats, yet its estimated value at the time exceeded twenty million US dollars—and even then, it was the kind of treasure that money couldn't easily buy.","If the necklace in her hand truly held a natural red diamond, it would be a world record holder, worth at least a hundred million—and that was in US dollars.","\"Eldest Miss, this necklace really suits you. Listen to the name, Dragon’s Dawn—it sounds wonderful,\" Ma Da flattered her.","Liu Yutong smiled slightly but didn't speak.","She truly did like the necklace; she had fallen in love with it from the first moment she saw it. That dazzling shade of red was breathtakingly brilliant.","However, she still planned to have a professional agency test it, just in case. After all, a red diamond of this size had never appeared in the world before. If it were a counterfeit, she would only make a fool of herself by wearing it out.","Next, she opened an aged manila envelope.","Inside, besides a cashier's check for twenty million US dollars, there was an old photograph, a paper document, a stack of bearer bonds, and several stock certificates.","She could only understand the gist of it; the bearer bonds and stock certificates seemed to be related to a foreign company called MapperLithography.","She had never heard of this company; it was a complete blind spot in her knowledge.","\"Did you hear any rumors while you were abroad?\" she suddenly looked up and asked Ma Da and Ji Yu.","Both men shook their heads.","\"Eldest Miss, we followed your instructions to the letter. We only focused on retrieving the items and didn't dare ask around.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. They had done the right thing. Since these items were so valuable, it was best to be cautious while abroad.","\"Assistant Su, come in for a moment,\" she pressed the internal intercom.","Su Mansu pushed the door open and entered quickly.","\"Boss!\"","\"Make a copy of these documents and keep the originals safe. Then, have someone use the copies to look into this company called MapperLithography. Find out what they do—their background, core business, technical capabilities, market position, and current financial status. I want a detailed report.\"","\"Understood, Boss.\" Su Mansu took the file and hurried out.","Liu Yutong’s gaze fell once more upon the necklace named Dragon’s Dawn. The fiery red hue was hauntingly beautiful under the office lights.","She then closed the briefcase and pushed it to the edge of the desk.","\"Ma Da, contact a jewelry appraisal institution. Ask them to send a professional over to test this necklace and confirm its authenticity.\"","\"Will do, Eldest Miss.\" Ma Da nodded. He and Ji Yu relocked the briefcase and left with the necklace.","Once they were gone, Liu Yutong finally picked up the yellowed old photograph. She leaned back on the sofa, sipping her tea as she studied it.","The background of the photo looked like an industrial laboratory or workshop from over a decade ago. There were several people in the frame.","In the center was a middle-aged Chinese man. Standing next to him were a foreign man and woman who appeared to be quite close to him. She wasn't sure if it was just her own facial recognition failing her, but she felt the foreign man looked somewhat familiar.","However, she wasn't particularly interested in the identities of the people in the photo; it likely had nothing to do with her anyway.","She then placed the photo, the twenty-million-dollar check, and the gold bars into the office safe and left the company.","The following day.","In one of the core commercial districts of Pearl City, gongs and drums thundered while colorful flags fluttered in the breeze.","The first large-scale shopping mall under the Wanlong Association, Wanlong Plaza, was officially open for business."]},{"number":568,"title":"Chapter 568: 568. Leaders Probing for Details.","paragraphs":["The grand opening of the first Wanlong Plaza in the country was a massive affair, executed with immense scale and grandeur.","Aside from Liu Yutong, nearly every high-ranking executive of the Wanlong Society who could make the trip back attended the ceremony, including Yu Xin, Yang Xin, Ma Da, Li Xiaohui, and others. Even the top leadership of Mingzhu City graced the event in person to attend the ribbon-cutting ceremony.","The contributions made by the Wanlong Society to Mingzhu City were plain for all to see. Beyond generating tax revenue for the city, Wanlong Supermarkets and Wanhui Selection had provided a vast number of jobs. They had also assisted in attracting investment for the new development zone, bringing in numerous enterprises, most of which were partners of the Wanlong Society Group.","When the entire industrial chain was added up, the annual output value was quite staggering.","In addition, the Mingzhu City government intended to build a software technology park near the headquarters currently being planned and constructed by the Wanlong Society Group.","In truth, given Mingzhu City’s current situation, pulling this off would be incredibly difficult. After all, they lacked resources like top-tier talent and prestigious universities.","However, since the rise of the Wanhui Selection platform, the leaders' eyes had lit up. They had inspected Wanhui Selection and gained a rough understanding of the situation, realizing that the platform had the potential to rival those massive online shopping giants in the future. This sparked an idea.","Perhaps they really could use Wanhui Selection as the \"bellwether\" to establish a software and high-tech industrial park?","The top leader’s personal attendance at the ribbon-cutting ceremony was not only to show affirmation for the enterprise but, more importantly, to test the waters.","As the saying goes, one must perform the duties of their office. If Wanhui Selection truly grew into a company worth tens or even hundreds of billions in the future, the city leadership naturally wanted to keep the headquarters in Mingzhu City.","But they were also well aware that Mingzhu City’s appeal couldn't compare to that of first-tier cities; its flaws were too obvious.","Yet, if they could truly make this happen, they could build a software technology park centered around Wanhui Selection. With Wanhui Selection as the anchor, they could attract more software and high-tech companies to move in, which would be a significant political achievement.","After the ribbon-cutting ceremony ended, the crowds gradually dispersed, and customers began to flood into the mall.","At this moment, the leader took the initiative to invite Liu Yutong to tour the shopping center.","\"Chairman Liu, you wouldn't mind accompanying this old man for a walk inside, would you? I'd like to experience the commercial vitality of your Wanlong Society firsthand.\"","He spoke with great courtesy.","He had to be polite. If he wasn't, and Wanhui Selection decided to relocate its headquarters, it would be a major loss for Mingzhu City.","Furthermore, leaders are always well-informed. He had already heard rumors that the provincial capital was planning to poach them. After all, the provincial capital had always wanted to transform itself into a high-tech industrial hub. It was difficult to poach companies from outside the province because they had to compete with other major provinces—especially those on the coast, whom they simply couldn't outmatch.","But poaching a company from within their own province? That gave them a massive advantage.","Take educational resources as an example. Mingzhu City only had two key undergraduate institutions: the University of Finance and Economics and the Medical University. Meanwhile, the provincial capital not only possessed multiple key universities but also a world-class \"Double First-Class\" institution: the Dragon Country University of Science and Technology.","There was a saying: if the two top-tier universities in the Imperial Capital were the cradle of engineers and the stronghold of humanities and social sciences, then the Dragon Country University of Science and Technology was the sanctuary for scientists.","In short, whether in terms of resources or talent, Mingzhu City was no match for the provincial capital.","Hearing the leader’s polite words, Liu Yutong immediately responded, \"You are far too kind, Leader. It is our honor. This way, please.\"","She took the lead, guiding him down the main corridor into the heart of the mall.","Behind them, the secretaries and assistants tactfully lagged a few steps behind. This ensured the leader's safety while leaving enough private space for conversation.","The leader looked around as he walked, watching the endless stream of people and the bustling scenes inside the various brand stores. He praised sincerely.","\"Good, truly good! Chairman Liu, look at this popularity, look at this consumption momentum. Wanlong Plaza hasn't just opened a mall; it has injected a shot of adrenaline into this entire southern district of the city! Your Wanlong Society is now the undisputed leading enterprise of Mingzhu City.\"","\"You flatter us, Leader,\" Liu Yutong replied modestly. She continued, \"Our development would not have been possible without the excellent business environment of Mingzhu City and the strong support of leaders at all levels, especially yourself. The Wanlong Society is rooted in Mingzhu City; as we grow and flourish, it is only natural that we give back to this land.\"","The leader nodded with satisfaction. \"Chairman Liu, I've been thinking about a problem lately, and I’m a bit conflicted. I’d like to hear the perspective of a young entrepreneur like you.\"","\"Please, go ahead,\" Liu Yutong said.","The leader continued, \"To be honest with you, seeing how well your Wanhui Selection is developing makes me happy, but it also makes it hard for me to sleep at night.\"","This time, Liu Yutong did not respond. It wasn't her turn to speak or state a position yet; she only needed to listen attentively.","\"I know that a high-tech company like Wanhui Selection, which can drive domestic demand and create jobs, is incredibly precious. But because of that, I worry. Mingzhu City's industrial foundation isn't thin—the industrial chain driven by your Wanlong Society Group, along with our traditional strengths like glass and filters, are the anchors that stabilize current employment. But in the long run, if a city wants to avoid falling behind in the next round of development, it must cultivate new growth points.\"","\"So, I keep thinking. A city—especially one that wants to move to a higher level—cannot just have a solid body; it must also have a clever brain and a high-tech soul. Every time I go to those tech hubs in the south for inspections and see the internet companies and software firms they’ve incubated, I feel both envious and anxious.\"","Liu Yutong remained quiet, still not speaking.","Seeing that she hadn't said a word after he had talked for so long, the leader grew a bit anxious himself.","How could this girl be so composed? Say something!","In reality, it wasn't that Liu Yutong was exceptionally calm, but rather that he had lost his own composure first.","Who would have thought that in such a short time, the tables would turn so completely?","A year ago, she was a girl leading a group of street thugs to flip lobsters. Now, she had grown to the point where even he had to find ways to woo her just to keep her from leaving.","The leader felt helpless and decided to stop beating around the bush. \"Fine, fine. You're going to make me spell it out, aren't you? I'll be blunt. After several discussions, the city plans to build a software technology park to concentrate our efforts on developing high-tech industries. But we need a leader. Can you give me a straight answer—can Wanhui Selection stay in Mingzhu City and not move away?\"","Only then did Liu Yutong speak. \"Uncle Gao, if you had something to say, you could have just said it. Why go in such a long circle with me?\"","The leader burst into a helpless laugh. \"You... you really are something...\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Leader, I'll be honest with you. Wanhui Selection won't have just one headquarters. However, I will keep one headquarters here in Mingzhu City.\"","The leader caught her drift immediately. He understood that for an enterprise like Wanhui Selection to thrive and expand, attracting top-tier talent was an essential hurdle to clear.","A multi-headquarters model offered a distinct advantage: it allowed for a job rotation system similar to those used by other internet giants. By cycling employees and core staff through different locations, the company could prevent internal stagnation while funneling talent toward the Pearl City headquarters.","If they could convince people to stay long-term, Pearl City’s talent pool would naturally deepen.","However, getting talent to actually settle down in Pearl City required more than just a competitive salary. Once people attained a certain level of wealth, they tended to gravitate toward established metropolises to build their lives.","To counter this, Pearl City needed to offer something truly magnetic—a more livable environment, superior education, and top-notch medical resources.","While Pearl City’s medical facilities were respectable and its medical university held a fair bit of prestige, its educational offerings were a matter of opinion, as different regions always had their own unique academic strengths.","The living environment, however—that was where they truly needed to focus their efforts."]},{"number":569,"title":"Chapter 569: 569. This is a good girl","paragraphs":["\"Uncle Gao, look, relying solely on our company to fight alone to retain talent is ultimately limited in its power. But wouldn't it be wonderful if we could work together to make Mingzhu City itself a place where people never want to leave once they arrive?\"","The leader was momentarily taken aback by Liu Yutong's sudden shift in topic, but he gestured with keen interest for her to continue.","\"I know there must be people in the city government discussing plans to attract chemical plants to the development zone. But if this must be done, I suggest building them far away from the urban area, and even far away from the suburbs.","Mingzhu City has beautiful mountains and rivers, a uniquely advantageous geographical environment, and an excellent transportation network. We absolutely must not destroy these exceptional advantages just for short-term economic gains,\" Liu Yutong said earnestly.","The leader's eyes immediately narrowed. He knew very well that Liu Yutong was hinting at something specific.","Indeed, there had been people in the leadership team pushing for chemical enterprises to settle in the new industrial park, but they faced resistance from the companies brought in by the Wanlong Group. If those companies hadn't claimed the spots first, the eastern part of the city would likely be filled with chemical plants by now. Although chemical industries don't necessarily guarantee pollution, they undeniably bring a negative impact to the city's image.","The urban area of Mingzhu City wasn't large to begin with, and according to the city planning, it was bound to expand outward gradually. If those chemical plants were too close, who would want to buy new houses in the newly developed areas?","Let alone the talents recruited from outside.","\"There's also the issue of urban transportation. Many roads in the old district of Mingzhu City are simply too narrow, and the city planning is still stuck in the outdated mindset of ten or twenty years ago. During the morning and evening rush hours, it's common to be stuck in traffic at key intersections for half an hour...\"","Liu Yutong went on to list many areas she believed needed improvement.","Whether now or in the future, these issues truly affected the city's development, not to mention she was looking at them from the perspective of someone from the future. In her previous life, the exact problems she mentioned had plagued Mingzhu City's growth, turning a city that originally ranked near the top in provincial GDP into one at the very bottom.","Speaking up in advance was her way of giving a warning to prevent history from repeating itself.","If the city couldn't keep up with development, it came back to the old saying: even if she brought the talent in, they wouldn't stay.","The leader never expected that a girl not even twenty years old could have such a long-term vision.","Every issue she pointed out precisely hit the crux of Mingzhu City's development, and many were pain points that the city's leadership team had repeatedly discussed but struggled to solve.","At the end of the day, it all came down to a lack of municipal funds.","But seeing this young woman speaking with such confidence and eloquence beside him, he suddenly felt that if he didn't take these matters seriously, he wouldn't even measure up to a little girl.","\"By the way, Uncle Gao, I heard the city is planning to invest in building a sports stadium. Is that true?\" Liu Yutong suddenly asked.","The leader paused for a moment and nodded. \"That's right. Why do you ask?\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"To be honest, I think the scale of this stadium is too small.\"","The leader was a bit surprised. \"Is that really small? The plan is to accommodate twenty thousand people at once, which is already somewhat excessive for our Mingzhu City.\"","In reality, he knew very well that building this stadium would be a loss-making venture. After all, not many sporting events would be willing to be hosted in a small place like Mingzhu City. Building it smaller meant losing less money.","But as soon as the words left his mouth, he realized something: this girl, Liu Yutong, wouldn't care about a stadium for no reason.","\"Do you have any thoughts on this stadium?\"","Liu Yutong nodded and spoke frankly. \"Uncle Gao, we just talked about how retaining talent in Mingzhu City requires enriching everyone's entertainment life. A twenty-thousand-seat stadium is just too petty. My suggestion is to do it right the first time: aim for a capacity of fifty thousand and build it to the standards capable of hosting top-tier domestic leagues and international single-sport events.\"","\"Fifty thousand? Are you sure?\"","\"Absolutely!\"","The leader fell deep into thought. He understood the underlying meaning of Liu Yutong's words. She was clearly telling him that she had a way to increase the stadium's utilization rate. And to fill a fifty-thousand-seat venue, it would definitely require attracting a significant number of out-of-town tourists to boost attendance.","If that were truly the case, it would indeed be a wonderful thing.","His guess was correct; Liu Yutong had long had plans in this regard.","The Wanlong Group controlled an entertainment company. In the future, asking their famous singers to hold concerts in Mingzhu City wouldn't be too much to ask, right?","If Weibo took off, they could also host events like Weibo Night here every year.","Furthermore, with the esports club Li Xiaohui was running, future esports tournaments could also choose to be hosted in Mingzhu City.","She had countless ways to attract tourists to Mingzhu City.","When the time came, if Mingzhu City vigorously promoted its tourism industry, over time, it was entirely possible for Mingzhu City to become a trending internet-famous city.","By then, wouldn't those talents be even more willing to stay and settle down?","Once the talent stayed, the scientific and technological development level of the entire city would rise.","With technological advancement, tax revenues would naturally increase. As the financial situation improved, the city could be better renovated, making it even more livable.","This would undoubtedly create a virtuous cycle.","However, whether Mingzhu City could develop according to her expectations still depended on the leader's boldness and execution capabilities.","To put it bluntly, the leader had to be a true doer.","Looking at the light in Liu Yutong's eyes, the leader sighed in his heart: This girl really spares no effort in wanting to develop her hometown. What a good kid!","In the future, if anyone dared to gossip in his ear saying that the Wanlong Group might be involved in organized crime, he would fly into a rage at them!","How could such a kind-hearted kid, so wholeheartedly devoted to her hometown, be involved in anything shady?","Someone must be throwing dirty water on her!","Subsequently, the leader turned his head and instructed the secretary behind him, \"Write this down immediately. When we get back, gather everyone for a discussion to see if we can redesign this project. We can refer more to the opinions of the Wanlong Group.\"","\"Yes, sir!\" the secretary immediately complied.","An hour later, having finished his inspection, the leader got into his car with a gratified smile on his face.","\"Little Zhang, look at this girl. Just over a year ago, she was leading people on the streets to sell crawfish, and now she has transformed into a pragmatic entrepreneur. What a huge change.\"","The secretary smiled in agreement. \"Yes, sir, Director Liu's growth speed is indeed astonishing.\"","The leader said with a touch of emotion, \"More than astonishing, it's no different from riding a rocket. I still remember the first time I met her last year; she was still a bit immature and reserved. Now look at her, she dares to directly offer city planning suggestions to me, the local magistrate.\"","There was not a hint of blame in his words; instead, they were filled with admiration.","The secretary naturally understood the leader's thoughts and followed his lead, saying, \"This shows that Director Liu genuinely treats Mingzhu City as her home and sees you as an elder in her own family. That's why she doesn't treat you like an outsider and can't wait to share any good ideas with you.\"","\"You are absolutely right.\"","The leader nodded in agreement and said earnestly, \"This child always keeps her hometown in her heart. She isn't just focused on making money for herself; she genuinely wants to pull Pearl City forward along with her. Just for this dedication and drive of hers, as her uncle, I must support her.\"","\"Give the departments below a heads-up. From now on, whenever the Wanlonghui Group, especially that Liu girl, makes a reasonable request, as long as it doesn't violate any principles, give them the green light and expedite the process. Whether our Pearl City can seize this opportunity to take off might really depend on this group of young people.\"","\"Understood, sir.\" The secretary noted it down solemnly.","At the same time, he was secretly astonished. Having followed this exceptionally rigorous and principle-abiding leader for so long, this was the first time he had ever seen him pull strings for anyone. It was clear just how much weight Liu Yutong held in the leader's heart.","Just then, as the leader was about to close his eyes for a quick nap, the figure of a certain guy who always opposed him suddenly flashed through his mind, and his gaze instantly turned sharp.","\"Little Zhang, later on, go find Qi Wei privately and ask around. He's been mixed up with that investigation team for over half a year now; isn't it about time to close the net!\""]},{"number":570,"title":"Chapter 570: 570. The Future is Online.","paragraphs":["After the successful grand opening of Wanlong Plaza, its popularity remained high for several consecutive days.","As a newly opened commercial complex in Pearl City, its level of modernization was much higher than those older department stores. Whether it was the environment or the shopping experience, it was far superior. Coupled with numerous and rich promotional activities, it naturally attracted a large number of visitors for shopping.","On the opening day alone, the foot traffic exceeded 80,000. The cumulative foot traffic over three days approached 200,000, and total sales broke the twenty million mark.","Among them, Wanlong Supermarket performed the most brilliantly, accounting for nearly one-third of the total sales.","On the afternoon of the fourth day, Liu Yutong brought her assistants, Su Mansu and Lan Die, to inspect the mall again. Though she called it an inspection, she actually just wanted to go shopping herself, so she didn't notify anyone.","After buying some clothes in the mall, she made her way to the third floor and saw her old classmate Guo Yani next to the Yuyuefang branch restaurant.","Liu Yutong had not expected Guo Yani to open her branch near Yuyuefang, even launching a free hand care service right at the restaurant's entrance, creating a collaboration with them.","It was worth noting that Yuyuefang was now one of the top-ranked chain restaurants in Pearl City in terms of reputation.","Achieving this level of success was because Yuyuefang had perfected both its service and its flavors to the extreme; it would be hard for it not to be popular. During holidays, the restaurant would even see spectacular scenes of customers waiting in long lines for a table.","To soothe the waiting customers' emotions, the restaurant had long ago thoughtfully introduced a series of services, including providing seats, free tea, and snacks.","Guo Yani had precisely spotted the business opportunity and foot traffic here, choosing to locate her branch right next to the restaurant. She offered free hand care services to ladies waiting for their meals, using this as a way to promote her own beauty salon.","When Liu Yutong saw Guo Yani, the girl was wearing her work uniform, focused entirely on giving a customer a free hand treatment.","To be honest, the girl was quite smart, knowing how to leverage the traffic from Liu Yutong's restaurant—something Liu Yutong had never taught her.","Liu Yutong waited until the customer left before walking over.","\"Boss Guo, business is booming, I see.\"","Hearing the voice, Guo Yani looked up. The moment she saw it was Liu Yutong, she immediately stood up.","\"Oh my, has my big boss come for an undercover inspection? Why didn't you give me a heads-up so I could line everyone up to welcome you!\" she joked with a smile.","\"Save it.\"","Liu Yutong smiled and sat down in the chair opposite her, naturally extending her hands. \"Just finished shopping and my hands are a bit dry. Care to serve me personally, Boss Guo?\"","\"It would be my honor, my generous investor!\"","Flattering her, Guo Yani took out her tools. She first used a warm, damp towel to carefully wipe Liu Yutong's hands before beginning the care routine.","\"How does it feel? Have you adapted well these past few days since the new store opened?\" Liu Yutong asked.","\"Couldn't be better.\"","While applying exfoliating cream to Liu Yutong's hands, Guo Yani expressed her gratitude.","\"Yutong, thank you so much. If you hadn't invested money and reserved a spot for me, I probably wouldn't have dared to dream of opening a shop in Wanlong Plaza in this lifetime. Just look, my employees and I have done hundreds of free treatments over the past few days. More than thirty of them converted into in-store consultations and membership sign-ups. The preliminary revenue is almost catching up to a whole month's earnings at my old store.\"","\"Oh right, I've transferred your share of the profits to your card on time. Don't forget to check your account, big boss.\"","The largest investor in Guo Yani's beauty salon, named Elegant Times, was none other than Liu Yutong. According to their initial seventy-thirty split agreement, Liu Yutong could take seventy percent of the profits without having to do a thing.","\"No rush about the money. Could I possibly not trust you? Seeing your business get on the right track puts my mind at ease.\"","\"You're really easygoing, but I'm truly honored!\"","\"...\"","Guo Yani then applied hand cream for her, performing the final massage steps, and casually asked a question she had been pondering for a long time.","\"Yutong, my chain store is up and running now, and business is pretty good, but I still feel a bit uncertain inside. How should I proceed to make the business more stable and larger? Could you point me in the right direction, big boss?\"","After thinking for a moment, Liu Yutong said, \"You can pay more attention to online channels. Take Wanhui Choice, for example; there are huge opportunities there. You can set up shop directly on it and launch some promotional packages for online booking and offline experiences. This way, you can attract more online customers to spend money in your physical store. You can also sell your store's well-reviewed skincare products on e-commerce platforms. It's still quite easy to make money in e-commerce nowadays.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Just remember one thing: the future of business will definitely be a tight integration of online and offline.\"","\"I get it! Yutong, you are truly amazing! Why didn't I think of this? Once I get back, I'll research how to set up group buying and online shopping.\"","Speaking of this, Guo Yani suddenly remembered something.","\"Oh, speaking of which, Yutong, let me tell you something. Just a couple of days ago, a few foreign guests came here, and they actually knew about you! I never thought my big boss's name would have spread overseas.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong narrowed her eyes. \"Is that so? Did they say anything?\"","Guo Yani thought for a moment, then shook her head. \"Those foreigners were speaking a foreign language most of the time, so I couldn't really understand them. But they seemed quite interested in you. Could they be wanting to visit you? After all, you are the most outstanding young entrepreneur in Pearl City.\"","\"Oh right, one of the foreigners was even injured. His head was wrapped in bandages, like he had been beaten up.\"","\"Beaten up?\"","\"Yeah, it looked like it. But I think it's normal. That guy talked way too much, chattering non-stop like a chanting monk. He was so noisy I wanted to slap him just to make him quiet down for a bit,\" Guo Yani said jokingly.","A chatty foreigner?","A name instantly popped into Liu Yutong's mind: Jesse, the foreigner she had briefly met in Great South City.","After the hand care was done, Liu Yutong chatted with Guo Yani for a few more minutes before leaving.","As soon as she got into the car, she instructed, \"Call Ma Da first and tell him to come see me at my house.\"","\"Yes, boss,\" Su Mansu replied.","Over ten minutes later, at the Qiongyuewan Villa District.","Upon returning in her car, Liu Yutong saw a black sedan parked at the entrance of her house. Yaya jumped out of the car carrying a small backpack.","Seeing Liu Yutong step out of the car behind hers, the little girl immediately sprinted over in excitement.","\"Sister!\"","Liu Yutong crouched down, opening her arms to catch the little cannonball plunging into her embrace.","\"Yaya, are you back from the zoo?\"","\"Mhm!\" Yaya nodded vigorously. Looking up with her small face and big, blinking eyes, she started chattering away about the animals she had seen at the zoo today.","Listening to her story, Liu Yutong held her hand and walked into the villa.","The housekeeper had already prepared dinner. Just as Liu Yutong and Yaya finished washing their hands and sat down to eat, Ma Da rushed in like a whirlwind."]},{"number":571,"title":"Chapter 571: 571. Preparing to Enter the Chip Industry","paragraphs":["Seeing the food on the table, Ma Da did not stand on ceremony. He found a seat, sat right down, and asked the housekeeper to bring him a set of bowls and chopsticks.","Who knew what this guy had been busy with earlier; he wolfed down his food ravenously. Fortunately, the housekeeper had cooked plenty of rice, otherwise there really would not have been enough for him.","Only when he was almost full did he grab a tissue, wipe his mouth, and say to Liu Yutong, \"Miss, the key has been released through our contacts exactly as you instructed. I even made sure to have someone tamper with it.\"","The key Ma Da referred to was the one that matched the badge.","Liu Yutong had long known that many people overseas were looking for this item. Therefore, after extracting the contents from the badge, she had Ma Da find someone to tamper with the key. From now on, whoever tried to use this key to open the badge would not only fail to unlock it, but the key would also snap off inside.","This way, no matter who obtained the badge and the key, they would not be able to open it. Even if they forced it open violently, the useless voucher she had placed back inside would be completely destroyed and rendered unusable, naturally preventing anyone from suspecting her.","After all, if you did not even know what the item inside was supposed to be used for, how could you possibly harbor suspicions?","A few days ago, Liu Yutong had already returned the badge to Mr. Li, the man who had originally won it at auction.","\"Has anyone bought the badge from Mr. Li?\"","Ma Da nodded. \"Yes, a foreigner named Hawke bought it.\"","\"And the key?\" Liu Yutong asked.","\"The key ended up in the hands of a foreigner named Jesse,\" Ma Da replied again.","A peculiar expression appeared on Liu Yutong's face. \"It seems they are all familiar faces.\"","But on second thought, Hawke, much like Jesse, seemed to have gang affiliations overseas. It made sense that they would want to track down the contents of the badge.","\"Since they have both been given away, let them fight it out like dogs. We do not need to worry about it anymore.\"","\"Yes, Miss.\"","Then, Ma Da pointed to the briefcase he had brought. \"Miss, I had someone appraise the necklace. It is authentic. The appraisal agency even wanted to help me contact a buyer, saying it could sell for at least a hundred million dollars, but I turned them down.\"","Hearing this number, even the usually aloof Lan Die was somewhat moved.","A necklace, worth a hundred million? And in US dollars?","That was too exaggerated!","Internal complaints aside, such priceless jewelry held a fatal attraction for women.","Even if she did not harbor any improper thoughts about the necklace, she still wanted to catch a glimpse of its true appearance immediately.","Soon, Liu Yutong fulfilled Lan Die's wish.","She simply ordered Ma Da to open the case, and a breathtakingly vibrant red instantly caught everyone's eyes.","When Liu Yutong took the necklace in her hand, the breathing of the people around her involuntarily lightened, for fear that the slightest disturbance might startle the Miss, causing the necklace to fall to the ground and break. The loss would be catastrophic.","\"Lan Die, help me put it on.\" Liu Yutong's voice carried a rare hint of anticipation.","\"Yes, Miss.\"","Lan Die carefully took the priceless necklace from Liu Yutong's hands and gently fastened it around Liu Yutong's fair, slender neck.","Once the necklace was on, Liu Yutong walked straight over to the huge floor-to-ceiling mirror in the living room.","The person in the mirror had dark hair like clouds and skin as white as snow. Her already peerlessly beautiful face, accentuated by the exquisite red diamond necklace, appeared even more dazzling and incomparably luxurious.","It even gave off the feeling that amidst all the prosperity in the world, only she was worthy of such magnificence.","The usually cold and composed Lan Die rarely held her breath, her eyes full of awe.","Only by seeing it with her own eyes did she finally understand why someone would be willing to pay an astronomical price for a luxury item.","At this moment, it was no longer just a piece of jewelry; it was a symbol of power, a kind of ultimate beauty. And this beauty could only truly reflect its value when worn by the right person.","Liu Yutong gazed quietly at herself in the mirror, the corners of her lips curling into a very faint, yet breathtakingly beautiful smile.","\"Not bad, I really like this necklace.\"","After recovering from his amazement, Ma Da slapped his thigh and started showering her with praises.","\"It is absolutely stunning, Miss! This necklace is practically tailor-made for you! I, Ma Da, used to think those shiny stones were just whatever, but today my eyes have truly been opened. With this necklace on you, it is like a treasure covered in dust... wait, spit, spit, I mean, it is just too beautiful! Even the fairies in heaven must look like this!\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","\"If you do not know how to speak, then don't.\"","Ma Da scratched his head and chuckled. \"Anyway, it just looks really good.\"","Just as he was about to continue his flattery, the phone in his pocket suddenly rang. He took it out, glanced at the number, gestured to Liu Yutong, and pressed the answer button.","\"Hello! What is it?\"","\"It is that Jesse again? He got his head busted open again? This guy really has terrible luck...\"","After hanging up, Ma Da reported directly to Liu Yutong, \"Miss, that foreigner Jesse got cornered by a group of strangers and got his head busted open again. Should we intervene?\"","Liu Yutong pondered for a moment and suddenly asked, \"Ma Da, do you think this person is reliable?\"","Ma Da immediately shook his head. \"That guy talks absolute nonsense and is a chatterbox. I do not think he is reliable.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Then take some people to go take a look. Consider it doing a good deed.\"","Ma Da: \"...\"","He could not quite understand the Miss's thought process. Was her question not pointless then?","\"Yes, Miss. I will take some men to check it out right now.\" With that, he turned and left.","Liu Yutong had her own considerations for doing this.","A few days ago, the company named Mapper that she had Su Mansu investigate turned out to be a Dutch company that manufactured lithography machines.","The company's current financial situation was not ideal; it was on the verge of bankruptcy, and she, the major shareholder of this company, was only finding out about it now.","Of course, that was just a joke, as she had only just acquired the company's bonds and equity.","Mapper primarily focused on the maskless electron-beam direct-write technology route. Compared to the optical lithography technology of the lithography giant ASML, this technology indeed had obvious flaws, mainly its low mass-production speed, making it unsuitable for large-scale standardized production, which had led to its developmental predicament.","However, even so, the value of this company was still not low. Although it could not achieve large-scale mass production, it held certain advantages in low-cost rapid prototype development and small-batch, multi-variety production.","Furthermore, Mapper had a long-term technical cooperation and supply chain relationship with an ASML subsidiary specializing in ALD technology.","The importance of ALD technology in chip manufacturing goes without saying; it is essentially a cutting-edge process capable of achieving atomic-level precision in thin-film deposition.","It was precisely because ASML made a breakthrough in ALD technology last year that it consolidated its dominant position in the high-end lithography sector.","Honestly, Liu Yutong had never thought about stepping into the fields of microchips and lithography machines. To her, these were simply too difficult; she had no technology, no talent, absolutely nothing.","Even though she was someone who had been reborn into the past, she knew her limits and felt she shouldn't touch this stuff.","However, against all expectations, and despite having no such intentions, she inexplicably found herself owning 80 percent of the equity in a company focused on the research, development, and manufacturing of lithography machines, effectively becoming its controlling shareholder.","Now that things had come to this, if she remained indifferent, wouldn't she be throwing away a golden opportunity to enter the semiconductor industry?","Although she knew absolutely nothing about chip manufacturing and lithography machines, she did know one thing: for the next ten or twenty years, the core and fiercest battlefield of global technological competition would be microchips.","In short, whoever mastered advanced chip design and manufacturing capabilities would hold the initiative in the future information age.","But for now, she needed to plan things out carefully.","For instance, she first needed to acquire the remaining 20 percent of shares in Mapper Company to complete a full privatization. Then, she would use Mapper as a technology absorption platform. By leveraging local advantages, she could legally recruit experts and former engineers from companies like ASML and Philips, rebuild a research and development team, and work toward reverse-engineering ASML's DUV lithography machines and developing key subsystems.","Later, she would find an opportunity to transfer the talent and equipment back to her home country, moving the foreign technological achievements back little by little, like ants moving house.","The only problem was the high level of difficulty. Foreign technological blockades were extremely strict, so she absolutely could not expose the fact that Mapper Company was controlled by Dragon Country capital. Otherwise, certain rogue governments would definitely force the confiscation of the company.","Therefore, she hoped to find a foreigner who wouldn't arouse suspicion to act as her proxy and carry out these tasks in secret.","That Jesse was on her shortlist, because his identity as a gang member offered far more advantages than that of an ordinary businessman.","In foreign societies, there was nothing the underworld couldn't solve."]},{"number":572,"title":"Chapter 572: 572, Too Dark and Too Cruel","paragraphs":["\"Fuck! Do you know who I am? I am the heir to the Corallo family! If you touch me, you'll be in big trouble! Huge trouble!\" Jesse roared at the gang of thugs before him, his back pressed against the wall.","But the thugs opposite him couldn't understand a single word he was saying.","\"What's this foreigner babbling about? What Corgi, what Mala family? Sounds like he sells hotpot.\"","\"Who gives a damn if it's spicy hotpot or a half-and-half broth. Just grab the stuff so we can finish the job. The boss who's paying us is still waiting.\"","Meanwhile, not far behind them, a young blond foreigner was watching the scene with cold detachment.","He was the one who had hired these thugs. He had already bought his plane ticket, just waiting to fly out the second he got the key.","Staying in the Dragon Kingdom for too long was simply unsafe, especially since this place seemed to be the home turf of that woman who had beaten him up before.","Looking at these thugs who were on a completely different wavelength, Jesse almost spat out a mouthful of blood in frustration.","\"Fuck! You muggles! Don't you understand human speech?!\"","\"Oh ho? You dare swear at us? Who are you calling a motherfucker?!\"","Hearing this, the lead thug instantly flared up. \"Boys, get him! Let's teach this loudmouth foreigner a lesson!\"","Seeing the gang about to rush up and give him a brutal education of love, Jesse wailed inwardly.","\"God, Buddha, Allah! Is the grand young master of the Corallo family really going to meet his end here today?!\"","Just as he fell into utter despair...","Beep beep!","A bright light suddenly pierced through from the entrance of the alley.","Immediately after, a teasing voice rang out behind them.","\"Yo, yo, yo, what's everyone doing here?\"","A black sedan was parked at the alleyway. A chubby figure with a lollipop in his mouth walked toward them, leading a group of young men in black.","The thugs were momentarily stunned by the sight.","So much black! All black suits!","\"W-who are you guys? Mind your own business!\"","Ma Da slowly took the lollipop out of his mouth and pointed at Jesse. \"This foreigner is under my protection. Do me a favor, go back to your own homes and find your own mothers, alright?\"","\"Who the hell do you think you are! You think we'll just leave because you say so?!\" the thug leader retorted, feeling his pride was on the line.","Just then, a sharp-eyed underling beside him tugged at his sleeve. \"Boss, stop talking, just shut up!\"","\"Shut up? Shut what up? Why are you being such a coward?!\"","The thug leader shook off his subordinate's hand in displeasure. \"Damn it, don't tell anyone you run with me when we get out of here. It's embarrassing!\"","The underling was so anxious he was about to cry. \"Boss, look closely at the logo on their clothes! Those are men from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","\"So what if it's the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? Does that mean they can just throw their weight around?\" the thug leader retorted instinctively. But halfway through his sentence, his entire body stiffened, and all the color drained from his face.","\"I-is it that Ten... Ten Thousand Dragons Society?\"","\"Yeah, black suits with a dragon crest embroidered on the chest. That's them!\"","The next second, under the astonished gazes of Jesse and all the underlings, the previously aggressive thug leader dropped straight to his knees, sliding forward.","\"Boss, I was wrong! I have a foul mouth! We'll get lost right now! Immediately! Right this second! Please let us off the hook!\"","This was the Ten Thousand Dragons Society! Everyone on the streets knew how ruthless their methods were and how terrifyingly solid their background was.","Many of them had heard about how the East Sea Alliance was wiped out back in the day.","They had also heard that the boss of the East Sea Alliance, Zhao Tianxing, was taken out by the Ten Thousand Dragons Society right in front of the cops.","When that news spread, everyone in the underworld trembled in fear.","That was why the thug leader knelt so fast after confirming these were men from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. If he had been even a second slower, he feared he would become the next Zhao Tianxing.","No, he wasn't even worthy of being compared to Zhao Tianxing. At least Zhao Tianxing was the boss of a major syndicate; he was just a small-time nobody.","Ma Da seemed completely used to this kind of scene. He sucked on his lollipop and drawled lazily, \"Yo! Now you know you're wrong? Weren't you acting pretty tough just a second ago?\"","The thug leader was on the verge of tears. \"I wouldn't dare, I wouldn't dare! Boss, you are the sky! You are the earth! You are the only myth!\"","\"I'm just a rotten scallion, no... I'm not even a scallion, I'm just a clove of garlic! Please just let me go like a fart!\"","The others also quickly followed suit, kneeling and begging for mercy.","\"Boss, we were wrong!\"","\"Boss, I have an eighty-year-old mother to support at home and three kids to feed. If something happens to me, my family will collapse!\"","\"My wife just gave birth and is still in confinement! Spare my life, boss!\"","\"Huh? Wait, aren't you single? Where did you get a wife and kids?\"","\"Piss off!\"","\"............\"","\"Alright, alright, get up, all of you. Stop wailing like ghosts,\" Ma Da waved his hand impatiently.","\"Thank you, boss! Thank you, boss!\" The thug leader felt as if he had been granted a general amnesty. He was just about to flee with his underlings when a group of men in black blocked their path.","\"B-boss, are you still not going to let us go?\"","Ma Da replied, \"No, it's just that I need you guys to be witnesses.\"","\"Witnesses?\" The thug leader looked confused.","\"You'll find out in a bit,\" Ma Da said, offering no further explanation.","Meanwhile.","The young blond foreigner who had been peeking from the back saw that things were going south and prepared to slip away quietly.","But just as he was about to turn around, he found that his body couldn't move.","Two young men in black, who had somehow slipped behind him unnoticed, grabbed his arms from the left and right, restraining him.","\"Let me go! Do you know who I am? I am Hawke! My boss is the leader of the Mafia!\"","\"I'm warning you, I'm a foreigner! If anything happens to me, the embassy will definitely intervene, and it will cause a serious diplomatic dispute! You can't bear the consequences!\"","Ma Da slowly walked over and laughed. \"Oh ho, a diplomatic dispute? Do you even know you broke the law? You dare hit people on our turf. Never mind just using the embassy's name, even if you carried the consul over here yourself, you're still going to be locked up today!\"","With that, he gave a pointed look to the two subordinates holding Hawke.","The two men in black immediately nodded and dragged Hawke deeper into the alley.","Soon after, bloodcurdling screams that sent shivers down the spine echoed from within.","\"Ah! Stop... Please! Stop! Hahaha... I was wrong! I was really wrong! Help...!\"","The voice was intermittent, a mix of manic laughter and broken screams. Just hearing it was enough to make one imagine a scene of horrific, inhumane torture.","The gang of thugs all shivered in absolute terror, screaming internally.","\"Holy shit! I've always heard the Ten Thousand Dragons Society loves to torture people, and they really live up to their reputation! Damn, this foreigner sounds like he's begging for death! Thank god we knelt fast, otherwise we'd end up exactly like that!\"","What they didn't know was that the men in black were actually just tickling Hawke.","Jesse, who had just escaped danger, now felt a chill shoot straight from the soles of his feet to the top of his skull, making every hair on his body stand on end.","After all, he was someone who had run with foreign gangs. He had seen plenty of gunfights, turf wars, and even his fair share of gory scenes.","Where he came from, resolving conflicts was usually simple and brutal. With a loud bang, all grudges were settled. It was cruel, but at least it was quick, clean, and painless.","But this group of people in front of him—what the hell kind of playbook were they using?!","They actually used torture? And the kind of cruel torture that made your blood run cold just hearing about it!","Sure enough, the underworld syndicates in Dragon Country were much more ruthless than their foreign gangs. There was absolutely no humanity to speak of!","Devils! These guys were absolute devils!","The more Jesse thought about it, the more terrified he became. He stole a glance at Ma Da beside him, who was casually sucking on a lollipop with a breezy expression, and for the first time, true fear welled up in his heart.","From now on, if anyone dared to tell him that Dragon Country was the safest country in the world, he would fight them!","Had you ever seen torture that tormented a person until they were crying through their laughter, begging for a death they couldn't have?","He was witnessing it right now!","It was simply too dark, too utterly ruthless!"]},{"number":573,"title":"Chapter 573: 573, Great-Grandmother","paragraphs":["A few minutes later.","Hawke was dragged out by several men in black. At this moment, he looked as if he had just been fished out of the water, completely drenched in sweat. Wet tear tracks hung on his face (actually from laughing), his eyes were unfocused, and the corners of his mouth twitched uncontrollably. Every now and then, he would let out a reflexive giggle, looking exactly like a madman.","Witnessing this scene, Jesse and the street thugs felt an ever-growing chill in their hearts.","How long does it take to torture a person into insanity?","These men in black had provided their answer: less than five minutes.","\"Brother Ma, it's all handled. He confessed everything. Here is the badge.\" A young man in black handed a sealed bag to Ma Da.","Ma Da took the badge, casually stuffed it into his pocket, glanced at Hawke, and waved his hand in disgust. \"Alright, pack up this foreigner and that bunch of guys and send them away!\"","\"Yes!\" the men in black responded.","Jesse could barely understand some of the Dragon Kingdom's language. Hearing the words \"send them away\" at the end of Ma Da's sentence, he began to feel uneasy again.","Send away?","Send them where?","He knew that the language of the Dragon Kingdom had always been profound and expansive. The phrase \"send away\" could have many meanings, such as seeing a guest out or escorting someone, which were friendly intentions.","However, \"send away\" could also mean physical elimination or eco-friendly disposal.","Looking at the way these men in black operated, the latter was obviously much more likely!","The more Jesse thought about it, the colder his heart grew. He looked again at Ma Da's chubby, almost cute profile and subconsciously swallowed hard.","Just what kind of monsters were working under Miss Liu Yutong!","Ma Da turned around and looked at the inexplicably trembling Jesse, feeling a bit confused. Was this guy having a malarial shiver?","Sure enough, foreigners were just uninhibited, entirely shameless.","\"Let's go, Mr. Jesse. The trouble is solved, and we should go back to report to the Eldest Miss.\"","Jesse stuttered in his broken Chinese, \"O... okay... Mr. Ma... you... after you!\"","Right now, he only had one thought in mind: to return to Italy immediately!","The waters of Pearl City were far too deep!","...","This was Jesse's first time visiting Liu Yutong's home, and his second time seeing her in person.","His mood at this moment was completely different from the last time.","Last time, he had still carried a bit of superiority from the Collaro family, feeling that he could stand on equal footing with her. But this time, he felt like a rabbit that had mistakenly wandered into a tiger's den, taking every step with extreme caution for fear of angering the other party.","This was also his most visceral realization during his time in Pearl City.","Only by coming to Pearl City could he truly feel the formidable power of the Wanlong Syndicate.","Such as the black-clad gangsters seen everywhere on the streets, the various terrifying rumors about the Wanlong Syndicate passed around by street thugs, and the scene he had just witnessed with his own eyes...","The source of all this stemmed from the incredibly beautiful woman right in front of him.","There is a saying that you can't judge a book by its cover, and it was perfectly exemplified here.","Who could have imagined that a woman whose looks surpassed those of female celebrities by several degrees was secretly a ruthless and black-hearted syndicate boss?","When Jesse walked into the living room, Liu Yutong was sitting on the sofa, holding a steaming cup of clear tea in her hands, her posture elegant and composed.","Today, she was wearing a simple silk shirt, her long black hair draped casually over her shoulders. She looked very much like the gentle and demure Oriental woman from Jesse's previous stereotypes.","Incredibly beautiful and graceful!","But he knew that beneath this highly deceptive exterior lay a depth of cunning and ruthlessness sufficient to strike fear into the hearts of many.","Without such cunning and ruthlessness, how could a woman possibly develop the Wanlong Syndicate to such a massive scale?","\"Miss... Miss Liu.\"","Jesse approached Liu Yutong and subconsciously gave a slight bow. \"Thank you very much... and Mr. Ma Da, for saving my life today.\"","Liu Yutong put down the teacup in her hands and raised her eyes to look at him. \"Take a seat, Mr. Jesse.\"","Jesse sat down on the side sofa, his back perfectly straight, his attitude as sincere as if he were facing a reprimand from a family elder.","Liu Yutong took the badge that Ma Da handed to her and asked directly, \"Mr. Jesse, I heard that you were all fighting over this badge?\"","Jesse nodded hastily. \"Y... yes, Miss Liu. It's because of this damn badge that that treacherous Hawke actually hired people to ambush me. If Mr. Ma Da hadn't arrived in time, I'm afraid I would have gone to see my great-grandmother!\"","Liu Yutong asked, \"You care so much about this badge. Does it hold some kind of secret? Is it convenient for you to tell me about it?\"","She asked this on purpose, just to see exactly how much this guy knew.","Jesse hesitated for a moment but ultimately decided to confess. After all, the lady in front of him had just saved his life. Of course, the most crucial factor was her terrifying identity.","\"It's a long story. The badge in your hand is actually a token of our Collaro family.\"","\"Just a token? Is there anything else?\"","\"It is said that the badge also hides a certain secret, or a clue to a massive fortune. Miss Liu, that's all I know. To tell you the truth, the Collaro family is not in a good situation right now, and there is some internal turmoil. My father hopes that I can use this to turn the tide and consolidate our position within the family.\"","Liu Yutong listened quietly, her face betraying no expression.","Just when Jesse thought she would want to keep it for herself after hearing the secret of the badge, she made a move that left him completely dumbfounded.","He saw her casually toss the badge over to him.","\"Catch.\"","Jesse scrambled to catch it. After confirming that the badge was indeed his family's lost token, he looked up at Liu Yutong, somewhat in disbelief. \"Miss... Miss Liu, what... what are you doing?\"","\"Since it's your family's token and it's so important to you, I'll return it to you,\" Liu Yutong said casually.","Jesse instantly became excited and thanked her repeatedly. \"Thank you! Thank you, Miss Liu! You are truly too generous! I don't know how to properly thank you!\"","Right now, he felt that Liu Yutong's image had become incredibly grand. He even thought that perhaps Miss Liu wasn't as terrifying as the rumors suggested, but rather quite reasonable and understanding.","Just then, Liu Yutong made a request. \"I'm very curious about what exactly is hidden inside. Open it up right now and let's take a look.\"","\"R... right now?\" The expression on Jesse's face froze, and one of his hands subconsciously reached for the pocket where he kept the key.","Could it be that she intentionally returned the badge to him just to trick him into opening it?","\"What, is it inconvenient?\" Liu Yutong asked.","\"No, no, no! It's convenient! Of course it is!\" Jesse shook his head hastily.","He had no choice now. Since Liu Yutong had spoken, the consequences would be unpredictable if he refused.","Just thinking about Hawke's fate made that perfectly clear.","Suppressing a trace of unease in his heart, Jesse took the key out of his pocket and inserted it into a particularly hidden small hole on the badge.","However, the mechanism felt a bit stiff.","But he didn't think much of it and twisted the key with a slight flick of his wrist. Then, he heard a sharp crack!","A heartbreaking sound of something snapping rang out, and the expression on his face instantly solidified.","A moment later.","Jesse slowly pulled out the key. It was only half a key. The other half had shockingly snapped off inside the badge's keyhole, fitting so tightly that it was completely impossible to ever get it out again.","He stared blankly at the key, his mind going completely blank.","\"No! This is impossible! How could it break?!\"","\"It's over! It's all over!\"","\"The Collaro family is finished! Our last hope is gone! How am I supposed to explain this when I go back?!\" Jesse fell into absolute despair, his tears finally welling up uncontrollably.","Liu Yutong did not comfort him, nor did she show any reaction at all. She merely watched his performance in silence.","Two minutes later.","Jesse finally recovered from his overwhelming grief. When he looked at Liu Yutong again, he noticed the dazzling red diamond necklace around her neck.","Wait!","Why did this necklace look so familiar to him?","Then, his gaze snapped to a yellowed photograph casually placed on the living room counter. He had noticed it when he first entered the house, but intimidated by Liu Yutong's overbearing presence, he had not dared to look closely.","Now, the simultaneous appearance of these two familiar items instantly triggered a memory.","It was a story his late grandfather had told him when he was a child.","Jesse was certain the necklace looked exactly like the precious token his grandfather had mentioned. Moreover, one of the people in the photograph looked remarkably like his grandfather's father, which was his own great-grandfather.","\"Miss Liu, how... how do you have this necklace? And how do you have a picture of my great-grandfather?\"","Suddenly, a wild possibility struck him.","\"Great... Great-grandmother? Could it be that you are my great-grandmother?\"","Liu Yutong: \"???\"","Who is your great-grandmother?","Did the emotional rollercoaster completely fry this guy's brain?"]},{"number":574,"title":"Chapter 574: 574. Could it really be the great-grandma","paragraphs":["Pfft!!!","Cough, cough, cough...","Ma Da nearly spat out a mouthful of tea, his face turning completely red. He finally managed to catch his breath and burst into loud laughter. Hahaha... Boss, he actually called you Great-Grandma!","Isn't this guy stretching family ties a bit too far? Why not just call you his ancestor?!","Jesse looked serious: Can I call you that?","Ma Da: .......","Liu Yutong: .......","Ma Da, if you say one more word, I'll exile you to Africa!","Ma Da instantly shut up, covering his mouth tightly with both hands, not making another sound.","Liu Yutong had just wanted to tell Jesse, Don't just call me whatever, we have absolutely no relationship, but before the words could leave her mouth, she saw Jesse suddenly slap his thigh.","I... I figured it out!","Great-Grandma! I finally figured it out! Everything makes sense now! No wonder this necklace is with you, no wonder you have that photo.","You must be a descendant of my great-grandfather's godfather's family, right?","According to seniority, my great-grandfather called your great-grandfather his god-great-grandfather, which makes him my great-great-great-great-grandfather. You should be the great-granddaughter of my great-great-great-great-grandfather... Calculating it like this, you are exactly four generations above me, so you are indeed my Great-Grandma!","No wonder I felt you had an extraordinary aura the moment I saw you. It turns out we are family! Great-Grandma!","Great-Grandma! Your great-grandson Jesse was blind and offended you before, please forgive me. When I go back, I will tell my father that our Corraro family still has an honorable elder like you in the East. This is truly God's blessing!","Jesse kept calling her Great-Grandma, sounding smoother and more natural with every utterance, leaving Liu Yutong's mind completely buzzing.","What a mess, great-grandfathers and god-great-grandfathers.","She had only gotten her hands on this necklace and photo recently. How did a great-grandson suddenly pop out of nowhere? And a foreigner at that.","But she couldn't outright deny it at the moment. After all, Jesse recognized these two items. If she cleared up the relationship, how would she explain their origins? She could tell this guy didn't know these things were related to the badge.","Liu Yutong pondered for a moment and had no choice but to give an ambiguous answer: Mr. Jesse, as long as you understand it in your heart, there is no need to make a big deal out of it.","Neither confirming nor denying, think whatever you want.","Jesse was instantly overjoyed: Great-Grandma admitted it! She admitted it! She acknowledged him as her great-grandson.","Yes, Great-Grandma! I understand. I will only tell my father that I found his dear grandmother.","Liu Yutong: ......","Stop calling me Great-Grandma!","Jesse: Okay, Great-Grandma!",".......","Hearing Jesse constantly call her Great-Grandma, Liu Yutong felt her temples throbbing. I don't have a grandson like you!","She directly changed the subject.","Mr. Jesse, since the items have been returned to their rightful owner, what are your plans next?","This question instantly hit Jesse's sore spot. He looked down at the broken key and badge in his hand, and the excitement of just recognizing his relative dissipated, leaving him dispirited again.","Perhaps because he suddenly had a relative thousands of miles away, he stopped hiding things and opened up, revealing the predicament he faced.","Great-Grandma, to tell you the truth, the Corraro family is now like a sinking broken ship, unable to hold on much longer.","My father, who is your grandson, the head of the Corraro family, was in a car accident three months ago. Although he survived, his legs are crippled, and his spirit is much worse than before. It's hard for him to take charge of the overall situation now. My uncle, Carl Corraro, took the opportunity to win over and threaten the elders and core members of the gang. Now, over sixty percent of the family's businesses and armed forces are secretly or openly controlled by him.","Carl tells outsiders it's for the stability of the family, but he really just wants to seize power. Those loyal to my father have either been marginalized or suffered various accidents. Now everyone within the family is in a state of panic, and fewer and fewer people dare to speak up for my father and me.","My father said that this badge is a family heirloom. If we get the things inside, we have a chance to turn the tables... But now, I've actually ruined the item!","I am a sinner of the family!","The more Jesse spoke, the more he blamed himself, feeling so frustrated that he wanted to slap himself a few times. As for why he didn't do it, it was because he was afraid of pain.","Great-Grandma, without the items in the heirloom, going back would be walking right into a trap. My uncle will definitely not let me off!","Great-Grandma... How about you take me in?","Beside them, Ma Da couldn't help but interject: If the Boss takes you in, what about your dad? Your dad is counting on you to go back.","Jesse: It's fine. I'll tell my dad that from now on I'll be fulfilling my filial duties by Great-Grandma's side. Even if he gets offed by my uncle, he won't have any complaints.","Ma Da: ......","You really are a damn dutiful son!","Right at this moment, Liu Yutong slowly stood up and went upstairs. When she came down, she had a check in her hand and handed it to Jesse.","Take it.","Jesse subconsciously took it, looked down, and his pupils shrank sharply.","The amount column on the check had a long string of numbers: $20,000,000.00.","Twenty million US dollars!","He abruptly raised his head, looking at Liu Yutong in disbelief.","Great-Grandma... is... is this for me?","This sum of money was undoubtedly timely help for him, who was at the end of his rope. The reason his uncle was able to control the family in a short time was, aside from force, using money to buy people off.","Now that he had such a large sum of money, he had much more room to maneuver. Plus, there were inherently more family elders loyal to his father, so he had a complete chance to regain the family's power.","At the same time, he felt incredibly moved in his heart.","If acknowledging her as a relative before had a hint of deliberate social climbing, at this moment, he was truly a bit swayed.","Could it be that he really met his true Great-Grandma by some stroke of destiny?","It must be! It must be!","Otherwise, who would be so generous, giving away twenty million US dollars right off the bat!","Sure enough, Great-Grandma still doted on her great-grandson.","Great-Grandma, you are too good to me! In the future, I will definitely care for you in your old age and give you a proper burial!","Liu Yutong: ...","Shut up! Take the money and get back as soon as possible. Contact me after you've handled your family's affairs; I still have tasks for you to do.","Yes! Yes! Great-Grandma! Rest assured! I will definitely not let you down! Jesse guaranteed with high fighting spirit.","After he left.","Ma Da couldn't help but ask: Boss, you just gave him the money like that? That's twenty million bucks. What if this kid takes the money and runs?","Liu Yutong didn't care: If he runs, he runs. The money was free anyway.","She was telling the truth; she really didn't care much.","This money, along with the Longxi necklace around her neck, was originally a windfall anyway.","If Jesse proved his worth, managed to regain control of his family, and kept his promise, he could become a major asset to her in the future. But if he dared to go back on his word... she had more than enough ways to make his life difficult.","Not long after Jesse left, Liu Yutong received a phone call. It was news that Shen Hao had gotten into a massive physical altercation with his family, and things had completely escalated out of control!"]},{"number":575,"title":"Chapter 575: 575, The Plan","paragraphs":["\"They're fighting? Is Shen Hao that brave? He's taking on his whole family by himself?\" Liu Yutong was extremely surprised.","Although she had long known that Shen Hao's relationship with his family wasn't great, she never expected it to deteriorate to this extent, to the point of actually coming to blows.","On the other end of the phone, Gu Yebai said,","\"Well, not exactly. It wasn't a physical fight, but Shen Hao has completely broken ties with his family. Shen Hao was a bit impulsive this time; he tried to seize power by winning over the company's shareholders. But his family found out about his plan, so naturally, it failed. Unwilling to accept defeat, he leveraged himself to buy a massive amount of shares from the secondary market. However, just as his holdings reached 4.9%, someone suddenly initiated a massive sell-off, crashing the stock price. The kid was completely blindsided and lost a fortune.\"","\"He later found out that it was all his two younger brothers' doing. One of them manipulated the market behind the scenes, while the other pretended to support him by his side, only to extract information and set a trap for him.\"","At this point, Gu Yebai couldn't help but laugh out loud.","\"Shen Hao really lost his head. How could a listed company be so easily taken over by him? Not to mention his family's company has a poison pill plan.\"","As the name suggests, this poison pill plan is an extremely ruthless defensive strategy.","Once someone attempts a hostile takeover of shares without the board's approval, the poison pill can be activated. The company can issue a massive amount of new shares at a low price to all existing shareholders except the acquirer, instantly diluting the acquirer's ownership percentage and voting power. This drastically increases the cost of the takeover, which is enough to scare off outside predators.","Years ago, when a certain capital firm wanted to swallow up Xinlang, Xinlang used this exact move to defeat the acquirer.","However, this tactic isn't entirely beneficial; it's a double-edged sword that harms the user almost as much as the enemy. Because doing so damages the interests of all shareholders, no one would use it unless absolutely necessary.","After listening to Gu Yebai's account, Liu Yutong pondered for a moment and asked, \"Where is he now?\"","Gu Yebai replied over the phone, \"Where else could he be? He's sulking and drinking alone in his private apartment. I heard his dad came back and gave him a severe scolding, saying that if he keeps disobeying and messing around, he'll disown him and kick him out of the house.\"","\"Sister Yutong, do you have a way to help him? I'm just afraid he'll act impulsively again and ask for the money he invested in Yunshan Capital back. If he loses his mind and throws it all into the stock market, he'll really lose everything.\"","\"I'll think of something. Tell him not to do anything rash. Also, tell Silin that if Shen Hao wants to withdraw his shares from Yunshan Capital, reject him immediately! Tell him I said so!\"","\"Understood!\"","Liu Yutong chatted with Gu Yebai for a few more minutes before hanging up.","At this time, Ma Da had nothing else to do, so he said goodbye and left first.","Afterward, Liu Yutong went upstairs and took a comfortable bath. Seeing that Yaya was already asleep, she returned to her bedroom, turned on her computer, and began researching information.","One of the main assets of Shen Hao's family was a listed company called Qiming Electric.","Qiming Electric was a leading enterprise in the domestic home appliance industry, primarily producing and selling white goods such as air conditioners, refrigerators, and washing machines. It had a comprehensive sales network across the country, and its export business accounted for the highest percentage among similar domestic companies. Its current total market value was about 28.5 billion yuan, over 10 billion lower than it was half a year ago.","This market value was actually very unhealthy, or rather, severely undervalued.","There were two main reasons for the sluggish stock price of Qiming Electric.","First, the financial crisis this year caused market panic to spread, leading to a decline in the stock prices of many companies.","Second, Shen Hao's family was intentionally suppressing the stock price. Even if Shen Hao hadn't impulsively tried to seize power, the stock price would have continued to drop.","Under normal circumstances, a company's major shareholders naturally want the stock price to be as high as possible; a low stock price does not align with their interests. The reason Liu Yutong deduced that Shen Hao's family wanted to suppress the stock price was that she had also been paying attention to Qiming Electric, naturally because of Shen Hao.","As a member of the Yunshan Club, it was impossible for Liu Yutong to know absolutely nothing about his background.","Combining this with the information she had just researched, she confirmed that Shen Hao's family was indeed deliberately suppressing Qiming Electric's stock price. There was one piece of data to support her view: Shen Hao's family currently held about 19% of the shares, whereas a month ago, this figure was only 15%. It had grown by 4% in just a short month.","It is well known that the country has always followed the principle of equal rights for equal shares; the higher the shareholding ratio, the greater the say. A 15% shareholding ratio was actually on the lower side. Even with a poison pill plan as a defense, there was still a risk of being swallowed up by certain capital tycoons.","Shen Hao's family had clearly realized this problem, and coincidentally encountering the outbreak of the financial crisis, they began scheming to secretly buy back shares at a low price. That silly boy Shen Hao could completely be said to have thrown himself right into his own family's line of fire.","However, Qiming Electric's current stock price was completely unsuited to its true value, and by doing this, they were also harming the interests of other shareholders.","In addition to this, Liu Yutong speculated that there should be another reason why Shen Hao's family was so eager to buy back stock.","She clicked open the calendar on her computer and checked the date.","The time for the government to announce the Four Trillion Yuan Stimulus Package and the Home Appliances Going to the Countryside policy was not far away.","Liu Yutong guessed that the other party had probably caught wind of it too.","\"What a clever calculation,\" she sneered after thinking it through.","The Shen family was indeed seasoned and ruthless in their capital operations and tactics. They used this to solve internal hidden dangers, consolidate their control over the company, and take advantage of national policies to make a massive fortune.","However, they seemed to have overlooked one point: listing a gold mine for sale as scrap metal comes with risks.","After figuring everything out, Liu Yutong personally called Shen Hao. The phone call lasted for nearly an hour.","Next, she contacted Zhu Silin and arranged a time to meet, finally bringing matters to a close for the moment.","Having finished all this, Liu Yutong turned off her computer and walked over to the huge floor-to-ceiling window.","At this moment, the night view of the residential area outside the window turned into a chessboard in her eyes. The Shen family's supposedly brilliant layout was, in her opinion, actually full of loopholes.","The Shen family's actions were inherently a violation of the rules. As long as she had an insider helping to collect evidence, she could use it as leverage to render their poison pill plan completely ineffective. When the time came, she could sweep up shares in the secondary market, and then declare her stake! Declare again! And declare again!","Until a complete change of regime!"]},{"number":576,"title":"Chapter 576: 576. The Anniversary of the School is Coming.","paragraphs":["Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, it was the day of the University of Finance and Economics' fiftieth-anniversary celebration.","On this day, the university gates were festooned with red banners and decorations, with an endless stream of vehicles and people coming and going.","The anniversary ceremony was scheduled to officially begin at 10:00 AM. Liu Yutong arrived at the university at around 8:50 AM.","As soon as she got out of the car, she saw Lin Lele hurrying over to greet her. Lin Lele wore a bright red sash diagonally across her chest, clearly indicating she was a student cadre selected specifically to receive important alumni and guests.","\"Class Monitor, you're here! According to the arrangement, I'll be guiding you to the Jinghua Pavilion VIP lounge. The university leaders and several prominent alumni who arrived early are all over there.\"","Liu Yutong smiled and said, \"It's not like I'm unfamiliar with the university. Are you afraid I'll get lost?\"","Lin Lele replied, \"Oh, it's just proper etiquette. Whether you know your way or not, I have to lead you. Besides, you are now a VIP guest at Jinghua Pavilion and our university's student representative. It's an honor for me to show you the way.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"What kind of VIP am I? I haven't even graduated from college yet.\"","Lin Lele affectionately linked arms with her. \"Oh, come on, let's go.\"","Before long, the two arrived in front of Jinghua Pavilion.","Looking at the three familiar large characters above the lintel, Liu Yutong felt deeply moved. A year ago, she was a student cadre responsible for receiving VIPs here; now, she had become the VIP being received.","As soon as Liu Yutong walked inside Jinghua Pavilion, she saw many men and women dressed in suits, exuding an extraordinary aura.","Most of these people were distinguished alumni who had graduated from the university. Today, they held considerable influence in politics, finance, industry, and various other fields.","The moment Liu Yutong made her appearance, someone took the initiative to greet her.","\"Director Liu, I didn't expect it to really be you!\" a slightly surprised voice called out.","Liu Yutong looked toward the voice and saw a slightly plump middle-aged man walking toward her with a smile. It was President Zhang of Suning, whom she had met briefly once last year.","\"President Zhang, long time no see,\" Liu Yutong smiled faintly, elegantly reaching out to shake his hand.","President Zhang's greeting of \"Director Liu\" was quite loud, immediately catching the attention of several friends he had just been talking with.","Those individuals were all successful alumni or specially invited figures from the financial and business sectors.","At this moment, they still carried a bit of the natural arrogance of successful people, curiously sizing up the exceptionally young and beautiful girl standing in front of President Zhang.","President Zhang clearly wanted to show off his connections to them. He enthusiastically introduced her to his group of friends, \"Come, come, let me introduce you. This is the current star of the university, Liu Yutong, Director Liu! She is a junior alumna to some of you here!\"","\"Liu Yutong?\" A few of them felt the name sounded somewhat familiar.","\"Are you the chairwoman of the Wanlonghui Group?\"","With that reminder, the others also remembered.","\"It's that Wanlonghui Group, I remember now. The largest supermarket chain in Pearl City right now, as well as that highly popular group-buying website Wanhui Youxuan, are both under the Wanlonghui Group, right?\"","\"Wow, that's impressive! I saw the news; Wanhui Youxuan's Series B valuation reached 2.2 billion. If it goes public in the future, that will be incredible!\"","\"Yes! Absolutely!\"","\"...\"","Seeing everyone's reactions, President Zhang felt very proud, as if he had discovered Liu Yutong himself. \"That's right, she is Director Liu of the Wanlonghui Group! You guys don't know, but when I met Director Liu last year, she was just a college freshman. I wanted to poach her for my company back then, but unfortunately, I was rejected. I never expected that after just one year, she would become the chairwoman of the Wanlonghui Group. It's truly amazing.\"","As soon as he said this, the eyes of the several executives who didn't know Liu Yutong and had just been looking at her with scrutinizing gazes instantly changed. The arrogance they carried vanished without a trace, replaced by shock and fervent interest.","\"What? President Zhang, are you saying that Director Liu started her business in her freshman year?\"","\"Our junior is also the university's student representative. If I remember correctly, she should only be a sophomore, right?\"","\"Doesn't that mean in just one year, she built a massive group worth billions and became its chairwoman?\"","\"A sophomore chairwoman worth billions!\"","\"Hiss~\"","Everyone couldn't help but gasp in shock; this seemed to shatter their understanding of the world.","A sophomore, not even twenty years old, had already reached heights that many could never achieve in their lifetimes, becoming the chairwoman of a corporate group.","What kind of genius was this!","Everyone present, whether investors or entrepreneurs, had only achieved success after years of hard work. And the vast majority of them had only slowly made their mark after graduating from college.","But the girl before them had started her business in her freshman year and became a billionaire in just one year, with her company valued in the billions. It was simply terrifying!","What they didn't know was that they were still vastly underestimating the girl in front of them. In reality, the wealth she controlled had long surpassed ten billion. If they knew that, they would probably jump up in fright and call her an absolute monster!","In an instant, several people gathered around Liu Yutong, eagerly introducing themselves.","\"Junior Liu, truly a young hero... no, a young heroine! Hahaha! I'm Li Da from Tianyu Investments. We should definitely keep in touch.\"","\"Director Liu, I'm Liu Ziyu from Ruihua Securities. If you ever need services related to opening security accounts, just let me know.\"","\"Junior Liu, do you remember me? I'm your senior, Wang Meng. We met last year, right here. I'm in the import and export trade. If you have any good projects in the future, please keep your senior in mind.\"","\"Junior Liu...\"","\"Junior...\"","\"Director Liu...\"","\"...\"","For a time, the titles \"Junior\" and \"Director Liu\" constantly rang in Liu Yutong's ears.","This group of figures, who normally dominated their respective fields, had now lowered their pride, using their status as alumni to build a relationship with Liu Yutong.","After all, in the face of absolute strength, seniority and age no longer mattered. Moreover, this young junior was still so young; her future achievements would undoubtedly be limitless. If they didn't make connections with her now, when would they?","A smile remained on Liu Yutong's face as she calmly exchanged pleasantries and business cards with them.","After the greetings concluded, President Zhang deliberately sought Liu Yutong out for a private chat.","\"Director Liu, could you save a spot for me at your Wanlong Plaza? I feel that your location is excellent, and Suning is planning to open a direct-sale store there.\"","\"That is naturally not a problem. I couldn't be more welcoming of Suning moving in.\"","\"Hahaha, then it's settled.\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong then noticed that President Huang, whom she had met last year, didn't seem to be present this year, so she casually asked, \"President Zhang, did President Huang not come this year?\"","She thought to herself, could it be that this guy had already been thrown into prison?","President Zhang shook his head. \"I am really not sure about that. As you can probably tell, he and I have never seen eye to eye.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, then asked another question half-jokingly, \"President Zhang, Suning is growing with such great momentum right now. When do you plan to surpass Guomei and take the top spot in the domestic home appliance retail industry?\"","These words hit President Zhang right in his sweet spot, as this had always been his ultimate goal. Of course, he still had to act a little modest on the surface.","\"Director Liu, to tell you the truth, everyone at Suning from top to bottom is...\"","Before President Zhang could finish his sentence, a rather domineering voice suddenly rang out behind the two of them.","\"President Zhang wants to claim the top spot, but have you asked me first?!\"","The two turned around to find that the newcomer was none other than the wealthiest man, Huang Yu. His way of speaking was just as overbearing as ever.","\"President Zhang, I suggest you think it over and just sell Suning to me. As long as I am around, your Suning will only ever be in second place!\""]},{"number":577,"title":"Chapter 577: 577. Negotiations Fail, Leading to Renewed Hostilities.","paragraphs":["Hearing Huang Yu's words, President Zhang's face instantly darkened, but he showed no sign of weakness.","\"President Huang is as sharp-tongued as ever! However, morale is high across the board at Suning, and our market share has increased by another two percentage points this quarter. You had better be careful, President Huang, lest you accidentally get overtaken and pushed aside by us from behind.\"","Upon hearing this, Huang Yu slightly raised an eyebrow, revealing an arrogant expression. \"It is a good thing to have fighting spirit. But President Zhang, in the face of an absolute gap in strength, fighting spirit alone is not enough. I am destined to be a mountain you can never overcome.\"","Seeing the smell of gunpowder between the two growing stronger and a dispute about to break out again, several familiar executives around them quickly smiled and tried to smooth things over.","\"President Zhang, President Huang, are you two going to spar right in front of us?\"","\"Exactly. Everyone here is a prominent figure, it wouldn't look good to make things too stiff.\"","\"Healthy competition is a good thing. With your two companies chasing each other, those of us in the supporting industries can finally make a living.\"","\"Right, right. Today is the anniversary of the University of Finance and Economics. Let's not talk about business, just catch up on old times.\"","\"..........\"","Under the crowd's persuasion, the tense atmosphere from just a moment ago gradually eased.","Huang Yu adjusted the collar of his suit, showing an expression of disdain to argue further, and turned to leave.","Just then, a clear female voice rang out.","\"President Huang, please wait a moment.\"","Only then did Huang Yu seem to notice Liu Yutong, his tone noticeably cold. \"If it isn't Chairwoman Liu. Is there something you need?\"","Liu Yutong had ruined his plans back in Great South City and hadn't given him, the richest man, any face at all. Naturally, he wouldn't show her a good attitude.","Liu Yutong didn't mind his attitude towards her at all and smiled brightly. \"President Huang, I do have a matter I'd like to discuss with you privately. I wonder if you would do me the honor of stepping aside for a word?\"","Huang Yu raised an eyebrow, seemingly a bit surprised by Liu Yutong's reaction.","\"Oh? Discuss with me? Whatever it is, Chairwoman Liu, you might as well just say it right here.\"","\"There are too many people here, it's hard to explain clearly. President Huang, please come this way.\"","Huang Yu stared at her for a few seconds before finally nodding. \"Let's go.\"","The two walked one after the other to a relatively quiet corner of the VIP room.","Huang Yu stopped first and turned to look at Liu Yutong. \"You can speak now, right?\"","Seeing this, Liu Yutong got straight to the point. \"President Huang is a straightforward person, so I won't beat around the bush either. As far as I know, you hold about 8% of the shares in Qiming Electric under your name. I would like to ask if you have any intention of transferring these shares?\"","Hearing her idea, Huang Yu's eyes instantly became sharp. \"Qiming Electric? Chairwoman Liu, are you joking with me?\"","Liu Yutong: \"I am serious. As for the price, we can negotiate based on a 10% premium over the market price.\"","Huang Yu suddenly sneered and flatly refused. \"Impossible! Have you forgotten what my company does? Since you have your eyes on Qiming Electric just like me, you should also be able to see that its current price is undervalued, right? Isn't it ridiculous that you want the shares in my hands for this little amount of money?\"","Hearing him say this, Liu Yutong sighed inwardly: Sure enough, there are still many smart people in the world.","She was able to assess that Qiming Electric's value was mismatched mainly because she knew that the four-trillion stimulus plan and the home appliances going to the countryside policy were about to be introduced. Even if Qiming Electric was currently at a high point, as soon as these two policies were announced, the stock price would skyrocket all the same.","But Huang Yu, relying entirely on his business intuition, had quietly acquired 8% of the shares, becoming the second-largest shareholder of Qiming Electric. If Qiming Electric hadn't had a poison pill plan in place, with his personality, he probably would have already made a move to seize control of the company.","\"I naturally admire President Huang's business acumen. However, since you also believe that Qiming Electric is undervalued, we can completely cooperate this once.\" Liu Yutong didn't shy away and spoke frankly.","\"Cooperate?\"","Huang Yu acted as if he had heard a joke. \"Hahaha, Chairwoman Liu, have you forgotten what happened in Great South City?\"","\"Back in Great South City, you didn't leave me any face at all, slapping me right in the face. Do you think it's possible for me to cooperate with you? Just based on your talking?\"","\"Let me tell you, Liu Yutong, I, Huang Yu, have been struggling in the business world for so many years, and what I despise the most are arrogant young people like you who don't know the immensity of heaven and earth. You want to buy the shares in my hands? Keep dreaming!\"","The smile on Liu Yutong's face gradually disappeared. \"President Huang, we are discussing business, why resort to personal attacks?\"","Huang Yu coldly snorted again. \"I have no business to discuss with you. Even if the shares of Qiming Electric rot in my hands, I will never sell them to you!\"","\"I also want to remind everyone here to be careful when cooperating with this kind of young person who doesn't respect her elders and ignores the rules. Who knows, one day she might stab you in the back.\"","He deliberately said his last sentence very loudly, so many people around heard it.","The guests looked at each other in dismay, muttering in their hearts: How did Liu Yutong provoke the richest man?","After hearing this, Liu Yutong was no longer polite with him either. \"President Huang, I have taken note of what you said today.\"","\"I also want to remind you that if you walk by the river often enough, your shoes are bound to get wet. President Huang, you'd better be careful in the future!\"","After speaking, she didn't cast another glance at Huang Yu and turned straight around to leave.","Little did she know, her last sentence left everyone present dumbfounded.","\"Damn! Did I hear that right? Is Junior Sister Liu threatening the richest man?\"","\"You heard right, our junior sister is quite formidable!\"","\"Crazy! Absolutely crazy! It's not that I don't support our junior sister, but given Huang Yu's status in the business world, no matter how capable she is, she shouldn't have said that, right?\"","\"I actually think this little girl is not simple. Think about it, would someone who can build an enterprise to this scale within a year be reckless? For her to dare say that, she is either young, frivolous, and suicidal, or she truly has guts.\"","\"It's a good thing for young people to have drive, but in the end, the business world relies on strength to speak.\"","\"Well said!\"","\".........\"","President Zhang, on the other hand, really admired Liu Yutong. This girl was truly brave and full of domineering aura. Although he hoped she could bring Huang Yu down, just thinking about it made him realize it was impossible.","The two were not on the same level at all. One was the richest man, and the other was just a rising local tycoon. How could they compare?","But for some reason, he still couldn't help but have an absurd thought pop into his mind.","What if Huang Yu really got taken down by this girl?","He had also vaguely heard some rumors that the Longhui Group was not simple, having connections in both the lawful and unlawful worlds, especially on the dark side, where their strength was terrifyingly formidable.","If that were the case, then President Huang might really be in trouble...","No matter how wealthy the richest man was, you wouldn't dare casually offend an underworld-linked syndicate, right?","Unless you had a death wish.","On the other side, several executives who were closely associated with Huang Yu also gathered together to chat.","\"Mr. Huang, this girl is too arrogant. Should we teach her a lesson?\" a balding man said as he leaned in close to Huang Yu.","This man was Huang Yu's supplier. Since he relied on Huang for his livelihood, it was only natural that he spoke up on his behalf.","Huang Yu's expression was grim. In all his years, this was the first time he had been publicly threatened by a junior young enough to be his own daughter. What infuriated him even more was Liu Yutong's attitude as she left, acting as if he were completely beneath her notice.","Truth be told, deep down, he was actually a tiny bit afraid of her. Because of the Great South City incident, he had eventually caught wind of exactly how Master Jiu had been 'taken care of'.","This girl was truly ruthless to the core!","However, he certainly wasn't going to admit his fear out loud.","\"There is no need. I would like to see just what an ignorant little girl who doesn't know her place can possibly do to me!\""]},{"number":578,"title":"Chapter 578: 578, School Anniversary Speech, Liquidation","paragraphs":["As everyone waited, the time for the 50th-anniversary celebration of the University of Finance and Economics drew nearer.","\"The leaders have arrived, let's go greet them,\" someone reminded the group.","\"Let's go together!\"","With that, the VIPs in the Jinghua Pavilion headed to the lobby entrance together to welcome them.","Soon, a group of leaders dressed in administrative jackets approached them, accompanied by university staff. The middle-aged man leading the group was none other than Li Xiaohui's father. Beside him were the leaders of Pearl City, the president of the university, and other school officials.","The leaders shook hands with the VIPs of Jinghua Pavilion one by one. When the top leader shook hands with Liu Yutong, he deliberately added that he wanted to speak with her privately after the celebration.","Liu Yutong, who had been quite calm up until now, couldn't help but mutter in her heart: Was he going to settle a score with her?","Ever since Li Xiaohui joined the Wanlong Association, she had worried this day would come. Especially now that Li Xiaohui was acting more and more like an internet-addicted teen, it wasn't impossible for her father to come looking for trouble.","Well, since it's come to this, she would just have to face it. If they needed to talk, they would talk.","After the leaders exchanged a few more pleasantries with the crowd, the large group marched grandly toward the main sports field.","By the time Liu Yutong and the leaders arrived, the students and faculty were already in their seats. Tens of thousands of people gathered together, making for an incredibly grand and spectacular scene.","It even sparked a thought in Liu Yutong's mind: when could the Wanlong Association host a gathering of tens of thousands? Just imagining that scene was...","Normally, given Liu Yutong's status, she should have been sitting with her class, as she was still a current student at the university.","But this time, the school deliberately arranged for her to sit in the second row, alongside a dozen prominent alumni. As for the row on the rostrum, it was naturally reserved for the visiting leaders and school officials.","Shortly after she sat down, the ceremony officially kicked off with the majestic sound of the national anthem. The entire audience stood up, and tens of thousands sang the anthem together. The momentum was magnificent. Even the elites from various fields, who were used to grand occasions, looked solemn and sang along with surging emotions.","After the flag-raising ceremony, the university president took the stage first to give a speech.","He reviewed the university's ups and downs over the past fifty years, detailed its educational achievements, and thanked alumni from all walks of life for their support of their alma mater.","When the speech ended, warm applause erupted across the venue.","Next, the leaders spoke in turn, speaking highly of the university's academic accomplishments and expressing earnest expectations for its future development.","Following that were speeches from prominent alumni representatives.","The speech segment alone took over an hour.","After everyone finished speaking, the host finally announced, \"Next, please welcome our student representative and the Chairman of Wanlong Group, student Liu Yutong, to deliver a speech!\"","As soon as the words fell, the entire sports field instantly boiled over with excitement.","Compared to the seniors and leaders, the students in the audience were clearly more eager to hear Liu Yutong speak. This was easy to understand, as Liu Yutong was their peer.","Moreover, this peer was a current student and a prominent figure on campus.","Just thinking about her age and achievements, it was hard not to feel admiration, well, and a bit of awe.","In short, everyone showed immense enthusiasm for Liu Yutong, far exceeding the warmth shown to the prominent alumni and business seniors who spoke earlier.","The top leader sitting in the center of the rostrum saw this, turned to the president, and smiled, \"It seems student Liu Yutong is very popular among her peers.\"","The president smiled in response, \"Yes, she is now the pride of our university.\"","Liu Yutong walked up to the podium. She first bowed to the leaders on the rostrum, then turned and bowed to the faculty and students. This gesture drew another round of applause.","She waited for the applause to die down before she began her speech.","Unlike the lengthy speeches of the leaders before her, her speech was relatively short, ending in just a few minutes.","\"Here, on behalf of all current students, I solemnly promise our alma mater: We will live up to our youth, forge ahead, and repay our alma mater's nurturing grace with outstanding achievements!\"","\"I also want to take this opportunity to say to the students here today: Please cherish every day at the university. Be brave to try, to innovate, and to chase your dreams! Thank you all!\"","With Liu Yutong's speech concluded, the celebration drew to a close, and it was time for lunch.","Naturally, lunch was to be eaten in the school cafeteria.","The school had originally arranged for the leaders and alumni to dine on the second floor, but the top leader chose to eat with the students on the first floor, hoping to chat with them about their studies and daily lives.","Liu Yutong had wanted to find an inconspicuous seat to minimize her presence, but she was still invited by a secretary to join the top leader's table.","\"Come, come, student Liu, sit here.\"","\"Thank you, sir!\"","Liu Yutong sat down as told, but her heart was pounding. She noticed that the other regional leaders had been seated at the next table; only she and the top leader were at this table. This was clearly a deliberate arrangement.","The secretary then brought over two trays of food, one for the leader and one for her. Both were standard student meals: two meat dishes, two vegetable dishes, served with rice and the soup of the day.","Seeing the food arrive, the leader immediately ushered Liu Yutong, \"Come! Eat! Let's eat first!\"","The more polite the leader was, the more restless Liu Yutong felt. This meal was turning into mild torture.","It wasn't like she forced Li Xiaohui to get into esports; the girl simply loved esports and gaming too much. What was she supposed to do? She could only support her. She wasn't some old-fashioned pedant who viewed gaming and esports as a cancer.","She always firmly believed that as long as they were on the right path, working in the esports industry was nothing to be ashamed of. In the future, they might even win glory for the country.","After the two ate quietly for a few bites, the leader finally spoke up. \"What has Xiaohui been busy with lately? That child, every time she calls home, she rushes to hang up after just a few words and never wants to chat much with me.\"","Liu Yutong quickly replied, \"Xiaohui has indeed been quite busy recently. Aside from her studies, she is independently managing a project, so it's normal for her schedule to be tight. But, sir, she is working really hard.\"","The leader replied, \"Working hard? You mean working hard at playing games and doing that esports stuff?\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong's scalp tingled. She thought to herself: Sure enough, the reckoning has come."]},{"number":579,"title":"Chapter 579: 579. Is the leader interested in chips","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong was left speechless for a moment, not knowing how to answer, because she felt that no matter what she said, she would be held accountable.","She glanced down at her dinner plate and suddenly had a stroke of genius. Pointing at the plate, she asked, \"Leader, do you eat fish?\"","The leader waved his hand. \"No.\"","Before he could react, Liu Yutong picked up her chopsticks and snatched the small yellow croaker from his plate, dropping it onto her own.","\"Thank you, Leader.\"","The leader: \"...\"","What kind of move was that? Are young people nowadays all playing games like this?","No way, he had to get back at her.","He paused, then pointed at the braised pork. \"Do you eat braised pork?\"","\"I'll eat half!\"","Without any hesitation, Liu Yutong picked out the fattiest pieces of braised pork from her plate and placed them onto his.","The leader: \"...\"","He stared at the newly added pieces of pork—which were ninety percent fat and ten percent lean—and fell into deep thought.","Where exactly did things go wrong?","Wait, no, this girl was changing the subject.","\"Student Liu, what do you think about the current gaming industry, and that... what do you call it, e-sports? How are its development prospects?\"","Liu Yutong's chopsticks paused. She was genuinely a bit surprised, not expecting him to ask this. Weren't they supposed to be discussing why Li Xiaohui had become an internet-addicted teenage girl?","Speaking of Li Xiaohui, she hadn't even seen her yet. The girl was probably hiding from the leader on purpose.","\"Leader, if you are asking about its commercial value and development potential, then I believe e-sports will become an emerging industry worth hundreds of billions in the near future.\"","Throwing out such a massive number suddenly did take him slightly by surprise. For people of his generation, it was truly hard to imagine that a simple video game competition could generate such immense value.","\"Hundreds of billions? Isn't that a bit of an exaggeration? What is your basis for this?\"","\"First of all, the core audience for e-sports is young people aged 15 to 35. This demographic is not only massive in number but also possesses strong spending power. Secondly, the e-sports industry chain is very long. From game development, tournament operations, live broadcasting, and club management, all the way to merchandise and educational training, every single link can create tremendous economic value.\"","\"Take our neighbor, South Korea, for example. They have already built e-sports into a national-level cultural industry, which has not only driven economic growth but also enhanced the country's soft power. And our Dragon Kingdom has the largest number of gamers in the world; the potential of this market is immeasurable.\"","The leader nodded thoughtfully and asked a question that many people were currently concerned about: \"But there is a lot of negative public opinion regarding video games right now. How do you view this issue?\"","\"That is exactly the bottleneck we need to break through. We need to promote the professionalization and standardization of e-sports. For instance, establishing a comprehensive player training system, setting industry standards, and hosting high-level professional tournaments. When e-sports can demonstrate the same level of professionalism and competitiveness as traditional sports events, public perception will naturally shift.\"","\"Of course, gaming companies must also shoulder their social responsibilities, such as implementing effective anti-addiction systems and setting reasonable limits on playtime...\"","Liu Yutong explained a great deal, and the leader listened intently. He knew his daughter's stubborn temperament; once she set her mind on something, not even nine oxen could pull her back.","Besides, he had never forced his daughter to enter the civil service system anyway. He just didn't want her to truly become an idle, internet-addicted girl.","\"It seems you have thought this through very thoroughly. To be honest, when I first heard that Xiaohui was running off all day to play games and participate in some e-sports competitions, her mother and I were very worried. But hearing you put it this way, I actually think it might not be a bad idea for her to work in this industry.\"","\"However, as a father, I still hope you all can maintain a proper balance.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"We will. Please don't worry, Leader.\"","\"Actually, Xiaohui mentions you and Auntie to me quite often. She says you have always supported her choices and are very open-minded parents, for which she is always grateful.\"","\"Is that so?\" The leader chuckled. \"It's rare for that girl to ever acknowledge anything good we do.\"","This conversation seemed to lift a heavy weight off his chest.","Following that, he changed the subject and brought up the Wanlonghui Group.","\"Your Wanlonghui Group has been developing quite rapidly. Over the past six months, you've stimulated a lot of employment in Pearl City and even brought in quite a few enterprises to invest and build factories.\"","How could Liu Yutong not hear the underlying implication in his words? \"Leader, we have invited over a dozen companies along the industry chain to settle in the development zone. Once all investments are fully realized, it is estimated that the direct and indirect jobs created will exceed twenty thousand. Furthermore, we will continue to work hard to help our hometown attract more business and investment.\"","\"Not bad at all. You're doing a great job.\"","The leader's tone shifted. \"However, Pearl City is a third-tier city after all, so its room for development is limited. The provincial capital is currently building a digital economy industrial park with massive policy support. I wonder if you have ever considered relocating Wanhui Youxuan to the provincial capital?\"","There it is.","Being personally headhunted by the big boss made Liu Yutong feel somewhat honored.","\"About that... to be completely honest, the officials in Pearl City have been incredibly supportive of us, and we have already promised that Wanhui Youxuan will continue to invest locally.\"","She raised her voice slightly when she said this. Uncle Gao, who was sitting not far away, couldn't help but reveal a gratified smile upon hearing it.","This girl was good! Reliable!","Thank goodness he had the foresight to give Liu Yutong a heads-up beforehand; otherwise, Wanhui Youxuan really might have been poached.","Even though they all belonged to the same province, local officials still didn't want high-quality enterprises to flow outwards. His previous proposal to Liu Yutong about setting up a software technology park was precisely to keep Wanhui Youxuan. As long as Wanhui Youxuan could grow to the scale of a major internet tech giant, it would be able to propel the entire park to take off.","The top leader didn't show any disappointment upon hearing this. \"A company's development indeed requires comprehensive consideration of various factors. It's wonderful that you have the desire to give back to your hometown.\"","Just as he was about to end the conversation, Liu Yutong suddenly spoke up in a low voice, \"Leader, Wanhui Youxuan is off the table, but I wonder if you have any interest in microchips?\"","\"Microchips?\"","The leader froze for a moment. \"Are you sure you're talking about microchips?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Yes, I'm planning to prepare and build a wafer fab domestically. If the provincial capital is interested, I could consider investing and building the plant here.\"","Hearing this, the leader frowned and fell into thought.","In 2008, the Dragon Kingdom's semiconductor industry was still in its infancy. For this girl to suddenly propose investing in a wafer fab was too massive of a leap, wasn't it?","He had some understanding of the Wanlonghui Group, and there was no way they had anything to do with microchips. They had absolutely none of the necessary resources, so how could they possibly pull it off?","Suddenly, the leader recalled a domestic scandal from a few years prior—the Hanxin incident.","Could this girl be trying to defraud government subsidies too?","As soon as this thought arose, the leader's expression turned stern, and he looked at Liu Yutong with a piercing gaze. \"Student Liu, the semiconductor industry is not child's play. I advise you to be a bit more cautious.\"","He was already being very tactful with his words. If it weren't for the fact that his daughter was still hanging around with her, he probably would have harshly criticized her right to her face.","There was no helping it; the Hanxin incident back then had scammed people far too ruthlessly.","As the saying goes, once bitten by a snake, one fears a well rope for ten years. Not to mention, whether it was Liu Yutong herself or her company, they had neither the technology nor the talent. It was simply impossible for them to develop microchips.","To suddenly say she wanted to make chips now, wasn't this just kidding around like she was talking to a three-year-old?","Who did she think she was, Zhang Rujin?","However, the words Liu Yutong secretly whispered to him next made the high-ranking official lose his voice on the spot.","Are you telling the truth?!","This sudden outburst startled everyone around them, causing them to look over. What on earth did Liu Yutong say to make the big boss so agitated?","Liu Yutong said earnestly, Li Xiaohui is my best friend. I wouldn't joke about something like this with my best friend's father.","Mentioning Li Xiaohui out of the blue was her way of telling him that she chose to be completely honest precisely because of this relationship. After all, the fact that she held a controlling stake in the foreign Mapper company was strictly confidential. She wouldn't easily tell outsiders, for fear that leaking it would alert certain foreign entities.","How did the saying go? Sneak into the village quietly, and hold your fire.","Therefore, only a few core members of the Wanlong Society knew about this matter at present.","However, when the time actually came for her to invest and build a factory, she would definitely need the backing of the leadership, and it had to be the top provincial leaders. For something like this, the support of local municipal leaders would be far from enough.","Therefore, she could only choose the provincial capital.","In fact, opening the factory in some major coastal cities would be the absolute best choice. The main reason she brought it up with this leader was that he was Li Xiaohui's father.","Of course, she had another option, which was to invest and build the factory in BS Province, where Zhu Silin's father was. It was just that the location was too far from the Wanlong Society headquarters, and she hoped to be able to drop by and inspect this business at any time.","The leader pondered for a moment before finally making a decision.","Come to my office next week for a formal presentation. If the feasibility study passes, this project will be listed as the province's number one initiative.","Liu Yutong broke into a smile. Thank you, sir!"]},{"number":580,"title":"Chapter 580: 580. Lawyer Zhao's Cunning Trick.","paragraphs":["After lunch, the leaders left one after another.","Liu Yutong was walking toward her dorm when she was stopped halfway by Li Xiaohui, who had been waiting there for her.","\"Sister Yutong, how did it go? My dad didn't give you a hard time, did he?\"","Liu Yutong shook her head and smiled. \"Your dad is actually quite easy to talk to.\"","Hearing this, Li Xiaohui looked suspicious. \"My dad? Easy to talk to? You're not just fooling me, are you?\"","In her mind, her father had always been incredibly strict. Sometimes she didn't even dare to breathe too loudly around him. Not just her—even her cousin was as obedient as a puppy whenever he saw him.","Liu Yutong: \"I'm really not lying. He even insisted I visit him in the provincial capital next week.\"","Li Xiaohui's eyes widened. \"Are you serious? Who's his biological daughter anyway? It feels like he treats you way better than he treats me.\"","Liu Yutong was a bit speechless, thinking to herself: Is this girl getting jealous?","But after complaining, Li Xiaohui added, \"I guess it's fine, though. My dad's biggest dream has always been to have a smart, highly capable daughter.\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","She suddenly suspected that one day, this girl might actually try to persuade her to become her father's goddaughter.","Knowing her personality, it was entirely possible!","Li Xiaohui: \"By the way, Sister Yutong, is my dad still against me doing e-sports?\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong deliberately put on a serious face and let out a long sigh, avoiding a direct answer.","Sure enough, seeing her expression, Li Xiaohui's face instantly fell. \"It's over. I have no chance. I knew it, my dad is just like all the other older folks—they all think playing video games is just fooling around.\"","\"If I were a leader, I'd be the first to support youth e-sports. My dad is so out of touch. He should just retire early and let the younger generation take over.\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","She felt she couldn't let the girl keep grumbling like this, or who knew what other rebellious things she might say.","\"Actually, your dad said he doesn't think it's completely impossible for you to work in this industry.\" Realizing she had to stop the girl's complaining, she quickly interrupted, \"Actually, your dad said it's not entirely out of the question.\"","Li Xiaohui froze. \"Wh... what did you say?\"","Liu Yutong continued, \"But he also said that, as a father, he wants to remind you to keep things in moderation. Simply put, your dad has tacitly agreed.\"","After a brief silence, Li Xiaohui suddenly jumped up and shouted excitedly, \"Really? That's awesome! Now I can play games openly and proudly, hahaha...\"","\"Did my dad say anything else?\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"I told him you often praise them for being open-minded parents and that you're very grateful to them. He felt you've grown up and was very relieved.\"","Li Xiaohui's face instantly turned red. \"Hey, when have I ever said anything that cheesy?\"","Liu Yutong laughed, \"Didn't it work out great? Your dad was so happy to hear it that he stopped opposing your e-sports career.\"","\"Hahaha, you're the best, Sister Yutong!\"","Li Xiaohui happily linked arms with Liu Yutong. \"Come on, I'm treating you to a big meal. We have to celebrate today!\"","Liu Yutong: \"Sure, I'd never say no to a free meal, but I need to invite someone to join us.\"","Li Xiaohui paused, asking curiously, \"Who?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Lin Muyang.\"","Hearing that name, Li Xiaohui suddenly covered her mouth, her eyes wide. \"Are you two...\"","Lin Muyang's frantic pursuit of Liu Yutong last year was known to almost everyone, so she deliberately acted gossipy.","Liu Yutong reached out and tapped her lightly on the head. \"Don't talk nonsense. I just have some business with him, so we'll chat over food.\"","\"Besides, you'll definitely be dealing with him a lot in the future. If the Purple Dragon Club ever needs to shoot promotional videos, make tournament highlights, or upload and promote videos, you can ask him for help.\"","Li Xiaohui's eyes lit up. \"Really? That's great! I've been wanting to shoot a promo video for ages!\"","Twenty minutes later.","Lin Muyang hurriedly arrived at a private room in the Yuyuefang University City restaurant.","Liu Yutong and Li Xiaohui had arrived early and already ordered the food.","Since they were all acquaintances, after greeting each other, Lin Muyang didn't stand on ceremony and simply pulled up a chair and sat down.","After the three clinked their glasses.","Liu Yutong first chatted with him about how things were going since the video website launched.","\"Dragon View World has been online for almost a month now. How does it feel? I took some time to look at the data, and user growth seems a bit slower than expected.\"","Lin Muyang replied, \"We've definitely hit a bottleneck. The video websites currently on the market have already gained a head start, and user habits have largely been formed. It's not going to be easy to break through their moats.\"","Li Xiaohui chimed in while gnawing on a spare rib, \"Most of my friends use the Soybean website. They say it has a lot of content. Brother Muyang, is there anything different about the site you're running?\"","Lin Muyang: \"Honestly, there's nothing really different, and we don't have a technical advantage either. Right now, our only advantage is the massive copyright library we hold.\"","\"My next step is to use these copyrights to focus on the concept of 'reliving the classics,' turning Dragon View World into a hub for nostalgic, classic content. At the same time, I plan to launch a 'Classic Innovation' project. We're going to open our copyright library to users and encourage them to use these classic film and television materials for secondary creation—like mashups, dubbing, or parodies. This will attract young creators while breathing new life into old content, maximizing the use of the copyrights we own.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong nodded and said, \"That's a good idea, but it's not enough to rely solely on that. How much do you know about web dramas?\"","Lin Muyang paused slightly. \"Web dramas? What web dramas?\"","Liu Yutong explained, \"You can think of web dramas as serialized shows funded by the platform and produced specifically for online streaming. The episodes are shorter, and the themes cater more to the tastes of young people. We could invest in some exclusive web dramas to attract users.\"","Lin Muyang said thoughtfully, \"Sounds a bit like television dramas, but more lightweight?\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Exactly. Later, I'll give you a few names. See if you can track them down and poach them. Some are probably still in college, so once you find them, you can sign them early.\"","Lin Muyang smiled. \"That sounds great!\"","He believed that any talent Liu Yutong recommended would definitely be top-notch.","After briefly discussing the website's future plans, Liu Yutong asked about the copyrights again.","\"Regarding the copyrights, have you talked to Zhao Tianyi?\"","Lin Muyang: \"We talked. I have to say, the top lawyer really knows his stuff. He completely opened my eyes.\"","\"At first, I had my people try to contact those platforms, demanding they take down some of the movies and shows they didn't have the copyrights for. But they claimed the users uploaded them without permission, so they had no right to handle it. They even brought up the so-called 'safe harbor principle' to shirk responsibility. I was furious.\"","\"Attorney Zhao later told me to ignore them for now and cut off all contact. Then he gave me an idea: send some people to go undercover at those platforms. Once they are hired, we will use user accounts to massively upload film and television content that we hold the exclusive copyrights to. When this content accumulates to a certain amount on their platforms, we will suddenly send a lawyer's letter, demanding that they immediately take the content down and compensate us for our massive losses.\"","\"If the platforms refuse, we can use the opportunity to hold a press conference, publicly condemning their infringing behavior while promoting Longkan Vision as the true hub for officially licensed content. After that, we can arrange for some paid online commenters to guide public opinion and hype up the issue. That way, we can attract even more users to our platform.\"","\"Of course, even if they agree to pay compensation, we will still do the promotion and hype it up just the same.\"","\"Besides this, Attorney Zhao also said that since they are damaging the interests of a Mingzhu City enterprise, we can apply to file the lawsuit right here in Mingzhu City. After all, our company's registered address and main place of operation are both in Mingzhu City, which perfectly complies with the jurisdiction regulations of the Civil Procedure Law. Furthermore, as long as the evidence is sufficient, the Mingzhu City court has full authority to freeze the opposing companies' assets.\"","\"In short, no matter how many lawyers the other side brings in, once they step into Mingzhu City, Attorney Zhao is confident he can give them one single word: Lose!\"","\"I have to say, Attorney Zhao is truly top-notch!\"","Speaking of this, Lin Muyang thought of another angle. \"As far as I know, those platforms are currently operating at a loss. If their assets are suddenly frozen, it could be fatal for them. We could take advantage of the situation and acquire them directly.\"","\"You guys have thought this through very thoroughly. Just go ahead with your plan.\"","Liu Yutong emphasized a point. \"But you must remember, we are not deliberately trying to suppress our competitors; we are trying to push the entire industry toward standardization.\"","Lin Muyang nodded. \"Understood. We are a legitimate company, after all.\"","\"Exactly!\"","The three of them had pretty much finished their meal. Just as they were getting ready to leave, Liu Yutong suddenly turned to Lin Muyang and said, \"I didn't see the school leaders on campus today. I think it's necessary to remind you that your surname is Lin.\"","The smile on Lin Muyang's face instantly vanished. Finally, he nodded heavily and said simply, \"I know.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"Well, don't worry. We have always been friends, and that will not change.\"","Lin Muyang's eyes instantly reddened. \"Thank you!\"","To be honest, this was what he had feared the most lately.","When Liu Yutong suddenly called him out for a meal today, he had been feeling quite anxious, terrified that she would act like everyone else—silently distancing herself, looking down on him, or even completely abandoning him.","It wasn't until he lost his former status that he clearly saw he was actually nothing at all.","He also clearly saw the strength of this girl, Liu Yutong. She had absolutely no background, yet she had climbed step by step to a position where even he had to look up to her.","Fortunately, she was still willing to be his friend!"]},{"number":581,"title":"Chapter 581: 581. Mingzhu Capital Discloses Shareholding in Qiming Electric Appliances","paragraphs":["November 11th. A date not yet branded as Singles' Day or a massive shopping carnival. It was just an ordinary trading day in the A-share market, and on the surface, everything seemed perfectly calm.","The helmsman of the Shen family, Chairman of Qiming Electric, Shen Yanchang, was instructing his second and third sons to continue secretly accumulating the company's floating shares according to their original plan.","During this period, they had quietly swallowed up another 4.3% of the shares, bringing the family's total holding to over 23%. Their ultimate goal was to acquire over 30%.","Once they gathered enough chips to reach their target, they planned to release a stellar earnings report to completely detonate the stock price, sending it skyrocketing.","However, shortly after the market opened on Tuesday, a hint of something unusual appeared on Qiming Electric's trading board.","Several massive buy orders, each worth tens of millions, flooded in without warning. They instantly broke the balance between the bulls and the bears, forcibly straightening the stock's curve and sending it surging upward.","This situation was quickly noticed by the Shen family.","\"Dad, some big money is sweeping up shares!\" Shen Rui, the second son in charge of market operations, rushed into the office to report.","Shen Yanchang frowned slightly, clearly a bit displeased with his son's lack of composure. \"What are you panicking for? It's just some hot money sniffing out an opportunity and trying to make a quick buck. Stick to the plan and smash them right back down.\"","Shen Rui took the order and immediately mobilized their affiliated funds and hidden accounts to sell off frantically. Sell orders poured down like a waterfall. The newly rising stock price was forcefully suppressed back to its original position, even dropping into negative territory.","Before long, Shen Yanchang looked at the intraday chart recovering its lost ground, a cold sneer playing at the corners of his mouth. It seemed his judgment was correct; it was just a few small fries.","Last month, his good-for-nothing eldest son had done something similar, ending up wasting hundreds of millions for nothing.","He just couldn't figure out where his eldest son had gotten so much money, as his allowance from the family was nowhere near that amount.","Unable to make sense of it, he didn't dwell on it. Time was tight right now, and their top priority was to acquire enough shares at a low price.","Perhaps because of the sudden large orders today, even though Shen Yanchang didn't care much, he still personally monitored the market until the closing bell just in case. Seeing that there were indeed no more fluctuations, he finally relaxed.","However, his peace of mind didn't last long. When the market opened on Wednesday, the exact same drama played out again.","And this time, the buying was even more ferocious and persistent. No matter how many chips the Shen family threw out, the other side swallowed them all. The stock price seemed nailed to a 5% gain, projecting an aura of absolute unmovable dominance regardless of what the market threw at it.","\"Something's wrong. This doesn't look like retail investors, nor does it look like standard hot money.\"","\"The depth of this buyer's pockets is unfathomable!\"","Shen Rui, who was managing the trades, broke into a slight sweat on his forehead when he saw the massive buy-ins today.","He originally planned to report to his father immediately, but his body had barely left the seat before he sat back down. He remembered what his father had told him yesterday: he needed to stay composed and not run to him over every little fluctuation, as it made him look incompetent and prone to making a fuss over nothing.","Shen Rui checked the time. There wasn't much left until the market closed. He decided to test the bottom line of these buyers once more, so he ordered his team to continue dumping shares in heavy volumes.","Sure enough, after his maneuvers, the stock's upward momentum was temporarily halted, and the curve began to bend downward. With only a few minutes left until the closing bell...","Shen Rui breathed a sigh of relief and wiped the fine sweat from his forehead, thinking it was just a false alarm.","Unfortunately, before he could completely relax, the situation on the board abruptly changed again!","The seemingly suppressed buying pressure hadn't retreated at all; it had merely been gathering strength. Just as the stock price dipped, an astronomical buy order, like a giant whale that had been lying in wait, suddenly opened its massive jaws and swallowed every single sell order Shen Rui had thrown out. A staggering ten-thousand-lot order flashed on the transaction ledger, yanking the stock straight up from its slight dip. It instantly smashed through the 5% gain threshold and, with undiminished momentum, charged straight toward the daily limit up.","\"How is this possible! How is this even possible!\"","Shen Rui sprang up from his seat, his eyes glued to the screen, seemingly unable to believe what was happening right in front of him.","By the time he snapped out of it and checked the time, it was too late. The market had closed.","Meanwhile.","Shortly after the A-share market closed, a secretary burst frantically into the chairman's office.","\"Ch-Chairman, bad news! A statement of changes in equity!\"","Shen Yanchang snatched the document. With just one glance, his face turned livid.","\"Simplified Report on Changes in Equity of Qiming Electric Co., Ltd.\"","Information Disclosure Obligor: Pearl Capital Investment Consulting Co., Ltd.","As of today's close, Pearl Capital has increased its holdings through the secondary market and now holds 5.01% of Qiming Electric's total share capital!","\"Pearl Capital? Who are they?!\" Shen Yanchang roared in anger.","In just two days, the opposing party had swallowed 5% of the shares, causing the percentage of shares he held to drop by 3.01%, from 23.44% to 20.43%.","That final massive order had been released by their family. The volume was huge, yet it was instantly snapped up by the other party. This proved that they had come fully prepared.","At this thought, Shen Yanchang's eyes filled with murderous intent.","He would show no mercy to anyone who dared to ruin his plans, especially since he still held the trump card of a poison pill defense.","However, even though he guessed that this Pearl Capital came with ill intentions, he decided to have his secretary investigate their background first and wait and see. If the other party just wanted a piece of the pie, he could let it slide. But if they dared to harbor any inappropriate designs on the company's controlling rights, he would undoubtedly strike back without hesitation!","Pearl Capital's sudden triggering of the disclosure threshold on Qiming Electric caused quite a stir in the market, drawing the attention of many investors, especially retail investors who discussed it the most.","A blue-chip stock forgotten by the market had actually been targeted for a major stake acquisition for the first time during a stock market crash?","What did this mean? A massive value depression!","Although the market was closed for the day, many people looked at the final stock price trend and judged that there was a high probability it would continue to rise tomorrow, preparing to enter the market then. After all, Pearl Capital had shown immense ambition by crossing the 5% threshold right out of the gate; it was impossible for them to stop so quickly.","Even though it had taken a dip today, they imagined it would definitely turn positive tomorrow, perhaps even hitting the daily limit up.","As the saying goes, ideals are beautiful, but reality is cruel.","They perfectly illustrated what it meant to be dumb money waiting to be harvested. Over the next few trading days, the dark horse Pearl Capital, upon which they had placed such high hopes, showed absolutely no movement, falling completely silent. Instead, someone in the market began frantically dumping shares, leaving many retail investors seeing stars.","By the time the next few trading days rolled around the following week, many retail investors still saw no large buy orders. With the stock price dropping lower and lower, they couldn't hold on any longer and chose to cut their losses and exit the market.","Seeing this, the Shen family completely relaxed, believing that the other party was merely an investor with a slightly larger appetite who posed no real threat to them.","However, to avoid any unforeseen complications from a long delay, the Shen family planned to finish accumulating their target shares before the end of the month.","Otherwise, there won't be enough time."]},{"number":582,"title":"Chapter 582: 582. Activate the Poison Pill","paragraphs":["Shen Yanchang summoned all three of his sons, including Shen Hao, the eldest son who always gave him a headache. Regardless of everything, Shen Hao was still his son. Even though they had their disagreements in the past, Shen Yanchang wouldn't go so far as to completely exclude him from the family.","Of course, he was also worried that if he left Shen Hao out, the kid would start causing trouble behind his back, which was why he made sure to call him over.","\"Now that everyone is here, let's get down to business. That incident with Pearl Capital turned out to be a false alarm, but we don't have much time left.\"","\"We have to speed up our progress. Before the end of the month, no matter what it takes, we need to push our shareholding ratio above 30 percent. This is about the Shen family's control over Qiming Electric, and it concerns our family's core interests. We absolutely cannot afford any mistakes!\"","Shen Rui immediately spoke up to show his support. \"Dad, don't worry. I've already contacted several reliable channels, and the funds are all ready. As soon as the timing is right, we can rapidly absorb the shares.\"","Shen Ming chimed in, \"If my second brother needs any coordination, I can mobilize some resources on my end as well to ensure nothing goes wrong.\"","Shen Yanchang nodded, his gaze finally landing on Shen Hao, who had remained silent the entire time.","\"Little Hao, regarding the money you recklessly lost before, as long as you keep your head down now and help the family get through this critical period, you will get your fair share in the future. Tell us, what are your thoughts?\"","Shen Hao looked up, the corners of his mouth twitching slightly. The expression looked like a smile, but not quite.","\"What thoughts could I possibly have? I overestimated myself before. Now, whatever you say, Dad, I'll do. I don't have anything left to lose anyway.\"","His seemingly defeated words made Shen Rui and Shen Ming simultaneously purse their lips in disdain.","Their eldest brother was completely crushed by them; he had absolutely no fighting spirit left. But this was exactly how they wanted it.","Shen Rui and Shen Ming were twins. They had never really liked their eldest brother since they were young, probably because Shen Hao always loved to put on the airs of a big brother and lecture them.","However, the two brothers were indeed smart. Both graduated from prestigious universities, showed great talent in investing, and were deeply favored by their father, Shen Yanchang.","In contrast, Shen Hao had only gilded his resume at an overseas university where money could buy admission. His personality was a bit too flamboyant, and he spoke too bluntly, which greatly dissatisfied Shen Yanchang.","Under these circumstances, the Shen family's businesses would most likely be handed over to the twins in the future.","This was exactly what Shen Hao had always held a grudge about deep down.","He was the eldest son!","Shen Yanchang gave his eldest son a deep look, knowing perfectly well that Shen Hao had grievances against him. After all, as the eldest, being excluded from the core family business would naturally breed resentment.","\"Since no one has any objections, we'll proceed according to the plan. Little Rui, you are in charge of pacing the operations. You need to acquire the shares without driving the stock price up too high, so as not to attract outside attention. Little Ming, keep a close eye on market dynamics, especially Pearl Capital. See if there are any other potential rivals. The moment you notice anything unusual, report to me immediately.\"","\"Yes, Father!\" Shen Rui and Shen Ming answered in unison.","Shen Yanchang gave Shen Hao one last look. \"As for you... just behave yourself lately. Don't go out and cause any more trouble. When I need you, I will naturally call you.\"","Shen Hao lowered his eyes and replied, \"Understood.\"","The meeting ended. Shen Rui and Shen Ming were the first to walk out of the study, discussing the details of their upcoming operations as they went.","Shen Hao trailed behind. The moment he turned around and closed the study door, the defeated look on his face vanished instantly, and his eyes grew sharp.","He then pulled out his phone, quickly typed out a text message, and hit send.","Before the end of the month, they plan to acquire 30 percent. Their defense lines are shrinking. You can start the second phase.","A reply came back almost immediately.","I will request a shareholder meeting before the end of the month. Get your materials ready.","Understood!","After finishing the exchange, Shen Hao put his phone away.","............","The Shen family originally planned to suppress the stock price while quietly absorbing shares, and everything seemed to be going smoothly. Especially over the past few days, Pearl Capital had quieted down and made no further moves.","They had also looked into Pearl Capital's background. It was a firm from a small city called Pearl City. Regional capital of that scale usually didn't have massive funds; a 5 percent stake was likely their absolute limit. After all, swallowing that many shares required over a billion in capital, which was no small sum. Unless the other party heavily leveraged themselves, but the risks of doing so were immense, and no rational person would try it.","They believed the other side knew their limits and wouldn't cause any more trouble.","However, just as the Shen family absorbed enough shares to reach 23 percent and were on the verge of breaking 24 percent...","A storm erupted again!","\"A stake declaration! Someone else just declared a major stake in Qiming Electric!\"","\"Holy crap! It's not just one. Several major capital firms are entering the market at the same time!\"","\"Incredible, multiple firms are declaring their stakes together! Are there more?\"","\".........\"","The major investment forums and retail investor chat groups exploded.","\"What the hell is going on? Is Qiming Electric about to turn from a crow into a phoenix?\"","\"Wasn't it half-dead just a couple of days ago? Why are so many big players suddenly rushing in?\"","\"Damn it, I just cut my losses two days ago, and now it's taking off. Are they messing with me?!\"","\"Fellow leeks, do we still jump in under these circumstances? Could this be a trap?\"","\"Who cares, hurry up and follow! This is definitely some massive good news!\"","\"I'm in!\"","\"Damn it, I'm in too!\"","\".........\"","Meanwhile.","Inside Shen Yanchang's office, the atmosphere had plummeted to freezing point.","In just three trading days, they had received three consecutive equity change reports.","Yunshan Capital: 5.58 percent stake.","Wanlong Capital: 5.23 percent stake.","Pearl Capital made a secondary declaration, increasing their stake to 10.29 percent.","The combined shareholding of these three capital firms had now surpassed 20 percent. At the same time, Qiming Electric's stock price had hit several daily limits, and its market valuation had skyrocketed from under 29 billion to nearly 40 billion.","\"Dad, we can't hesitate anymore! These three firms are clearly colluding, and their combined equity has already exceeded 20 percent. If we let them continue sweeping up shares in the secondary market, or if they unite with other minority shareholders to convene a general meeting, we'll be in grave danger.\"","Shen Yanchang stared at the numbers on the report, his face ashen. His family held 23.99 percent, while the opposition openly held over 20 percent. More importantly, the stock price had been driven up so drastically that it was now virtually impossible for the Shen family to increase their stake to 30 percent at a low cost. The financial pressure was simply too great.","\"Since they want to play dirty, they can't blame me for being ruthless! Activate the poison pill strategy!\""]},{"number":583,"title":"Chapter 583: 583. The Discordant Shen Brothers.","paragraphs":["\"Dad, according to the regulations, issuing new shares requires the approval of more than two-thirds of the shareholders.\"","\"I know. You don't need to worry about that; I know what I'm doing. Those three investment firms are trying to swallow the Shen family's two-decade-old foundation, but they better be prepared to break their teeth on it. Have someone run the calculations first to see how much capital we need and to what extent we can dilute the shareholding ratio of those three bastards.\"","\"Okay, Dad.\" After the two sons replied, they immediately arranged for personnel to run the numbers.","It didn't take long for the results to come out.","\"Dad, the finance department has made a preliminary calculation. If we want to suppress their combined shareholding ratio from the current 20% to below 10%, we will need to issue a massive amount of new shares. I'm afraid we'll have to use up more than two billion in cash reserves, and this will greatly dilute the company's earnings per share. The other shareholders might have objections.\"","\"Two billion...\"","Shen Yanchang repeatedly weighed this number in his mind. This was almost the absolute limit of the liquid funds they had available on the books.","But quickly, he made his decision.","\"Two billion it is. As long as we can keep control, this price is nothing. Didn't you investigate them? Pearl Capital is just a local firm with limited strength. Yunshan Capital and Wanlong Capital are also newly established investment companies. I estimate their total funds are at most five or six billion, which should be almost depleted by now. Once we throw out this two-billion poison pill, it will be enough to cripple them, or even force them to liquidate!\"","\"I think you're absolutely right. We need to make them lose more than they sought to gain. Once the poison pill is launched, the stock price will inevitably face short-term pressure, and we can take the opportunity to buy back some shares at a low price. It's truly killing two birds with one stone!\"","\"Yes, arrange it just like that. I will contact the other shareholders and prepare for the vote on the share issuance.\"","Shen Hao, who had been sitting on the sidelines like an invisible man, watched the father and two younger sons enthusiastically discussing how to crush the three major capital firms. A sneer formed on his face.","Were they joking?","His father and his two good younger brothers had absolutely no idea what kind of behemoth they were facing.","True, these three investment firms were indeed very young. The earliest established, Pearl Capital, had been registered for less than a year, while Wanlong Capital and Yunshan Capital had only been around for a few months.","Looking at it from this angle, it was easy to misunderstand and assume that these three firms had limited strength and no deep foundations.","But if they really thought that, they were gravely mistaken. Although these three firms had a short history, the actual capital they could mobilize when working together could make many industry giants tremble.","Not to mention anything else, just on the books, without any leverage, the funds these three firms could mobilize exceeded forty billion. Let alone triggering a poison pill plan, even taking Qiming Electric private directly would be more than enough.","If it weren't for Liu Yutong feeling that going head-to-head wasn't cost-effective and would affect the final profit, she could have completely ignored the Shen family's share issuance and just swept up whatever stock was available on the market.","To put it bluntly, her willingness to unite her three capital firms to help Shen Hao seize control of the company came with conditions. Friends are friends, and business is business. No one would be foolish enough to use tens of billions in funds just to help a friend grab a controlling stake, no matter how good their relationship was.","Shen Hao had promised that after he gained control of the company, he would buy back a portion of the shares held by the three firms at a reasonable price, and the rest would be slowly cashed out after the lock-up period expired.","According to preliminary estimates, through this operation, the three capital firms would earn at least around ten billion.","In other words, by then, their selling price would have to at least double their purchase price, and Qiming Electric's market value would have to soar to over sixty billion to achieve this goal. Although this profit was far less than what they made during the financial crisis, both Liu Yutong and the members of the Yunshan Club were very satisfied with this estimated figure.","After all, people should be content with what they have.","Of course, if the outside world knew that they planned to make ten billion in just over half a year and still talked about being content with what they have, the internet slang \"Versailles\" for humblebragging would probably have been born a decade earlier.","Shen Yanchang's observation skills were still very sharp. Noticing the strange expression on his eldest son Shen Hao's face, he suddenly asked, \"Xiao Hao, do you have a problem with the plan your brothers and I came up with?\"","As soon as these words came out, Shen Rui and Shen Ming, who were about to leave, stopped in their tracks and looked at their eldest brother Shen Hao with some dissatisfaction.","Shen Hao quickly restrained his expression and replied, \"Dad, what opinion could I possibly have? I'm currently bearing the blame for my past mistakes; how would I dare to point fingers at your brilliant decisions?\"","\"I just find it a bit ironic. Before, I wanted to buy some shares from the market, but I ended up losing everything because I was set up by my own family. Now that outsiders are coming, the family is resorting to a poison pill—a tactic that hurts the enemy a thousand times but damages ourselves eight hundred. I just feel it's a bit ridiculous. If we had known this would happen, why did we act that way in the first place?\"","The meaning behind his words was very clear. If they hadn't guarded against him like a thief back then, the Shen family's shareholding ratio wouldn't be as low as 24%. It probably would have surpassed the 30% safety line long ago, and they wouldn't have to fear outsiders causing trouble now.","Shen Rui couldn't help but speak up, \"Big brother, what are you saying? You were stupid back then, who else can you blame? Now that the family is facing a crisis, Dad is trying to turn the tide! If everyone messed around like you did, our family's control over the company would have been snatched away long ago.\"","Hearing this, Shen Hao immediately got angry and glared coldly at Shen Rui, \"Second Brother, cut the crap. Whether you and Third Brother are afraid of outsiders taking control, or just afraid that I, your eldest brother, will take a share of the family fortune, you know perfectly well in your own hearts!\"","\"Also, what right do you have to point fingers at me, your eldest brother?! You deliberately set me up just to prevent me from getting more shares. Is my money not the family's money?!\"","Shen Rui's face turned pale and then green from Shen Hao's scolding. Although he deeply hated his eldest brother in his heart, he didn't dare to show it too obviously; after all, their father was still right there.","Seeing that his sons were about to start arguing again, Shen Yanchang slammed his hand heavily on the table: \"Enough, all of you shut up!\"","\"Let's not bring up the past anymore! The most important thing right now is unity, standing together against outsiders! From now on, no one is allowed to say anything detrimental to our unity. You are brothers, do you understand?!\"","\"Understood, Dad.\"","\"Understood.\"","\"...\"","All three obediently answered.","Shen Yanchang looked at the three sons in front of him, a wave of powerlessness surging in his heart. With foreign enemies at their doorstep, his sons were still causing him so much worry. Then, he waved his hand, \"All of you, get out and proceed according to the plan. Xiao Hao, you stay.\"","After Shen Rui and Shen Ming left, Shen Yanchang finally asked in a deep voice, \"Xiao Hao, it's just the two of us now. Tell your dad the truth, are you hiding something from me?\"","Shen Hao knew he couldn't hide it from his father, so he simply dropped the act. \"Dad, I knew I couldn't keep it from you. I do have some inside information. Yunshan Capital, Wanlong Capital, and Mingzhu Capital are all working together.\"","\"Is that it?\" Shen Yanchang asked. \"Didn't we already know that?\"","Shen Hao paused for a moment before continuing, \"What if I told you I know exactly how much ammunition is left in their capital pool?\"","Shen Yanchang's pupils contracted sharply. \"Are you certain?!\""]},{"number":584,"title":"Chapter 584: 584. Short Sellers vs. Bulls (Part 1)","paragraphs":["\"I know the president of Yunshan Capital, Zhu Silin, and I am actually quite familiar with her. She knew that I had a falling out with you before, so she specifically approached me, wanting to pull me in to take down Qiming Electric together. She even said she would make me the chairman after it was done, but I refused.\"","\"No matter what, I am still a member of the Shen family. Even if I am at odds with you and my younger brothers, that is our own family business. I couldn't possibly stand by and watch our own family's assets fall into the hands of outsiders.\"","\"Furthermore, even if they really got the controlling stake, that chairman position wouldn't necessarily fall to me. No matter how good my relationship with Zhu Silin is, she isn't the one calling the shots. Ultimately, she still has to listen to the decisions of the investors behind her.\"","Hearing these words from his eldest son, Shen Yanchang felt very gratified: \"Xiao Hao, you are absolutely right. This is our own family's business, how could we let outsiders interfere! It is very good that you can see things so clearly!\"","Shen Hao: \"So I took the opportunity to fish for some information from her. She admitted that for this battle, the three capital firms prepared a total of ten billion in funds. Right now, the usable funds left in their accounts are only about three billion. Under normal circumstances, that would be more than enough to deal with our Shen family.\"","\"Of course, I didn't completely believe her words. Later, I spent some money to bribe one of their traders. From the information they fed back, I can confirm that what Zhu Silin said is basically true. Their early-stage consumption was indeed massive, and that three billion is very likely the last of the ammunition they can mobilize.\"","Shen Yanchang had to admit that although his eldest son usually caused him a lot of worry, looking solely at this matter, he had handled it beautifully!","This information came at such a crucial time! It was so timely!","It was a good thing he had noticed his eldest son acting a bit strange just now and asked an extra question, otherwise he might have missed this incredibly important news.","If the opposing side really only had three billion in ammunition left, then the balance of power between the enemy and themselves was not irreversible. Currently, the funds the Shen family could mobilize were about two billion. If they went all in with their entire fortune, they could scrape together another billion. Added up, that was also three billion, basically tying with the enemy's remaining ammunition.","Don't forget, he still had a trump card in his hand. He just needed to issue an additional one billion worth of shares. Originally, he had planned to issue an additional two or even three billion shares, but issuing too many might face opposition from other shareholders, as it would harm the interests of all shareholders.","Now it seemed he didn't need to issue that many. An additional one billion would be enough. This was also equivalent to him having an extra billion in ammunition, adding up to four billion in total.","Four billion against three billion, the advantage was his!","Once they exhausted the ammunition of those three capital firms, the Shen family would not only be able to defend their controlling stake, but they could also turn around and devour the chips the enemy had previously swallowed, forcing those three firms to cut their losses and exit the market!","\"Xiao Hao, you did exceptionally well! If we can defeat those three capital firms this time, you will take the top credit! The money you lost, Dad will also make it up to you!\"","\"Dad, this is all what I should do. No matter what, I absolutely will not let the company's controlling stake fall into the hands of people outside our surname.\" Shen Hao then silently added in his heart: \"I am not someone with an outside surname, am I?\"","Hearing this, Shen Yanchang heavily patted Shen Hao's shoulder before turning around and leaving.","On the third Monday of November, the chill was deepening, and people generally needed to wear padded jackets and coats to brave the cold wind when going out. But those retail investors in the A-share market who had their eyes glued to Qiming Electric didn't feel cold at all; instead, they felt a feverish heat.","How hot did they feel? Some people wished they could strip naked right then and there and jump into the river for a winter swim.","Over the past weekend, news about the battle for the controlling stake of Qiming Electric had already been brewing into a massive uproar across major financial forums and stock message boards. Many people had a premonition that today's market opening would inevitably be a bloodbath, so they were all rubbing their hands together, gathering their momentum, ready to jump in and make a big play.","At nine fifteen, not long after the pre-market call auction began.","Those retail investors who had just rushed into Qiming Electric hadn't even fully reacted before the bad news struck.","They saw the buy orders on the time-sharing chart instantly wiped out, replaced by a massive influx of sell orders, a frantic dumping of shares regardless of the cost! The stock price plummeted in a straight freefall from the previous trading day's close of 41.50, heading straight for the limit-down board.","Some retail investors who had just entered the market were completely stunned!","\"Holy shit! Limit down! Pinned to limit down right at the call auction?!\"","\"37.35, it really hit limit down! The blocked orders are huge! Over eight hundred thousand lots!\"","\"Is this crazy?!\"","\".......\"","At nine twenty-five, the call auction results were released, and Qiming Electric opened at a limit-down price of 37.35 yuan per share. On the trading screen, behind the grayed-out Sell 1 tier, hung a despair-inducing number of over 800,000 lots, with suppressing funds exceeding three billion.","Inside the core trading room of the Shen family.","Shen Yanchang personally sat in command. His second son, Shen Rui, was in charge of directing the traders, while his third son, Shen Ming, was responsible for monitoring various information channels. The three men of the family all took the field together, entirely for today's battle.","Their goal was singular, to use the force of a thunderbolt to firmly pin the stock price to the limit-down board, creating panic, forcing back the trend-following buyers, and showing those three arrogant capital firms the true strength of the Shen family!","\"Dad, the blocked orders are very stable, approaching 3.1 billion. Let's see how they pry this open now!\" Shen Rui looked at the screen, his face full of smugness. It was as if he could already see their opponents panicking and begging for mercy.","Shen Yanchang nodded slightly, but still gave a very cautious reminder: \"Do not be careless. Keep a close eye on the market, especially the movement of large orders.\"","\"Yes, Dad!\"","At nine thirty, the market officially opened.","The blocked orders on the limit-down board not only didn't decrease, but instead, fueled by the surge of panic selling, continued to increase. They quickly surpassed one million lots, with suppressing funds exceeding four billion.","The buy orders were pitifully scarce. Occasional transactions of a few lots or a few dozen lots were no different from an ant trying to shake a tree in the face of the massive sell orders.","In the forums and stock message boards, as well as various investment group chats, there was already a chorus of wailing and howling.","\"It's over, it's over! It's all over! I just chased the rally and bought in last week, and now I'm eating several limit-downs. This is too ruthless!\"","\"Shen family, screw your ancestors! What's the meaning of smashing your own company's stock?!\"","\"Was it the Shen family? That can't be, right?\"","\"Does the person above even need to guess? This is obviously a battle for controlling rights. Right now, the only ones capable of pulling off such a massive short position are the Shen family, because doing this is most beneficial to them. They just want to crash the stock price and force those three capital firms to blow up their accounts!\"","\"Not going to lie, your analysis makes a lot of sense!\"","\"Damn it, the major shareholders fight, and us little retail investors suffer. These rules are so freaking unfair!\"","\"Run! Hurry up and list your sell orders at the limit-down price! Salvage whatever you can!\"","\"Run my ass, don't you see the billions of funds lined up in front? Will it ever be the turn of our few lots? The rule is large orders get priority. Little shrimps like us are just waiting to be suffocated to death.\"","\"Damn, us retail investors are too miserable! No, I'm going to throw feces at the Shen family's door! This is too freaking disgusting!\"","\".......\"","Time ticked by, minute by minute. The stock remained firmly locked at the daily limit-down, with the capital backing the sell orders surpassing a staggering five billion.","The smugness on the faces of the two brothers, Shen Rui and Shen Ming, grew ever more apparent. They were already imagining how they would scoop up the shares at rock-bottom prices once their opponent's account was liquidated, and then mercilessly mock them.","To celebrate this very moment, Shen Ming even had someone bring over a bottle of champagne and popped the cork right then and there.","With a loud pop, the bubbly foam gushed out.","\"Dad, Second Brother, it seems we overestimated them! Come on, let's have an early celebration!\" Shen Ming laughed as he poured a glass for his father, Shen Yanchang, and his brother, Shen Rui.","The three men raised their glasses in unison, calling out a toast.","\"To the Shen family! And to our recklessly foolish opponents!\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"...\"","Perhaps it was true what they say: never pop the champagne too early, or it might just jinx you.","At 9:58 AM, right after they downed their drinks, a sudden twist occurred!"]},{"number":585,"title":"Chapter 585: 585. Short Sellers Battle Long Investors (Part 2)","paragraphs":["At 2:44 PM, a sudden anomaly occurred! (Changed the time to fit the vibe of popping champagne at halftime).","In the transaction details list, several staggering super buy orders popped up without any warning.","The first order, 200,000 lots!","The second order, 300,000 lots!","The third order, 300,000 lots!","In just a few short seconds, a massive wave of buying totaling 800,000 lots and worth nearly 3 billion swept in with crushing force, instantly swallowing more than half of the millions of sell orders stuck on the limit-down board.","Witnessing this scene, the brothers Shen Rui and Shen Ming instantly turned pale and cried out in dismay.","\"Dad! Something's terribly wrong!\"","\"They're breaking... breaking the board! The limit-down has been busted!\"","The retail investors who were also keeping an eye on Qiming Electric saw the limit-down board break and completely exploded in an uproar.","\"Holy shit, holy shit, holy shit! What the hell just happened?! Three billion, gone in an instant?!\"","\"Who the hell is this divine entity? That adds up to nearly a million lots, right?!\"","\"It's open, it's open! The limit-down is broken! Look! The stock price is pulling up!\"","\"A pulse! It's a pulse order! It surged to -5%! Damn, why did it drop back down!\"","\"The short sellers are dumping again! Another 100,000 lots of sell orders just hit! Mother of God!\"","\"They're going to beat the living daylights out of each other now!\"","\".........\"","Just as the limit-down board was pried open and the stock price pulsed upward for a brief moment, a short order of over 100,000 lots slammed down again, instantly pinning the stock price back toward the limit-down.","Inside the trading room.","Shen Rui's voice carried a hint of a tremble. \"Dad, this is the last short order we can afford to dump. If we keep smashing it down, it's really going to cripple us.\"","Shen Yanchang's old face had long since darkened. \"Cripple us? Is the situation not severe enough already?!\"","\"If we stop now, the billions we invested earlier will all go down the drain! The other side will step over our dead bodies to take complete control of Qiming!\"","\"Contact the brokers and funders we know immediately. Use our shares in Qiming as collateral and get another billion in funds back here!\"","\"Dad, that's too risky! Our family currently holds 15.92% of the shares, which is already nearing the critical point. If we pledge even 1% more, our control will...\"","Shen Yanchang interrupted, \"Say no more. We have no way out now. The other side has made it clear they want to swallow us whole! If we retreat now, forget about control, the entire Shen family will be uprooted!\"","\"The more critical the moment, the less we can afford to back down. As long as we can win this battle and pull the stock price up, we'll still have a chance to redeem the shares later!\"","\"Execute the order!\"","\"Yes!\" Shen Rui could only bite the bullet, pledging a billion worth of shares according to his father's arrangement, and then dumped them all as short orders.","Shen Yanchang seemed to remember something and suddenly asked, \"Where is Xiao Hao? Where did he go?\"","Shen Ming replied, \"I haven't seen my older brother since this morning. I don't know where he went.\"","Shen Yanchang frowned. \"Call him and tell him to come see me.\"","He now had an uncertain suspicion in his heart that he might have been deceived by his eldest son; the opponent's funds were probably far more than three billion.","Just as he was thinking this, less than two seconds after that 300,000-lot sell order was posted, it was instantly eaten up again by two buy orders of 120,000 and 180,000 lots.","Witnessing this scene, even a business veteran like Shen Yanchang, who was used to weathering storms, instantly slumped back into his chair.","\"It's over! It's truly over now!\"","Now they were truly out of ammunition and supplies. Unless they pledged all their remaining shares, but if they did that, there was a high probability he would be completely swept out of the game.","Moreover, it was too late to use a poison pill now. The recent share issuance had been too small. They had fallen for a massive trap!","Those retail investors watching Qiming Electric from the sidelines boiled over with excitement once again upon seeing this.","\"The shorts are out of bullets, right? The sealed orders seem to be gone.\"","\"The bulls are too awesome! They smashed the short sellers' dog heads!\"","\"Don't celebrate too early. Who knows if this is a trap? We retail leeks better stay cautious.\"","\"Trading volume is exploding! Truly exploding! It's only been a dozen minutes since the market opened, and the turnover has already surpassed six billion! The turnover rate is over 20%! Crazy, this is pure madness!\"","\".........\"","At 3:10 PM, the short-selling camp completely collapsed. The stock price, as if breaking free from its shackles, leaped upward. The decline rapidly narrowed to -3%, -1%... and then turned positive!","\"It's positive! The stock price has turned positive!\"","\"The bulls won! The shorts really got blown out!\"","\"Chase it! If we don't buy in now, when will we!\"","\".........\"","Market sentiment was completely ignited. Countless retail investors followed the trend and chased the rally, causing Qiming Electric's stock price to climb steadily higher!","Subsequently, an emergency announcement issued by the official exchange platform suddenly descended.","Indicative Announcement on the Simplified Report of Changes in Equity of Qiming Electric Co., Ltd.","Information Disclosure Obligors:","Mingzhu Capital has reached the disclosure threshold for the third time, holding a total of 15.69% of Qiming Electric's shares!","Yunshan Capital has reached the disclosure threshold for the second time, holding a total of 10.33% of Qiming Electric's shares!","Gome and its concerted action party Huang Yu have reached the disclosure threshold for the second time, holding a total of 18.99% of Qiming Electric's shares!","Before the close of the market, a total of two capital firms and one natural person had crossed the disclosure threshold. Among them, Gome and its concerted action party Huang Yu became the largest overt shareholders of Qiming Electric. Next was Mingzhu Capital, holding 14.97%. The Shen family was reduced to third place, holding 13.16%.","No one expected that in this fierce battle between bulls and bears, Huang Yu would suddenly charge in halfway, causing the situation at Qiming Electric to become unpredictable once again.","In Great Nancheng.","Zhu Silin, who was monitoring the market, was also somewhat surprised when she saw the announcement. They had been intercepted!","She didn't delay and immediately dialed Liu Yutong's number.","\"Sister Yutong, a spoiler has appeared. It's the richest man, Huang Yu.\"","Liu Yutong on the other end of the phone didn't seem surprised. \"I know. The guy couldn't hold back in the end.\"","Zhu Silin paused, her tone laced with astonishment. \"Sister Yutong, did you anticipate this?\"","Liu Yutong neither admitted nor denied it, saying ambiguously, \"More or less.\"","Actually, ever since she spoke with him at the school last time, she had a premonition that Huang Yu would never easily let go of this fat piece of meat. It was only a matter of time before he made a move.","However, what surprised her was that Huang Yu was actually still safe and sound. This was a bit unscientific!","Could it be that she remembered the time wrong?","\"Let's ignore him for now. The shares we control now add up to over 30%. We can initiate a shareholders' meeting to dismiss the Shen family from their positions.\"","Zhu Silin quickly did some mental math on the other end of the line before saying, \"Sister Yutong, the shares we currently have clear control over do indeed exceed thirty percent. However, if we really want to oust them, we need a majority vote from the shareholders. If the richest man and the Shen family join forces, combined with the fact that the Shen family has been deeply rooted in Qiming Appliances for many years, our proposal will likely fail to pass if they manage to rally the other shareholders to oppose the dismissal.\"","\"The richest man in particular is a massive variable. It will be fine if he stays out of it, but once he gets involved, the outcome will be really hard to predict.\"","Liu Yutong wasn't worried at all. \"Don't worry about him. Just convene the shareholders' meeting as usual.\"","\"Understood!\" Zhu Silin replied."]},{"number":586,"title":"Chapter 586: 586, The Lively Shareholders' Meeting","paragraphs":["The next day.","The front pages and headlines of all major financial media outlets were completely dominated by the thrilling long-short battle over Qiming Electronics.","\"Epic Long-Short Showdown! Qiming Electronics Single-Day Trading Volume Tops Ten Billion, Retail Investors Follow Suit, Short Sellers Crushed!\"","\"Sudden Shift in Qiming Electronics' Control! Richest Man Huang Yu Emerges with Gome, Becoming the Largest Shareholder in One Fell Swoop!\"","\"When the Snipe and the Clam Grapple, the Fisherman Profits? A Disruptor Appears in the Qiming Electronics Battle; Huang Yu Enters, Landscape Shifts Again!\"","\"The Shen Family in Crisis! Qiming Electronics May Change Hands, Future Direction a Mystery!\"","\".........\"","Just as major media outlets were still reporting on the long-short battle, another, even more explosive announcement and news story took over the financial headlines once again.","\"Breaking News! Qiming Electronics to Hold Extraordinary General Meeting; Shen Family's Eldest Son Shen Hao Teams Up with External Capital to Propose Ousting His Father, Shen Yanchang!\"","\"Family Feud Goes Completely Public! Shen Hao Turns Coat, Power Reshuffle at Qiming Electronics Imminent!\"","The moment the news broke, it immediately sparked heated discussions among a massive crowd of onlookers.","\"Love to see it! A son actually wanting to oust his old man, this plot is too thrilling!\"","\"Isn't it obvious? A classic wealthy family feud! They definitely couldn't agree on dividing the inheritance and had a falling out!\"","\"Grabbing my popcorn! This feels even better than a TV drama. Getting my little stool ready to wait for the updates!\"","\"I knew the eldest young master of the Shen family had been too quiet lately and definitely had a backup plan. I just didn't expect him to be this ruthless—flipping the table and refusing to play along!\"","\"Wait, what is Shen Hao even after? What good does it do him to drive his own dad out of power? Isn't the company still the Shen family's?\"","\"The commenter above is too naive! The title of the largest shareholder of the Shen family has already changed hands. It's obvious Shen Hao promised outsiders some benefits and wants to step up as a puppet chairman himself!\"","\"Insider news is here! I heard Shen Hao wanted to increase his shares before, but he was teamed up on and screwed over by his dad and two younger brothers, losing everything! This is his revenge!\"","\"Real or fake? If that's true, you can't blame the eldest young master for fighting back! If his own family played dirty first, they can't blame him for showing no mercy!\"","\"Heh, no matter what, that's still his biological father. Teaming up with outsiders to seize the family assets now is just unfilial! An absolute ungrateful wretch!\"","\"Here comes the filial piety moral kidnapping again? The business battlefield is all about ability and profit! Shen Yanchang caused the company's stock price to plummet, damaging the interests of all shareholders. What's wrong with ousting him?\"","\"Exactly, and who knows if his dad secretly consented when Shen Hao was screwed over back then? Maybe he's just biased towards the other two sons!\"","\"Even an upright official finds it hard to settle family quarrels, but this family fighting like this is really an ugly sight.\"","\"I'm more curious about the background of those three capital firms. Mingzhu, Yunshan, Wanlong—I've never even heard of them before!\"","\"Same here. I feel like these three firms have quite the background; they seem very powerful!\"","\"Who cares, let's just enjoy the drama! Sitting tight for the latest news from the shareholders' meeting. I think this will definitely be more exciting than a palace drama!\"","\"..........\"","Just as many netizens had guessed, this shareholders' meeting was more spectacular than many could have imagined, and it even revealed a piece of news far more explosive than the Shen family feud.","The extraordinary general meeting of Qiming Electronics was held in the largest auditorium at the company's headquarters.","Even so, the venue was still packed to the brim, completely impenetrable.","The number of attending shareholders far exceeded any previous meeting, almost more than three times that of a normal annual general meeting.","Shen Yanchang sat on the rostrum, looking at his eldest son, his face terrifyingly gloomy.","He never expected his eldest son to be so ruthless as to directly propose ousting him. If it weren't for the large crowd present, he would have wanted to sever his father-son relationship with this rebellious child right then and there.","The meeting proceeded methodically according to the established agenda. When it came time to deliberate the motion to dismiss certain company directors and senior management personnel, the atmosphere in the entire hall instantly grew tense.","As soon as the host announced that the representative of the proposing party should speak, Shen Hao stood up without hesitation, adjusted his suit buttons, and walked to the podium.","He ignored his father and two younger brothers, who were sitting on the rostrum with livid faces, picked up the microphone, and began to explain his reasons for the dismissal.","\"Fellow shareholders, I am Shen Hao. Standing here today is not my original intention, but for the future of the company, I have no choice but to do this.\"","\"I hereby officially propose the dismissal of Mr. Shen Yanchang from his position as Chairman, the dismissal of Mr. Shen Rui from his positions as Company Director and General Manager, and the dismissal of Mr. Shen Ming from his position as Deputy General Manager of the company!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, an uproar broke out in the audience.","Although everyone had long known that Shen Hao would make this move, actually hearing a son demand his father's ousting with their own ears still carried a very strong impact.","After the hall quieted down, Shen Hao continued to elaborate on his reasons for the dismissal.","\"The reasons are as follows. First, when the company faced normal market trading behaviors, Mr. Shen Yanchang and his management team made severe decision-making errors. They abused the poison pill strategy and did not hesitate to mortgage core company shares for irrational market confrontation, causing severe fluctuations in the company's stock price and greatly damaging the company's value and the interests of all shareholders!\"","\"Second, the management abilities of Shen Rui, Shen Ming, and others are truly concerning. They have caused numerous problems within the company and have long been unfit to continue holding core management positions!\"","\"Third, and most importantly! In order to maintain their personal control, they did not hesitate to drag the company into the mud. Even before this, for their own selfish interests, they maliciously obstructed other shareholders, including myself, from normally increasing our company shares. Their behavior has long deviated from the original intention of seeking profit for the company and all shareholders. What qualifications does such a management team have to continue leading Qiming Electronics?!\"","\"Shen Hao, you unfilial son! Shut your mouth!\"","Shen Yanchang could no longer hold back the fury in his heart. He slammed his hand on the table, stood up abruptly, pointed his finger at Shen Hao's nose, and cursed, \"How did I ever raise a traitorous thing like you! For a bit of family property, you actually colluded with outsiders to scheme against your own father!\"","Shen Rui and Shen Ming also couldn't wait to jump up, joining their father in condemning their eldest brother.","\"Big brother, do you have any conscience left! Dad worked so hard to raise you, and this is how you repay him? You teamed up with outsiders to snatch away the foundation our Shen family has built for over twenty years! You are going to destroy our Shen family!\"","\"That's right! Everyone, open your eyes and see what kind of people my big brother is cooperating with! Yunshan, Wanlong, Mingzhu—these three capital firms are all shell companies less than a year old. Who knows if their money is even clean? They are a pack of bloodthirsty wolves! Big brother, you are being used by them! You are inviting wolves into the house, and you have destroyed our father's life's work!\"","Faced with the relentless reprimands from his father and younger brothers, Shen Hao's expression remained perfectly calm. \"I never intended to betray the Shen family. You are the ones who pushed me to this point. Everything I have done is to save the company. One day, you will understand.\"","His words were not without merit. Liu Yutong had spoken with him about the hidden crises lurking within Qiming Electronics. For instance, the display screen technology that the company was currently pouring its research and development funds into had already veered completely off track.","Although no glaring issues had surfaced just yet, within a year's time, it was bound to deal a devastating blow to Qiming Electronics."]},{"number":587,"title":"Chapter 587: 587. The Girl in Black.","paragraphs":["Why was it said that Qiming Electric would suffer heavy losses in the future?","This was mainly because Liu Yutong had barely even heard of this former electrical manufacturing giant in her past life. Combining this with some materials provided by Shen Hao, she finally figured out where the problem lay.","At that time, the display screens and related home appliance products produced by Qiming Electric occupied a significant share of the market.","The mainstream television screen technology of this period was CCFL, or Cold Cathode Fluorescent Lamps. This backlight technology had its advantages: the technology was mature, the supply chain was complete, and the costs were low. For manufacturers like Qiming Electric, who could independently produce display screens and televisions, continuing down the CCFL route was both stable and capable of maintaining high profit margins.","On the other hand, the newly emerging LED technology not only had higher costs but also required more complex driver circuits. Under normal circumstances, the price of an LED-backlit television or display screen was 50% to even over 100% higher than a CCFL television or display of the same size.","This led many conservative manufacturers and consumers to feel that spending so much extra money just to have a slightly thinner television with slightly better picture quality was simply not worth it.","Qiming Capital was a manufacturer firmly committed to the CCFL route, and thus they invested almost nothing in LED research and development. This resulted in their technology falling completely behind just a year later, causing their stock price to plummet continuously. Although they did not go completely bankrupt, they rapidly deteriorated from an industry giant into a bottom-tier manufacturer.","Shen Hao undoubtedly trusted Liu Yutong's vision. This needed no proof; after all, who among the members of the Yunshan Society did not submit to her now?","Since Liu Yutong determined that choosing the CCFL route was a mistake, then it had to be a mistake. As long as he could successfully take power, he would definitely push the company to invest in LED research and development, upgrade the production lines, and achieve a certain degree of transformation.","Additionally, as one of the giants in electrical manufacturing, Qiming Electric had a massive demand for microchips. Since Liu Yutong had decided to invest in building a semiconductor foundry, she first needed to ensure that there would be buyers for the chips they produced. Qiming Electric was an excellent prospective client, and a massive one at that.","This was exactly why, among the three major capital firms controlled by Liu Yutong, Mingzhu Capital was the first to announce a stake acquisition and held the highest percentage of shares. Her plan was to use Mingzhu Capital as the primary shareholder to invest in the construction of the wafer fabrication and packaging plants.","............","The internal strife within the Shen family was visibly escalating.","Right at this moment, a rather domineering voice suddenly echoed into the venue from outside the doors.","\"Heh, what a fine drama of father and son turning against each other.\"","Everyone's attention was instantly drawn to the voice. They saw the richest man, Huang Yu, walking into the venue surrounded by several assistants.","\"It's the richest man! The richest man is here!\"","\"Sure enough, as a major shareholder, how could he possibly miss the shareholder meeting?\"","\"Things just got a lot more complicated.\"","\"I wonder whose side the richest man will take...\"","\"I feel like he might seize power too, considering he's a major shareholder now.\"","\".........\"","After arriving at the scene, Huang Yu did not take a seat. Instead, he walked straight up to the rostrum and directed a meaningful remark at Shen Hao, who was standing at the speaker's podium.","\"Nephew Shen, it's a good thing for young people to have ambition, but choosing the wrong partners can lead to eternal damnation.\"","After saying this, he turned his gaze toward the representatives of the three capital firms seated below, led by Zhu Silin.","\"Miss Zhu, this move played by you and the Miss Liu behind you is indeed brilliant. However, Qiming Electric is a real economy enterprise, not a tool for you to arbitrage. Don't you think it's a bit unkind to stir things up like this, making a father and son turn against each other and throwing their family into turmoil?\"","Hearing this, Zhu Silin replied calmly, \"Mr. Huang, all of our actions are legal and compliant, and what we are doing is for the good of the company.\"","Huang Yu sneered, ignoring her further, and turned to look at Shen Yanchang. \"Chairman Shen, it seems this situation today must be settled once and for all. Then let me state my position. I am willing to support Chairman Shen in continuing to manage the company. After all, the real economy needs grounded people to run it. We can't really let some capital of unknown origin and some ignorant young people destroy a perfectly good enterprise, can we?\"","Hearing the richest man actively voice his support, the two brothers, Shen Rui and Shen Ming, instantly showed joy on their faces.","\"Mr. Huang is deeply righteous; our Shen family is endlessly grateful!\"","Shen Yanchang seemed to have known the richest man's choice all along. His expression visibly relaxed, and he stood up, cupping his fists toward Huang Yu in a gesture of thanks.","\"Thank you for your support, Mr. Huang. Have all the shareholders seen this? Who is the one truly thinking about the company!\"","\"Little Hao, you want your old man to step down so badly, but what a pity, you've underestimated your old man.\"","\"Did you think teaming up with a few outsiders would be enough to make me step down? Take a good look at who the shareholders present and business leaders like Mr. Huang actually support. Everyone's eyes are clear; they all know who can truly lead Qiming Electric forward!\"","\"Everyone, I, Shen Yanchang, have been at the helm of Qiming for over twenty years. I dare not claim massive credit, but I have at least grown this company from a small local factory into an industry giant. As long as you continue to support me, I promise I will double the company's stock price at the very least!\"","Following Shen Yanchang's declaration, coupled with the public backing of the richest man, Huang Yu, the previously wavering shareholders in the venue began to voice their support one after another.","\"Since Chairman Shen has put it that way, I will continue to support Chairman Shen.\"","\"Shen Hao is indeed too young. I support Chairman Shen as well.\"","\"Even the richest man has stepped forward to endorse Chairman Shen, so I'll support him too.\"","\"Me too...\"","The title of the richest man simply carried too much persuasive power!","If Huang Yu had not stated his position, the outcome would have been hard to predict. But now that he had publicly supported Shen Yanchang, they weren't about to go against the richest man. Letting Shen Yanchang continue as chairman wasn't unacceptable.","Although what Shen Yanchang had done previously wasn't very pretty and had even harmed the shareholders' interests, he was still more reliable than Shen Hao, a young man who hadn't achieved any track record yet, right?","Soon, a rough count on the scene showed that the percentage of shareholders explicitly supporting Shen Yanchang and opposing the dismissal motion had surpassed fifty percent.","The situation seemed excellent!","Shen Rui and Shen Ming wore smug expressions. They looked at their eldest brother and mouthed the words: Big brother, you're still too green!","Shen Hao's expression remained entirely normal, as if he hadn't realized he was about to lose.","In the eyes of his two younger brothers, his calm demeanor was nothing more than a desperate attempt to maintain his composure and put on a brave face.","The host didn't waste any time and prepared to push forward to the voting phase.","\"Then, regarding the motion to dismiss Shen Yanchang, Shen Rui, and Shen Ming from their positions...\"","Bang!","The doors of the conference room were pushed open from the outside once again, interrupting the host's words.","There, backlit against the light in the doorway, a silhouette appeared.","She was a very young woman, looking no more than eighteen or nineteen, dressed in a custom-tailored black suit. She possessed an almost flawless face, and her eyes were strikingly bright. Yet, they held not a single trace of a young girl's delicate charm or innocence; instead, she exuded an overwhelming sense of intimidation.","She simply stood there with one hand tucked into her trouser pocket. Before she had even uttered a single word, her powerful aura caused the originally noisy venue to rapidly fall dead silent.","\"Who is this girl?\"","\"Never seen her before. Is she the daughter of one of the shareholders?\"","\"So young and beautiful, but her presence is seriously intense!\"","\"Did you guys notice the bodyguards behind her? All dressed in black, they give off a bit of an underworld vibe!\"","\"...\"","Amidst the crowd's bewildered and anxious whispers, the young woman in black strode forward. Wherever she walked, people unconsciously stepped sideways, parting to make a path for her.","Zhu Silin immediately stood up, voluntarily giving up his front-row seat, and greeted her in a low voice, \"Sister Yutong.\"","Liu Yutong did not stand on ceremony. She sat right down in the seat Zhu Silin had vacated and crossed her legs. Her posture was elegant yet carried a distinct, overbearing dominance as she addressed the room.","\"Where did the discussion leave off? Please give me the report from the top.\""]},{"number":588,"title":"Chapter 588: 588. Two-level Reversal","paragraphs":["Although the host did not know this strange girl in black, seeing her powerful aura, he knew her identity was far from simple. He briefly explained the situation, indicating that they had now reached the voting stage.","Meanwhile, upon seeing this suddenly appearing young woman, Shen Yanchang's mind raced, frantically searching his memory for anyone who could match the girl before him, but he came up empty.","\"Who is this girl? Do any of you know her?\"","Shen Rui and Shen Ming looked equally bewildered and shook their heads at the same time.","Right at this moment, the richest man, Huang Yu, who had always believed he had everything under control, showed a change in expression, adding a bit of wariness and displeasure.","\"I was wondering who could have such a grand entrance, so it's Miss Liu gracing us with her presence. I thought you wouldn't dare to come today.\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"What are you talking about, President Huang? If you are here, how could I not come?\"","Seeing that the two seemed to know each other, Shen Yanchang couldn't help but ask Huang Yu, \"President Huang, do you know her?\"","Huang Yu nodded. \"I do. She is the boss behind Mingzhu Capital, Yunshan Capital, and Wanlong Capital.\"","Upon hearing the richest man, Huang Yu, reveal the identity of this girl in black, the entire venue instantly erupted into an uproar!","\"What? She's the boss behind those three capital firms?\"","\"The boss of three capital firms is actually the same person? That's ridiculous.\"","\"Are you kidding me? How old does she look? Is she even twenty?\"","\"Oh my god! The one who leveraged tens of billions of funds and pushed the Shen family into a corner is actually such a young girl.\"","\"President Huang said it himself, how could it be fake? It's truly unbelievable!\"","\"Then what's her background? Is she the daughter of some wealthy family? But I've never heard of her!\"","\".........\"","Shen Yanchang and his two sons also changed their expressions upon hearing this.","They originally thought their opponent was an old fox in the capital market. They never expected it to be such a young girl, and they suddenly felt extremely humiliated.","Being beaten so badly in the capital market by a girl who might still be in school was indeed a terrible look.","Listening to the shock and discussions around her, Liu Yutong looked at Huang Yu with a half-smile.","\"President Huang, it seems you didn't take to heart what I told you at the school last time.\"","School?","Hearing these two words, the crowd's imaginations instantly ran wild.","Could it be that the richest man, Huang Yu, and this mysterious girl knew each other before? And it sounded like they had some unpleasant history?","Huang Yu's face instantly darkened. \"Miss Liu, you still want to threaten me? Do you think you can scare me?!\"","\"I won't waste words with you. You just want to seize control of Qiming Electrics. Today, at this shareholders' meeting, I, Huang Yu, will put my words right here: I firmly support Chairman Shen Yanchang to continue leading the company. If you want to seize power, don't even think about it!\"","He wanted to rely on his prestige as the richest man and his shareholding advantage to forcefully ruin Liu Yutong's plan.","Liu Yutong was just about to retort when Shen Yanchang's youngest son, Shen Ming, seeing this girl being so arrogant, couldn't help but interrupt and curse.","\"Damn it, what are you pretending to be, you little brat?! Do you really think you're a big shot? You're just a woman who climbed up relying on your face and who knows what dirty tricks. This is the shareholders' meeting of our Qiming Electrics, not a place for you to act wild. Get out!\"","As soon as these words came out, the whole room was shocked!","Was the third young master of the Shen family crazy? How dare he speak to someone like that, knowing that she held the most shares among everyone present on the surface.","Actually, Shen Ming wasn't completely hot-headed when he cursed. He saw that the richest man had a grudge against this woman, so in order to please the richest man and vent his anger for him, he unceremoniously stood up to humiliate her.","Zhu Silin's eyes instantly turned ice-cold, and she was just about to say: How dare you speak like that?","Before she could even open her mouth, Lan Die, who was standing behind Liu Yutong, moved in a flash.","Shen Ming only saw a cold glare and a hand as fast as lightning. Before he could even react, a piercing pain shot through his wrist, and he involuntarily let out a scream like a slaughtered pig.","\"Ah! My hand!\"","Lan Die used a grappling technique, instantly locking Shen Ming's arm against its joint, making him bend over in agony, his face ruthlessly pressed against the tabletop by her.","\"What are you doing! This is a shareholders' meeting! Security, where is the security!\" Shen Rui immediately yelled when he saw his brother pinned down.","The security guards outside didn't dare to come in at all. They all lowered their heads and pretended not to hear. Because standing in front of them were about twenty men in black, looking like hardened thugs, staring them down, so they simply didn't dare to move.","Just like that, under everyone's horrified gaze, two more men in black stepped directly onto the stage, one on the left and one on the right, and dragged Shen Ming right out.","\"Let me go! Do you even know who the hell I am? You dare touch me? My dad is Shen Yanchang! President Huang, the richest man, is right here, you're looking for death...\"","Dragged out of the venue and into the hallway, Shen Ming was still struggling desperately, cursing with foul language.","But the very next second, he let out another miserable shriek.","\"Ah!!!\"","\"I was wrong! I was wrong! Spare me!\"","\"Ah! Hahaha...\"","\"...\"","As Shen Ming's half-dead screams and eerie laughter drifted in intermittently, the shareholders in the venue felt their hair stand on end, everyone fearing for themselves.","\"They're hitting him, they actually dared to hit him!\"","\"Committing violence in broad daylight, right in front of so many people? Is there no law anymore!\"","\"Who exactly are these men in black? This is too scary!\"","\"Utterly lawless!\"","\".........\"","Shen Yanchang watched his youngest son get dragged out and beaten in public. Trembling with anger, he pointed at Liu Yutong. \"You... you are too presumptuous! I'm calling the police! I'm going to have you arrested!\"","Liu Yutong remained calm. \"Today is a shareholders' meeting. I merely kicked out an irrelevant person. Chairman Shen, you don't need to get so worked up.\"","Shen Ming actually had no shares under his name. Because of the recent stock war, the equity under his and his second brother's names had been dumped first. So he wasn't a shareholder of Qiming Electrics at all; there was nothing wrong with what Liu Yutong said.","Huang Yu also didn't expect Liu Yutong to be so arrogant as to have her people lay hands on Shen Ming right at the shareholders' meeting, in front of so many socialites and shareholders. He instantly flew into a rage.","\"Liu Yutong, I'm warning you, tell your people to let Shen Ming go immediately! Otherwise, I will call the police right now! Don't think you can do whatever you want just because you have some background!\"","Liu Yutong looked indifferent. \"Sure! If you want to call the police, go right ahead! You don't need to borrow my phone, do you?\"","Huang Yu: \"You...\"","He was just saying it; he couldn't actually call the police, because calling the police might bring even more trouble.","Liu Yutong seeing that they were all just all talk, didn't want to keep tangling with them and looked straight at the host.","\"Host, let's start the voting now, hurry up!\"","The host trembled all over with fear. Subconsciously, he glanced at the wealthiest man, Huang Yu, and Chairman Shen Yanchang, then looked at the powerfully intimidating young woman in black and the menacing men in black standing behind her.","Ultimately, his survival instinct gained the upper hand. He stammered as he announced, \"N-now... we will proceed with the... the vote on the motion to dismiss Mr. Shen Yanchang, Mr. Shen Rui, and Mr. Shen Ming from their respective positions!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the wealthiest man, Huang Yu, spoke up again.","\"Don't be afraid, everyone. I will back you up today! Vote for Chairman Shen if you support him. If they dare to cause any more trouble, I'll make sure they pay dearly for it!\"","\"Rest assured, this is a shareholders' meeting, not the turf of some crime syndicate. They wouldn't dare actually lay a hand on you!\"","Hearing the wealthiest man's words, the shareholders felt their hearts settle slightly. Just as they were preparing to cast their votes...","Bang!","The doors to the conference hall were pushed open once again.","This time, a squad of stern-faced police officers in uniform marched in.","The moment they saw the police, the shareholders looked as if they had just seen their saviors or their own family members. Their sense of security was instantly maxed out.","Although everyone couldn't see exactly what Shen Ming was being subjected to, his miserable screams alone were enough to tell them he was enduring inhuman torture. They also knew that this group of men in black was probably genuinely ruthless, which was why they had been hesitating and afraid to vote so quickly.","But things were different now. The police were here, and they had nothing to fear!","Immediately, a shareholder stood up. \"I want to cast my vote for Chairman Shen Yanchang! I support Shen Yanchang continuing...\"","Before this shareholder could even finish his sentence, the police officers scanned the shareholders present, locked eyes on Huang Yu, and immediately held up a stamped arrest warrant.","\"Huang Yu, you are suspected of multiple serious crimes. The evidence is conclusive. This is an arrest warrant. We are now placing you under arrest in accordance with the law. Please cooperate!\"","The shareholders: ???","What?!","Arresting the wealthiest man? Was this a joke?!","The shareholder who hadn't finished speaking froze for a moment when he heard the police officer's words. Then, abruptly changing his tune, he frantically shouted, \"I... I support Chairman Shen Yanchang stepping down!!!\""]},{"number":589,"title":"Chapter 589: 589, Rumor","paragraphs":["Two law enforcement officers stepped forward, snapped cold handcuffs onto Huang Yu's wrists, and escorted him away from the scene, flanking him on both sides.","The wealthiest man, a titan who could summon the wind and rain in the business world and make the capital markets tremble with a single stomp of his foot, was now being taken away in front of everyone's eyes.","Just a moment before Huang Yu was led out of the venue, he suddenly turned his head and glared fiercely at the girl who had remained perfectly calm from beginning to end, Liu Yutong.","It was her! It had to be her!","No wonder she had told him to watch his back at the university last time. He never expected her to actually go through with it. What a strong desire for revenge.","In reality, Huang Yu was completely mistaken; his arrest had absolutely nothing to do with Liu Yutong. He had brought this entirely upon himself. He had been called in for questioning before, and instead of laying low after getting out, he had attempted to seek profit through illegal means. His downfall was only a matter of time.","Silence!","A deathly silence!","After Huang Yu was taken away, the entire venue plunged into a suffocating silence.","If the female bodyguard subduing Shen Ming earlier had merely made them think this girl in black was ruthless and a bit shady, then at this moment, her image in everyone's eyes had transformed into an entity of absolute, overwhelming power.","That was the richest man in the country. To put it bluntly, ordinary people wouldn't dare lay a finger on him because the repercussions would be too massive.","But now, he was arrested just like that?","What kind of terrifying background and influence would it take to pull this off?","No wonder this girl in black could control three major investment firms at such a young age. Now, everything made sense.","Without a sky-high background, how could she control so much capital? How could she effortlessly pull out nearly ten billion in funds and beat the Shen family into utter defenselessness?","All the shareholders, including Chairman Shen Yanchang and his second son Shen Rui, looked at Liu Yutong with a newfound trace of fear in their eyes.","This woman was ruthless and decisive, with a background so formidable that it was simply impossible for them to oppose her.","Anyone who objected was just asking for death!","The host, holding the microphone with trembling hands, asked cautiously, \"Miss... Miss Liu, do you think we should still proceed with the vote?\"","Liu Yutong slowly stood up, her calm gaze sweeping across the room.","Anyone her eyes brushed past lowered their heads, their hearts pounding wildly, not daring to meet her gaze.","After all, with two cautionary tales right in front of them, who would dare to stick their neck out?","Liu Yutong finally looked at the host and said lightly, \"Please continue.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes! Continuing! I will continue right away!\"","The host hurriedly shouted, \"The vote, the vote begins now. Shareholders in favor of dismissing Shen Yanchang, Shen Rui, and Shen Ming from their positions, please raise your hands!\"","The result was without any suspense.","Those shareholders who had previously been ambiguous or even explicitly supported Shen Yanchang and Huang Yu were now scrambling to raise their hands, terrified that if they were too slow, Liu Yutong would remember them and they would suffer terrible luck.","\"I am in favor!\"","\"Shen Yanchang is incompetent in his management; he must be dismissed!\"","\"I support all decisions made by Miss Liu and Young Master Shen Hao!\"","\"...\"","There were no surprises.","The percentage of shares in favor of the dismissal exceeded sixty-five percent. Some chose to abstain, and the richest man's absence naturally counted as an abstention, leaving only the shares held by the Shen family themselves.","The vote ultimately passed. Shen Yanchang was officially stripped of his chairmanship, and Shen Rui and Shen Ming were also relieved of their duties.","Next, Zhu Silin put forward another proposal. Naturally, it was a vote regarding Shen Hao taking over as chairman, as well as a vote for Yunshan and the other two investment firms to join the board of directors. These also passed.","With this, the power structure of Qiming Electronics completely reshuffled on this day, in a way that no one could have ever anticipated.","...","That evening, explosive news headlines bombarded the internet.","The front pages of almost all mainstream media outlets were dominated by the Qiming Electronics incident.","Shocking Upheaval! Richest Man Huang Yu Taken Away by Police at Qiming Electronics Shareholder Meeting!","Qiming Electronics Power Reshuffled Overnight, Shen Family Dynasty Falls, Mysterious Young Woman May Be the Biggest Winner!","The reports detailed the dramatic scenes at the shareholder meeting. From the infighting among the Shen family father and sons, to the high-profile entrance of the richest man Huang Yu to support former Chairman Shen Yanchang, and finally to the mysterious young woman in black appearing and sealing the outcome, the entire process was more thrilling than a television drama.","Although no photos of the girl in black circulated online, it still sparked countless imaginations regarding her mysterious identity.","\"Not even TV shows would dare write a script like this. The richest man was actually arrested right at the shareholder meeting?\"","\"Can anyone tell me what kind of background that young lady in black has?\"","\"To be able to take down the richest man, I have a bold guess: could she be an heir from some top-tier wealthy family we don't know about, out to gain experience?\"","\"Definitely. Otherwise, how could an ordinary person handle the richest man?\"","\"Is a new era coming? It feels like the capital circle is about to be turned upside down!\"","\"...\"","When the richest man fell, aside from the delighted onlookers gossiping online, the business world also paid close attention.","After all, as a top-tier tycoon in the business world, many CEOs and investors knew Huang Yu, and some were even very familiar with him.","Hearing suddenly that he was in trouble, and that he had fallen at the hands of a young girl, felt particularly absurd. At first, no one believed it.","But when they actually made calls to understand the situation and confirmed it was true, everyone was both shocked and amazed.","Wait, is there really a girl with such a powerful background?","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, two investors from Wanhui Select, were currently sitting together chatting about investments. Just as they were planning to push for an IPO after their Series C funding, they also received the news of the richest man's arrest.","Initially, they were merely surprised, but when they learned that an old acquaintance was also present at the shareholder meeting, their first reaction was: Isn't Miss Liu a bit too impatient?","As famous investors, they knew not only Liu Yutong but also Huang Yu. They had heard that there was some bad blood between Liu Yutong and the richest man, but they never expected Miss Liu to be so petty as to directly take him out.","They didn't suspect that this matter actually had nothing to do with Liu Yutong. This was mainly because, in their impression, Liu Yutong was exactly that kind of domineering person, and her methods were far more ruthless than an ordinary person's.","It wasn't too surprising to them that Liu Yutong could pull off something like this.","They even felt that Liu Yutong wanted to use this incident to declare to the world: whoever dares to stand in her way, whoever dares to oppose her, this will be their end!","\"Using the richest man to establish her dominance, that is truly a grand move. From now on, who would dare to easily offend this Miss Liu? Old Chu, Wanhui Select is about to launch its IPO after the Series C round. At this critical juncture, although we haven't had any conflicts with Miss Liu before, we absolutely must not offend her. At the very least, we must never stand on her opposing side.\"","\"I understand. We can only be friends, not enemies. This Miss Liu is so young, yet her mind is so deep, her methods so ruthless, and her background so terrifying. I have truly never seen anything like it in my life. I used to think her reach couldn't extend beyond Pearl City, but looking at it now, I was wrong. We all underestimated her.\"","\"The business world of the Dragon Kingdom is about to change skies!\"","\"...\""]},{"number":590,"title":"Chapter 590: 590. Weibo's Beta Testing: Its Reputation is Getting Worse and Worse","paragraphs":["The incident involving the richest man caused an uproar in the outside world. In less than a day, dozens of different versions of the story had sprung up.","Liu Yutong paid no attention to these increasingly outrageous rumors. At this moment, she was looking at Weibo, which had already begun its closed beta testing.","Weibo didn't have any prefixes; it was simply called Weibo. In her past life, Xinliang only changed its name to Weibo a few years later, but now she had preemptively claimed the name.","Liu Yutong entered the closed beta address into the browser's address bar, and the page quickly loaded. The interface was very minimalist, which perfectly matched Zhang Dalong's style of creating products.","The website's background colors were mainly blue and white, and the functional areas were clearly divided. In particular, the core functions of posting, following, forwarding, and commenting had all been implemented.","After testing it for more than ten minutes, Liu Yutong finally looked up at Zhang Dalong.","\"I've taken a rough look at the closed beta version. The basic framework is built quite well, and the core functions are running smoothly. How long until the open beta?\"","\"It should be open for public beta testing within about half a month,\" Zhang Dalong replied.","\"Well, content moderation needs to be prepared in advance. The characteristics we've set for Weibo are real-time, public, and fast-spreading. This means that any inappropriate information—whether it's rumors, defamation, pornography, or violent content—once published, will spread much faster and have a wider impact than traditional media. If we aren't careful and fail to act as good gatekeepers, things could easily go wrong. You need to pay special attention to this.\"","\"Yes, Miss! It's just that recruiting moderation staff takes quite a long time, and they'll also need time for training,\" Zhang Dalong said with some hesitation.","Hearing this, Liu Yutong smiled. \"Actually, this part should be the easiest for us.\"","Zhang Dalong was taken aback. \"The easiest?\"","Liu Yutong reminded him, \"Have you forgotten your other identity?\"","Zhang Dalong thought seriously for a moment and suddenly realized what she meant. \"I understand. I'll go find Brother Ma later and have him transfer a group of people to do content moderation.\"","Although he had been fully leading the team to develop Weibo during this time, as a core member of the Wanlong Society, he also needed to study at the law firm in his spare time like everyone else.","Although the teaching method at Tianyi Law Firm was a bit... well... special, it had to be said that everyone's enthusiasm for learning was indeed very high. Generally, core members who could pass the assessment would at least have a relatively thorough understanding of criminal law.","The main responsibility of Weibo moderation is to screen information that may be suspected of violating laws and regulations. If someone who knows nothing about the law were to do this job, they would indeed need training and adaptation. But it was a different story for the core members of the Wanlong Society. They could tell at a glance if there was a problem. If they couldn't tell, wouldn't their law classes have been for nothing?","After solving the problem of moderation staff, the two talked about the promotion and operation of the website.","Liu Yutong's idea was very simple: in the early stages, they needed to pull in more celebrities, media outlets, experts, and scholars to join, using their influence to drive Weibo's initial ecosystem.","However, in the starting phase, if the money wasn't right, those celebrities and stars might not be willing to join. They needed to find a suitable opportunity.","Instead, Zhang Dalong brought up the gift Liu Yutong had promised him earlier. \"Miss, you said before that you'd give me a gift once Weibo was made. Can I know what it is now?\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and asked, \"Do you know about light apps?\"","Zhang Dalong: \"Light apps?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"You can understand it as an interactive program module that can be used with a click, without needing to be downloaded or installed, and can be seamlessly embedded into Weibo's web pages. It doesn't pursue complex functions; its main focus is on fun, interactivity, and social attributes. The goal is to enhance user stickiness and activity on the platform.\"","\"The gift I said I'd give you is related to this. If you don't understand, go find Yu Xin. She will take you to see that gift, and you'll understand then.\"","\"Okay, then I'll go find President Yu right now.\"","\"Mhm, go ahead.\"","Not long after Zhang Dalong left, Liu Yutong's phone rang. The caller ID showed it was President Zhang of Suning.","\"Hello, President Zhang!\"","On the other end of the phone, President Zhang coughed a few times, and then chatted with her about President Huang being arrested. After all, as his old rival, President Huang's sudden arrest made him sigh with emotion.","He hadn't expected this battle for industry leadership to end in such a dramatic way.","Huang Yu getting into trouble was definitely good news for him. It was also a great opportunity for Suning to surpass Gome in one fell swoop and become the industry leader.","\"President Zhang, what happened to President Huang has absolutely nothing to do with me. I was completely unaware of it,\" Liu Yutong explained.","However, President Zhang on the other end said in an understanding tone, \"I understand. It was the police acting according to the law; it has nothing to do with you.\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","\"It really has nothing to do with me, President Zhang. You can't spread rumors,\" she emphasized again.","The more she emphasized it, the more President Zhang on the other end was convinced that she had done it.","\"Chairman Liu, you don't need to explain. I definitely believe you. Moreover, I want to reach a strategic partnership with your side. I know you're going to build several more Wanlong Plazas. You must save a spot for my Suning. I won't haggle with you over the rent; whatever it is, I'll pay it, even if it's extra.\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","Hearing the dial tone from the phone, she felt a wave of speechlessness.","What on earth was all this?","She was clearly telling the truth, so how did it sound to the other party like a guilty conscience trying to cover up?","Forget it! Let them think whatever they want.","Later, Liu Yutong successively received calls from investor Ji Zhe and some business friends she had met during the school anniversary. They all seemed to have heard some rumors and wanted to verify them with her, the person involved.","She basically used the same explanation with them as she did with President Zhang, but the replies she received were invariably \"I understand!\" and \"I believe you!\"—words that sounded extremely perfunctory.","And as soon as these guys hung up the phone, they turned around and told their friends nearby.","\"I called to verify it with her personally. She did it.\"","\"Offend Miss Liu, and even the richest man can't expect a good ending!\"","\"But didn't Miss Liu say she didn't do it? She wouldn't lie, would she?\"","\"Flies don't bite seamless eggs. Do you think her words can be trusted? She has a track record.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"I've been to Pearl City and heard some incredible things. This person might really be a bit shady...\"","\"...\"","After an unknown amount of time, Liu Yutong's phone rang again. It was from a stranger.","Perhaps the rumors were too convincing; the other party immediately asked her what it would take to let President Huang go, even offering to give her shares in Qiming Electrical Appliances, begging her to be magnanimous.","She was so angry she laughed. She said, \"It has nothing to do with me,\" and hung up the phone.","Moreover, she couldn't shake the feeling that her reputation in the business world was about to be ruined!"]},{"number":591,"title":"Chapter 591: 591, The Surprising Ya Ya.","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong had received so many phone calls today that she was starting to feel annoyed. She had just hung up from one, and barely two minutes had passed before her phone rang again.","Originally, she was going to just turn it off, but when she saw the caller ID this time, a smile instantly appeared on her face.","\"Grandpa!\"","\"Hmph! So you still remember you have a grandpa? How could you hide such a huge matter from us!\"","Liu Yutong froze for a moment. She vaguely guessed what her grandpa was referring to, but she smiled and said, \"Grandpa, what are you talking about? How would I dare hide anything from you and Grandma?\"","\"Still playing dumb? The Liu family has gained a little girl. How long has it been, and you still haven't told me and your grandma. If Debao hadn't let it slip, I wouldn't even know you found us a little granddaughter. Are you afraid we wouldn't welcome the little girl?\"","Sure enough, it was about Yaya.","Liu Yutong had originally planned to wait until Yaya got used to her new environment before taking her back to their hometown to visit her grandparents. It was just that she had been so busy lately that she completely forgot about it.","\"Grandpa, what are you saying? How could I think that way? Yaya was a bit shy around strangers before. I wanted to wait until she settled in before taking her back to see you and Grandma. It was my oversight; I should have told you sooner.\"","\"Stop making excuses! No matter how shy she is, we are still her grandparents!\"","\"I don't care. Tomorrow happens to be the weekend. You must bring the little girl back for dinner and let your grandma meet her.\"","\"Alright! Alright! I'll bring Yaya back tomorrow, okay?\"","\"...\"","After finally coaxing her grandpa, Liu Yutong raised her hand to check her watch and realized there were less than twenty minutes left until kindergarten let out.","Since she had mostly finished her work for the day, she decided to go pick up Yaya herself.","Ten or so minutes later, she arrived by car at Crescent Kindergarten.","This kindergarten wasn't far from the Qiongyue Bay villa district where Liu Yutong lived, and it was one of the most exclusive kindergartens in Pearl City. The roads on both sides of the school gate were already lined with cars, and parents were waiting at the entrance to pick up their children.","However, as the dismissal bell rang, waves of children came out and were picked up batch by batch. The crowd at the gate gradually thinned out until eventually no one was left, but Liu Yutong still hadn't seen Yaya.","Just as she was about to ask the teachers at the gate what was going on, a young female teacher walked over to her.","\"You are Jingyao's sister, right?\"","\"Yes, I am. Where is she? Why hasn't she come out yet?\"","\"Yaoyao is currently in the principal's office. This afternoon, she had a little conflict with another child in her class.\"","\"Did she get into a fight? Take me to see her.\"","Led by the teacher, Liu Yutong soon arrived outside the principal's office.","Before she even entered, she heard a shrill female voice shouting excitedly from inside: \"I don't care, you have to give me an explanation! She's so vicious at such a young age, what will she be like when she grows up? It's obvious she wasn't raised right at home! A little brat with a mother who birthed her but didn't raise her!\"","\"Hey, Haohao's parent, how can you insult a child like that?\"","\"So what if I insult her? Who told her to hit my Haohao! And where are her parents? Why aren't they here yet?\"","Outside the door, Liu Yutong's eyes instantly turned cold upon hearing the woman's voice. She was just about to push the door open when she heard Yaya speak. She pulled her hand back and stopped the teacher who was with her.","If Yaya had been crying, she would definitely have rushed in immediately. But not only did she not hear Yaya crying, she also wanted to hear how the little girl would handle this.","Inside the office.","Facing her classmate's parent, Yaya was a bit scared, but she still refuted the woman with clear logic.","\"Auntie Wang, first of all, I need to correct a few of your inaccurate statements.\"","\"First, regarding the fight. The fact is that Wang Hao deliberately spilled soup on my clothes during lunch. This behavior constitutes intentional damage to another person's property. Secondly, he repeatedly called me a wild child, which infringed upon my right to personal dignity. Finally, he pushed me first, and I only fought back. My actions are legally termed self-defense, not a fight like you said, and it certainly doesn't count as me hitting him.\"","\"From beginning to end today, the fault does not lie with me. It is Wang Hao's fault, and he should bear the consequences himself.\"","Mrs. Wang was left dumbfounded by the little girl in front of her, and even the principal and the teachers in the office were stunned.","Wait, were these really words that a five or six-year-old child could say? And did she just cite legal clauses?","Could it be that this little girl didn't watch cartoons or play with toys at home, but spent all day reading law books? But she was so young, she probably couldn't even recognize many words, right? Law books gave even adults headaches, let alone children.","How on earth did this girl do it?","Little did they know, there were only three places Yaya often went to on weekends: the company, the law firm, and the boxing gym. Liu Yutong was too busy to keep her company all the time, so the task of taking care of her was handed over to the core members of the Wanlong Association. Basically, whoever was free would take her out to play.","The places those guys took her the most were not amusement parks or hobby classes, but either the boxing gym or the law firm.","Influenced by what she constantly saw and heard, the little girl developed an interest in those fun laws.","Of course, this was mainly because her teachers taught in such a vivid and entertaining way. Even the guys in the Wanlong Association who hated studying could listen with great relish, so the little girl was naturally no exception.","And so, as the days passed, not only did the little girl's martial arts skills improve a bit, but she also became much more articulate.","Although Liu Yutong had noticed some changes in Yaya early on, seeing with her own eyes that Yaya could refute an adult so reasonably still left her somewhat surprised.","This little sister was quite a prodigy!","After Yaya finished addressing her classmate's issue, she immediately pointed her little finger at Mrs. Wang and continued, \"Second, regarding your comments just now, Auntie Wang. You said I had a mother who birthed me but didn't raise me. This statement is extremely wrong and highly insulting. Not only does this constitute another personal insult against me, but it also violates basic moral standards and the provisions in the Law on the Protection of Minors regarding the respect for the personal dignity of minors. I demand that you immediately stop making such remarks and apologize to me.\"","Mrs. Wang was completely dumbfounded. \"You... you little brat, you dare lecture me?! This is outrageous!\"","\"Tell me, who taught you these twisted logics! Principal, look at this, does this sound like something a normal child would say? Her parents must have taught her! What kind of adults teach their kids these things? It's completely crooked!\"","\"Let me tell you, little brat, this isn't over today. Tell your family to get over here right now. They must apologize to my son and pay for his medical expenses, otherwise I'll show you what's coming!\"","Faced with this shrewish screaming, Yaya shrank back in fear, but still asked in a crisp voice, \"Are you requesting that my guardian step in and intervene?\"","\"Exactly! Call your guardian over! I want to see what kind of person raised a... little wild brat like you!\"","Perhaps because Yaya had just mentioned the Minors Protection Law, she forcefully swallowed the word 'bastard' that was right on the tip of her tongue and swapped it for another term.","After asking the kindergarten principal for permission, Yaya picked up the office landline and dialed the front desk of the Wanlonghui Group.","The reason she dialed this number was that her older sister had told her that calling it would solve any problem, no matter what it was, and that it was also the way to reach her sister. Most importantly, the landline number was short and very easy to remember.","The call connected quickly, and the lady at the front desk answered.","\"Hello, this is Yaya. I am at the kindergarten right now... My classmate's mother is insisting that my guardian comes over... You are asking how many people should come?\"","Holding the phone, Yaya turned her head to look at Mrs. Wang: \"Auntie Wang, would you like all my guardians to come, or is just one enough?\"","If she remembered correctly, she had many, many guardians—so many she could not even count them. As for why she had so many, her sister had told her that anyone in the company wearing black clothes counted as her guardian.","Therefore, she needed to confirm. After all, calling everyone over did not seem like a good idea, as those older brothers and sisters still had to work and study.","Mrs. Wang clearly misunderstood her words, thinking the little girl was threatening her: \"What do you mean? Are you trying to call your whole family over to back you up? Then call them! Call them all over!\"","Yaya nodded and spoke into the receiver: \"Auntie Wang wants all my guardians to come over, so could I trouble you to notify them... Okay, thank you.\""]},{"number":592,"title":"Chapter 592: 592. The Disposition of Ya Ya.","paragraphs":["Outside the office door, after hearing the conversation inside, Liu Yutong first sent a text message to Ma Da, telling him to bring fewer people over. She told him not to actually call everyone, just enough to make a point.","Yaya was still young, and she didn't even know how many core members there were. If they really called everyone, the kindergarten courtyard probably wouldn't be able to hold them all. Excluding the core members who had gone out of town, there were still at least over a thousand core members currently in Pearl City.","After sending the text, Liu Yutong turned and walked away.","Since Yaya was so assertive, she naturally didn't want to step in halfway and ruin Yaya's experience. She believed that with today's experience, even without her stepping forward, Yaya would know how to independently handle this kind of conflict in the future. This would be beneficial for Yaya's growth.","Liu Yutong didn't say a word and turned to leave. The teacher beside her was stunned for a moment and hurriedly chased after her. \"Miss Liu, Miss Liu? Why are you leaving?\"","\"Teacher Yu, I'll just wait outside for a while. You go back, pretend you didn't see me, and don't mention that I was here,\" Liu Yutong turned her head and said.","Although Teacher Yu didn't understand why, she didn't dare to ask too much. After all, the families of the children who could attend this kindergarten were either rich or noble. It was normal to have some eccentricities, so she just treated it as a rich person's quirk.","Liu Yutong didn't go far; she just sat in the kindergarten's security room. The security guard inside tactfully stepped out and silently stood at the main gate to continue his watch.","About seven or eight minutes later, the sound of car engines came from outside the window, and over a dozen cars stopped uniformly at the kindergarten's main gate.","Fortunately, the kindergarten students had already been dismissed from school, so it didn't cause any traffic congestion.","Immediately after, young men dressed in matching black suits stepped out of the cars and quickly gathered at the kindergarten entrance. Visually, there were over a hundred of them.","The security guard standing at the gate had never seen such a lineup before and immediately panicked.","In an instant, countless drill scenarios flashed through his mind, such as how to respond if thugs or hooligans tried to break into the kindergarten.","It was just... damn it, no one had ever taught them how to deal with hundreds of gangsters!","\"What... what are you doing here?\"","A chubby man in black leading the group merely glanced at the security guard, and the guard instantly lost his voice, his hand reaching for the phone in his pocket to call the police.","\"We are the little miss's guardians. We just received a call to come and resolve a dispute,\" Ma Da said.","The security guard was stunned, thinking he had misheard. \"You... you are all guardians?\"","Ma Da nodded. \"That's right, we are all guardians.\"","The security guard: \"...\"","Now he had seen everything!","He had worked at this kindergarten for so long, and it was his first time seeing a child with over a hundred guardians.","Could it be that there was a mafia boss's child in their kindergarten?","It seemed that was the only logical explanation.","\"Then... then I'll go inform them.\"","Ma Da waved his hand. \"No need, we'll just go straight in.\"","Anyway, the kindergarten was empty now, so going in wouldn't scare the little kids.","The security guard could only watch helplessly as this group of intimidating figures barged in, not even daring to entertain the thought of stopping them.","Meanwhile, in the principal's office.","Mrs. Wang seemed to be getting impatient from waiting.","\"Where are they? How long has it been? I think it's just a bluff! Let me tell you, my husband will be here soon too! When he gets here, we'll see how he deals with you...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, the office door was violently pushed open from the outside.","In an instant, the light in the office seemed to dim a bit.","At the doorway and in the hallway outside, a dense crowd of men dressed in black suits stood packed together, instantly maximizing the sense of oppression.","The faces of the people in the office instantly turned pale with fright. The little boy burst into tears of terror and hid behind his mother.","Ma Da walked into the office with an arrogant swagger and immediately asked, \"Who wants to see the little miss's guardians? We are here now.\"","When Yaya saw Ma Da, she first politely greeted him, and then pointed her little finger at Mrs. Wang. \"Brother Ma Da, it's this Auntie Wang. She insisted that my guardian come, so that's why I called you all here.\"","Hearing this, Ma Da nodded and looked at the trembling Mrs. Wang.","\"Speak. How do you want to resolve this?\"","Mrs. Wang was already somewhat out of her wits. \"What... what do you want to do? Let me tell you, my husband is Wang Dacheng. He's the boss of Chengyuan Construction Company and a prominent figure in Pearl City. If you dare touch me, my husband will definitely not let you off!\"","After saying that, she hastily took out her phone to make a call. \"Hubby, hubby, come quickly! Our son and I are blocked in the kindergarten. There are so many of them, hurry up and bring people to save me!\"","Mrs. Wang hung up the phone and yelled at Ma Da and the others, \"Just you wait, my husband will be here right away! Let's see how he deals with you!\"","Ma Da was speechless for a moment, thinking to himself: We didn't even plan to do anything to you, why are you so excited?","However, out of respect for Yaya, he gave her face and just waited for her husband to arrive.","It didn't take long.","A slightly overweight middle-aged man ran into the kindergarten panting heavily. Behind him followed over a dozen people who looked like construction workers.","\"Who the fuck dares to bully my wife and kid? I'll kill him!\" Wang Dacheng shouted angrily as he ran.","However, when he reached the door of the principal's office and saw the dense crowd of men in black suits at the doorway and in the hallway, his angry shouts abruptly stopped, and his footsteps grew slower and slower.","Hearing the noise outside, Ma Da immediately walked out of the office, wanting to see who had such a big mouth.","Before he could even speak, the other party recognized him first.","Upon seeing the person approach, Wang Dacheng's pupils shrank sharply, and he stuttered, \"President... President... President Ma?\"","His Chengyuan Construction Company was just an inconspicuous little company in Pearl City's business world. He had once seen Ma Da from afar at a high-end commercial cocktail party. At the time, someone had told him that this man was a core figure of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang, absolutely not someone a small fry like him could afford to provoke.","But why would such a big shot be here? And bringing so many people?","Wang Dacheng instantly had a bad premonition in his heart.","Could it be...","Ma Da looked at Wang Dacheng condescendingly. \"You're that Wang Dacheng guy? Your wife said she wanted an explanation from us. Now we're here, so tell me, how do you want to resolve this?\"","Hearing this, Wang Dacheng wished he could strangle his stupid wife to death on the spot.","\"President Ma, I'm sorry! It's my fault for not disciplining her properly. We apologize! We admit our mistake! Please be magnanimous and spare us this once!\"","\"What the fuck did you do! Hurry up and apologize to President Ma! Quickly! Otherwise, we're all going to die here today!\"","Seeing her husband's reaction, no matter how stupid Mrs. Wang was, she finally realized that she had provoked someone she absolutely could not afford to mess with. Even the husband she always relied on was scared like this, which showed just how powerful this group of men in black really was.","She instantly burst into tears. \"I am so sorry! I was wrong! I truly know I was wrong! Little girl, it was my foul mouth! I have no manners! Please forgive me! I will never do it again!\"","Yaya did not act smug or demand severe punishment for the woman like a normal child might. Instead, she showed a level of tolerance and grace far beyond her years.","\"Mr. Wang, Ma'am, I can accept your apology.\"","\"But I have two conditions. First, since Mrs. Wang insulted me, she needs to do a week of volunteer work at the kindergarten as a punishment.\"","\"Second, in order to help Wang Hao realize his mistake and learn to be a polite and well-behaved child, I want him to apologize to me in front of all the children and teachers when he comes to class next week. He also needs to take the initiative to give a piece of candy to every friend in our class as a gift.\"","\"If he can meet my demands and learn from his mistakes, I am still willing to be good friends with him.\"","Hearing Yaya's handling of the situation, even Ma Da's eyes flashed with a hint of surprise and appreciation.","She was truly worthy of being the little lady adopted by the Eldest Miss. To be so sensible and graceful at such a young age was remarkable.","Hearing Yaya's conditions, Wang Dacheng and his wife nodded hastily. \"Of course! Of course! We will definitely do it! We will follow your instructions exactly!\"","\"Thank you! Thank you, little girl!\"","Clap! Clap! Clap!","Right at this moment, the crisp sound of clapping came from a short distance away.","Everyone instinctively turned their heads, only to see the dense crowd of people gathered in the open space by the office door automatically part to the sides, clearing a path.","At the end of the path stood a girl in black with an extraordinary aura.","Before Wang Dacheng and the others could even figure out the girl's identity, they saw the men in black, led by Ma Da, bow slightly in unison toward the girl to greet her.","\"Eldest Miss!\"","\"Eldest Miss!\"","\"...\""]},{"number":593,"title":"Chapter 593: 593. Striving to Escape the Sea of Suffering.","paragraphs":["\"Eldest Miss!\"","Over a hundred men in black greeted her in unison. The sheer volume of their voices sent an unprecedented shockwave through the principal, the teachers, Wang Dacheng and his wife, and the dozen or so workers!","Wang Dacheng, in particular, was panicking inside. Could this girl, who commanded such respect from President Ma and these men in black, be the mysterious head of the Wanlong Society?","She was too young!","Amidst the shocked and reverent gazes, Liu Yutong walked up to Yaya and gave her a thumbs up.","\"I never expected our Yaya to be such a sensible little lady. Can you tell me why you did that?\"","Hearing her sister's question, Yaya answered earnestly.","\"Because I know you shouldn't bully people for no reason, and if you are bullied, you have to bravely stand up for yourself. I also know that a good child is one who corrects their mistakes!\"","\"Very well said.\" Liu Yutong smiled, stood up, and took Yaya's hand.","Only then did she seem to notice the shivering couple and the little boy in the corner.","\"Since my sister has spoken, you will do exactly as she said.\"","\"Yes! Yes! We will definitely do it! We will!\" Wang Dacheng and his wife felt as if they had been granted amnesty and hastily promised.","Liu Yutong said no more. Holding Yaya's hand, she left the kindergarten surrounded by the men in black.","It wasn't until the massive convoy drove away that Wang Dacheng and his wife collapsed to the ground at almost the exact same time, as if completely drained.","\"Oh my god! That was terrifying!\"","\"H-husband, who exactly are they? Who is that woman? It's too scary! I've never seen a scene like this in my entire life!\"","\"You have the nerve to ask! Let me tell you, we were almost finished today! Do you know who President Ma Da is? A core figure of the Wanlong Society! He's someone with immense power, someone who can walk sideways in Mingzhu City's underground... no, in both the lawful and unlawful worlds. Yet even a man like him was completely deferential to that girl. What do you think?!\"","\"The W-Wanlong Society? I remember now, aren't Wanlong Plaza and Wanlong Supermarket their properties? Isn't that a legitimate company? But they...\"","\"What you know is only the surface. Have you ever seen a legitimate company that can instantly summon over a hundred gangsters in black suits with a single phone call? Let me tell you, don't be fooled by this Eldest Miss's young age. Her methods are ruthless, she's even offed people...\"","\"O-offed people? Then... didn't we just take a trip to the gates of hell?\"","\"It's good that you know. Let me tell you, from today onwards, you better educate our son properly. You must strictly follow that little girl's demands without any negligence. If you dare make even the slightest mistake again, our whole family might end up at the bottom of the river.\"","\"I know I was wrong! I really know I was wrong! I'll start doing volunteer work tomorrow...\"","\"...\"","...","Duan Village in Wushui County had now taken on a completely new look.","The cement roads in the village had not only been widened, but some previously unpaved paths, even those leading straight to the fields, had also been paved with cement. Rows of solar street lights had been installed on both sides of the roads. When villagers went out at night, they no longer needed to carry a flashlight just to see the way like they used to.","A newly built, fully equipped plaza sat on the open ground in the center of the village. During their free time, villagers would gather at the plaza to dance and exercise. It was very lively.","Although the weather had turned cold, the plaza remained popular on weekends, especially among the children and the elderly of the village who loved to chat and play there.","This weekend was no exception.","Not long after breakfast, the villagers gathered in twos and threes at the plaza to chat. Most of the topics revolved around the Liu family's granddaughter.","\"It's all thanks to that girl Yutong! She built roads and installed street lights for the village. Most importantly, she even arranged for someone to specifically handle the garbage. The sanitary environment in the village is so much better than before!\"","\"Yes! The Liu family's ancestors must be blessing them to have produced such a successful granddaughter. It's just that Yushan seems a bit miserable.\"","\"He brought that upon himself. Who else can he blame?\"","\"...\"","While everyone was chatting animatedly, a figure wearing an orange sanitation vest and dirty work gloves pushed a garbage cart near the plaza.","This person was none other than Liu Yutong's older brother, Liu Yushan.","Speaking of Liu Yushan, he used to be a notorious deadbeat in the village. He was idle and loved to gamble, sharing almost the exact same virtues as his father.","Yet, such a reckless fellow had been thoroughly sorted out by his own sister. He had been forced to work as a street cleaner in the village for nearly a year. It was as miserable as it could get.","It was fine now that it was winter, but during the summer, he had thrown up countless times while cleaning the garbage bins.","Although he was now one of the most miserable people in the village, whenever someone teased him, he remained stubborn.","\"I just love taking out the trash!\"","\"My work here is directly related to my sister's reputation! If some big leader or boss comes to our village for an inspection and sees that the roads aren't clean, it would be a huge disgrace and affect her multi-million dollar business!\"","\"My sister is doing this on purpose to train me. Once I'm trained well, I'll definitely be able to go to her company and become a CEO or whatever, reaching the pinnacle of my life!\"","Although everyone knew in their hearts that he was just trying desperately to save face, they never exposed him. No matter what, this guy was Liu Yutong's brother after all.","Liu Yushan dawdled as he finished sweeping the edge of the plaza, then leaned against the garbage cart to rest, casually bragging with the villagers. However, he couldn't help but constantly look down at the time on his phone.","Today, he had accidentally overheard his grandfather mention that his sister was coming back today, and it seemed she was also bringing back the little girl she had adopted.","He immediately had an idea. Perhaps he could give a gift to that little girl he would be meeting for the first time, indirectly flattering his sister. That way, if his sister's heart softened, wouldn't she let him off the hook?","Heaven knew how painful it was for him to be solely responsible for the cleaning work of the entire village. It could simply be described as a living hell.","Getting up early and staying up late every day to sweep the streets and take out the trash, exposed to the wind and sun, all for a measly few hundred bucks a month—it wasn't even enough for a single round at the poker table like before. And on top of that, he was constantly teased and laughed at by the villagers.","If he wasn't so thick-skinned, he would have wanted to die a long time ago.","Today his sister was coming back. No matter what, he had to fight for the chance to take off this uniform!"]},{"number":594,"title":"Chapter 594: 594. Taking Ya Ya Back to the Hometown.","paragraphs":["An unknown amount of time passed.","Just as Liu Yushan finished his break and was about to push his garbage cart to continue sweeping the road, a low engine roar suddenly came from the entrance of the village.","The villagers chatting in the square all looked over, only to see a black motorcade slowly driving toward them from the village entrance.","Leading the way was a solid black Maybach, closely followed by five black Mercedes-Benzes.","When this motorcade came into view, everyone immediately knew who had returned. After all, in the entire village, other than the Liu family's granddaughter, Liu Yutong, no one else could afford such a grand display.","\"Look! Who's back? Those cars are magnificent!\"","\"It must be that girl Yutong coming back, right?\"","\"Definitely. Who else in our village could have such a lineup but her?\"","\"Let's go over to the old Liu house and join the fun.\"","\"...\"","Watching the incredibly impressive motorcade brush past him, Liu Yushan suddenly grew nervous.","Although he often bragged to the villagers, claiming his sister was just testing him and that when she returned he would do this and that, his first reaction upon his sister Liu Yutong's actual return was a guilty conscience and fear.","He couldn't help it; his sister's aura was simply too overwhelming.","The motorcade finally stopped in front of the grand gates of the Liu family's new residence.","The single-story old house of her grandfather that Liu Yutong remembered had long been torn down and rebuilt. With the power of money, it had been transformed into a three-story modern Chinese-style villa courtyard.","A sightseeing elevator connecting all three floors was built on the side of the courtyard. Just installing this elevator and the overall barrier-free design cost an extra million or so. The total cost of the entire house, including the remodeling and renovation of the whole courtyard, exceeded six million.","In 2008, this price tag was absolutely a massive fortune.","However, the dozen or so chickens and large white geese running wild in the yard seemed somewhat out of place compared to the meticulously designed courtyard.","Liu Yutong didn't really mind, though. Since her grandparents liked raising them, she was happy to let them do as they pleased.","The door of the Maybach was respectfully opened by a man in black who had stepped out ahead of time.","Liu Yutong was the first to step out of the car.","She wore a cream-white cashmere coat today, which accentuated her exceptionally slender figure. Her temperament carried a touch more warmth than before, no longer quite so aloof and cold.","Then, she reached her hand into the car.","A fair and tender little hand was placed in her palm. Next, a little girl wearing a babydoll dress with cute braids popped out of the car.","It was the little girl's first time visiting her older sister's hometown. As soon as she got out, she curiously examined the big house in front of her, as well as the chickens and geese running around the yard.","\"Tongtong is back!\"","Grandfather Liu and the old grandmother had been waiting at the door for a while, their faces filled with undisguised joy.","When the two elders saw the little person Liu Yutong was holding by the hand, their eyes lit up.","\"Is... is this that child?\"","Liu Yutong immediately smiled and introduced her, \"Grandpa, Grandma, this is Yaya. Yaya, say hello to Grandpa and Grandma.\"","Yaya tilted her little face up, looked at the two kind-faced elders in front of her, and immediately called out obediently, \"Hello, Grandpa. Hello, Grandma.\"","This sweet and crisp greeting was like a piece of candy that instantly melted the hearts of the two elders.","The two elders immediately beamed from ear to ear, \"Oh, oh! Good child, so well-behaved!\"","Grandpa even stepped forward to pick Yaya up, \"Let Grandpa get a good look at you. So cute.\"","Grandma couldn't stop praising her from the side, \"What a pretty little face, just like our Yutong when she was little.\"","\"Are you tired from the journey? Are you cold?\"","The old man asked with concern, then muttered to himself, \"Listen to me, of course you're tired. Hurry, hurry inside! Grandpa has chicken soup simmering on the stove, it smells delicious. Oh right, and Grandma made some crispy and fragrant rice crackers. Does Yaya want to eat some?\"","Yaya immediately nodded, \"I want to eat! Thank you, Grandpa, thank you, Grandma!\"","This shout made the grandparents even happier, and they joyfully carried her into the house.","\"Let's go, let's go home, Grandpa will get you something delicious!\"","Liu Yutong followed behind the two elders with a smile, gesturing for her subordinates to bring down the prepared gifts from the cars. The large and small bags of gifts caused the two elders to nag again, saying she spent too much money, that the family lacked nothing, and that they had piles of food and clothes, and so on.","Despite their words, the smiles on their faces grew even wider.","As the two elders carried Yaya inside, beaming with joy, more and more villagers who had heard the news gathered around. They crowded at the courtyard gate, peeking in and discussing, making the scene very lively.","Liu Yutong stopped and turned to face the fellow villagers outside the yard. \"Uncles, aunts, thank you all for coming to see us. We just got home today and want to settle in first and spend some time with the elders and the child. Our place is small, and I'm afraid we can't host you properly right now. Once we're settled in tomorrow, I'll invite everyone over for tea and a chat.\"","She spoke very politely, and the villagers nodded and smiled in understanding.","\"Right, right. The girl Yutong just got back and must be exhausted. Have a chat with the old man and old lady first.\"","\"Let's not block the doorway, let the family have a proper reunion.\"","\"Let's go, let's go, we'll come visit tomorrow...\"","Chatting and laughing, everyone dispersed in twos and threes.","Relationships in the village were sometimes very delicate.","If it were just an ordinary wealthy family, chasing people away so directly might attract a lot of pointing fingers and sour remarks. They would say things like having money makes you arrogant, looking down on people, or questioning if the money came from legitimate sources. In short, all sorts of rumors would fly around.","But with the Liu family, this situation didn't exist.","Everyone still had fresh memories of what Liu Yutong and her men in black had done in the village during the New Year. She had even sent her own father away; who would dare to cross her?","If they upset her, they might be the next ones to suffer.","In short, even though almost a year had passed since the New Year incident, the villagers still held a deep sense of awe and fear toward Liu Yutong, not daring to show any dissatisfaction.","Lunch consisted of farmhouse dishes personally cooked by the grandparents.","There was a rich soup stewed from their own home-raised hen, cured meat stir-fried with garlic sprouts, stir-fried seasonal vegetables, and the golden, crispy rice crackers fried by Grandma.","Meeting her for the first time, the grandparents wished they could put all the delicious food into Yaya's bowl.","Yaya was a bit reserved at first, but after getting familiar for a while, she gradually relaxed. She ate until her little mouth was shiny with oil and her cheeks were bulging, a sight that made the two elders laugh heartily.","After the meal, the old man couldn't wait to take his little granddaughter to inspect their family's territory.","First, he took Yaya to collect eggs, then went to the cellar to dig up some winter radishes. Even on such a cold day, he specifically went to their own pond behind the house to cast a net and catch fish. He guided Yaya to experience a lot of fun rural life that she had never experienced before.","Throughout the afternoon, the little girl's laughter hardly stopped.","Of course, it wasn't completely non-stop.","Once, while Yaya was playing in the corner of the yard, she accidentally provoked a large white goose. She was chased by the goose, took a tumble, and immediately burst into tears out of fright.","That evening, a large iron pot was set up in the courtyard.","Inside simmered the very same audacious white goose from earlier that day. Only now, Grandpa had thoroughly cleaned and prepped it, tossing it in with radishes, glass noodles, shiitake mushrooms, and other ingredients. The stew bubbled away, releasing a rich, mouthwatering aroma.","Just as the goose stew was finally ready, a timid, hesitant figure dawdled at the front gate."]},{"number":595,"title":"Chapter 595: 595. Inquiry.","paragraphs":["This person was none other than Liu Yutong's older brother, Liu Yushan.","Liu Yushan dawdled at the front gate for a long time, not daring to enter, staring longingly at his sister, Liu Yutong, who was busy helping their grandfather serve the food in the courtyard.","Liu Yutong had noticed him long ago. Seeing that he still didn't dare to come in, she turned her head and glanced at him.","Liu Yushan tensed up at the look, subconsciously straightening his back, and said with a trembling voice, Yu... Yutong, have... have you eaten? Where are Grandpa and Grandma?","Seeing this guy spouting nonsense with his eyes wide open, Liu Yutong suddenly asked back, Has the village's garbage been cleaned up today?","Liu Yushan nodded hastily, It's clean! Clean! From the beginning of the village to the end, I swept it three times! Really! I'm not lying to you!","Hmm!","Liu Yutong seemed to have just asked casually and said nothing more.","Liu Yushan was left completely unsettled by her ambiguous attitude, having no idea what his sister meant. He could only stand at the front gate, daring neither to leave nor to enter, standing there like a door god.","The excuses he had prepared to beg for mercy were now completely stuck in his throat under his sister's invisible aura.","He suddenly felt that standing in front of his sister was even more agonizing than taking out the trash.","Old Master Liu naturally saw Liu Yushan's cowardly appearance at the door. Towards this eldest grandson, he felt both anger and sighs. He was angry that he used to be as disappointing as his bastard father, addicted to gambling and lazy, completely losing the Liu family's face. He sighed because, after all, they were connected by blood, and he couldn't truly wash his hands of him.","What are you standing there for? Get in here! Are you waiting for an eight-bearer sedan chair to invite you?! The old man yelled at the door in a bad mood.","This sounded like a reprimand, but it actually gave Liu Yushan an out.","Liu Yushan shuddered and walked trembling into the courtyard. Then he rubbed his hands, bowed his back, and with a fawning expression on his face, greeted his grandparents, and especially his sister. He also casually handed the remote control car he had just bought to Yaya.","Yaya was very sensible and thanked him, Thank you, brother!","You're welcome, you're welcome!","Liu Yushan was so polite to the little girl that it bordered on humble.","Grandma Liu was setting the bowls and chopsticks. After glancing at him, she said directly, Go wash your hands and get ready to eat.","Liu Yushan quickly agreed and ran to wash his hands.","Liu Yutong took in her grandparents' attitude towards her brother, Liu Yushan.","She could see that the two elders still couldn't truly let go of this good-for-nothing brother. After all, Liu Yushan was the only grandson of the Liu family.","In any case, no matter how much she disliked this brother, considering the elders, she couldn't completely ignore him. But she couldn't indulge him either, lest he get carried away again, or become like that deadbeat father, gambling and messing around.","After everyone was seated, Liu Yutong spoke calmly, Since you're here, that's perfect. I haven't been back for a while, and there are some things I want to know.","Hearing his sister's words, Liu Yushan's back instantly broke out in a cold sweat.","Here it comes!","His sister was going to put him on trial!","Um... Yutong, I really haven't been lazy. I've changed! I've really changed!","Liu Yutong didn't believe him. She took out her phone and directly dialed a number. Debao, are you free right now? Yes, I'm back. Come over to Grandpa's house. Bring Uncle along too; I have something to ask you both.","Liu Yushan became even more anxious. How could he not know why his sister was calling their uncle and cousin over? It was nothing more than to ask about his performance in the village.","In that split second, countless images flashed through his mind, from whether he had done good deeds like helping old ladies cross the street, to whether he had found money and not handed it over to the police...","Before long, footsteps came from outside the courtyard.","A young man in a leather jacket and a slightly travel-worn middle-aged man walked into the courtyard one after the other.","Sister, my dad and I are here!","Liu Yutong got up to greet them at the door. She first nodded to Liu Debao, then said to Liu Jianhong, Uncle, you haven't eaten yet, right? Let's eat together and chat while we eat.","No, no, we just ate, Liu Jianhong hurriedly waved his hand.","It's fine, have a little more.","Liu Yushan was quite perceptive and quickly ran to bring over two chairs.","Seeing Liu Yushan, Liu Jianhong roughly understood why his niece had called the two of them over.","Finally, he stopped declining and sat down.","Yaya greeted the two newcomers very politely, Hello Uncle, hello brother.","Liu Debao's eyes lit up when he saw the pretty little girl. Oh, this must be Yaya, right? I finally get to see you in person. You're so pretty.","He had only heard before that his cousin had adopted a little girl, but he hadn't seen her, mainly because he was in a hurry to get home.","This was their first time meeting.","Yaya, she's part of our family now too. Liu Yutong gave a simple introduction.","Although there weren't many words, everyone understood the weight behind them.","Liu Jianhong even took out a thousand yuan from his pocket, insisting on giving it to the little girl as a meeting gift.","After getting her sister's approval, Yaya accepted it and thanked him again.","After some simple pleasantries.","Liu Yutong looked at Liu Debao first and asked casually, Debao, how has the village's environmental sanitation been over the past year?","She didn't name Liu Yushan, but everyone knew what she was asking about.","Liu Yushan's ears immediately perked up, and his heart pounded wildly.","Liu Debao glanced at the anxious Liu Yushan, thought about it, and decided to tell the truth. Sister, to be honest, Brother Yushan has really done a decent job in this regard. In the past, garbage was dumped everywhere in the village, and the roads were always dirty with everything on them. Since Brother Yushan took on this job, the village has indeed become much cleaner. Although I'm not home often, I've heard others say that Brother Yushan rides his cart out to deal with the garbage before dawn every day. He hasn't rested much even in wind and rain. He really put effort into it.","Hearing Liu Debao's words, Liu Yushan suddenly felt a rush of heat to his eyes and almost cried out of sheer relief.","Debao! Good brother! You are my real brother!","But... Liu Debao suddenly shifted his tone.","Hearing this ominous word, Liu Yushan's heart, which had just settled, leaped to his throat again. He even wanted to jump up and slap Liu Debao. Shut up! What you said before is enough, don't say anything else!","But when he saw his sister's gaze, he obediently sat back down.","Liu Yutong: But what? Go on and finish."]},{"number":596,"title":"Chapter 596: 596. Disposition of Liu Yushan.","paragraphs":["\"It's nothing much, just that Brother Yushan is getting better at bragging, nothing else,\" Liu Debao said.","Liu Jianhong also nodded, agreeing with his son. \"Yushan is doing a pretty good job at work. As for bragging, it's not a major flaw. Young people always care about their reputation.\"","\"I've also asked other people in the village. Besides this, although Yushan occasionally goes to the gambling house to join the fun, he hasn't actually gambled.\"","The gambling house he mentioned was different from the ones in the past. It was mostly for entertainment, and the winnings or losses usually wouldn't exceed two hundred yuan. It wasn't that people didn't want to bet bigger, but they were afraid of getting themselves locked up.","In the past, the police had a hard time managing these things in the village. When villagers gambled, apart from the casual games at the small supermarket, the high-stakes games were hidden in some villager's home. They were very concealed and hard to investigate.","It was different now. Anyone who dared to play a game with stakes over two hundred yuan in the village had to weigh the consequences first.","Perhaps someone would say, \"The money I win or lose in gambling is my own, and it's all voluntary. What does it have to do with you? Why are you being so nosy?\"","But the answer they received was always the same: \"This rule was set by the Liu family's girl. If you have the guts, go talk to her about it.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, those hardcore gamblers would instantly chicken out. Thinking back to the dense crowd of men in black during the New Year, and how the Liu family's girl had dealt with her own biological father, those were readymade examples.","When she was ruthless, she even dared to send her own father to jail, let alone outsiders like them.","Since then, at least in their village, there had never been a gambling table with stakes over two hundred yuan again. When the villagers played cards or mahjong, they consciously kept the amounts under control and generally didn't go overboard.","Old Master Liu was actually afraid to hear bad things about his grandson from them, afraid of losing face.","Hearing that there were no major flaws now, his expression softened a bit, but he still snorted, \"A leopard never changes its spots!\"","Liu Yutong looked at Liu Yushan again. \"Add anything you need to. Do you have anything else to say?\"","Liu Yushan shivered and hurriedly said, \"It's true! It's true! What Debao and my uncle said is all true! I've really been honestly doing cleaning work this past year. I haven't... haven't gambled a single cent since. I cut ties with those people a long time ago! I swear!\"","\"Also, I just have a loose tongue sometimes and like to brag a bit... Sister, I know I was wrong. I really have changed! Look at my hands, they're like this from working...\" He pointed to the calluses on his hands, trying to gain some sympathy.","Liu Yutong pretty much had a good idea of the situation now. After a moment of silence, she suddenly asked a seemingly unrelated question.","\"Is the salary from cleaning the trash enough for you to live on?\"","Liu Yushan choked for a second and stammered, \"It's... it's okay. If I'm frugal, it's enough.\"","In fact, it wasn't enough at all. His meager salary would be gone if he spent even a little freely, but he didn't dare say so.","\"Have you asked Grandpa and Grandma for money again?\" Liu Yutong asked once more.","\"No! Absolutely not!\"","Liu Yushan raised his hand to swear. \"No matter how much of a jerk I am, I wouldn't dare ask Grandpa and Grandma for money! Look how old I am!\"","This was actually the truth. Ever since Liu Yutong forced him to stay in their hometown for reform, he had never dared to reach out his hand to the two elders again. On one hand, he was afraid his sister would find out; on the other hand, he was a man after all, and his pitiful sense of pride would occasionally rear its head.","Hearing this, the oppressive aura around Liu Yutong slightly retracted. \"It seems that you really have endured a lot of hardship this past year and have done some actual work.\"","\"However, cleaning is just the most basic form of social labor. It's still far from truly reforming you.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yushan felt a bit of despair in his heart. It seemed his sister still had no intention of letting him off.","Liu Yutong changed the subject. \"Starting tomorrow, Uncle, arrange for someone else in the village to take over the garbage cleaning work. You can hire a few more people. The salary will be on me.\"","Liu Jianhong nodded. \"Alright! It's easy to hire people.\"","Although doing garbage cleaning was a bit tough, as long as the salary was good, the villagers would still fight to do it. Not to mention, it wouldn't be just Liu Yushan doing it all by himself like before.","However, when Liu Yushan heard this, not only was he not the least bit happy, but his vision went dark and he almost fainted.","It's over! His sister wasn't even going to let him sweep the streets anymore! She was probably going to send him to jail too!","The only place of reform he could think of now, besides being a cleaner, was to get an iron rice bowl like his father and undergo a true, deep reform behind bars.","Just as Liu Yushan was about to beg for mercy, he heard Liu Yutong continue, \"You will follow Debao from now on.\"","\"Huh?\" Liu Yushan and Liu Debao were both stunned at the same time.","Liu Debao pointed to his own nose. \"Follow... follow me?\"","\"Yes.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"I've contracted a lot of land to grow vegetables and grain. Debao manages all of this. From now on, you'll be his assistant and learn some proper skills. You have to do all the chores, moving goods, riding along with the deliveries, everything. You will do whatever Debao tells you to do. Your salary will be two thousand a month, which should be about enough for you to spend.\"","\"Debao, I'm handing him over to you. You don't need to give him any special treatment on my account. Boss him around when needed, and teach him a lesson when necessary. If he slacks off, refuses to listen, or starts messing around with those people from his past again, tell me directly. Do you understand?\"","Liu Debao said, \"Understood. Don't worry, sister, I will definitely keep a close eye on Brother Yushan!\"","He then looked at Liu Yushan. \"Brother Yushan, see you at the vegetable greenhouse at six tomorrow morning. We need to deliver two trucks of vegetables to the supermarket. Make sure you aren't late.\"","Liu Yushan finally realized what was happening. He could finally take off that yellow work uniform.","Although it was a far cry from being the CEO he had bragged about, it was at least a good thing. In fact, it was a great thing!","At the very least, his sister had acknowledged him somewhat.","\"Thank you! Thank you! Yutong, rest assured, your brother will work hard and won't embarrass you!\"","\"Let's eat!\"","\"Okay, okay, let's eat!\"","Grandpa and Grandma didn't say much throughout the whole process; they mostly just listened.","They knew very well in their hearts that the only person who truly called the shots in this family was their granddaughter, Liu Yutong. Even if they had their own thoughts, as long as their granddaughter didn't relent, they would never say a word on behalf of their grandson.","Simply put, whether Liu Yushan lived or died was entirely up to their granddaughter.","After dinner, Liu Yushan, Debao, and the others left separately.","Liu Yushan still lived in his own old house. There was no room for him in Grandpa and Grandma's new house.","While Liu Yutong was helping her grandparents wash the dishes, she suddenly said, \"If Liu Yushan can work hard and do well, I'll build a new house for him to marry a wife in the future.\"","Grandpa had mixed feelings upon hearing his granddaughter's words, but he remained stubborn. \"You don't need to worry about him. Building a house and marrying a wife depends on his own abilities. If he can't get a wife, he can stay a bachelor for the rest of his life!\"","Liu Yutong smiled and didn't say anything more.","However, when they chatted about other topics later, there were noticeably more smiles on Grandpa and Grandma's faces.","The bond between grandparents and grandchildren was no joke. Although their grandson had been a bit of a scoundrel in the past, deep down, they still hoped he could change for the better. They didn't expect him to be outstanding, but at least they wanted to be able to mention him without feeling too ashamed to speak.","That night, Liu Yutong and Yaya slept on the second floor. Lan Die and a few other female members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society also stayed in the other two guest rooms on the second floor.","Grandpa and Grandma slept in the master bedroom on the first floor. It was not that they could not go upstairs, but rather that the elderly couple was used to living on the first floor and found it more convenient. Even though an elevator had been installed in the house, they still were not very keen on sleeping upstairs.","The next day.","By the time Liu Yutong and Yaya got up and washed up, Grandpa and Grandma had already prepared breakfast.","However, when they went downstairs to eat, they saw Grandma and some neighbors rushing frantically toward the village square, every one of them looking eager and impatient.","\"Grandpa, what are Grandma and the others going to do?\" Liu Yutong asked curiously.","\"They are going to pick up some goods. They said it is free, so everyone went.\"","Grandpa urged, \"Eat quickly. Once we finish, we will go get some too. If we are late, there won't be anything left to claim.\"","Hearing the word free, Liu Yutong could not help but feel a bad premonition. Why did this sound so much like the usual tricks used by those countryside scammers from her past life?","Could it be that swindlers had actually come to their village to run a scam?"]},{"number":597,"title":"Chapter 597: 597. Deposit Refund Scam.","paragraphs":["After finishing her meal, Liu Yutong took Yaya, Lan Die, and the others toward the village square.","Before they even arrived, they could see a simple red tent set up in the square from a distance. Several long tables were placed in front of the tent, piled high with colorful boxes.","Two young men wearing white shirts and ties held microphones, speaking enthusiastically to the elderly villagers who were gradually gathering around.","\"Uncles and aunts, grandpas and grandmas, although many of us are already familiar faces, we still need to introduce ourselves. We are salespeople from Kangshou Company. Our company is an elderly care enterprise heavily supported by the province, and we've specifically come down to the countryside this time to bring you health and benefits!\"","\"The company leaders have said that since the country is now focusing on rural revitalization, our enterprise must also give back to society. Therefore, for this event, all products are free to try and experience!\"","\"...\"","After the brief introduction, the host finally cut to the chase.","\"Over the past few days, we have proven our company's integrity with real actions. We refunded money when we said we would, and we gave out gifts when we said we would. You've all seen this with your own eyes, right?\"","The villagers in the audience immediately responded.","\"That's right!\"","\"We all saw it.\"","\"...\"","This was indeed something they had witnessed with their own eyes. The villagers who paid the deposit yesterday had all their money returned today.","The host nodded in satisfaction and spoke again in an excited tone, \"Today we have another event. We will introduce the finale product of this campaign: the Kangshou brand spectrum energy mattress!\"","Two assistants carried out a mattress wrapped in transparent plastic film from a small truck. It looked thick and had patterns printed on it that resembled circuit diagrams.","\"This mattress uses the resonant frequency technology of the American space agency, combined with three years of research and development results from the Chinese Academy of Sciences. As long as you elderly folks lie on it, the low-frequency spectrum can clear the meridians, and the high-frequency spectrum can kill cellular viruses. It has remarkable curative effects on high blood pressure, diabetes, arthritis, and even cancer.\"","Hearing this, a chorus of amazement rose from the audience. This thing could even treat cancer? That was too incredible, wasn't it?","Information flow at this time was far less advanced than in later years. Many elderly people in rural areas, in particular, lacked formal education. Coupled with the fact that they had grown familiar with these salespeople, they didn't harbor much suspicion and simply assumed it was due to advanced technology.","\"This product is our company's flagship item, with a market price of eighteen thousand eight hundred yuan. But today, to give back to the trust of our fellow villagers, the company is launching a special reservation event. By paying a deposit of three thousand yuan, you can secure a spot to purchase it. Moreover, tomorrow morning, as long as you come with your receipt, the three thousand yuan deposit will be fully refunded, and you will also receive a free magnetic therapy device worth three thousand eight hundred yuan.\"","\"In addition, our company's regional manager is also here. He told me he wants to give everyone even more benefits. Customers who pay the deposit today will automatically be upgraded to senior members, enjoying an eighty percent discount on any company product purchased in the future. Furthermore, tomorrow I will personally bring the company's gratitude gift packages, and everyone will receive an extra barrel of imported peanut oil!\"","\"...\"","Peanut oil, magnetic therapy devices, full refunds, massive discounts... this barrage of perks left the elderly audience dizzy with excitement, each one eager to pull out their money and pay the deposit.","Had it been yesterday, they might have hesitated, afraid their money would go down the drain. But today, having seen with their own eyes that those who paid yesterday got their deposits back and received free items, they naturally refused to miss out on such a good deal.","Not to mention, the men had said they would come back tomorrow to deliver gift packages. The deposit would only be kept with them for a single night.","\"I want to order two!\"","\"Me too! I'll order one!\"","\"Register me, I want a mattress and a magnetic therapy device!\"","\"...\"","The elderly villagers scrambled to push their way to the front.","Liu Yutong saw her grandmother pull out a cloth bag and take out a thick stack of cash—all hundred-yuan bills—and order several items as well.","She didn't stop her.","Because right now, the elderly folks were caught up in the heat of the moment. Forcibly exposing the scam might backfire. It was better to let them pay the deposit and treat it as a lesson for the villagers, which would help improve their anti-fraud awareness in the future.","Besides, even if these scammers managed to get their hands on the money, they would have to obediently spit it back out to her.","Not long after, Liu Yutong received a call from her assistant, Su Mansu.","\"Boss, I've checked. That Kangshou Company was registered only two months ago with a registered capital of one hundred thousand yuan. Their office address is in an office building in the city, where they just rented a tiny twenty-square-meter room.\"","\"As for the products they're selling, the market price ranges from just a few dozen to a hundred yuan. It's a complete idiot tax...\"","The investigation report Su Mansu provided was very detailed.","This gang consisted of five people—four men and one woman. They drove a minivan and a small truck, roaming around committing crimes.","They had already hit six or seven towns and villages just under Mingzhu City. The routine was always the same: they stayed in each place for a few days, first distributing eggs and small gifts to gain trust, then promoting products through deposit refunds. On the final day, they would reap a massive haul and then abscond with the funds.","It was estimated that the amount this gang had defrauded so far was no less than four hundred thousand yuan.","Liu Yutong was quite satisfied with the efficiency of Su Mansu's investigation.","Of course, this was also because the power of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was far greater than before. Investigating a few people was a very fast process.","After listening to the report, Liu Yutong briefly explained the situation to Lan Die, who was responsible for protecting her.","\"Miss, should we just take them down directly?\" Lan Die asked after hearing the details.","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"If we take them down now, the village elders might not appreciate it and might feel that we cut off their benefits. Just arrange for two people to keep an eye on them, and make sure we secure the evidence properly.\"","\"Understood!\" Lan Die immediately turned around and gave a few instructions to another core member.","Time slowly passed, and the sun gradually rose higher.","When the last elderly man in line tremblingly finished paying and received his receipt and membership card, the host once again jumped onto the temporarily erected small stage. Holding the microphone, he announced the schedule for tomorrow.","\"Thank you, uncles and aunts, grandpas and grandmas, for your trust and support in our Kangshou Company! Today, all the reservation spots have been fully registered. Congratulations to everyone, you have all made the wisest investment for your own health and the health of your families!\"","\"Tomorrow morning at eight o'clock, right here in this very spot, our company will hold a grand gratitude and give-back ceremony. Not only will we fully refund your deposits and distribute peanut oil, but our Manager Wang will also bring extra surprise gifts specially approved by the head office. Please make sure to arrive on time and bring your receipts and membership cards. We won't wait for latecomers!\"","Enthusiastic applause erupted from the audience. Afterward, the elderly folks began to disperse, completely satisfied and carrying the items they had reserved with their deposits.","Liu Yutong's grandmother also walked over, smiling warmly and clutching her receipt and membership card. Naturally, someone was helping her carry the things she had bought.","\"Grandma, is everything registered?\"","\"Yes, I'm all registered. I ordered a mattress and a physical therapy device. Look here, dear, isn't this membership card just exquisite? They said it's a premium membership. I can get my deposit refunded tomorrow, and from then on, everything I buy will be eighty percent off. It's such a great deal,\" Grandma said cheerfully.","\"As long as you think it's a good deal,\" Liu Yutong said with a smile, handing the items back to her grandmother without saying much else.","Before leaving, she cast another glance at the group of people who were packing up the display booth and boxing up their goods.","The sole female member of the five-person crew happened to catch Liu Yutong looking. Whether it was just her imagination or not, she felt that the women in black suits standing beside this young girl looked awfully familiar.","It wasn't that their faces were familiar, but rather the suits they were wearing."]},{"number":598,"title":"Chapter 598: 598, Snake Brother.","paragraphs":["Around ten o'clock at night, while Liu Yutong was half asleep, Lan Die knocked on her bedroom door.","She got up to open the door. As soon as Lan Die entered, she immediately reported the situation.","\"Miss, news came from Xiao Liu. Those swindlers drove off, but our people followed them. Eventually, their car stopped at an agricultural machinery station on the edge of Wushui County. It seems they are going to rest and spend the night there.\"","Liu Yutong nodded and instructed, \"Tell Xiao Liu to keep a close eye on them. If necessary, he can mobilize personnel from Wushui County for backup. Remember, catch the thieves with the loot.\"","\"Yes, Miss.\"","It was impossible for her to personally take action just to catch a few petty scammers. There was no need. After giving her instructions to Lan Die, she went back to sleep with Yaya.","She figured that when the villagers woke up tomorrow, they would probably be completely dumbfounded.","...","On a dark and windy night, a perfect time for dirty deeds...","A white van and a small truck, one after the other, quietly slipped into the courtyard of a place called Xingwang Agricultural Machinery Repair Station.","As soon as the vehicles came to a steady halt, five figures couldn't wait to jump out. It was exactly the four men and one woman who had been running scams in Duan Village earlier that day.","Right after getting off, they hurriedly tried to close the main gate.","\"Hurry! Close the gate quickly!\" urged Sun Neng, the leader.","After the gate was shut, Sun Neng impatiently pulled open the side door of the van, took out a canvas bag, and dumped all the money inside onto a table.","Stacks of red banknotes scattered across the surface. At a rough glance, it was no less than a hundred thousand yuan. The underlings standing nearby stared with wide, mesmerized eyes.","\"We're rich! Brother Sun, we really hit the jackpot this time!\"","\"I didn't expect those old geezers in Duan Village to be so wealthy. Today's profit is almost equal to what we made from the last two or three villages combined.\"","\"Yeah! If it weren't for the rule that our business can only pull one job per place, I would've wanted to go back to Duan Village to sell more health supplements.\"","\"Speaking of which, they are all villages, so why did that one look so different? It's my first time seeing a rural village with so many streetlights and such a grand public square.\"","\"I heard the villagers gossiping that a big shot came from their village, and they donated the money to build all that.\"","\"Sigh, why does it feel like it's so easy for others to make money, while we have to be on edge just to earn a little...\"","\"Stop talking and let's start splitting the cash.\"","\"Right, right, split the money first.\"","...","Sun Neng had Xiao Cui, the only female member of the gang, take charge of the accounting, and then began dividing the money by head. Everyone took ten thousand first, and he took twenty thousand for himself. The remaining seventy thousand or so was stuffed into a black bag; the money in this black bag could not be touched.","\"You all know the rules, right? The bulk of this has to be saved as tribute for Brother Snake. Without Brother Snake's connections and reputation covering us, could we have pulled this off so smoothly?\"","\"Of course, it's only right to show our respect to Brother Snake!\" the crowd immediately chimed in.","\"By the way, Brother Sun, since we performed so well this time, could you mention that matter to Brother Snake? You know, about joining the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang?\"","\"I'll give him a call first and ask.\"","The Ten Thousand Dragons Gang!","These words rang loud and clear in the underground world of Pearl City and its surrounding areas. The Brother Snake they mentioned was one of the founding members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang.","Of course, that was just what they believed.","For anyone mixing in the underworld, who wouldn't want to join a powerful and wealthy syndicate? They were no exception.","It wasn't as if they hadn't seen how impressive the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang members in Wushui County looked. Wearing sharp black suits and traveling in black sedans, they commanded respect wherever they went. People had to treat them with the utmost courtesy. It was incredibly badass!","Sun Neng and his crew's dream was to join the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang. Ideally, if they could gain the appreciation of the gang's legendary underworld young lady, they would truly skyrocket to success.","Even though they had managed to scam a few hundred thousand recently, this kind of work wasn't sustainable in the long run. Plus, they always had to sneak around, terrified of getting caught.","Then they thought about Brother Snake from the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang. All he had to do was reach out his hand, and the money came pouring in. The people delivering the money were always wearing apologetic smiles, even begging him to accept it.","Where else could you find such a sweet gig where you could make money just by standing there?","Sun Neng had met Brother Snake by pure chance. Brother Snake had promised that as long as they scraped together three hundred thousand yuan in tribute money, he would arrange for them to join the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang, allowing them to make easy money in the future too.","The call connected quickly.","After finishing the call, Sun Neng told the group, \"Brother Snake wants us to head over. He's waiting for us at the chess and card room.\"","\"Brother Sun, with the seventy thousand we're handing over this time, plus the previous amounts, that should be enough for the three hundred thousand, right? We should be able to get into the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang now, shouldn't we?\" one person asked.","\"It's more than enough. Who is Brother Snake? He's a veteran of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang. If he said three hundred thousand would get it sorted, he'll definitely let us in.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone became excited, chattering away as they fantasized about their future glorious lives as underworld bosses.","\"I asked around a long time ago. The Ten Thousand Dragons Gang pays a base salary of five thousand a month, plus allowances for running errands. They even issue black suits, and each set costs over a thousand.\"","\"I have a distant cousin who runs a restaurant in Wushui County. He said members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang never have to wait in line to eat. The boss even has to come out personally to offer a toast. It's super prestigious.\"","\"I just want to get my hands on one of those black sedans to drive. So cool!\"","\"Just thinking about it gets me pumped!\"","Right then, Xiao Cui suddenly thought of something and mentioned it to them. \"Hey, when you guys were in Duan Village, did you see a few women wearing black suits? I kept feeling like their clothes looked a bit familiar.\"","\"Xiao Cui, you don't actually think they were people from the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang, do you? You've got to be kidding me. Why would the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang go down to the countryside?\"","\"But I heard the young lady of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang is originally from a rural village.\"","\"Really? How come I heard she was the daughter of the former boss of the Yilian Society in Pearl City? That her hometown is in Pearl City?\"","\"Xiao Cui, you must be mistaken.\"","\"Alright, alright, stop chatting. Let's go see Brother Snake.\"","\"Okay!\"","Not long after they drove off in their van, a black sedan also emerged from the shadows, maintaining a safe distance as it quietly tailed them.","...","West side of Wushui County.","Inside a chess and card room in an old residential area opposite the Experimental Elementary School, even though it was past 11 p.m., there were still people playing cards inside. It was extremely lively.","\"Boss Li, I have to say, you opened an internet cafe without telling me in advance. If I hadn't put the word out, those punks from the East Street would have smashed your place up a long time ago.\"","\"What? You want to cut this month's protection fee in half? Boss Li, that's just not cool...\"","\"Fine, fine, for the sake of our old friendship, I'll take off a thousand, but no less than that. I have a lot of brothers under me who need to eat.\"","\"...\"","Hanging up the phone, the young man sitting in the main seat spat at his phone and casually tossed it onto the table.","Seeing this, a young underling nearby immediately handed him a cigarette and lit it for him.","\"Brother Snake, is Fatty Li trying to pull a fast one again?\"","The man known as Brother Snake took a deep drag of his cigarette and exhaled. \"Damn it, business is getting harder and harder these days. These bosses are all as shrewd as monkeys.\"","\"That is just them being ignorant. What is your status, Brother Snake? A founding member of the Wanlong Syndicate! In Wushui County, who would dare to disrespect you? It is only because you are so magnanimous that you didn't hold it against them.\"","A brief look of discomfort flashed across Brother Snake's face, but he quickly masked it.","\"Keep a low profile, keep a low profile. Our Wanlong Syndicate is on a legitimate path now. We can't be fighting and killing all day long. This is exactly what Brother Ma taught me back in the day.\"","Just as he was speaking, a knock came from outside the door.","\"Brother Snake, Sun Neng and the others are here.\"","Brother Snake's eyes lit up. \"Let them in.\"","The door opened. Led by Sun Neng, the five of them filed into the room.","As soon as they entered, they bowed and scraped, greeting Brother Snake respectfully.","\"Good evening, Brother Snake! Sorry to bother you!\"","\"Good evening, Brother Snake!\"","\".........\""]},{"number":599,"title":"Chapter 599: 599. Former Wanlong Society Member","paragraphs":["Brother Snake leaned back in his chair and flicked his cigarette ash.","\"Little Sun, calling and asking to see me this late, is there something urgent?\"","Sun Neng secretly gave a wink. Xiao Cui hurriedly placed the bag of money on the mahjong table, unzipped it, and revealed stacks of red banknotes.","\"Brother Snake, this is this month's cut, a full seventy thousand. Combined with the previous times, it makes exactly three hundred thousand. About that matter you promised last time...\"","Brother Snake's gaze swept over the pile of money. A smile appeared on his face as he extended a hand and said politely, \"Sit, everyone sit down first. The money is a minor detail; I mainly want to see if you are sincere.\"","After Sun Neng and the others sat down.","Brother Snake began to use his usual bragging tactics, intending to thoroughly hoodwink them first.","\"Do you know how big the Wanlong Syndicate is now? Let me tell you, just in our Wushui County alone, there are over a hundred official members and thousands of peripheral followers. Even the local police chief has to politely offer us cigarettes when he sees us. That's just how badass we are!\"","\"Yes, absolutely. We've long heard of the Wanlong Syndicate's prestige, which is why we're troubling you, Brother Snake.\"","\"When do you think it would be convenient to make the arrangements for us?\"","Brother Snake pretended to ponder. \"Well... you see, the Wanlong Syndicate has grown so large now that we have a clear division of labor. Specific tasks like recruiting new guys are handled by others. I am mainly in charge of... um... recommending talent.\"","\"Brother Snake, if you recommend us, what if the boss in charge of the review doesn't agree?\"","\"That's nothing to worry about. With me here, it's just going through the motions at most.\"","Brother Snake took out his phone, pulled up a photo, and placed it on the table. \"Let me show you something. I never let ordinary people see this.\"","The five of them hurriedly leaned in. On the phone screen was a somewhat blurry group photo. The poor pixel quality of phones from this era was mostly to blame, but they could still roughly make out the faces of the people in it.","The background of the photo looked like a private room in a restaurant. Over a dozen people sat around a table. In the center sat a slightly chubby young man, and right next to him was Brother Snake himself.","\"Do you know who this is?\" Brother Snake asked, pointing at the person in the middle.","Sun Neng and the others shook their heads blankly.","\"Ignorant!\"","\"This is Brother Ma Da, one of the founders of the Wanlong Syndicate. In the syndicate, he's basically a big shot second only to one and above ten thousand!\"","\"See that? I'm sitting right next to him. What kind of relationship does that imply? This is the treatment only a core confidant gets.\"","\"So that's why I'm telling you to rest assured. As long as the money is right, you'll definitely be able to wear the black suits of the Wanlong Syndicate in the future.\"","\"Brother Snake, you're amazing!\"","\"Brother Snake, since you could sit next to Brother Ma Da back then, your position in the syndicate must be quite high, right?\"","Hearing this, Brother Snake didn't look proud; instead, he sighed. \"Alas, it's a long story. It's true that I'm a founding veteran of the Wanlong Syndicate, but because of some family issues, I missed the opportunity to be promoted to a hall master. Thinking about it now, I really fucking regret it.\"","His frustrated appearance wasn't entirely an act. He really had been a member of the Wanlong Syndicate in the past, except it was before the syndicate was officially established.","Last year, when the eldest miss, Liu Yutong, announced her departure from the Yilian Society, he was one of the members who chose to quit.","At that time, he and many others who left felt that the eldest miss couldn't defeat Niu Ben. Niu Ben had been entrenched in Wushui County for years; he had money and manpower, and relying on the Yilian Society was the only way to have a promising future. The eldest miss insisted on going solo? They thought she was just courting death.","But who could have imagined that in less than two months, Niu Ben would be taken down by the eldest miss, and the prestige of the Wanlong Syndicate would instantly spread throughout Wushui County. By then, he wanted to go back but had no chance.","Later, he asked a friend who hadn't left the Wanlong Syndicate and expressed his desire to rejoin. But the other party simply replied: Those who quit the Wanlong Syndicate will never be hired again; it's useless no matter who you look for.","That attitude was already considered polite.","You have to know that before this, their slogan was: Those who betray the eldest miss and the brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Syndicate will be punished with three knives and six holes.","Not applying the gang's law and giving them three knives and six holes was already showing mercy.","Wanting to go back was naturally absolutely impossible.","However, as he watched the Wanlong Syndicate grow stronger day by day, even dominating Mingzhu City, the people he used to know had all traded their shotguns for cannons. They wore black suits, drove company cars, and each had a net worth starting in the hundreds of thousands. The first batch of members basically all became rudder masters. In reality, these were just positions like store managers or supervisors, but the core members were accustomed to designating them as rudder masters or incense masters.","Aside from these positions, the net worth of the first batch of members all exceeded a million, which included circulating shares within the Wanlong Syndicate Group, as well as their income and bonuses.","In just one year!","Originally, they were all brothers who squeezed into a broken-down van to go to the countryside to collect fish catches, but now every one of them was a millionaire. The most crucial thing was that the identity of the Wanlong Syndicate was incredibly useful. Ordinary people had to greet them politely when they saw them; they were incredibly majestic.","Then look at himself. A year had passed, and he was practically standing still. If it weren't for a chess and card room keeping him afloat, he would probably be starving on the streets.","This sense of disparity really made him miserable.","If he hadn't chosen to quit back then.","If he had been able to bring down Niu Ben with the eldest miss and conquer this territory, even if he couldn't compare to big brothers like Ma Da and Yun Cheng, he would at least be a high-ranking executive in the Wanlong Syndicate, right?","Worth millions, driving the company's Mercedes-Benz, being respected by everyone wherever he went...","Unfortunately, there were no ifs.","As time went on, this huge disparity caused his mindset to become increasingly unbalanced.","A while ago, at a gathering with friends, he drank too much and bragged about his former identity in the Wanlong Syndicate, even taking out the old photo on his phone as proof.","Unexpectedly, this unintentional act instantly made him the center of attention at the dinner. Those fair-weather friends enthusiastically came up to offer cigarettes and toast him with flattering attitudes. Some even secretly slipped him money, hoping he would recommend them to the Wanlong Syndicate.","Brother Snake looking at those fawning and sycophantic faces, suddenly realized that the words \"Wanlong Syndicate\" were now a golden signboard in themselves.","Having found the password to wealth, he became unstoppable from then on, using the name of the Wanlong Syndicate to swindle and bluff everywhere.","In just over a month, he transformed from a street punk who didn't even dare to add an egg to his street pancake and only smoked three-yuan packs of cigarettes, into a wealthy boss who ate at restaurants every day, smoked premium cigarettes, and even drove a sedan.","Life was comfortable, but he knew in his heart that this gig wouldn't last long.","There is no wall in the world that doesn't let the wind through; sooner or later, the Wanlong Syndicate would come looking for him.","Especially after he heard Sun Neng and the others mention that they had seen an incredibly beautiful girl in Duanzhuang, he knew it was time for him to get out and lie low for a while."]},{"number":600,"title":"Chapter 600: 600, Thinking of Running Away","paragraphs":["Brother Snake then asked Sun Neng and his group which village they had gone to today to get the money.","Sun Neng and the others didn't dare hide anything, answering honestly that it was Duan Village.","Hearing the words Duan Village, Brother Snake's heart skipped a beat. Especially when he heard them mention seeing a very elegant girl, he hurriedly asked, \"What did you say that girl in Duan Village looked like?\"","\"Quite young, looks under twenty, wearing a beige overcoat, and extremely pretty. She had three or four women with her, all in black suits, looking like female bodyguards.\"","Brother Snake's heart sank completely, but he forced himself to stay calm, saying in a dismissive tone, \"That might just be some boss bringing his bodyguards. Rich folks nowadays love that sort of thing, hiring a few women to keep up appearances.\"","\"By the way, you guys didn't go up and talk to them, did you?\"","Although Sun Neng and his crew thought Brother Snake was acting a bit strange, they shook their heads honestly. \"No, no, we just took a look from a distance and didn't talk to them.\"","Brother Snake nodded, then suddenly changed the subject. \"Here's the deal, you guys need to prepare another hundred thousand yuan.\"","Sun Neng and the others were momentarily stunned. \"Brother... Brother Snake, why? Haven't we already given enough money?\"","Brother Snake sighed, putting on a troubled expression. \"I only just received the news from the syndicate today myself, and I forgot to tell you earlier. The rules of the syndicate have changed. If you want to join the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate, you have to show some real skills. I also want to recommend a few capable and reliable brothers, so I can look good in front of Brother Ma and the others.\"","\"But besides scamming and deceiving, what else can you guys do? Do you have any presentable skills? Not a single one!\"","\"So, I have no choice but to take the brother in charge of recruitment out for a meal and grease some palms.\"","Sun Neng hesitated for a moment and said, \"Brother Snake, we still need to grease palms? But we've already handed over three hundred thousand!\"","Brother Snake frowned. \"Xiaosun, you just don't understand the rules. That three hundred thousand is at most my referral fee for recommending you. It's like buying a house. Is it enough to just pay for the house? Don't you still have to pay the agent a fee for their hard work? Don't you have to buy the bank loan officer a meal?\"","\"Also, do you know how many people are in the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate now? Over ten thousand! Yet, how many are actual core members, the ones who wear black suits? A little over a thousand. Do you think the remaining ten thousand people don't want to wear black suits? Of course they do, but the quota is very limited.\"","\"You guys are still outsiders. If you fork out another hundred thousand now, you can directly put on the black suits. Is that too much?\"","\"If you still don't understand, let me do the math for you. Once you join, black-suit members get a base salary of around five thousand a month. A custom-tailored suit is worth two to three thousand. There are attendance subsidies, year-end dividends, bonuses for good performance, and you can drive company cars whenever you want... Do the math yourselves. Won't you make back this little initial investment in just a few months? Not to mention the tributes you'll get from outsiders.\"","\"In short, are you going to pay or not? If not, take this seventy thousand back and don't come to me for favors ever again!\"","Sun Neng and the others were just calculating Brother Snake's words in their heads, wondering if they could really make their money back in a few months. But before they could figure it out, they suddenly heard his last sentence and instantly panicked.","\"Brother Snake, don't be angry. A hundred thousand it is. You're right, money that needs to be spent must be spent!\"","\"It's just, could you give us an exact time? It would be best if you could take us to see our Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate, just so the brothers can have some peace of mind.\"","Brother Snake rolled his eyes around and suddenly smiled. \"You've got quite a few tricks up your sleeve, kid. Fine! It just so happens I have to go to the Pearl City headquarters tomorrow for business. As long as you give me the money first, I'll take you to broaden your horizons, and let you witness the grandeur of the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate while we're at it!\"","The five men immediately became excited.","\"Can we really go?\"","\"When I, Brother Snake, speak, my word is gold. But be sharp when you go, don't go looking around everywhere. Once you join the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate and become one of our own brothers, then it won't matter.\"","Hearing Brother Snake's words, Sun Neng finally gritted his teeth and made up his mind. \"Alright! Brother Snake, we trust you!\"","Sun Neng then shot a glance at the other four. Although somewhat reluctant, they honestly took out all the money they had on them and placed it on the table. Adding the seventy thousand already on the table, they barely scraped together a hundred and twenty thousand.","\"Brother Snake, this is our entire life savings right now. Could you take a look and see if you can give us a grace period for the rest? Once we join the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate, we'll definitely make it up to you!\"","Brother Snake's face first showed a troubled expression, but ultimately he nodded. \"Fine, I'll make an exception this one time. Tomorrow morning at six, gather here again, and I'll take you to Pearl City.\"","Then he added in his heart, \"I'm slipping away tonight. You guys can just wait here slowly tomorrow.\"","Ever since he heard earlier that these blind fools had scammed people from the eldest miss's own village, Brother Snake knew he could no longer use the name of the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate to con people out of money. It was time to leave Wushui County and lie low for a while.","That was why he temporarily changed his tune and asked Sun Neng and his crew to cough up another hundred thousand yuan.","Of course, this price was just something he threw out casually; whatever Sun Neng and the others could scrape together would do.","\"Thank you, Brother Snake! Thank you, Brother Snake!\" The five men thanked him profusely once again.","\"Alright, go back now. Get some good rest and be energetic tomorrow. Don't embarrass me.\" Brother Snake waved his hand.","The five men backed out of the chess and card room with a thousand thanks.","As soon as the door closed, Brother Snake eagerly lunged at the table, sweeping all the bills into his arms and shouting excitedly, \"I'm rich, I'm rich! Now, even if I go out of town, this is enough to live it up for a while.\"","However, when he saw that there was still a subordinate in the room, he immediately reined in his excited expression and put on his big boss airs again.","\"Um... Xiaojun.\"","The subordinate hurried forward, his eyes still fixed intently on the cash on the table, swallowing hard. \"Brother, your orders.\"","He thought his boss was going to share some money with him, but the result left him terribly disappointed.","He watched as Brother Snake pulled a ten-yuan bill from his wallet and held it out to Xiaojun. \"Go, buy your brother a pack of Chunghwa cigarettes, and then get me some late-night snacks. A roast leg of lamb would be best. I'm in a good mood today.\"","Xiaojun: \"???\"","No way? What do you mean?","A pack of Chunghwa and a roast leg of lamb for ten yuan? Did your family's money appreciate a hundred times? How does it go that far?","\"Brother, isn't this money a little...\"","Brother Snake interrupted him, saying magnanimously, \"I know it's a bit small, but keep the change as your errand fee. No need to thank me.\"","Xiaojun's mouth twitched, and he reluctantly took the ten yuan and left.","Seeing his subordinate leave the room, Brother Snake immediately found a bag and started packing the money, preparing to pack up all the valuables in the chess and card room and take them with him.","He never expected his subordinate to actually buy him cigarettes and a roast leg of lamb; he purely wanted to send the guy away.","Just as he finished packing up his things and picked up his bag, ready to slip away...","Suddenly, with a loud bang!","The front door was violently kicked open from the outside!"]}]);
